window.FWN_INFINITE_MANA_CHAPTERS=(window.FWN_INFINITE_MANA_CHAPTERS||[]).concat([{"number":1601,"title":"Chapter 1601: Chapter 1600 An Ushered Era of Chaos! l","paragraphs":["Chapter 1600 An Ushered Era of Chaos! l","The expression on Empress Genevieve changed first as her Ninth Firmament Cardinal Royal Guard followed, with Beatrix and the others noticing this and pulling on the strings of their own Destiny as their eyes very quickly turned to those of shock!","Why did Noah feel a tremendous sense of danger even while being surrounded by an existence from the Olden Times, 9 Eighth Firmament existences, and even a genuine Ninth Firmament Tyrant that was a step away from becoming a Legend!?","Why would his destiny give such a drastic and shocking message to him through the Dictum Emperor that even now...the guards of Empress Genevieve caught on as their expressions turned dark?","This was because for some of them, they saw their destinies turning entirely black as any golden color faded- this being an unbelievable phenomenon as it wasn't at all realistic for anybody in this group to perish.","This was because they were truly the strongest of the strongest within their Realm of power. In the vast Realities, one could still find existences in the Eighth and Ninth Firmament of Ascendancy that weren't from the Cardinal Royal Bloodlines of Primordials and have them be just as powerful- but these were the rare Bloodlines that had been around since the Olden Times!","Furthermore, just their identities alone guaranteed that no beings would dare turn their gazes to their directions- as a Cardinal Royal Bloodline could not be offended, and much less the Cardinal Royal Human Bloodline! Going even further, who would have the guts to even try targeting a Future Candidate Ruler of a Pure-Blooded Cardinal Bloodline?!","Many questions buzzed in their minds as even while their destiny told them what was coming, it was still inconceivable for it to be believed that something could befall them.","After all, under the stage of Legends, they really had nothing to worry about!","So what...","BZZZZT!","The enormous cuboidal vessel was shockingly forced to come to a halt as the inhabitants within nearly jerked forward, Empress Genevieve tapping the enormous Relic once as it stabilized and showed all that was happening outside.","Shockingly, countless bloody webbed chains filled with age had instantly wrapped around the Relic and held it in place- these chains extending onto a terrifying creature that had horrifically moved to paint all the surrounding light years into a web of countless webbed crimson chains!","This creature was a terrific Eight-Eyed Demon Spider that released potent power at the Ninth Firmament of Ascendancy!","Dreadfully, the Eight-Eyed Demon Spider had an aurora of crimson wings waving behind it as it was already fused with its Ascendancy Halos- taking on its strongest form as its body was filled with demonic Runic Lines of Ascendancy.","OOOOOOH!","And it was not alone.","One aura after another at the Ninth Firmament of Ascendancy rose in fervor as an Apocalypse Turtle whose shell constantly showed the illusory destruction of countless Cosmos spat out waves of obsidian seas, causing an enormous black aquatic domain to wrap around the countless crimson webbed chains laid out by the Eight-Eyed Demon Spider.","This Apocalypse Turtle let out even more dense waves of power at the Ninth Firmament of Ascendancy as it had obsidian pairs of aurora wings erupting from its shell, its eyes releasing beams of tendrils of light as it roared with power!","ROAAR!","On another side there was a Scorpion crackling with arcs of obsidian light as it shone with potent poison and malice at this moment, its piercing tail already glowing with a deadly tint as its aurora of wings snapped, its tailing and body shooting out like a nuclear bomb as space itself shattered wherever it passed- poisoned and dead as it would take years to recover!","Its tail shone with a terrifying black and green glint as this Ninth Firmament Ender was shockingly just one of the Attackers while the Eight-Eyed Demon Spider and Apocalypse Turtle were just some of those with the task of containing everything in and cutting off all communications by laying out their domains in this area.","Apart from these three, there were 6 other terrifying auras at the Ninth Firmament of Ascendancy to make it a total of 9- with the 9th Ender being especially frightening as it was a pure White Dragon with stellar scales releasing a radiant light of majesty!","All the other 8 Ninth Firmament Enders were swarming around the cuboidal vessel or shooting towards it with their True Forms while fused to their Ascendancy Halos while this White Dragon Ender...","SHIIING!","This being actually had a fan that glimmered like the tail of a peacock in floating in front of it- this being a Relic that let itself be known as at least an Enlightened Primordial Relic as the colorful spots on its seemed like countless eyes- a shocking skill activated from it that already wrapped around the vessel at the center of this attack!","With this Enlightened Primordial Relic activated, those under its effects would find it extremely hard to even activate any abilities.","But this wasn't all.","Apart from the glimmering Enlightened Primordial Relic in front of it, the pure white figure of this White Dragon was also surrounded by the mesmerizing lights of over a dozen Ascendancy Halos!","Purely purple and Gold in color, with each Golden Ascendancy Halo representing a shocking truth...this White Dragon Ender had a full 30 Ascendancy Halos rotating over its body in fantastical ways as apart from their purple and golden colors, one could dreadfully see another point of uniqueness as all of these 30 Halos...held hazy streams and rings of milky white light surging around them.","Some of these white streams of light formed into glorious Runic markings on the Halo, while other white streams simply formed into rings of milky white that rotated around the Halos of this creature!","Such a sight caused its Ascendancy Halos to be particularly mesmerizing as this White Dragon Ender...stared towards the cuboidal vessel that contained a Future Candidate Ruler of a Pure-Blooded Cardinal Royal Bloodline as it spoke out with utter majesty.","\"Let it begin.\"","OOOOOM!","Behind it, dozens of Enders at the Eighth Firmament of Ascendancy flooded out as hundreds at the Seventh Firmament went on to circle the webs of crimson shackles that contained everything and the black liquid barrier around it- as if 9 Ninth Firmament Enders were not enough to take care of a party that held a single Ninth Firmament Pure-Blooded Human and the rest at the Eighth Firmament...and even a poor lass at the Seventh Firmament that was looking at everything occurring with luminous eyes!"]},{"number":1602,"title":"Chapter 1602: Chapter 1601 An Ushered Era of Chaos! ll","paragraphs":["Chapter 1601 An Ushered Era of Chaos! ll","A party of terrifying Enders of Reality moved as they started off a maddening assassination attempt on a Future Candidate Ruler of a Pure-Blooded Cardinal Royal Bloodline!","But...this was not an isolated event.","Not by a long shot!","Across the vast Realities, many tumultuous events were occurring around major domains of power and areas where immense authority was concentrated under Primordials.","Across the vast Realities, outside the Boundary of a prominent Prime Reality of the Royal Wolf Bloodline that had an Eighth Firmament Overseer protected by many Royal Wolves at the Seventh Firmament.","Outside the Boundary of such a Reality, the Matriarch Belladonna could be seen along with the Blight Serpent Dragon Emperor as they had silently brought an army of Royal Blight Serpent Dragons outside the doors of a Prime Reality under Primordials, their armies not being alone as they were surrounded by terrific variations of Primordial Beasts releasing guttural roars of power!","Belladonna was bounded to her left by an Eighth Firmament Ender that had the body of an enormous Iridescent Purple Cosmic Serpent, its beastial eyes shining with malice as it roared out before descending unto the Prime Reality before them.","OOOOOH!","Surrounded by power on all sides, Belladonna had a sneer as she gazed at the unfolding chaos and slowly responding Primordials in the Reality below.","\"It is time for the winds of change to ravage across Realities...it is time for the beginning of the end of the authority of Primordials!\"","RUMBLE!","A declaration of war!","A war that would begin on this day and go on for a long, long time as the ushering of a new Era from an old one could not be done in a day.","Those acting to try and bring about a new Era knew this.","It was why they moved the way they moved as their actions spanned across countless Realities!","In another infinitesimally small region of the vast Realities.","The figure of a Draconic Elephantine Ender was watching thousands of Enders surrounded by Enlightened Zombies surge into a Prime Reality under the Cardinal Royal Solaris Simian Bloodline as his trunk bellowed out with excitement.","\"I see.\"","Hyperion spoke out with fervor as he glanced at his destiny to see it rolling around with golden splendor.","\"A war filled with Enders for me to devour...this is a glorious stage I cannot step off of!\"","It was a selfish thought as a tumultuous and bloody conflict began. But in these vast Realities, one had to be cold-blooded and selfish if they ever wished to attain anything. So while seeing his very Bloodline declare war on Primordials and move while allied with other Bloodlines, Hyperion began to move and plan on how to best devour as many of these very same Enders to raise his own power and rise at the fastest possible pace during such a time!","In another region- this time near a Blue Tier Continuum Apocalypse Reality.","\"You fucking dare?! Do you know who I am?!\" With a look of rage and seriousness, an existence known as Europa stared at an Eighth Firmament Chthonian Telos backed by dozens of existences at the Seventh Firmament surrounding her and all those nearby as their eyes shone of malice and apocalypse.","\"It is precisely because we know who you are that you must die, Princess. You and many others!\"","The Eight Firmament Telos that released shocking waves of apocalyptic essence spoke coldly as it looked like a dead sea whale with a sparkling set of blue aurora wings, its eyes beginning to power up deadly lights thereafter as Europa's own eyes began to crackle with profound power while her body transformed into something else!","As she did so, her voice reverberated out to those around her.","\"Eckert...bring out everything you have with your weak little Origin and try not to die. If you stay alive after all this...you might just have the bodies of many Seventh and Eighth Firmament fools under your Legions!\"","WAA!","Her voice reached a blue eyed young man whose body was surrounded by waves of intense darkness, his eyes releasing tendrils of light as his face brought out into a devilish smile when facing enemies that would be certain death for others!","Such shocking events similarly unfolded across many regions of the vast Infinite Realities.","The Enders moved with shocking unity and timing as their targets were predetermined, whoever set up and planned such movements that spanned across different spacetimes being someone truly terrifying as their understanding of Destiny had to be entirely obscene!","This shock did not just pervade across the Infinite Realities though.","Across spaces and Dimension not seen by many, across Grotto Sanctums that powerful beings only knew about...golden blood spilled as a shocking cataclysm had begun at this time.","In a unique Dimension of Space that those of the Ninth Firmament of Ascendancy and below could not even reach.","\"A Telos will still be a Telos at the end! We let you be our compatriot for all these eons and you dare to raise your eyes towards us?!\"","RUMBLE!","A Reality shattering battle was unfolding in unseen planes of existence as the form of a creature the size of a Prime Reality was constantly flashing in and out of existence as his raucous laughter came out with ancientness and vicissitude.","\"Haha...no need to be surprised, Little Vine Legend. This is simply my nature. The cycles of Continuum Apocalypse Realities satiated my hunger for Apocalypse briefly...but why would I not participate in Apocalypses of even grander scales? I would be going against my very own nature if I just stood by and let these Enders have all the fun!\"","...!","Shock and horror bloomed across the explored Realities and Explored Unique Dimensions as very few areas were untouched by the ushering of a New Era.","An Era of war and Conquest that would benefit some while harming the vast majority of others!","The vast Realities moved at their own pace as they had countless billions of years of history.","No single being could think themselves to be a chosen one of these vast Realities!","No single being could think that everything revolves around them!","When the times of chaos came and the Age of Emperors fully bloomed, nobody knew who would survive and come out on top as an Emperor to be respected and revered!","---","{Author Note}:: Yet another rendition of Noah Osmont!"]},{"number":1603,"title":"Chapter 1603: Chapter 1602 An Ushered Era of Chaos! lll","paragraphs":["Chapter 1602 An Ushered Era of Chaos! lll","A cluster of shocking beings surrounded a Future Candidate Ruler of the Pure-Blooded Cardinal Royal Human Bloodline as their purpose was shockingly to assassinate!","The mystery of how they knew she would pass across this space across the vast Boundary Between Realities was unknown. The mystery of why she was targeted could be inferred as unfolding chaos broke out, but the party presented forth was overkill!","This...was what the vast majority of beings would believe when they stared at the group of Enders surrounding a single Cuboidal vessel with more than half of their strongest already releasing their most powerful attacks while fused with their dozens of Ascendancy Halos.","9 Ninth Firmament Enders releasing waves of horrendous power as they had to support them dozens of Enders at the Eighth Firmament of Ascendancy that vibrated with 20 Ascendancy Halos each! Then there were the Seventh Firmament Enders in the hundreds who either already had fused with their Halos, and there were less than half unfused as they showed 10 brilliant ascendancy Halos ranging from white to purple!","The entire domain for many light years was covered where not even a Primal Microbial species could escape, with an Enlightened Primordial Relic wielded by the most powerful White Dragon Ender releasing multicolored waves of light with the unique restriction of locking the essence of their targets momentarily to prevent them from even casting a single iota of an ability.","Then, there were three other Ninth Firmament Enders apart from the obsidian Scorpion shooting towards the cuboidal vessel as by all means...the single Ninth Firmament Pure-Blooded Human Guard surely could not stand against all of them, right? The Empress herself at the Eighth Firmament and her other guards at this same stage could sure not be able to extricate themselves out of this...yes?!","Let's not even mention the Seventh Firmament Enlightened Peerless Alchemist who should be one of the weakest beings in this enclosure!","If anyone looked at this situation, they would see that the fate of the party of Pure-Blooded Cardinal Royal Humans was sealed as the planners of this shocking move had judged that such a party of Enders would be enough to eradicate this Future Candidate Ruler just like many others on their list.","But...unknown to them, their target was not just a mere Candidate Ruler. Their target...was a hidden monster that had been living since the Olden Times!","\"They dare?! Mere Enders dare to make me a target?! Me?!\"","RUUUUUMBLE!","Obscene and pure unadulterated power leaked out from the cuboidal vessel that four Ninth tier Enders were surging towards, the small figure of Empress Genevieve that should have been locked down and not been able to cast anything releasing shocking waves of gold, red, and utterly black essence as she seemed utterly enraged!","Facing Nine Ninth Firmament Ender Tyrants and many more terrific Enders...she was more enraged more than scared!","Her dark hair fluttered over her shoulders madly as her blessed stature stood tall, her crimson gold crown spinning with immense splendor as her eyes released waves of pure regal darkness, her entire figure looking like an aged Empress from ancient times.","\"Come out.\"","She spat out these words as she saw the Reality shattering attacks of four Ninth Firmament Enders arrive, her own body not even moving even though she seemed to have entirely been able to ignore the restrictions that the White Dragon Ender imposed- and she instead called for something to come out!","Just what exactly could turn the tides against attacks from four powered up Enders who had already fused with their 30 Ascendancy Halos? Four Beasts that shone with multicolored lights of the essence of multiple Quasi-TABOO Nomological Edicts?!","CRACK!","Before the Empress, space cracked and sundered as crimson blood spilled out like a gushing geyser. It quickly filled the exquisite command room of the vessel as it drowned every single being within, their Origins trembling as this crimson blood carried a terrifying authority and was simply the prelude of an aura of something horrendous!","\"KAKAKA!\"","Cackling waves of madness echoed out from the bleeding crack before the Empress as an object enlarged from it, the horrific form of an ancient crimson skull making its appearance as the sockets of this skull shone with radiant golden flames of rage, vicissitude, and brutality.","The aura far exceeded any Enlightened Primordial Relic or Sui Generis Enlightened Primordial Relic- this being something far, far above it all!","As if it was alive, the golden flames of this crimson skull rolled gloriously as its bloody set of teeth cackled- the viscous blood that had spread out around the command room increasing in volume, becoming tout, and focusing itself in the four different directions where the attacks of four Ninth Firmament Enders were coming from as the blood formed into four illusory devilish sanguine Flowers shining with a demonic glint, the aura they carried being something no normal existence could release.","\"KAKAKA!\"","With fervor and excitement, the crimson skull howled as the expression of Empress Genevieve became increasingly cold, her dark eyes shining with multicolored light as she watched the attacks reach their cuboidal vessel, four blooming bloody flowers reaching to intercept them as...","BZZZZZT!","The obsidian Scorpion and three other Enders shining with an aurora of wings were brought to a halt, their faces becoming painted in surprise and shock as they actually felt a foreboding sensation and did not proceed forward any further.","The multicolored eyes of the White Dragon Ender from afar shine luminously as they turned stern, noticing the demonic glint from the bloody illusory flowers coming from a crimson skull that was just called out, its words coming out as they caused the very surroundings to shudder.","\"That...is something TABOO!\"","...!","The word 'taboo' was used as it didn't relate to the meaning of something that was just not allowed or permitted. It was used to specify a type of thing that no existences in the Firmaments of Ascendancy should have access to.","The existence that had called it out was truly not simple, the things she had access to being concepts and items that others could not even fully imagine!","Her figure rose at this moment as she brought her mesmerizing palm to stroke the crimson skull coldly, the Pure-Blooded Cardinal Royal Humans behind her finally being able to move freely once more as many of them shuddered when staring at the item the Empress had called out, their bodies exploding with an array of colorful Ascendancy Halos thereafter as the true might of the Pure-Blooded Bloodline bloomed.","SHAAA!","The cuboidal vessel they were on disappeared as the deadliest strike of an assassination was stopped with ease.","As if left unrestricted, the crimson blood leaking from a cackling bloody skull began to spread out and weave into tendrils of pulsing blood that shot out towards the Four Ninth Firmament Enders!","The enraged eyes of the Empress shone as she stroked the skull, speaking out a set of words that caused the weaker Enders to shudder as she turned to gaze at them all for even daring to make designs on her.","\"Let loose and drink plenty...MADNESS!\"","WAA!"]},{"number":1604,"title":"Chapter 1604: Chapter 1603 An Ushered Era of Chaos! lV","paragraphs":["Chapter 1603 An Ushered Era of Chaos! lV","<You have been affected by the influence of MADNESS and received the temporary reality altering Affixes of [Reasoned Madness], [Origin and Soul Expansion], [Soul Corruption], and [Resource Overdrive].>","Noah's expression was unchanged as such a prompt bloomed over his eyes the moment Empress Genevieve called out something horrific. Prompts due an item that granted Reality altering affixes Noah could only set a few of through RUINATION! Reality altering affixes that caused his origin to bubble with power as an unwanted brand of corruption actually forcefully tainted his soul due to this devilish crimson skull.","An item with sentience similar to Noah's Enlightened Primordial Relics, but far higher in tiers as the voice of a faraway Ender had called it TABOO!","\"Let loose and drink plenty...MADNESS!\"","The enraged voice of the Empress echoed out as she targeted four Ninth Firmament Enders as if she shockingly forgot she was at the Eighth Firmament! Yet the aura she released truly didn't match it as it seemed more horrific than even the enraged Ninth Firmament Pure-Blooded Human Guard beside her, her body shockingly blooming with Ascendancy Halos at this moment.","...!","Not the 20 that all Eighth Firmament existences seemed to display.","30 brilliant Ascendancy Halos that only Ninth Firmament experts showed bloomed around her robust and blessed figure as her golden wrappings caused her bountiful chest to tremble with grandeur!","30 Ascendancy Halos...that each shone with a terrific golden glint!","Even more gloriously, each of these golden Halos were covered with their own Olden Runic Ecritures, some of these Halos even showing crimson irises erupting from their golden regality as they entirely outmatched anyone else's on the battlefield.","BZZZZT!","Thereafter, bellowing tendrils of stellar Realities began to come to life from the back of her head, beside her two shoulders, and then from three points on her back as the illusory sight of five Reality Passages formed in this enclosed domain!","Space shuddered and quivered. Immense power and pressure was released as after such a shocking display, Beatrix moved along with the other Pure-Blooded Cardinal Royal Humans beside her.","\"Protect the Empress!\"","BOOM!","Her body and the bodies of other Pure-Blooded Humans exploded with Ascendancy Halos and the illusory light of two or three Reality Passages, a counterattack blooming against a siege of exceedingly powerful Enders of Reality at this moment!","The figure of a lone Seventh Firmament Enlightened Peerless Alchemist was entirely neglected.","Noah watched the utterly ecstatic show of power before him as his illusory crown that now carried the colors of crimson, gold, and blue was spinning ever faster as it became more and more corporeal.","In such an environment, he had to survive. His destiny was spinning out with surging waves as it told him of bountiful dangers and opportunities coming hand in hand, his vast fortune telling him of a grand change coming as if he played it well enough...Reality would be but a mere achievement in a short period of time.","To survive this shocking Era that was blooming, Noah had to be even more destructive and overpowered!","And for this...his Concepts were the answer.","<Due to the elevation of the Tyrannical Emperor, the Flames of the Tyrannical Emperor have burned away the Visage of the Emperor of Old Bloodline and obtained the full inheritance of the Bloodline, the identity becoming clear as the Supreme Tier Olden Bloodline of the Arcadian Tyrant now runs at the core of your Origin and Soul.>","WAA!","<The Title of Emperor of Arcadian Tyranny has been granted.>","Before the eyes of his main body, the prompts that told him of the elevation of the Tyrannical Emperor to the Quasi-TABOO level were blooming as he could read over them and ascertain their details before even an instant passed.","The speed of his thought processing was so powerful that when his main body returned to the Cosmic Holy Land, he could seemingly be thinking for a few hours before even an instant had passed in the outside world!","The shocking assassination of the Empress that put the life of one of his True Sanguine Clones in danger was akin to being paused and moving in slow motion as Noah took in all the information he was receiving while his main body analyzed and processed it in the Cosmic Holy Land...all the while Prime Realities began to fuse into his Infinite Reality and 5 Stars of Conquest formed from every single Prime Reality!","So at this moment, he was able to focus on the words that said he had Unlocked the Supreme Tier Olden Bloodline of the Arcadian Tyrant. The granting of the Bloodline of the Emperor of Arcadian Tyranny!","He was able to feel the shocking golden blood surging from the depths of his Origin and soul as his Ascendancy Value rose by another few million! Along with this, immense amounts of information flooded into his brain with its source being this very same source of golden blood.","<All basic abilities under the Nomological Edict of the Tyrannical Emperor have been greatly elevated, with the Ultimate Abilities under the Flames of the Tyrannical Emperor undergoing the greatest change.>","<The Ultimate Ability Nomological Regime is elevated to the point that the possibility to have the concept of the Tyrannical Emperor be elevated to TABOO has been opened, along with the possibility to elevate other Nomological Edicts to TABOO with the prerequisites of 5,000 True Stars of Conquest.>","<The Ultimate Ability Benevolent Light of Empowerment has been transformed as at this moment, it can grant Empowerment twice as it is also no longer restricted to concepts- with the Benevolent Light of Empowerment being capable of washing over and empowering the origin and souls of existences, concepts, items, and even treasures with the exchange of a single True Star Of Conquest. The Second Empowerment has a cost of ten times more than the first one...>","...!","Bountiful glory!","That was what lay before Noah's eyes as the Nomological Edict of the Tyrannical Emperor at the level of Quasi-TABOO Unlocked many things. The identity of the Olden Bloodline was revealed, the chance to elevate his concepts to TABOO were open, and he could now even Empower the Origin and souls of existences along with items!","All of these were simply fantastic, but he wasn't done receiving information as the most prized one came from the Olden Bloodline of the Arcadian Tyrant.","Just who was the Arcadian Tyrant, and what did this title stand for?","<The memories of the Olden Emperor of Arcadian Tyranny begin to awaken as the technique [Arcadian Body and Soul Refinement] that allows one to forge the Limit Breaking Extreme Physique of the Arcadian Tyrant has been granted.>","...!"]},{"number":1605,"title":"Chapter 1605: Chapter 1604 The Olden Emperor of ArcadianTyranny! l","paragraphs":["Chapter 1604 The Olden Emperor of ArcadianTyranny! l","Multicolored waves of beautiful essence pristinely flowed in slow motion before Noah's eyes in the Cosmic Holy Land.","He was in a Domain of time as he further focused on his overly strong soul and speed of thought processing to expand microseconds into hours- to the point that it was as if the events outside had nearly come to a halt!","The vibrant and unspeakable aura leaking from Empress Genevieve as she alone faced four Ninth Firmament Enders of Reality with something TABOO in her hands. The Pure-Blooded Cardinal Royal Human Guards that erupted with glorious Ascendancy Halos to shoot towards the White Dragon Ender and the remaining four Enders floating in different directions! The Dozens of Eighth Firmament and hundreds of Seventh Firmament Enders dazzling with waves of attacks from afar. Then...the lone figure of the Seventh Firmament True Sanguine Clone that had not made any moves.","All of this had nearly come to a halt in Noah's mind as when his lone True Sanguine Clone made a move in this terrifying enclosure, he wanted it to be a dazzling one that granted him tremendous benefits!","This was because all around him, hundreds of Seventh Firmament Enders that represented too many Insuperable Nomological Edicts waited!","Dozens of Eighth Firmament Enders who actually had a Golden Halo of Ascendancy here and there...they also lay in waiting if Noah could manage to defeat them as he could increase his collection of Quasi-TABOO Nomological Edict.","As for the 9 Ninth Firmament Enders...could Noah even touch them at this moment?!","The answer was unknown...but the possibilities were endless. This was because at this moment, Noah's irises spun with stellar light as the Nomological Edict of the Resplendent Treasure Emperor had covered them- the Resplendent Treasure Cache being activated as it shone on all the Eight and Ninth Firmament Enders that Noah could see!","If he could manage to kill any one of them...loot even higher than the level of the Gazer would land on his lap as things like Breath of Reality, Olden Orb of Transmogrification, Reality Jewels, and Blueprints of unique Constructs...they would bloom before him once again.","For Noah to utilize this chance to the fullest and obtain the maximum number of rewards possible, he had to prepare as his Main body moved his thoughts with haste in the Cosmic Holy Land, pulling in the new information he was receiving about the boons of the elevation of the Tyrannical Emperor while also feeling the strings of destiny being pulled as he received messages from multiple sources simultaneously!","From an existence linked to him by destiny- he received a vast memory of an army of Enders flooding towards a Prime Reality as a Draconic Elephantine Ender was about to join the fray. From his conquered Vassal Victoria of the Celestial Vines, he saw the memory of armies of Enlightened Zombies and Enders moving in conjunction as one of the main Prime Realities of Celestial Vines was actually being attacked!","'So...the Enders have begun their moves across the vast Realities...' Noah's thoughts played with Destiny as a golden book unfurled its pages within his mind, his thoughts being steered towards the right direction as a clearer picture was drawn in his mind.","'Just how far does their influence stretch? Will their alliances with other Bloodlines and the unfolding chaos last long or will Primordials suppress them in an extremely short period of time?'","His eyes danced with possibilities as these were questions one had to wonder!","Primordials had taken rulership and authorities over the vast Realities for eons! Would their authority really be tested and shaken by this move by Enders and those colluding with them, or would things unfold in an entirely different direction?","There were still too many unknowns as for now, Noah only saw what was directly ahead of him.","A battle where his True Sanguine Clone still faces the threat of death as the greatest danger from this Ender Assassination enclosure had yet to even show itself!","So...","'Let's power up to the fullest before collecting as much loot as possible!'","WAA!","Noah's thoughts were set as his focus honed in on the newly unlocked Bloodline of the Olden Emperor of Arcadian Tyranny that granted a technique for him to achieve a Limit Breaking Extreme Physique.","The boosts and elevation of Nomological Edicts were truly systemic as even though they each gave their own boosts, one could see a sense of similarities.","An example were the two concepts of Apocalypse and Tyrannical Emperor where after their elevation to Quasi-TABOO, they each Unlocked a Supreme Tier Bloodline and a method to attain a Limit Breaking Extreme Physique through their own means!","The only question that remained was just which one granted the better boosts and had a more efficient utilization? There was the changed ability of <Reality Devourer> to <Reality Limit Breaker> from the concept of Apocalypse that required Noah to spend 10,000 Units of the Essence of Reality to devour a Reality in exchange for slowly building up towards a Limit Breaking Extreme Physique.","Now, the concept of the Tyrannical Emperor Unlocked the Bloodline of the Olden Emperor of Arcadian Tyranny as would its utilization and Limit Breaking Extreme Physique it came with be something even more fantastical?!","<Olden Emperor of Arcadian Tyranny>:: An Olden Bloodline inherited by meeting the conditions set forth by the Arcadian Tyrant. The name of Arcadian was set forth by the Progenitor of this Bloodline as a contrast to their true nature of an existence that is always embroiled and constantly influencing the weaving of destiny around them, an existence that in the Olden Times had bathed countless Realities, Dimensions, and Grotto Sanctums in the blood of his enemies. When he stared out from his throne built by the blood and origins of countless shattered Realities, what he wished for the most was peace and calm- and so he titled himself the Emperor of Arcadian Tyranny. It is a Bloodline with roots tracing back across space and time as techniques from the Olden Time can return through your hands, with currently unlocked techniques being <Arcadian Body and Soul Refinement>, <Throne of Arcadian Tyranny>, and <Wisps of the Arcadian Modus Operandi>. The Heart of the Arcadian Tyrant is calm and peaceful as they are unphased by any outside forces no matter the situation, with the possibilities of unlocking further uses of this Bloodline relying on the actions of the holder of this Bloodline itself...>","'Ah...' Noah's eyes shone with a devilish glint of wonder as he read over the details and memories of the uniqueness that was the Emperor of Arcadian Tyranny!"]},{"number":1606,"title":"Chapter 1606: Chapter 1605 The Olden Emperor of ArcadianTyranny! ll","paragraphs":["Chapter 1605 The Olden Emperor of ArcadianTyranny! ll","Noah's thoughts moved with haste as he put his amazement and wonder on hold after viewing the details of the Olden Bloodline of the Arcadian Tyrant, his eyes honing onto their skills!","<Arcadian Body and Soul Refinement>:: The will of the Arcadian Tyrant quietly calls upon the submission of the body and Bloodlines of fallen enemies to be utilized for the Refinement of their own body and soul. Only the True Blood and Bloodlines of existences at the Eighth Firmament and above who have broken past their limits contain enough potency to activate this ability, with every fallen target that cannot defend their Origins having their True Blood and Bloodlines directly devoured to aid in the refinement of your Body and Soul. Achieving complete refinement will grant the Limit Breaking Extreme Arcadian Physique that will at a minimum guarantee a body capable of withstanding the connection of 10 Reality Passages. Current progression of the Limit Breaking Extreme Arcadian Physique- 0%>","\"...\"","Something truly beautiful appeared as it also held extreme conditions to achieve it!","To begin working on the Limit Breaking Extreme Arcadian Physique, Noah had to use the fallen bodies of Eighth Firmament existences and above as it was in case to ask an existence who had yet to break past the limits and forge Reality Passages to actually be targeting existences that had done so!","It was insane...and yet it was the path of the Arcadian Tyrant as such an existence was supposed to be capable of scanning upwards and ignoring the rank in power to be capable of wiping the floors with existences a stage above them.","'10 Reality Passages!' This wonder caused Noah's eyes to vibrate as even without the factor of a Modus Operandi coming into play, the Extreme Arcadian Physique could already grant one something so ridiculous as it made Noah wonder about the Reality Passages displayed by Empress Genevieve!","The reality known and set forth by many was that the moment you broke past your limits and established your Reality Passages for the first time- that was it. You couldn't somehow forge more later or reduce what you had as if you had forged a single one, you would forever be stuck with that and never achieve Reality! The 5 Reality Passages shown by Empress Genevieve were domineering and guaranteed her Passage into the realm of Reality, but were they really all she had?","Since Noah could possibly achieve 10 just from the Physique of his Olden Bloodline, could this Empress not do the same with hers?","There were many questions with little information as for the sake of time, Noah chose to move on with his preparations as he continued on the currently unlocked abilities of Arcadian Tyranny.","<Throne of Arcadian Tyranny>:: The Throne of Arcadian Authority can be called out from the illusory Emperor's Crown, allowing for the Arcadian Tyrant to undergo a passive <Soul Strengthening> whenever they bathe under its light, along with the capabilities to optimize the strength of their body and origin in unique ways. One can cleanse their body and soul of unneeded concepts as they turned into pure essence to strengthen their soul, and they can also seamlessly forge new concepts and add them to their soul as the effects of <Affinity Attunement>, <Monarchical Comprehension>, and <Seeker of Taboo> are constantly applied to them to aid in their understanding...","<Wisps of the Arcadian Modus Operandi>:: The method to operate one's Origin in the same manner as the Progenitor of Arcadian Tyranny can be obtained by following the wisps of the Arcadian Modus Operandi to lead you to the Remnants of the Olden Times that cannot be reached through normal means...","The other two features under the unlocked Emperor of Arcadian Tyranny were shown as each of them came with many possibilities, especially the one that could actually lead Noah to unknown locations that held things from the Olden Times!","It was something to utilize in the near future as because of the limitations of time at this moment, Noah's hand rose up as he tapped the illusory crown floating above him while calling out.","\"Throne of Arcadian Tyranny.\"","BZZZT!","Resplendence erupted around him as the crown shimmered with authority, shooting it out as it formed into an exquisite illusory throne that seemed to have crimson and gold flames constantly dancing over it as they formed into a flaming floor that the throne floated atop of!","Noah's figure went forward to sit on the Throne of Arcadian Tyranny as his soul instantly began to feel its nourishment, his eyes already seeing forward into the future when he would choose to eradicate the concepts he gained in exchange for strengthening his soul as with the Hundreds of Seventh Firmament Enders included in the Ender Assassination party...Noah would be able to obtain thousands of Nomological Edicts that ranged from Minor to Insuperable which he wouldn't have the uses for!","But this was only a possibility for him if his True Sanguine Clone could survive amidst a battle that included Ninth Firmament Tyrants. For this, his preparations involved the concept of Apocalypse that could now even allow him to break the Ascendancy Halos of others if their Quasi-TABOO Nomological Edicts could not defend against him, the concept of the Tyrannical Emperor opening the doorway to the Arcadian Body and Soul Refinement to help him break past his limits if he could take down the enemies before him...and there was one other crucial thing he had yet to do that would close up everything and have him ready.","The next step to making himself as powerful as possible before he made his move was...","\"Burn 50 True Stars of Conquest to elevate Sanguine Emperor to Quasi-TABOO.\"","...!","He spoke out domineeringly while situated upon the nourishing Throne of Arcadian Tyranny, his Origin buzzing with magisterial waves of power as the light of newly gained True Stars of Conquest erupted out!","50 dazzling stars spun around him as they represented the conquest of 50 Emerging Realities, austere rivers of milky white light beginning to swirl around the Throne of Arcadian Tyranny as they all surged towards a single being as he elevated a concept that was a major reason to the level of strength he currently had!"]},{"number":1607,"title":"Chapter 1607: Chapter 1606 Pioneer! l","paragraphs":["Chapter 1606 Pioneer! l","The first Prime Reality experienced Apocalypse and fused into the Infinite Reality as one of Noah's True Sanguine Clones was observing the wondrous sight while the main body overlooked the coming of the Arcadian Tyrant and the elevation of the Sanguine Emperor while also observing the assassination attempt still moving in extremely slowed time far away.","With the Assimilation of this Reality, tens of thousands of Cosmos were added along with the unique domains that the Overseer of this Reality managed! So austere lands that had clusters of essence of destiny were seamlessly placed towards the center of the Infinite Reality as the Overseer of this past Prime Reality and the Sixth Firmament existences and below...they had all already kneeled under the Atlatl of Reality!","Their Fealty was sworn to the being wielding the Spear of Reality as with every existence bending the knee and being assimilated into his Reality, Noah's Origin and Power thrived even more under the effects of the Tyrannical Emperor!","This was even more so after the elevation of this Edict to Quasi-TABOO as the effects of [Tyranny of the Soul] and [Oath to the Emperor] were magnified even more.","The conquest of entire Realities and the existences within them whose numbers were just becoming countless...the feedback from the Nomological Edict of the Tyrannical Emperor allowed Noah to feed off every Vassal pledging Fealty as his soul was strengthened by leaps and bounds!","To understand where he stood, one would have to equate it to a being that had lived for hundreds of millions of years and accumulated the strengthening of their soul this whole time with hard effort and the use of treasures.","He had already far surpassed the soul strength of normal Eighth Firmament existences as on this aspect...he could be considered to have already exceeded the limit! And the true issue that would give birth to a glorious happening in the future was the fact that the strengthening of his soul faced no limitations due to [Tyranny of the Soul] that simply added to his soul strength the more Realities full of beings that he conquered!","The True Sanguine Clone felt this feedback of soul strength from the main body as this broken limit was just the first aspect that Noah planned to exceed, with his having yet to even refine his soul with the means of the Olden Emperor of Arcadian Tyranny.","\"Now, what will the Sanguine Emperor call forth?\"","BZZZT!","Multicolored essence bloomed as the focus returned to Noah's main body.","50 True Stars of Conquest spun over his head as all their essence gushed into his Origin, painting a portion of his soul that contained the authority of the Sanguine Emperor entirely white as this concept that had made many things possible for Noah faced an elevation to Quasi-TABOO!","This was the concept that allowed Noah to birth the unique Ascendancy Halos he held. The concept that allowed for his True Sanguine Clone that were akin to three other combatants capable of dishing out ridiculous power! A concept that Interlinked the system of power as it could easily influence the Bloodlines of Noah himself and other existences...","The moment that its elevation began, Noah could feel the True Blood within his body begin to surge with fervor and madness Freeᴡebnᴏvel.cᴏm.","He could feel a unique sensation as if he went through with this elevation as it is, he would no doubt obtain something extremely beneficial to him!","'But...I do not just want another elevation similar to Apocalypse or Tyrannical Emperor. Give me something even more overpowered!'","WAA!","His thoughts moved with utmost tyranny as his voice commanded out.","\"Empower the Nomological Edict of the Sanguine Emperor...and then Empower it again!\"","...!","Dual Empowerment.","The first concept to undergo such a boost was Sanguin Emperor as Noah did this shocking process during its elevation to Quasi-TABOO- whatever boosts or Bloodlines of features that would have been unlocked before this being greatly elevated and thrown to greater levels because of this!","A single True Star of Conquest had risen as it split apart to release its milky white light, and 10 more rose thereafter for the second Empowerment as everything fervently surged into the concept of the Sanguine Emperor.","As this splendor of colors washed over him, Noah still wasn't fully satisfied as he truly wanted a game changer to result from the elevation of the Sanguine Emperor- his hands waving to a far away RUINATION looking towards him with curiosity as she caught 10 Reality Crystals that represented 10,000 Units of the Essence of Reality.","\"Corrupt it. Make it so that even if it is something taboo...I shall get my hands on it!\"","WAA!","His gaze was vast as he could seemingly see a boundless future. Even the emotionless RUINATION seemed to have been affected as she nodded with luminous eyes, coming beside Noah to place her hands on his head and chest as 10 Reality Crystals disappeared while Concept Corruption went to work on an evolving double Empowered Nomological Edict!","With all of these boosts and a Double Empowerment that no other Edicts had received...just how wondrous would the results of the Sanguine Emperor be? How differently would the boosts be now as what could possibly exceed the results of Apocalypse that now allowed Noah to even break Ascendancy Halos and Tyrannical Emperor that granted a full Olden Bloodline that had countless boons within it?","These thoughts of Noah...seemed like a challenge as everything around him began to tremble and shake thereafter.","Now, it was not just his True Blood...but even the strings of the many Bloodlines he held had also begun to rise and tumble within his body.","The Olden Bloodline of the Arcadian Tyrant bubbled forth. The Royal Bloodline being born under Interlinked Royal Lineage bubbled forth among many others as the moment that the True Stars of Conquest lost their light...","BZZZZT!","The whole Cosmic Holy Land shook in a terrifying tremor as Noah's glorious body of a cosmic being actually erupted into a vast crimson gold sea of blood, RUINATION becoming bathed within this sea as she continued her Corruption!"]},{"number":1608,"title":"Chapter 1608: Chapter 1607 Pioneer! ll","paragraphs":["Chapter 1607 Pioneer! ll","A constantly surging and expanding crimson gold sea of blood spread out as it shone of stellar Cosmos that sparkled with radiance- Cosmos that if one counted- they would get exactly 10 billion.","The True Sanguine Clones moving outside on their own nearly crumbled at this moment as to protect them, Noah subconsciously sent thoughts to his soul as a pristine crimson bloody cocoon went on to cover all of them at this moment- the change Noah was undergoing being too grand as it affected all of them!","The only glorious thing was the passage of time in the Cosmic Holy Land granting a semblance of time where after Noah finished whatever transformation was coming, maybe a microsecond or less would have passed on the outside world- so his True Sanguine Clones would not be too crazily affected.","But his body truly exploded into a stellar sea of blood as everything about him could be discerned within this sea...along with all of the strings that represented the Bloodlines he had collected so far!","'What is this...' His thoughts watched everything with utter marvel as his transformation wasn't just occurring within him, even outside space was affected as his raging sea of blood seemed to be resonating with the very space and natural laws of Reality around him!","The influence of double Empowerment. The influence of becoming a Ruined concept!","It caused everything to run wild as the resonance rose with a cacophony of sound and magisterial wonder until...","<The Dual Empowered and Ruined concept of Sanguine Emperor has begun its true birth as it forges towards the rank of Quasi-TABOO.>","OOOM!","Multicolored rays of light began to bloom from Noah's expanding blood sea as it stopped expanding after filling up nearly all of the Cosmic Holy Land, and it began to retract at this moment to form Noah's new body! And while this occurred...shocking prompts didn't stop coming!","<The abilities of Sanguine Aggregation and Interlinked Royal Lineage have resonated and evolved, becoming activated passively as the birth of the Quasi-TABOO Nomological Edict of the Sanguine Emperor forcefully pulls upon all your current Bloodlines and takes their strongest aspects to go towards fusing your own singular Bloodline.>","RUUMBLE!","The endless crimson gold seas converged in a shocking manner as Noah barely saw this message flash while his body was being reformed!","Shockingly, Sanguine Aggregation was activated forcefully along with an ability from another concept entirely as they didn't just select a few powerful Bloodlines to fuse as Noah planned to experiment...but they took all aspects of Noah's current Bloodlines as they tried to birth something fantastical along with the birth of Quasi-TABOO Sanguine Emperor!","The shocking phenomena occurring around Noah was truly not just focused around him as ever since the Empowerment and Corruption with his body exploding into a sea of blood, space itself had been shaking and trembling as the Cosmic Holy Land was the first affected, but now the vast hundreds of thousands of Cosmos within the Infinite Reality and even the second Prime Reality that was about to fuse into it...they all began trembling and humming uniquely as what was occurring seemed to be resonating with Reality itself!","Maybe it was due to Noah's connection to the Infinite Reality. Maybe it was merely the awakening of the Sanguine Emperor to Quasi-TABOO while also becoming empowered and corrupted. Maybe it was other factors that weren't even known...but his transformation seemed to be something that exceeded anything that should have been happening.","This was because as the crimson gold seas converted back to reform his body, the form of a stellar Cosmic existence bathed in the light of stars and the hue of crimson gold came to be. And as he came together...the space around him began to crack and be torn into shreds, wisps of multicolored Essence beginning to leak out as they surged into Noah's developing form!","Bountiful Essence of Reality flowed out of these cracks in space as along with them, something else also came in the form of memories and information.","<Your blood resonates with the natural laws of Reality as your Affinity increases!>","WAA!","Boundless essence and information surged towards Noah as around him, space cracked and sundered as Essence of Reality surged out- Noah's Affinity to the Infinite Realities vastly increasing at this moment!","Affinity!","Something abstruse that Noah had been steadily increasing anytime he forged unique treasures or refined stellar Alchemical products, the moment that it began to elevate at this moment allowing it to reach past a crucial Boundary and breaking through it as Noah received its bountiful rewards.","This action meant many things, but there was a factor that was changed the most that affected Noah at this moment...and that was the limit that was the 10,000 barrier reserves of the Essence of Reality that Noah had not even yet used the Limit Breaking Pills he forged to surpass yet. This limitation...was broken at this moment!","<The Limitation of 10,000 Maximum Reserves of the Essence of Reality has been exceeded.>","<Your Maximum Reserves of the Essence of Reality have been increased by 1,000.>","<Your Maximum Reserves of the Essence of Reality have been increased by 1,000.>","<Your Maximum Reserves of the Essence of Reality have been increased by 1,000....>","Multicolored essence surged into his body as Noah truly broke past a limitation with ridiculous ease even before forging his Reality Passages.","This meant that the Limitation of the Soul and reserves of the Essence of Reality had already been exceeded at this moment as one had to wonder- just how would this affect the number of Reality Passages Noah could form?!","THUMP!","The beat of his heart rang out like a stellar drum as it seemed to come alive and resonate with the Infinite Reality.","THUMP!","The boons of the Sanguine Emperor were just beginning as all the Bloodlines within his body...the newly unlocked Olden Bloodline of the Arcadian Tyrant, the Bloodline of the Watcher, the Bloodline of Primordial, Celestial Vines...even the Bloodlines of all of his current Nomological Edicts!","If they were a Bloodline, they were pulled upon at this moment forcefully and in a domineering manner as they contributed to the coming of something utterly preposterous!","BZZZT!","The Essence of Reality surged around Noah with even more fervor as his form became clearer and clearer, with the bountiful information he was receiving being displayed before his eyes as prompts- a particularly stunning one rising up at this moment.","<There was the Olden Era, but everything does not end there.>","...!","<After the Old, the New shall always arrive as you have achieved a condition to birth a Kainos Emperor Bloodline that Pioneers the coming Kainos Era!>"]},{"number":1609,"title":"Chapter 1609: Chapter 1608 An lllusory Crown Solidifies! l","paragraphs":["Chapter 1608 An lllusory Crown Solidifies! l","The Olden Times!","An Era of shocking power and destiny filled with terrible powerhouses...but it was a past Era!","It had come and gone as all those with wondrous Olden Bloodlines, all of the Emperors of Old that were reigning...their time had come and gone.","Why was this?","Why weren't the immensely powerful Emperors capable of continuing their reign as all that was left now were mere remnants with only a history of the Olden Times existing through a few surviving Bloodlines?!","Just what had caused the past Age of Emperors to come to an end? Just what had been the spark that burned the astounding visage of existences of the Olden Times!?","Noah had an inkling, but he did not have all the answers.","At this moment though, he pulled on something not of the Olden Era- but the Era that came after it as it was termed the Kainos Era!","Kainos was a word that had a meaning of new, and it was the term that would define the coming Age of Emperors that was fully blooming at this moment. As for why we would consider the Age of Emperors to have already arrived? It was due to existences like Noah that were currently laying their candidacy into this new Age!","BZZZT!","A stellar crimson gold sea filled with billions of Cosmos had converted as it formed a new body, Noah's form changing once more as the one feature of his that could never decide its color changed again. His hair had undergone many changes depending on which Bloodline he was representing, but his current reforming body had vibrant free flowing gold, crimson, and black streaks of hair that shone with dazzling light.","His skin was painted by a hue of crimson gold Cosmos as he truly looked like an existence that was fitting to be a Pioneer of a coming Era, the illusory crown above his head currently spinning as it actually began to feel more...real!","The illusory crown that represented the authority of an Emperor. It could be influenced by any powerful Bloodlines as even the Royal Bloodline Noah had been awakening through Interlinked Royal Lineage had painted a portion of this crown blue. Now...its colors were flashing with luminous frequency as it slowly seemed to be solidifying!","WAA!","As it did so, streams of multicolored liquid leaked from it to bathe Noah's body as while the outside was formed- it was merely like a husk as the inner parts of Noah's Origin and body were currently being reborn to match the new Bloodline of the Kainos Era!","As his Origin and soul were being reformed, Noah's soul still had a semblance of control as similar to what he had done during the elevation of the Sanguine Emperor...he wanted the utmost stellar results from the elevation of his body and soul as he used the chance of the birth of his Kainos Bloodline to do something he had to do.","And that was...","\"Dual Empower my Origin, Body, and Soul.\"","OOOOM!","The empowering of something other than his Nomological Edicts!","And he did it while he was undergoing a process of rebirth as whatever wondrous result was about to happen- he had commandeered the process to make this result even wilder!","He did all of this so that the moment he obtained the boons of a Quasi-TABOO Nomological Edict of the Sanguine Emperor and understood the new Bloodline from the Kainos Era, he wanted to erupt with his strongest power in the enclosure of an assassination as he began a thorough rampage!","SHING!","33 True Stars of Conquest rose and shattered to achieve their purpose, the last few Stars barely being reached a few seconds ago after another Prime Reality successfully fused into the Infinite Reality.","And while all of this occurred, information on all the changes continued to flash within his mind!","First was the successful elevation of the Sanguine Emperor to Quasi-TABOO even while some of its many shocking effects were occurring to Noah in real time.","<Through the Nomological Regime of the Tyrannical Emperor, the concept of the Sanguine Emperor has been successfully elevated to Quasi-TABOO.>","<Due to the elevation of the Sanguine Emperor, the Flames of the Sanguine Emperor are now in the process of forging an Evolvable Quasi-Venerable Bloodline of the Kainos Era that grants a unique distinction!>","...!","The information flowed down freely as Noah's Origin, bones, and organs were beginning to form within his body- but they were doing so through a unique fashion that was something new for even Noah to observe!","<An Evolvable Quasi-Venerable Bloodline stands with too much importance as its formation is led by its own awakening will.>","<At the core of your body and soul, [Kainos Primordial Mesenchymal Cells] begin to produce the very structure of your bones as the unconscious will of the awakening Quasi-Venerable takes charge to form the very blood cells that will continue producing your Kainos True Blood.>","BZZZT!","Noah's reforming body cascaded with waves of crimson gold power as blood and organs were formed in shocking stellar ways to account for a glorious new Bloodline that took from the aspects of all his other Bloodlines!","And the bountiful information continued to flow as this process continued!","<All basic abilities under the Nomological Edict of the Sanguine Emperor have been greatly elevated, with the Ultimate Abilities under the Flames of the Sanguine Emperor undergoing the greatest change.>","<After becoming A Ruined and Dual Empowered Concept, Sanguine Emperor is further elevated as all Ascendancy Halos formed through its influence can now display Ruined Sanguine Eyes of Ascendancy.>","Ah!","Noah's soul hummed with power as information of something wondrous came down.","The Ruined Nomological Edicts of Apocalypse and Tyrannical Emperor had granted Ruined Eyes of Ascendancy within the Ascendancy Halos they were in as they each had their own usage, but now all of Noah's Halos would be capable of displaying Ruined Sanguine Eyes of Ascendancy as the effects of such a fantastical concept were bound to be drastic!"]},{"number":1610,"title":"Chapter 1610: Chapter 1609 An lllusory Crown Solidifies! ll","paragraphs":["Chapter 1609 An lllusory Crown Solidifies! ll","Even though time was moving extremely slowly to the point that it didn't even seem to pass for Noah, events still continued to unfold in the enclosure that Enders had created to assassinate a Future Candidate Ruler of a Pure-Blooded Cardinal Royal Bloodline!","Across the vast Realities, wars had begun to bloom in multiple locations as assassinations of important figures of Primordial Bloodlines were also occurring in real time, with glorious bloody conflicts beginning across many major Prime Realities.","In the Grotto Sanctums that weaker beings could not even begin to comprehend- existences that normally lay dormant for hundreds of millions of years made their moves as this point in time could be considered the full ushering of the coming Age of Emperors, of the Kainos Era where just as specific races and beings had come to rule in the Olden Era...new Emperors would rise who would come to rule in the Kainos Era!","OOOOOOH!","In the enclosure where not even an ounce of Essence could leak outside, the over buff bodies of the Pure-Blooded Cardinal Royal Humans expanded even further as 20 Ascendancy Halos roared around the bodies of the Eighth Firmament guards with utter glory- these guards breaking into parties of two as they moved like dazzling nuclear lights towards a Ninth Firmament Ender!","The 8 Eighth Firmament Guards moved in parties of two as they were able to cover four Ninth Firmament Enders, while the only middle aged Ninth Firmament Pure-Blooded Human Guard under the Empress bellowed out while thundering towards the pure white Dragon Ender.","BZZZT!","Arcs of profound reality destroying light bloomed as three Reality Passages formed from the back of this devilishly handsome Pure-Blooded Ninth Firmament Guard, his 30 Ascendancy Halos going on to fuse with him as his right hand stretched out to call a treasure...and caused for a glimmering golden mountain filled with archaic vicissitude to appear at this time!","A mountain! It was actually a mountain that released an aura at the Sui Generis Enlightened Primordial Relic level as it revolved with Runic Ecritures over its surfaces- this mountain surging with essence as it smashed towards the cold eyed pure White Dragon Ender.","9 Ninth Firmament Enders, and 5 of them were covered by her guards as shockingly, the lone figure of Empress Genevieve stroked a crimson gold skull cackling with Madness as she shockingly targeted 4 Ninth Firmament Enders all by herself!","The dozens of Eighth Firmament and hundreds of Seventh Firmament Enders had to navigate such a shocking battlefield without perishing as even a streak of essence leaking from these beings could seriously injure them, so they stayed in the back while releasing the strongest attacks that their Origins could muster to destabilize any moves that the Empress and her Guards made.","Their purpose was to wear them down with their attacks while the Ninth Firmament Enders focused on reaping their lives!","A few Enders also honed their eyes on the lone figure of a devilishly handsome man who seemed to have veiled himself in a crimson gold cocoon that even covered his crown, their attacks also going towards him as all those traveling with the Empress had to die!","This was the shocking battle blooming out.","But even as this occurred in this enclosed domain where no beings should know what was happening, there were three pairs of eyes watching from an entirely separate Dimension of space.","Three pairs of eyes that ignored everything else and focused on the figure of a curvaceous robust Empress Genevieve with her dark hair sparkling with power, the golden wrappings around her tinted red from the seas of blood that were being released from the calling crimson gold skull she stroked!","The three hidden beings watching from the veils of a Mirror Reality were the Dimensional Archaic Devil Bird whose revolving eyes kept their presence in the Mirror Reality active, a Nine Reality Horned Unicorn that had a sharp horn shining with incandescent waves of stellar Cosmos and eyes that emanated immense holiness, and a winged golden eye burning with flames that was the Eclipsing Celestial Void Eye.","The Dimensional Archaic Devil Bird shone with tremendous brutality as its voice echoed out.","\"It is a vile Remnant Disaster that has already begun to reclaim its possessions...we cannot let it get any more powerful!\"","WAA!","The Dimensional Archaic Devil Bird locked its luminous eyes with the cackling skull in the hands of the Empress as its two powerful compatriots nodded, the Eclipsing Celestial Void Eye shining with destiny as its voice also echoed out.","\"We can uncover any other TABOO possessions this Remnant Disaster has hidden away after we split apart her Origin.\"","...!","A voice full of confidence and regality.","Eyes that looked at the scenes playing out without an ounce of worry!","These three beings were entirely confident in what they had to do even as they stared at the terrible power being shown below...because even a single one of them was letting out a unique aura more powerful than even all 9 Ninth Firmament Enders that were currently besieging Empress Genevieve!","—","Kainos Primordial Mesenchymal Cells! An Evolvable Quasi-Venerable Bloodline! Ruined Sanguine Eyes of Ascendancy!","Too many vibrant things rained down in a glorious fashion as it didn't even seem halfway there, the prompts still following closely within Noah's mind.","<Through the activation of any Ascendancy Halo put together by Sanguine Aggregation, the Ruined Sanguine Eye of Ascendancy is capable of releasing the inviolable Sanguine Authority of the Kainos Era that can take control of the Ascendancy Halos of other existences.>","BOOOM!","A shocking prompt of information flowed down as Noah wasn't given any breaks!","<Under the Ruined Sanguine Eye of Ascendancy, multiple authorities of Quasi-TABOO Nomological Edicts have to be utilized if they wish to resist the control of the Will of a Kainos Emperor. If a vast gulf exists in the strength of the Soul, even dozens of Quasi-TABOO Nomological Edicts would not be capable of stopping the will of a Kainos Emperor.>","...!","Control!","Apocalypse allowed Noah to destroy other beings' Ascendancy Halos as he could cause irreparable damage to their very concepts, while the Tyrannical Emperor allowed Noah to deactivate their Ascendancy Halos! Now, Noah could actually control them under the Authority of the Ruined Sanguine Eye of Ascendancy as he could effectively cause the Halos of others to release attacks against the very beings that forged them or their allies.","This was how ridiculous things were getting! And there was still more to come as other enhancements of the Sanguine Emperor continued!","<The Ultimate Ability Sanguine Aggregation is elevated to the extent that it now allows for the seamless fusion of 60 Flames of Nomological Edicts into a single Ascendancy Halo.>","\"...\"","THUMP!","Noah could feel the beat of his newly forged Heart as it felt like everything came to a stop.","As stellar bones, organs, and musculature fully bloomed within his body to grant him a stupendous rebirth...he was given a fantastical surprise that would pave way to utterly shocking possibilities!","60 Flames of Edicts into a single Halo of Ascendancy! Such a number would put Noah at 600 Nomological Edicts in his 10 Ascendancy Halos as any remaining Insuperable and Quasi-Insuperable Nomological Edicts he was saving in the Soul Library could all be implemented into his Halos so long as his soul could handle it.","But after Noah did this, the number of Concepts he had in his Halos would be so far ahead that it would even beat normal Ninth Firmament Existences who had already forged 30 Ascendancy Halos!"]},{"number":1611,"title":"Chapter 1611: Chapter 1610 An lllusory Crown Solidifies! lll","paragraphs":["Chapter 1610 An lllusory Crown Solidifies! lll","THUMP!","After the shocking new reality of him being capable of putting 60 Flames of Edicts into a single Ascendancy Halo, the reformation of his body and surprises of the now Quasi-TABOO Nomological Edict of the Sanguine Emperor seemed to be nearing their end.","THUMP!","The beat of his reformed heart was strong as his new body shone with cascading lights, his entire form seeming like it was made up of innumerable crimson gold Cosmos as his hair that had once more changed adopted streaks of stellar strands tainted with crimson, gold, and black colors as even these strands of hair also held minute illusory Cosmos sprinkled throughout!","His entire main body quite literally looked cosmic as his True Sanguine Clones could take on many other forms and have human skins or the skins of other Bloodlines- but his main body would remain the same!","It floated in the Cosmic Holy Land while being showered with liquefied golden essence all around him due to the continued fusion of Prime Realities into the Infinite Reality, yet another prompt that dealt with the Sanguine Emperor flowing through his mind as his transformation neared its end.","<The Ultimate Ability Bloodline Extraction has been changed to Hematopoietic Progenitor, an ability that can replicate the Bloodlines of others as if they were your very own so long as you obtain a sample of their Blood. From its elevation, even the Bloodlines of past and future Emperors of the Olden Era or Kainos Era can now be replicated and forged within your Origin so long as you obtain a sample. Each cast of Hematopoietic Progenitor to replicate an Olden Bloodline or a Kainos Bloodline required 20,000 Units of the Essence of Reality and 1 Trillion Units of Mana...>","The robust prompts and information about the elevation of the Sanguine Emperor stopped here with a last feature that was truly domineering!","It opened up many possible pathways as with it, Noah had the chance to play around with the Olden and Kainos Emperor Bloodlines of the beings he came across...if he could obtain a sample of their blood that is.","Many ideas crossed his mind as above his head, his illusory crown shockingly fully solidified as his reformation was completed.","OOOM!","<The Unnamed Quasi-Venerable Bloodline of the Kainos Era has been born. At your own discretion, you can choose the name of this Kainos Bloodline that best signifies what you stand for.>","...!","His surroundings buzzed with fervor and an austere aura of serenity and recognition as right after his illusory crown solidified, it began to be surrounded by crimson gold Runic Ecritures that rotated around it with shocking majesty!","As for Noah himself...his body felt limitless waves of power coursing through him as his Ascendancy Value continued to rise crazily, and it was about to shoot up even higher as he felt the buzzing of the Essence of Reality around him.","<An Astounding Achievement! You have managed to forge a Kainos Emperor Bloodline and solidified your candidacy as one of the Emperors striving for Hegemony in the coming Era!>","WAA!","Near his body, spatial cracks that had just healed were ripped apart once more as Essence of Reality gushed out, sinking into Noah's body and filling him up as if he was a dry desert!","<Your Maximum Reserves of the Essence of Reality have been increased by 50,000 due to your increased Affinity to the Infinite Realities and solidified destiny as an Emperor in the coming Era.>","...!","The concept of Affinity rose up once more as it related to the very natural laws of the vast Infinite Realities spread out across space time- and one must not confuse this with Noah's own Infinite Reality.","His Limitation of Maximum Reserves of the Essence of Reality were entirely torn apart and shredded due to his increased Affinity as the value had reached 15,000 during his power up, and now it became 65,000 as it was nearly five times its past Value! All of this...just from Noah solidifying his candidacy as an Emperor of the coming Era by obtaining its Bloodline!","And the unique thing about it all was that Noah could name his Bloodline just like how in the Olden Times, the Olden Emperor of Arcadian Tyranny had termed himself Arcadian only after he had established his path and knew himself.","Noah could choose to give himself his name at this very moment or days or years down the line as for now...","\"There is no rush.\"","WAA!","His voice came out as it sounded utterly mesmerizing, the mere opening of his mouth shooting out bountiful stellar essence as if any beings were near him, they would feel their origin and soul nourished from the sheer essence Noah released at this moment!","A stupendous stellar Dual Empowered Body, Origin, and Soul was achieved as his new Bloodline that took aspects of all his current Bloodlines and fused them finally rose before his mind in a crimson gold boxed prompt.","QUASI-VENERABLE <Unnamed Kainos Emperor Bloodline> :: An evolvable Bloodline that has cemented its qualifications as a Candidate Emperor in the coming Kainos Era. It is currently unnamed until its Progenitor chooses what best signifies him, with his nature being that of immense kindness to his loved ones and utter coldness towards his enemies. His very soul has an unquenchable need for the exploration of the unknown, as well as the search for a level of strength and power that no other beings could rival. An immensely Tyrannical nature is budding with his very Origin as he seeks to achieve his wishes no matter what stands against him, with the only path for those standing against him being Fealty or Death. As this Bloodline is made up uniquely of many aspects of Bloodlines that the Progenitor currently holds, abilities unique and geared for him have been unlocked as they include <Destined Physique>, <Limit Breaking Mana Refinement>, <Throne of Unnamed Tyranny>, <Cosmic Lineage>, <Bloodline Assimilator>, <Loot Emperor>, and <Eyes of a Kainos Emperor>. These are preliminary abilities as the chance to unlock more lie in the actions of the Progenitor of this Bloodline- the elevation to a Venerable Bloodline or even higher being possible through the inclusion of more Bloodlines into this evolvable Kainos Emperor Bloodline...","...!"]},{"number":1612,"title":"Chapter 1612: Chapter 1611 Quasi-Venerable!","paragraphs":["Chapter 1611 Quasi-Venerable!","Noah's newly unlocked Bloodline that was cemented in his Lineage came with truly too many things!","Each of them had wonders of their own, but this Quasi-Venerable Bloodline still stood a chance of becoming Venerable and even possibly going higher- a ceiling that Noah did not even know what came after!","The abilities that came with this Quasi-Venerable Bloodline were many, but Noah quickly skimmed over them as his eyes lit up when he focused on a single one- his time being extremely limited at this moment even with his thoughts processing rapidly while in the Cosmic Holy Land.","The battle was unfolding in the locked down domain as his True Sanguine Clone had to soon make a move, and Noah felt his preparations were already as overboard as they could be at this moment!","This was because after his increased Affinity granted him 65,000 total Maximum Reserves of the Essence of Reality, his reformed body allowing him to feel an endless sense of strength that was actually explained in the <Destined Physique> under his new Quasi-Venerable Bloodline, and also his elevation of just everything about him with Empowerment, Corrupting his concepts, and forming multiple new Quasi-TABOO Nomological Edicts...it brought his Ascendancy Value to 100,000,000!","The peak of the Seventh Firmament.","The barrier...that could not be broken until someone tore apart the shackles placed on them by the natural laws of the Infinite Realities themselves by forming Reality Passages!","Noah had reached 100 Million as he finished forging the Quasi-TABOO Nomological Edict of the Sanguine Emperor as it should have increased even more when he was blessed with increased Essence of Reality and from the completion of his Unnamed Kainos Emperor Bloodline- but this 100 million did not move an inch or even budge!","Even though Noah knew he was stronger than this. Even though he should have gone past this number, his system respected the significance of the shackles imposed upon by the Infinite Realities it was a part of as it didn't even try to estimate how much higher Noah's value would be until this barrier was broken.","The day that Noah broke past his shackles and forged his Reality Passages would be the day that his Ascendancy Value would change once more as until then- it would only be seen as a barrier!","Noah was bound to break this barrier as he already knew a shocking truth.","The truth that he...was capable of achieving power equivalent to the Eighth Firmament of Ascendancy and possibly even the Ninth Firmament of Ascendancy without having to break through the limits and forge his Reality Passages!","That he could exceed all known parameters and continue to exceed them in such a Tyrannical manner that when he did forge his Reality Passages...ah, it would be a sight that might even cause Legends to tremble at its majesty.","He could rival weak Eighth Firmament existences with a single Reality Passage before he even began upgrading his Edicts to Quasi-TABOO and unlocking full Olden and Kainos Emperor Bloodlines. After the round of power ups that he just went through...was he already capable of trashing Eighth Firmament existences that had forged two or three Reality Passages?","As he continued to exceed all limits, one must not forget that he had yet to forge his Limit Breaking Extreme Physiques that he could actually get from multiple concepts- with Apocalypse giving him a method of swallowing Realities to achieve an Extreme Physique, and the Tyrannical Emperor that gave way to the Olden Bloodline of the Arcadian Tyrant allowing Noah to forge another Extreme Physique from the blood and Bloodlines of Eighth Firmament Existences!","Now, there was yet another Extreme Physique from an ability under the Unnamed Kainos Emperor Bloodline that Noah would focus on now as one of the few last things he would do before his True Sanguine Clone made a move.","<Limit Breaking Mana Refinement> :: Mana is one of the major concepts that signify the Progenitor of the Unnamed Kainos Emperor Bloodline, and this ability conforms to that principle as it allows you to refine your Origin, Body, and Soul with pure Mana and Essence of Reality to achieve the Limit Breaking Extreme Mana Physique. To achieve a Limit Breaking Extreme Physique through sheer mana usage, extreme amounts of Mana are required as a single round of refinement required 100 Trillion Units of Mana and 10,000 Units of the Essence of Reality. During the first round of Refinement, the physique of the Unnamed Kainos Emperor will begin to be branded by Runic Mana Lines of Ascendancy, with any other previous Runic Lines like Dao Lines being elevated to become Runic Mana Lines of Ascendancy as their boosts are tenfold. The Runic Mana Lines of Ascendancy go towards constantly strengthening and reinforcing the Origin, Body, and Soul of the Progenitor as this is one of the strongest Limit Breaking Extreme Physiques one could attain for the sake of forming numerous Reality Passages. The number of possible Reality Passages that this physique could contribute is unknown as it can only be realized during its completion. Current progression of the Limit Breaking Extreme Mana Physique- 0%>","...!","100 Trillion Units of Mana and 10,000 Units of the Essence of Reality to cast this ability!","In comparison, even casting the newly unlocked <Hematopoietic Progenitor> ability that could replicate Olden and Kainos Emperor Bloodlines only required 1 Trillion Units of Mana and 20,000 Units of the Essence of Reality.","And yet...this ability was truly stupendous as it was one that was geared towards something only Noah could utilize in crazy amounts- Mana!","All of the abilities under his Kainos Emperor Bloodline were geared toward Noah's nature like this as even though the other abilities were yet to be fully explored, what Noah had at this moment was more than enough.","His preparations were already in place.","The only thing he had left to do was to make his move as to obtain the largest number and quality of Loot possible...he just had to do the last preparation of elevating the Nomological Edict of the Resplendent Treasure Emperor!","\"We can begin...\"","OOOM!","As a Path to Victory already formed in his mind, Noah got ready to make three moves simultaneously. One was the elevation of the Resplendent Treasure Emperor as he waited for more True Stars of Conquest to arrive from the remaining Prime Realities that were still fusing with his Infinite Reality, the other being his True Sanguine Clone breaking out of its crimson gold cocoon and making a move in a shocking domain of battle, and the last thing was....","\"<Limit Breaking Mana Refinement>.\"","RUMBLE!","Noah pulled upon 100 Trillion Units of Mana and the barely replenished reserves of Essence of Reality to call out 10,000 Units, the maddening color of cerulean blue mana beginning to surround his body as the faint Runic Dao Lines on his crimson gold Cosmic form began to be tinted a beautiful blue!","The first refinement to obtain a Limit Breaking Extreme Physique began at this moment.","At the same time, in the enclosed domain under restrictions by Enders...the aura of a neglected Seventh Firmament Clone began to rise as the already shocking battle was about to turn utterly chaotic!"]},{"number":1613,"title":"Chapter 1613: Chapter 1612 An Emperor of the Kainos EraMakes an Entrance! l","paragraphs":["Chapter 1612 An Emperor of the Kainos EraMakes an Entrance! l","\"For you to even dare!\"","OOOM!","The wrathful voice of Empress Genevieve rang out as her dark hair flew around madly, her hands sinking into the crimson skull she called MADNESS as it seemed to have become extremely energized in the last microsecond, beginning to enlarge crazily as crimson tendrils of blood continued to shoot out from it and surge towards 4 Ninth Firmament Enders that actually evaded them.","This was an extremely shocking scenario as Empress Genevieve still gave waves of power at the Eighth Firmament, and yet she held back 4 beings a stage above her for no other reason than the fact that the essence contained in the tendrils of blood being shot out from MADNESS...they held a poisonous type of essence that affected everything below the rank of Reality heavily!","Items such as MADNESS were termed TABOO as normally...only Legends were able to get their hands on them and utilize them!","If a Ninth Firmament existence even obtained one, they wouldn't have the unique types of methods or essence to activate them. Not unless you were extremely special.","Or in Empress Genevieve's case...if you were already an owner of such an item as its essence fully recognized and had yielded to you eons ago!","\"Remember why we are here! Do not fall back!\"","OOOM!","The voice from the brilliantly shining White Dragon Ender facing an enlarged buffed Pure-Blooded Cardinal Royal Human echoed out as the obsidian Scorpion and other Enders had their eyes shine with a red glint, their essence weaving in shocking ways as with slight hesitation...they made their way towards Empress Genevieve while trying their best to evade the countess tendrils of blood shooting out from the cackling skull near her.","Empress Genevieve watched this scene coldly as 30 brilliant gold Ascendancy Halos rotated around her body madly, her eyes releasing scintillating light as she seemed to have full control of the ongoing situation and wasn't the least bit flustered at such a shocking attack where they shouldn't have any chance of surviving! But as she was about to make another decisive move...","\"Huh?\"","Her brows fluttered as her eyes snapped wide open, her awareness widening to focus towards a certain location!","BZZZT!","It wasn't just her, but all existences in the surrounding light year felt something unique that caused their very souls to feel a reaction- and this reaction varied depending on their level of power!","Empress Genevieve only felt it as her brows fluttered, while the bodies of the Ninth Firmament Enders and Pure-Blooded Cardinal Royal Humans shook briefly, the Eighth Firmament Enders shockingly going on to actually tremble!","As for the hundreds of Seventh Firmament Primordial Beasts...their souls shuddered as they and everyone else in the surroundings momentarily halted in their attacks as if their wills were forcefully pulled towards a certain being.","A being that many of them ignored and simply waited for him to perish amidst the attacks...they finally noticed that this being had a crimson gold cocoon enveloping him as at this moment, this cocoon broke and released the shocking aura that was felt by everyone!","The figure released from the cocoon was glorious to see, the sight of a stellar Cosmic being whose entire body was littered with billions of Cosmos painted with a crimson gold hue revealing itself in a shocking manner as the transformation of Noah's body and soul was present and displayed on all of his Clones!","Faint lines of blue could also be seen flashing over his body as this wasn't the sight that caused the hearts of Seventh Firmament Enders to shudder! It was the sight and aura of a solidified crown rotating above the head of this being that sparked pristine Runic Ecritures to float around it- this solidified crown was what caused the very blood of Seventh Firmament beings to shudder fearfully while Eighth Firmament beings only trembled...and even those at the Ninth Firmament felt the overbearing and inexplicable aura that could enamored one's soul.","Others might not be able to understand what a solid spinning crown atop the head of someone meant.","Others might have only heard it in legends.","But those around this locked domain...were all powerful existences as the highest ones knew a great deal about history!","This was especially so for those who had lived history!","\"Impossible...\"","WAAA!","The resonant voice of the Empress could be heard as for the first time, her gaze wasn't utterly cold, smiling, or domineering as she displayed a light sense of shock on her face.","\"This...!\" Beatrix's body that had fused with her Ascendancy Halo released waves of light as her very Origin trembled- her gaze also locked onto the solidified crown as she understood what it represented!","The Ninth Firmament Enders looked on in stupor as the calm and collected pure White Dragon Ender was actually the one to spill waves of oil into the fire- its majestic voice resonating out loud in measured shock.","\"A Candidate Emperor for the current Age of Emperors!\"","RUUUUMBLE!","As if a nuclear bomb had exploded.","The Seventh Firmament Enders that hadn't fully understood trembled as their eyes could not pull away from Noah's exceedingly cosmic figure. All the other beings trembled at such a reality as nobody had expected to come across a genuine Emperor that was qualified to toil for Hegemony in the ushered Age of Emperors!","\"...!\"","Looks of alarm and shock.","Eyes that opened wide with disbelief.","Eyes that stared incredulously as in a short period of time...these eyes began to change as shockingly, greed actually appeared on every single pair of eyes from the Ninth Firmament Enders!","Even the Pure-Blooded Cardinal Royal Humans looked towards Noah as after their gazes of shock, they began to look at him greedily as if they wanted to devour him right here!","This was because all beings that knew of the history from the Olden Times were very clear about one thing.","The Authority of an Olden Emperor that had a solidified crown and was considered as one of the genuine candidates to fight for Hegemony within that Age of Emperors could never be disrespected. If an Emperor could not protect his authority...it would be taken by whoever managed to trample upon him!","The austere position and authority of a genuine Emperor with a solidified crown...it was enough to cause even Legends who had not achieved it to make a move if a weaker existence was exceptional enough to obtain candidacy.","This...was the path of the Age of Emperors!","One could not hide their status once they obtained it, and others could steal your status so long as they killed you!"]},{"number":1614,"title":"Chapter 1614: Chapter 1613 An Emperor of the Kainos EraMakes an Entrance! ll","paragraphs":["Chapter 1613 An Emperor of the Kainos EraMakes an Entrance! ll","An existence with an average destiny could be changed overnight if they were able to take the authority of such a Candidate Emperor of any Age...so the eyes of powerful Ninth Firmament existences locked onto Noah's glorious figure with extreme focus as they momentarily forgot their current situation.","It was an extremely rare thing to come across an existence that had solidified their crown and become a Candidate Emperor for that Era. It was even rarer for that existence to be something so weak as at the Seventh Firmament!","So when everyone ascertained Noah's power, even against the unique palpating aura he gave off...","BZZZZT!","Essence crackled and burst as their powerful auras burst forth like a broken dam.","Powerful auras of the Ninth Firmament experts that were undoubtedly more decisive than anybody else began to move while ignoring everything else- all going towards a single stellar existence who held a solidified crown rotating above him with austere power!","Wisps of nine lights shone like dazzling rivers as the white Dragon Ender that was further away was shockingly the fastest, being a mere white light that tore across spacetime!","The situation became clear to all.","The eyes of Empress Genevieve shone with murderous coldness as she couldn't help but release an expletive as she moved instantly, her fair hands smashing onto the crimson skull as they caused an enormous crack to spread- the skull releasing even more maddening tendrils of bloody light to cover everything!","\"Fuck!\"","Her figure flashed as since she was already near him, she arrived and stood before Noah mesmerizingly as the color of her Halos caused the surroundings to brighten up and show Noah's visage even more.","When one looked at him now, they would notice exceeding coldness and tyranny as even while Ninth Firmament Tyrants thundered toward his direction- he was not flustered or nervous!","He watched the figure of Empress Genevieve appear before him as if he had known this was what would happen, his stellar eyes actually ignoring the Ninth Firmament Enders as he looked at the dozens at the Eighth Firmament and hundreds at the Seventh Firmament.","Thereafter, the shocking visage of Ascendancy Halos bloomed from him while Empress Genevieve had a stern expression that seemed to be conflicting with herself, her voice echoing out with shocking authority and wrath as she made her stand clear.","\"This...is mine!\"","WAA!","Mine.","The Empress declared as such for an existence as if he was a mere tool that she already possessed!","A tool that no others should even dare to get their hands on!","—-","Genevieve's chest rose and fell in calm waves.","Her luminous eyes captured everything as her robust aged soul saw all moving figures as if they were stuck in a quagmire when they moved across space- with only her eyes across this entire battlefield being able to see the astounding amount of shackles that weaved around every single being.","Limitations and restrictions imposed by the vast Realities themselves until they broke them by entering the realm of Reality!","Only her eyes could see such a unique scene as she had broken these shackles before.","She had a goal to break them again soon as her plans were immeasurably deep and unfathomable, accounting for everything around her as with her knowledge- it was only a matter of time!","Then, a certain variable appeared that she merely added on to her plans as another being for her to devour to achieve what she wanted.","Yet now...this variable revealed itself to be even more valuable as it had already achieved candidacy on the path of Emperors of this Era! A solidified crown that she had nearly forgotten the visage of as she herself held one similar to it eons ago!","But she lost her qualifications.","She had not been able to reclaim it as other beings had fought for the Hegemony in the Olden Age of Emperors until a single one came out on top.","The Emperor to prevail at that time...his will was too tyrannical as their current situation was all attributed to the actions he took after he gained his undeniable authority!","Genevieve wanted to claim such an authority in this Era.","She was confident in solidifying her own crown and obtaining candidacy as soon as she began unlocking her past TABOO Nomological Edicts, so she wasn't worried about this! But if she could swallow another existence with a solidified crown as well...","'What this Empress claims as hers...nobody can have any designs on it!'","BZZZT!","Such were her thoughts as she appeared in front of the stellar looking Enlightened Peerless Alchemist.","She didn't make a move to kill him as she knew the current body here was merely a Clone, and killing would merely grant a minuscule portion of his authority as this didn't mean much to her! So she would protect what was hers now as when she locked down where his main body was...she would then eat everything up!","'Then...I'll break a few more shackles.'","RUMBLE!","Her will was utterly domineering as against the surging auras of Nine Ninth Firmament Enders surging towards her and the being behind her, she moved her fair hands to grasp around invisible multicolored chains that only her eyes could see around everyone.","CRACK!","With purpose, she began breaking these chains as every time she did it, her luminous eyes lost a small amount of luster as she hid the immense pain she was feeling- only showing an exceedingly cold expression!","CRACK!","As she broke the chains, her aura began to rise as it instantly spilled from the Eighth Firmament and into the Ninth Firmament of Ascendancy, and it only continued to rise higher!","HOOOWL!","Turbulent waves of essence surged around her as her fair body began to swirl with multicolored light, the illusory Reality Passages on her back spinning even faster and surging with essence as she gazed with murderous coldness towards her coming enemies while voicing out.","\"Let me show you power.\"","...!","As she said this, her body began to enlarge, her aura continuing to climb up the Ninth Firmament as she seemed like an unshakable post that nobody would ever be capable of bringing down!","She made a move as at this moment, dazzling multicolored lotuses began to bloom one after another as they grinded out with devilish fervor.","Ridiculously, the existence behind her also made a move as Genevieve's awareness became even more focused on him as this being had erupted with 10 Golden Ascendancy Halos!","'You little shit...'","10 Golden Ascendancy Halos that showed this being had been hiding himself deeply, with the shocking thing being the terrifying crimson gold eyes that were regally seen on all of these Halos!","He cared not for the powerful enemies coming towards him as he seemingly didn't put the Ninth and Eighth Firmament Enders in his eyes- focusing on the trembling Seventh Firmament Enders who seemed most affected by his authority as his cosmic eyes glared at them with undeniable authority.","Like an Emperor gazing at his subjects, his solidified crown spun while his golden Ascendancy Halos spread out with a terrifying will...his voice coming out mesmerizingly as he laid down a command!","\"Break.\"","...!","The Unnamed Kainos Emperor gave a command as the fused and unfused Ascendancy Halos of hundreds of Seventh Firmament Enders shuddered, a shocking scene blooming out at this moment that any beings who would come out of this event alive would never forget it!"]},{"number":1615,"title":"Chapter 1615: Chapter 1614 Utterly Trampling SeventhFirmament Enders! l","paragraphs":["Chapter 1614 Utterly Trampling SeventhFirmament Enders! l","The present and very real threats of genuine Ninth Firmament existences did not even appear in my mind.","This was because after a sufficient period of time, I had learned to instinctively trust the indications of destiny as at this moment, they told me I could focus on the Little Enders at the Seventh and Eighth Firmament without worry!","So I didn't question it when Genevieve appeared in front of me and this past Olden Emperor so easily shifted from the Eighth Firmament and into the Ninth while protecting me from the most powerful Enders, my focus only remaining on the culmination of what I had been powering up for this whole time.","As a solidified crown shimmering with crimson, gold, and blue colors rotated above me, it washed down a unique essence that caused an exhilarating feeling to permeate through every single cell in my body.","As the sheer power and uniqueness of the newly formed Unnamed Kainos Emperor Bloodline was replicated in the body of this True Sanguine Clone, torrential waves of mana and all the other essences I had now turned Infinite surged through every single cell as the exhilarating feeling of unstoppable power they gave...this was what I sought for the most!","BOOOM!","A stellar explosive light shattered in a portion of my Origin, a concept that was hidden there shining with a pristine white light as it was the indication that the Resplendent Treasure Emperor had been Dual Empowered with the True Stars of Conquest.","Prompts of information crossed through my soul about the elevated percentages of Increased Loot Quantity and Quality. A prompt that the maximum number of times that Resplendent Treasure Cache could be used had been increased from 4 to 6!","There were even more fantastical bouts of information, but my focus remained on the trembling Seventh Firmament Enders before me that from my sheer aura alone...they were afraid!","As 10 Golden Ascendancy Halos undulated over my body, their Ruined Eyes of Ascendancy vibrated as their authority painted over 327 Seventh Firmament Enders exactly, the feedback that my own soul received being that these powerful existences...I could do what I wished with them as not a single one could deny my authority at this moment.","Not a single one could deny the elevated concepts of Apocalypse, Tyrannical Emperor, or Sanguine Emperor as while being urged by the budding light of authority- by the budding will of an Emperor that I was only truly learning about ever so slightly...I laid out a command.","\"Break.\"","...!","BZZZZT....CRACK!","327 Seventh Firmament existences.","Whether they were fused with their Ascendancy Halos or not, each one came to a stop as from their eyes, I could see their fear from my mere authority turn very real as shockingly- their vibrant Ascendancy Halos fractured simultaneously!","BOOOOM!","Billowing waves of essence echoed out as the authority of the Ruined Eyes of Ascendancy had painted over all of their Halos and simply told them to break, and these Halos that did not contain any QUASI-TABOO concepts could do nothing but follow these words as on 327 Primordial Beasts, shining rings of light broke as the Origin and souls of these existences faced immense injury!","These powerful existences that I could not even raise my eyes to days ago had their hearts quivering and their eyes looking at me in shock and horror, the budding will of tyranny within me reacting with fervor as the more powerful the beings I could gaze down to and dominate, the more powerful this will became!","The authority of the Unnamed Kainos Emperor Bloodline had even spread to the nearby Eighth Firmament of Ascendancy as from them, I could also begin to smell the scent of shock and fear as these beings were asking themselves whether what I just did to the Enders was something that they could defend against.","The answer to that...would be ascertained very soon!","\"You little...!\"​","Genevieve's awareness was wrapped around this location as her eyes released bursts of anger, but I simply ignored this once more as destiny locked my focus onto my prey.","My prey that at this moment, they weren't just 327 Enders of Reality- but a representation of 49,050 Flames of Nomological Edicts.","Each one held 10 Ascendancy Halos that contained 15 Flames of Edicts as when these beings fell, all of these concepts would land under me as the strongest Insuperable Nomological Edicts among them would go towards filling up the remaining slots under my 600 Flames of Edicts limit of my very own Ascendancy Halos!","BZZZT!","My body coursed with more and more Essence as while watching the shocked and pained expressions of Enders while they stared at their broken Ascendancy Halos, the budding will within my Origin unconsciously waved over me as I tapped the solidified crown above me while calling out.","\"Throne of Unnamed Tyranny.\"","WAA!","Glorious waves of mana and Essence of Reality burst forth as a throne made from these stellar resources formed behind me.","Grand and striking, the throne was not illusory as it seemed very real- its surfaces lined up with countless willing Runic Ecritures as it gave off undeniable waves of authority! The cerulean blue of mana to represent me covered a large portion of it, the multicolored hue of the Essence of Reality covering the rest as it caused the surroundings to brighten up due to its sheer light.","My body went to naturally sit upon this throne as for these beings before me...I did not even need to stand!","These weren't just the actions I wanted to take, but it was the manner that the budding will of an Emperor within me implied I should be acting in.","To emulate a true Emperor after I had solidified my candidacy in the coming Age of Emperors!","BOOM!","The throne of a Kainos Bloodline connected with me as what I can only assume to be pure majesty shot out, even Genevieve's angered figure shifting in front of my eyes as while surrounded by powerful enemies- I was the only one comfortably sitting upon a throne!","Thereafter, it was time for me to collect my loot from enemies that I had already destroyed the wills of as my Ruined Sanguine Eyes of Ascendancy flashed 327 times in an instant.","I could degrade their Edicts and very souls or even break them under Apocalypse and the Tyrannical Emperor. I could also control their very Edicts they held so dearly as at this moment, the pieces of broken Ascendancy Halos that caused them so much pain flashed.","The Flames within these Halos they had forged over the millions of years came to life as they actually pulled upon the remaining dredges of Essence of Reality either the very bodies of these Seventh Firmament Enders and activated their strongest ultimate skills!","Bolstered by the very authority of my Ruined Sanguine Eyes of Ascendancy and the essence of my Quasi-TABOO Nomological Edicts that these eyes were activated through- a shocking attack that these Enders could never manage to dish out erupted as the target of these attacks were their very own Origins and souls!","Ah!","Can you imagine that?","The very concepts you had forged for millions of years turning their back against you as at your final moments, you received an attack you could not even defend against as your own Flames of Edicts and concepts battered your origin and soul!","BOOM! BOOM!","Stellar waves of light exploded out as without question, every single Seventh Firmament Ender had their Origins battered and ruined beyond repair.","My concepts were already tightly wrapped around their authority as the Essence of Apocalypse that could entirely and completely erase their souls across the spacetime Continuum was the concept to wash over them in their last moments, the newly Empowered essence of the Resplendent Treasure Emperor shining with an austere golden light as beams of Loot and thousands of Flames of Edicts erupted at this moment!"]},{"number":1616,"title":"Chapter 1616: Chapter 1615 Utterly Trampling SeventhFirmament Enders! ll","paragraphs":["Chapter 1615 Utterly Trampling SeventhFirmament Enders! ll","Loot.","Something that out of the many changing constants in my life- it would remain the one thing that I would always marvel at!","As 327 Origins of Seventh Firmament existences were ended due to me simply calling for it with my authority, the origins and souls of these beings were looted as all their achievements were turned to me with some of them magnified by multiple factors.","The golden boxes of Loot prompts rained over my luminous eyes as I could already feel my Expansive Space filled with dazzling splendor!","[+6,937,200 Cosmic Filament Cores obtained...] DING! The effects of Loot Multiplier are applied...[+693,720 Shards of a Seed of Reality are obtained.]","\"...\"","Was it something unexpected? Maybe not, but it was still utterly unbelievable!","693,720 Shards of a Seed of Reality!","When I took out the Gazer and Seventh Firmament Wolf Guard in the Forsaken Treasure Reality, I had only obtained over 4,000 Shards of a Seed of Reality from these beings that had reached the peak of the Seventh Firmament.","That alone was enough to grant me 4 Billion Cosmos as every single shard gave 1 Million!","But the numbers popping up now were utterly preposterous as they represented 693 Billion Cosmos.","Enough for anyone to attain the requirements to step upon the folds of Reality 6 times over!","This...was what I attained from this Nexus Event that was only beginning.","If it wasn't for the restrictions binding me right now to only 10 Billion Cosmos, achieving one of the conditions of Reality could already be considered to be in place!","But the limitations imposed by the very vast Realties would remain until one forges their Reality Passages.","And I wasn't planning to forge mine until cultivating my body and Origin with all the different methods to achieve Limit Breaking Extreme Physiques and designing my own Modus Operandi...so I was really putting my patience to the test as the tools I needed were already there!","But I could not rush it.","The establishment of Reality Passages would lay down a road and foundation that would decide everything for the future.","I was very young. There were old monsters that had lived for eons- creatures like Genevieve who were still alive from the Olden Times.","They were dreadfully powerful as while I had a mere handful of Quasi-TABOO Nomological Edicts, this being had over 30 that could be confirmed just from looking at her Golden Halos. And this was only if every Halo represented having a single Quasi-TABOO Nomological Edict- but there could be 15 of such concepts in every Halo as that was even more dreadful to think about!","Such were the beings I would be up against if I truly wanted the solidified authority of my Kainos Emperor Bloodline to achieve anything in the future...I had to catch up with these beings one way or another.","Exceeding all possible known limitations when it came to establishing Reality Passages...this would be something crucial to bridge the gap against beings that had lived for countless eons!","So the 693,720 Shards of a Seed of Reality would simply lie in wait for me to use as something even more fantastical was the fact that this number was one that was yet to be Quadruplicated by RUINATION.","BZZZT!","My body's essence buzzed excitedly as I couldn't help but form a smile, my eyes gazing at the lifeless bodies of Seventh Firmament Enders floating motionlessly as more golden prompts of Loot rained over my eyes.​","[+8,200,520 True Blood Pearls obtained...] DING! The effects of Loot Multiplier are applied...[+820,052 Existential Pearls are obtained.]","[+7,925,540 Runic Dao Line Enhancers obtained...] DING! The effects of Loot Multiplier are applied...[+792,554 Evolutionary Runic Lines of Ascendancy are obtained. ]","[+111,180 Trillion Skill Points obtained...] DING! The effects of Loot Multiplier are applied...[+111 Reality Resource Points obtained.]","Boundless prompts of glory spun out as the surrounding battlefield had turned exceedingly quiet.","The gazed of the Ninth and Eighth Firmament Enders were sharp as they gazed back and forth between my throne and the lifeless Seventh Firmament Enders, a sense of inexplicable dread beginning to spread in this enclosed domain!","But my eyes still focused on the prompts of Loot as the last prompt had a change from Cosmic Resource Points to Reality Resource Points that deserved a look into in its own time. I couldn't place too much thought into it now as at this moment, the addition of Edicts at a scale I had never experienced before began!","<The effects of Absolute Looter are applied.>","<The ownership of the Insuperable Nomological Edicts and Flames of the Eight Legged Emperor, Lunacy Enthronement, Instinctual Emperor, Eyeless Beast, Fate Deceiver, Cosmic Shatterer, Firmament Scaler...have been granted.>","OOOM!","Thousands of Edicts flowed in as anything Minor, Greater, and Quasi-Insuperable surged through my very soul and then they were all instantly placed in the Soul Library.","As for the Insuperable Nomological Edicts?","OOOM!","They began to sink into my 10 Ascendancy Halos as luminous rays of crimson gold light began to blast out from the Ruined Eyes of Ascendancy!","More Edicts than even what a Ninth Firmament Tyrant could hold!","And all of them were condensed into 10 Ascendancy Halos as the moment they began to fill the remaining hundreds of slots, the vibrant Ascendancy Halos began to undergo fantastical changes.","And my aura only rose higher as even though the 100 Million Ascendancy Value remained the same, my Origin felt ceaseless and unstoppable strength that should be more than enough for me to turn my eyes towards the most prized Loot on this battlefield today!","As beams of splendorous light shot forth from my Ascendancy Halos, I raised my eyes to see the oppressive auras of the 9 Ninth Firmament Enders that were almost here.","Their eyes held grim expressions as greed still overcame them, each one having released their Reality Passages while surging towards my location!","Yet I looked forward calmly as once more- there was my belief in destiny.","There was the monster from the Olden Times who was under the delusion that I was hers to claim as she had her own sense of greed, but she knew well enough that this was a mere Clone as she wouldn't receive anything if she attacked me!","So this past Emperor from the Olden Times now protected me as the battle between me and her would be decided depending on when I obtained my TABOO Nomological Edicts.","BZZZT!","Her body caused the surrounding space to tremble as it gave off a torrential aura at the Ninth Firmament, the 30 spinning Ascendancy Halos flashing around as her as they seamlessly went to sink into her body.","...!","To protect what she thought to be her possession, this monstrous existence fused with her Ascendancy Halos to attain her true form while Reality shattering attacks rained down!"]},{"number":1617,"title":"Chapter 1617: Chapter 1616 BLACK! l","paragraphs":["Chapter 1616 BLACK! l","A shocking development!","The existence that had revealed himself to be a Candidate Emperor for the coming Age of Emperors made a single move that caused all those on this battlefield to view him in an even more astounding light.","He had used the authority of his solidified crown to call out a dazzling throne that shone with an austere blue color at its core, its edges lined by multicolored light as it gave off unstoppable waves of mana!","With a single word, this being had broken the Ascendancy Halos of every single Seventh Firmament Primordial Beast as in the next moment, the terrific crimson eyes on his golden Ascendancy Halos flashed as they called forth destruction of these beings simultaneously.","Their own Halos...their very Essence turned against them as they effectively lost in a battle of wills against this Candidate Emperor and died on the spot!","Thereafter, this enthroned existence seemingly gazed over his work as if it was artistic perfection- his eyes flashing with a domineering golden light as what caused somberness to course through the backs of the Eighth Firmament Enders was the fact that they saw a smile light up devilishly on this being.","A smile that they felt signified cruelty and tyranny of the utmost degree as which type of being could smile like that after massacring over 300 Seventh Firmament existences in a mere instant?!","They didn't know what Noah was flashing this smile simply due to the abundant loot rushing into his Expansive Space.","They didn't know the Tyrannical Emperor was merely enjoying the fruits of his labor!","He prepared and powered up for what seemed like forever so that when he came to destroy his enemies- they could perish in an instant!","But even as be released this grandeur and shocking authority that even made the dozens of Eighth Firmament Enders somber, the surging lights that were the Ninth Firmament Tyrants actually surged down even faster as the Essence of Reality wrapped around their bodies to unleash attacks capable of folding and twisting the very Reality itself.","They sped up even faster as Noah's actions only further showed just what stupendous power and authority a Candidate Emperor of the Age of Emperors could wield- where an existence at the Seventh Firmament of Ascendancy could obliterate hundreds of those in the same stage without barring an eye!","They wanted such a Bloodline.","They wanted such an authority as the assassination of Empress Genevieve actually took a back seat!","The mission of one's race and Bloodline was important....but was it more important than the seeking of Reality? These beings that had lived for millions of years answered this question as they put aside their mission to try and capture something for their own gain.","But...someone else was there who already considered herself to have laid claim to this as while her cackling crimson gold skull maddeningly surged with boundless tendrils of blood, her golden Halos surged into her body as she went to take on what should have been her True Form.","But halfway there as an aurora of Resplendent wings of light began to emerge from her back while she enlarged, her incandescent hands reached out to grasp tightly onto the cackling skull as thereafter...its crimson light began to merge with her as it eventually fused!","....!","THUMP!","Everyone's soul skipped a beat as they saw the shocking scene of an Item at the level of TABOO actually merging with a living existence.","Even the regal enthroned Unnamed Kainos Emperor's eyes flashed as his throne leaked seas of Mana with his eyes rising up in slight surprise!","BOOOM!","A storm of essence burst and surrounded the figure of Genevieve as pure madness leaked from her, the visage she took on being displayed in a shocking fashion as she enlarged to be bigger than all other beings here. Her form...it was utterly serene and in no way matched her demeanor as everyone's eyes locked onto a black and white furred magisterial creature that was dazzling with profound light.","Pairs of aurora wings erupted from its back as an enlarged illusory crown spun above it, its head filled with crimson gold fur unlike the black and white of its whole body as three regal furred tails waved majestically behind it!","Floating on its four glorious beastial furred legs, the head of this creature was the most shocking as two crimson gold skull horns erupted from its sides that weaved together to form the Runic Ecriture that meant <MADNESS>.","The face seemed like a mixture of a lioness and dragon as the most striking thing about it was its eyes. Exceedingly large eyes for its face as they shone of a stellar endless river within each of them- immense wrath being felt within as these eyes flashed out with a glorious and unstoppable light.","An endless river of star light that divided into nine rivers that surged towards every single Ninth Firmament Ender- the very Reality being pierced and torn as the impact was disastrous!","BOOOOM!","Billowing spatial storms rose as the Pure-Blooded Cardinal Royal Humans looked towards Empress Genevieve in shock and confusion.","Her True Form was not that of a Pure-Blooded Cardinal Royal Human. It was instead of an unknown species of a beast that shone with unbound majesty as they found themselves questioning if they were seeing properly!","\"What are you fools doing?! Aid the Empress!\"","...!","It was only Beatrix's voice that shook them out of their stupor as they moved to block and oppress the beastial Enders that had their eyes shining with a light fall of unbound greed.","A light that the Pure-Blooded Cardinal Royal Human Guards tried to repress as one could see the Ninth Firmament middle aged Pure-Blooded Royal Human gaze at Noah in the corner of his eyes with a cold glint!","Yet the Kainos Emperor on his throne had only given his few microseconds to the true form of Genevieve before he even turned his eyes elsewhere- not paying attention to any of them as his Ascendancy Halos vibrated and spun around him while releasing beams of multicolored light.","The oppressive air he released seemed to be condensing as his surroundings twisted and churned, and this was because hundreds of Flames of Edicts were being pumped into the mere 10 Ascendancy Halos as they pulsed with shocking might that didn't seem to be capable of being held in!","CRACK!","A sound akin to glass shattering echoed out once.","CRACK!","Then for a second time, and then a third...until it reached the tenth!","The 10 golden Ascendancy Halos could not withstand the sheer amount of Concepts within them as...","<The number of Concepts within a single Ascendancy Halo has exceeded established limits and parameters as a higher tier of Halo is required to contain them.>","...!","<You have reached the Boundary of the Tier of a Halo of Ascendancy only accessible with the inclusion of the Flames of a TABOO Nomological Edict.>","WAA!"]},{"number":1618,"title":"Chapter 1618: Chapter 1617 BLACK! ll","paragraphs":["Chapter 1617 BLACK! ll","In the hidden folds of space veiled by a Mirror Reality.","\"...do you guys have a record of that one?\"","The Nine Reality Horned Unicorn had its horn releasing multicolored light as it spoke lightly while watching the black and white furred beastial form that a certain being had taken. The pairs of aurora wings on its back and the crimson gold demonic horns twisting to write MADNESS took their attention as no matter how one looked at it- they couldn't find out its species! Even its head seemed like a mixture of a lioness and a dragon as its eyes of brutality shone with a stellar light!","\"If it is just a mixed blood Disaster Remnant, this will be even easier. The worry of the Olden Emperor of the Golden Eye when he sends us out is if we come across a Pure-Blooded Disaster Remnant trying to reestablish themselves.\"","The Eclipsing Celestial Void Eye's words rumbled out with ancientness as it gazed down, all three of these beings becoming quiet as even though they were speaking about the Disaster Remnant they came here to kill, their eyes were currently locked onto another being entirely!","The revolving luminous eyes of the Dimensional Archaic Devil Bird shone with gorgeous splendor as its maddeningly oppressive voice echoed out.","\"A Candidate Emperor has risen...this one being beside a Disaster Remnant.\"","WAA!","The words were stated coldly and callously as the eyes of all of these three beings maintained their regality, but another emotion was budding with them!","Silence reigned as they watched this being's figure suffused with light, the scene of his golden Ascendancy Halos shedding their outer layer and releasing a terrifying new color! The rising emotion in their eyes only became firmer at this scene as the Eclipsing Celestial Void Eye's voice boomed out.","\"We are simply observers and cannot make a move against Candidate Emperors of the coming Era.\"","\"...\"","\"Yet the will of the Past Emperor has stipulated that when a future Candidate Emperor associates with any of the Remnants...we have the right to eradicate them if we can.\"","OOOM!","Waves of destiny exploded out silently at these words as the three beings went quiet.","They were utterly unique creatures who came from an astounding Lineage- their backs carrying the weight and will of the existence who had taken reigns and all the authority in the Olden Times!","His will stretched out far as those who carried it...were purely dreadful existences that others of the same stage could not compare to.","\"Then...destiny shall decide which one of us lands the killing blow to obtain Candidacy for the coming Kainos Era.\"","....!","Such a decision was made as their choice only became firmer when they saw what was happening around this existence that still released an aura that had not exceeded the Seventh Firmament of Ascendancy!","—","<You have reached the Boundary of the Tier of a Halo of Ascendancy only accessible with the inclusion of the Flames of a TABOO Nomological Edict.>","WAA!","The Ascendancy Halos surrounding Noah pulsed with vibrant light as they seemingly couldn't hold the concepts surging within them anymore- cracks beginning to spread out as the golden grandeur of the Halos was gradually washed away!","With the gold fading away, a new color was blooming as shockingly...dazzlingly glorious rays of utter blackness pierced out and covered everything.","CRAAACK....BOOOM!","Like a prisoner freed. Like shackles that were binding it down.... The color gold faded from the Ascendancy Halos as their outer exterior entirely shed to reveal pristine and breathtaking Ascendancy Halos that were utterly Black!","A black that shone with a dazzling aura as those who gazed at it might never be able to look away.","<An Astounding Achievement! You have exceeded the possible limits of a Golden Tier Ascendancy Halo that can be obtained through the inclusion of a Quasi-TABOO Nomological Edict and unlocked the Black Tier Ascendancy Halo that can be obtained through the inclusion of a TABOO Nomological Edict.>","WAA!","<By exceeding the limit of 50 Edicts within a single Ascendancy Halo, the condition to unlock the authority of a Black Tier Ascendancy Halo was achieved. Your Affinity to the natural laws of the Infinite Realities has risen as your Maximum Reserves of the Essence of Reality are raised by...>","Prompt after prompt cascaded down as a shocking reality unfolded!","Pristinely Black Ascendancy Halos surrounded Noah as they surged with unworldly grace and might, the hearts of all beings quivering in fear as the only one who only batted him an eye...was the beastial form of the Empress!","\"What the fuck?!\" A sonorous voice that seemed to come from a sacred beast.","The pace of the battle was interrupted yet again as shock ran through the hearts of every existence here.","This obscene Candidate Emperor seemed to be showing off one thing after another as what he had shown right now was simply too unbelievable!","Pure obsidian Black Ascendancy Halos! What did they represent? What exactly did they mean?! All existences remaining alive on this locked down domain knew.","The eyes of the Empress were not filled with shock or trembling- simply disbelief from the sheer fact that she did not agree that the black Halos of Light she saw stood for what they really represented.","She had tangled with this being before for hundreds of days as if he had the sufficient requirements to actually make his Ascendancy Halos Black- she would be in a worse state right now!","No. He was a unique existence with the right to become a Candidate Emperor by himself, but he could not have TABOO Nomological Edicts to make this possible.","And yet there he was situated upon his throne majestically as 10 Black Tier Ascendancy Halos undulated around him, giving him an austere light of shocking authority as his eyes opened at this time to lock onto specific beings!","The Eighth Firmament Primordial Beasts.","BZZZT!","Their hearts shuddered as they had the illusion of a billowing beast far greater than them locking onto their very souls as prey, this beast grandly sitting on a throne as he actually raised his right hand at this moment and beckoned.","A beckoning...that caused an illusory flash of Reality to appear as a menacing Spear of Reality thundered down- crying out with fervor as it seemed to be calling for blood!"]},{"number":1619,"title":"Chapter 1619: Chapter 1618 BLACK! lll","paragraphs":["Chapter 1618 BLACK! lll","[<Back Tier Ascendancy Halo>:: A tremendous achievement that can only be brought about by touching upon the stage of TABOO concepts that irrevocably alter the very Reality. Other methods of obtaining this Tier of Halo exist as the exceeding of 50 fused Bloodlines of Nomological Edicts into a single Halo has allowed for this Halo to come to fruition. The concepts contained in this Halo are granted the Reality Altering Affix [Evolvable] as they automatically become concepts that can be elevated through their own specific means. A permanent and thorough method of elevation of Concepts can also be done through transferring the Tier of one concept to another- where the Quasi-TABOO Tier of a Nomological Edict contained within this Halo can be transferred to a lower tier Edict within the same Halo permanently. Abilities that require the Essence of Reality utilized though the authority of the Black Tier Ascendancy Halo only require half the normal amount of such a resource as offensive abilities are granted a multiplier of 100 True Reality Damage Values and defensive abilities are granted a multiplier of 100 True Reality Defense Values. A single True Reality Damage Value is equivalent to the explosive force of an imploding Reality while a single True Reality Defense Value is a barrier only broken by a force capable of shattering a single Reality...]","[...Along with this, a single Black Tier Ascendancy Halo grants the generation of 1 Million Royal Cosmos Daily- with this number increasing even more over time as the True Blood within your origin is passively refined. The daily passive generation of 1,000 Units of the Essence of Reality is granted, and the chance to increase this will come when TABOO Nomological Edicts begin to occupy the Ascendancy Halo. The Eyes of Ascendancy permeating across an Ascendancy Halo have also received a great elevation in their authority as denying them will require a great deal of Quasi-TABOO Nomological Edicts. The results of the fusion of Black Tier Ascendancy Halos are still unknown as the true value can only be ascertained when you fuse with them for the first time...]","...!","Many things rose up as Noah's focus had locked in a singular new concept.","True Reality Damage Value!","Normally, the most powerful Seventh Firmament existences across the vast realities could display a Single True Reality Damage Value as they could release attacks capable of shattering Emerging Realities.","An example was Overseer Natalya or the Heartsplitter Bow that Noah had crafted which could release attacks with a force of a single explosive Reality!","Then you had common powerful Eighth Firmament existences who had obtained 1 or 2 Reality Passages after breaking their shackles- and such beings could use their Essence of Reality to rain down damage equivalent to the force of 10 exploding Realities, or they could release 10 True Reality Damage Values at their base.","Of course, you had truly exceptional existences in the Eighth Firmament who could exceed this value and even display 20 or 30 True Reality Damage Values as it was a force equivalent to 30 Realties exploding simultaneously on your face!","Then...you had singular unique cases like Empress Genevieve.","An existence from the Olden Times as she had seamlessly stepped onto the Ninth Firmament of Ascendancy and released nine rulers of shining rivers of Reality that thundered towards Nine Ninth Firmament Enders!","For her to be capable of matching the strikes of Ninth Firmament Enders, she had to release 9 attacks that held equivalent damage to 100+ True Reality Damage Values as that was the norm for existences of this level!","Under what seemed to be her true form and while fused with MADNESS, she had shockingly been capable of achieving such a feat.","Now, there was Noah.","Through his sheer shocking powerups in the last few hours, he had conducted multiple actions that all culminated into a Quasi-TABOO Nomological Edict that allowed him to fuse 60 Flames of Edicts into a single Halo.","An action that broke apart a Limit and allowed him to unlock Black Tier Ascendancy Halos that allowed any abilities released with their authority to dish out a multiplier of 100 True Reality Damage Values! Attacks equivalent to the powerful Ninth Firmament existences!","This applied to any and all abilities utilized with the Authority of a Black Tier Ascendancy Halo as when one recalled the fact that Noah had unlocked Instant Cast, he could theoretically release waves of attacks equivalent to the explosive force of 100 shattering Realities.","\"...\"","Dreadful.","An utterly dreadful path had been unlocked at this moment by the Unnamed Kainos Emperor!","100 True Reality Damage Values were granted to Noah purely through the Black Tier Ascendancy Halo he cast an ability from, and then there was the factor of the cast abilities themselves one had to consider.","If Noah cast an Ability that could release an explosive force of 1 Reality, then the released multiplier True Reality Damage Value would still be 100. But if he released an ability with a base offense of 2 shattering Realities, the Multiplier True Reality Damage Value would be 200...and so on!","This single unlocked feature that only came after Noah upgraded a great deal of things could now allow him to dish out damage equivalent to Ninth Firmament experts as he could even act this way defensively with a multiplier of True Reality Defensive Value.","This was just one thing that the Black Tier Ascendancy Halo granted as apart from this, each Ascendancy Halo granted 1,000 Units of daily passive generation of the Essence of Reality!","Each!","It meant that Noah currently had a passive generation of 10,000 Units of the Essence of Reality from his 10 Ascendancy Halos as on top of this, there was the formation of 1 million Royal Cosmos for each Halo, and his Eyes of Ascendancy having their authority even further strengthened.","This was what the Tier of Black granted!","It was...","\"Glorious!\"","RUUMBLE!","His voice rumbled out explosively for everyone to hear for the first time, the Throne he sat on vibrating as he swung the Spear of Reality within his hands with utter majesty, his essence moving onto a single Black Tier Ascendancy Halo as he called out again- but this time he Infused his voice with <Emperor's Haki>!","\"GLORIOUS!\"","\"....!!!\"","BOOOOOM!"]},{"number":1620,"title":"Chapter 1620: Chapter 1619 Refine with the Blood of Enders!","paragraphs":["Chapter 1619 Refine with the Blood of Enders!","Situated atop a multicolored throne, an Emperor called out with a devilish smile as he pulled upon a shocking newly granted authority.","\"GLORIOUS!\"","BOOOOOM!","Horrifically, an area of effect ability was the first thing Noah utilized.","It did not differentiate against friends or foes as the will of the Unnamed Kainos Emperor traveled through sound waves and smashed onto every single existence here!","SQUELCH!","The dozens of Eighth Firmament existences felt their Origins tremble as all of them spat out blood and felt as if they had the wind knocked out of their very origins.","The innate defenses of the Ninth Firmament existences buzzed and trembled as they felt this attack nearly pass through, their auditory senses buzzing as they looked towards the shocking existence atop the throne with pure shock!","The Candidate Emperor of the coming Kainos Era had spoken a single word as he utilized an area of effect ability to do it, his mere voice carrying with it the force of 100 shattering Realities as it caused Eight Firmament existences to nearly face the destruction of their Origins right then and there!","Beatrix had blood leaking from her mouth as she ground her teeth dangerously, while Empress Genevieve's fur fluttered as her eyes also showed a true trace of genuine shock!","Genuine shock!","And how could one not be shocked at such a reality when if they looked at this being- they saw that he had not even achieved his Reality Passages or broken through any of his shackles.","He was still bound below the Eighth Firmament...so why could he release an attack of a Ninth Firmament existence with his mere voice alone?!","Such a question was asked in all their minds as it was actually one that was answered moments ago...this answer also clicking in their minds soon after.","There wasn't a reason to ask how.","The only reason one needed to explain this was the fact that this existence before them was a Candidate Emperor of the coming Age of Emperors who had already solidified his authority and crown!","Of course his capabilities were disastrous!","Of course he could do something as shocking as what he just did!","It was just...his Realm confused them as even now, they had not seen him call upon his Reality Passages even once as their senses truly told them he had yet to reach the Eighth Firmament.","If this proved to be true, then this existence before them was just...","\"Monstrous...\"","WAA!","The holy voice that seemed to be coming from a Sacred Beast rang out from Genevieve, her black and white fur swaying slightly as her crimson gold winding horns shimmered with an austere stellar light.","Yet the existence upon the throne did not pay attention to this as with his scintillating Spear of Reality waving majestically, he came to point it towards the cluster of shaken Eighth Firmament Enders as his throne began to float forward.","OOOOM!","His movements caused cold sweat to run down the souls of these Enders as they recalled how their very origins had tumbled and shook from this being's mere voice carried by his will, some of these Enders being in the far back of the locked down domain as they unconsciously pulled back until they felt the Boundary of the laid down domain stop them from going any further back!","Fear.","These beings were truly feeling fear as they had felt the damage to their Origins close hand, knowing they couldn't handle anymore of such damage as with such an existence turning his attention towards them, they could do nothing but tremble as their eyes pleasingly gazed up towards the Ninth Firmament Enders!","Ninth Firmament Enders who at this moment were also looking towards Noah with somber gazes after deflecting the fearsome strikes of Empress Genevieve.","The Eighth Firmament existences were scared, and those at the Ninth were somber!","And then there was Noah himself.","His eyes spun with luminous light as with a devilish smile, his crown floated forward while his stellar Cosmic form could be seen releasing waves of austere resplendence, his Spear of Reality pointed forward as he once more called upon his will and cast <Emperor's Haki> through the authority of a Black Tier Ascendancy Halo while suffusing his voice into it!","\"PERISH!\"","BOOOM!","The area of effect will that dispersed the explosive force of 100 shattered Realities boomed out indiscriminately once more as chaos ensued.","\"Ah..!\"","\"Ancestral Enders!\"","SQUELCH!","The body of the weakest Eighth Firmament Ender could not handle it as its Origin received an impact it could not defend again, its Reality Passage flickering and dwindling soon after as its body cracked apart into a golden shower of True Blood and gore!","WAA!","The throne of the Unnamed Kainos Emperor neared the area of this exploded Ender with his spear pointed forward, the exploding blood surging and seething as it began to coil around his spear and surge into his body- arcs of crimson gold tendrils beginning to form around him as he looked entirely devilish.","<Arcadian Body and Soul Refinement> was activated.","The glimmer of Loot Prompts with the exception of racial Bloodlines rang out as the Bloodlines and True Blood of these existences...they went towards the refinement of a Limit Breaking Extreme Arcadian Physique at this moment!","Noah's actions caused the bodies of the remaining Eighth Firmament existences to turn ragged as they called upon everything they had to defend themselves against a spread out force of 100 shattering Realities.","The Ninth Firmament Existences felt as if a sharp hammer was billowing on their defenses as if they were weak existences of this level...they might already be injured!","But each of them were shockingly powerful in this stage as every single one had more than one Reality Passage.","They were powerful, but they were becoming increasingly somber as the damage they still defended against right now was potent as this being...it didn't seem like he was going to stop after he bathed and consumed the blood of a single Eighth Firmament Ender.","His shimmering throne turned towards those nearby and those scrambling to get out of the way as he ridiculously spoke out with a booming voice once more.","\"EXPLODE!\"","BOOM! BOOM!","Over three Eighth Firmament Enders could not handle it as their bodies erupted in a shower of blood that all surged towards the Unnamed Kainos Emperor, his throne floating forward with an unmatched visage as the True Blood and Racial Bloodlines of these existences all surged to his body to refine a stellar Physique- his skin and muscles releasing a multicolored light as this was the second Limit Breaking Extreme Physique he was cultivating at the same time!","\"Fucking stop! Please!\"","Off to one side of the locked domain, Beatrix's voice echoed out as she kneeled in space, her body bleeding all over as her Ascendancy Halos released a cocoon of light around her. She was battered and beaten to the point that she was bleeding, and she could at most take another set of these attacks before she actually perished just like these Enders as she called out to Noah murderously while also gazing towards Empress Genevieve.","The other Eighth Firmament Pure-Blooded Cardinal Royal Humans were in the same state as the Empress turned towards the visage of the shocking existence with a sharp gaze, Noah only smiling as he didn't pay any heed and instead continued to lock onto the scrambling Eighth Firmament Enders.","None of them dared to even come close to him as they truly were scrambling out of the way, some even rushing towards their Ancestral Enders that were the Ninth Firmament Primordial Beasts!","As the gaze of Empress Genevieve locked onto him dangerously, Noah pointed his Spear of Reality forward as a Black Tier Ascendancy Halo flashed, another ability being cast.","An ability that would carry with it the multiplied force of 100 True Reality Damage Value as it was equivalent to the force of 100 shattering Realities!","It was...","\"Fireball.\"","...!","BRRRR!!!"]},{"number":1621,"title":"Chapter 1621: Chapter 1620 Refine With the Blood of Enders! ll","paragraphs":["Chapter 1620 Refine With the Blood of Enders! ll","A Tyrant sat on a throne as shockingly, an assassination of an Empress of the Pure-Blooded Cardinal Royal Bloodline by the Enders of Reality had now turned to something with him at the center of focus!","Wielding a glimmering Spear of Reality, he pointed towards extremely powerful existences that had opened their Reality Passages.","Existences that would normally be looked at as Grand Elders of Bloodlines- these ones being magisterial beasts that could devour entire Emerging Realities!","Variations and combinations of Foxes, Draconic Beasts, deep sea creatures, and even ancient Frost Beasts who had lived for hundreds of millions of years. Each of them had a Reality Passage glittering behind them as no matter their grandeur before this- they currently ran away while scrambling towards the nearest Ninth Firmament Ender they could find!","Golden blood was already leaking profusely from their bodies as they had already suffered disastrous injuries just from the words of the Tyrant upon a throne as now...this being spoke once more as his voice caused them to shudder.","\"Fireball.\"","...!","BRRRR!!!","Pure fantastical wonder bloomed as crimson balls of Flames that glimmered with the illusion of a stellar river of Reality reverberated out.","Each one shone with the blinding light of stellar bodies as they seemed to contain a whole illusory Reality within them, dozens blooming out as when they exploded- they would release the shocking force contained within them that could rip apart Realities!","They shot out with speed and haste that the moment they bloomed...they instantly arrived at their targets an instant later as explosive sounds that tore apart space itself and caused Unstable spatial storms ruptured the bodies of any Eighth Firmament Enders they came across!","Unstable spatial storms that raged with crimson flames of extreme heat that caused the surrounding space to turn molten!","BOOOM...RIIIP!","Horrific sounds echoed out as it seemed like exploding balls of Realities had been thrown over, beastial limbs and True Blood flying out on all sides as the being to cause all this simply raised his spear thereafter and spread his will out, the 8 Eighth Firmament Enders that had fallen to a mere cast of [Fireball] that carried with it the True Reality Damage Value of 100 having all their True Blood and Bloodlines surging towards him.","As this occured, his luminous eyes that spun with palpable excitement gazed around to lock onto the remaining Eighth Firmament Enders that actually prayed that he wouldn't turn his eyes towards them!","They continued to scramble as far away from him as possible, while some were finally able to hide behind the visage of the Ninth Firmament Enders!","And as all of this occured, prompts of loot continued to descend before Noah's eyes as he watched them in passing, his eyes only twinkling when something truly special came around!","<The ownership of the Quasi-TABOO Nomological Edict and Flames of the Nine Tailed Emperor has been granted.>","Every now and then, an Eighth Firmament Ender that had a golden Ascendancy Halo would fall as a Quasi-TABOO Nomological Edict or two would be granted to Noah.","This was what caught his eyes the most as a large number of Insuperable Nomological Edicts also flowed in, Noah placing everything he couldn't use towards the Soul Library while he continued to marvel at the results of his actions and what he had now grown to be capable of doing!","And this...was just the cusp of the possibilities as the methods of Empowerment he had in his hands were simply monstrous.","The tens of thousands of Nomological Edicts he received from the Seventh Firmament Enders and even the top tier Edicts he was receiving right now from the tens of Eighth Firmament Enders...any of those that he didn't need, he could burn them under the Authority of the Throne of Arcadian Tyranny to elevate his soul even further.","The stronger his soul was, the more concepts he could handle. The more concepts he could handle, the more terrifying the power he could display! Theoretically, the possibilities truly were endless as what Noah was doing was akin to a positive feedback cycle of just more and more!","SHAA!","The surroundings calmed as Noah's disastrous attack died down, leaving over 17 Eighth Firmament existences dead from a mere cast of Fireball as the equivalent of 100 imploding Realities honed in on these beings and battered them to the point that they could not defend.","Fiery Unstable spatial storms and molten space stretched out in arcs as Noah tested the True Reality Damage Value of his Black Tier Ascendancy Halos, coming to few conclusions after testing abilities a few times!","One was the fact that the authority to grant the 100 True Reality Damage Value multiplier was permitted only through the Halo that cast the ability, where Noah could not pull upon all 10 Black Halos to cast a single ability and stack their 100 True Reality Damage Multipliers until they reached 1,000!","The most he could do was Instant Cast the same ability ten times or ten different abilities at the same time through the 10 different Halos, being capable of achieving multiple attacks that each contained 100 True Reality Damage Values- effectively being capable of landing 10 basic consecutive attacks of a Ninth Firmament existence.","'But...what will happen when I seamlessly fuse with the authority of all 10 Ascendancy Halos? What True Reality Damage Value will be attained then?!'","...!","His thoughts were wild and untamed as he had truly stepped onto a grand stage when he still hadn't broken his shackles and forged his Reality Passages.","What an achievement this was!","Most Ninth Firmament existences touched upon 100 True Reality Damage Values with their most powerful attacks as those within this rank that were the most powerful could dish out 200 to 400 True Reality Damage Values- if not more depending on what type of existence they were!","This was the stage Noah had arrived at as he reveled in it while his body was refining the Limit Breaking Extreme Mana Physique and the Limit Breaking Arcadian Physique simultaneously.","As the blood of Enders rushed into his body and coursed through him, faint blue lines that shone with beauty were becoming etched onto his stellar skin as these represented the Runic Mana Lines of Ascendancy whose description was gradually forming in Noah's mind- this concept containing its own unique surprises!","BZZZT!","The Blood in the surroundings fully surged into Noah as the chaotic space still held raging flames that could burn apart any below the Eighth Firmament, all those left in the battlefield entirely somber as they watched Noah turn his Atlatl of Reality towards the 28 remaining Eighth Firmament Primordial Beasts.","It was time for him to wipe out these existences and use their blood merely for refinement, where his eyes would then target the main course of this Nexus Event- the Ninth Firmament Enders!","Those were the beings that Noah would utilize his Resplendent Treasure Cache on!","WAA!","He wanted an attack to eradicate all his chosen enemies at this moment as for the purposes of testing things, he now moved on to how the authority of the Black Tier Halo of Ascendancy could be used when an ability of a Relic was cast while he utilized this same Relic.","...!","He wanted to see just what the Atlatl of Reality would cause as this weapon now carried the weight of over 80 fused Emerging Realities and as of now, 10 fully assimilated Prime Realities!"]},{"number":1622,"title":"Chapter 1622: Chapter 1621 Refine With the Blood of Enders! lll","paragraphs":["Chapter 1621 Refine With the Blood of Enders! lll","One must be clear that Atlatl of Reality was a Sui Generis Enlightened Primordial Relic that held the weight of Noah's Infinite Reality and it didn't represent a damage equivalent to the shattering of a Reality, with the main question at this juncture being whether the weight of the Infinite Reality was comparable to the explosion of the shocking force released by a shattering endless river of Reality.","Among the abilities of the Atlatl of Reality, there already existed some that could directly deal out 1 True Reality Damage Value...with some abilities being elevated to be capable of dealing 2 or even 3 True Reality Damage Values with the recent infusion of Realities that directly changed the mass of the Infinite Reality!","There were many abilities under the Atlatl of Reality as this time around, Noah didn't use the strongest one that would provide the highest True Reality Damage Value- but one that would eradicate all his chosen enemies in one strike.","It was <Cosmic Thrower>!","<Cosmic Thrower> :: The Atlatl of Reality can release unlimited Unstable Cosmos containing within them the essence of all flames of Edicts within the user's arsenal, the Unstable Cosmos carrying the homing quality as they can pierce through the veils of Reality to reach their enemies wherever they are, even if they are hidden in locations as abstruse as Mirror Realities. Each cast requires 10 Units of the Essence of Reality along with millions of Units of Mana ...","An ability that might have seemed high cost when it first appeared, and yet Noah's reserves of Essence of Reality had risen so much that it seemed minimal at this moment! His Reserves had further gone to exceed 65,000 as unlike the ridiculous 50,000 boost gained from achieving the solidification his candidacy in the Kainos Era, the unprovoked birth of a Black Tier Halo granted Noah another 10,000 as his reserves rose to 75,000. Evidently, the task of achieving a Kainos Emperor Bloodline was looked at with much more importance.","Even though his reserves of the Essence of Reality were high, he had been using them far faster than what the daily generation or his Affix could bring in as he even had to replenish his Reality Crystals from his True Sanguine Clone that had delved into another Treasure Reality in the Forsaken Treasure Emperor that apart from a page of the Modus Operandi within this Reality- a cluster of Reality Crystals were also located.","Just a few rounds of refinement with the Limit Breaking Extreme Mana Physique had nearly drained him as it put the corruption of many Edicts through RUINATION on hold, but to spend a mere 10 Units now to cast a single ability that would reap the lives of 28 Eighth Firmament existences was a negligible expense as the base True Reality Damage Value of <Cosmic Thrower> was 2 when called upon with the Atlatl of Reality!","BZZZZT!","The Spear of Reality within Noah's hand buzzed and crackled as before anybody could even make another move- before the molten Reality utterly destroyed by fireballs could even heal...he pointed his Spear forward serenely while sitting on his multicolored throne, his voice coming out softly.","\"Cosmic Thrower.\"","\"...\"","An incandescent light flashed.","The Atlatl of Reality released astounding radiance as from it, 28 pulsing Unstable Cosmos were called out as the moment they appeared, they sank into the surrounding space and disappeared as if they never existed!","\"...\"","No horrendous explosive forces or ripping of the very structure of Reality occured for a single microsecond as it seemed that the Atlatl of Reality had only flashed with light and released a few glimmering balls before it dimmed a little.","But the 28 remaining Eighth Firmament existences felt their destinies turn entirely dark at this moment as if an inescapable fate had been ordained for them- and it truly was so as even though they couldn't see the attacks, Unstable Cosmos containing the force of 200 True Reality Damage Values fused into the very fabrics of Reality to only reappear when they came in contact with their bodies through the homing feature!","...BOOOM! BOOOM!","Then, the fabric of Reality was torn and laid to waste- along with the bodies and origins of their targets.","Beatrix and the other Eighth Firmament Pure-Blooded Cardinal Royal Human Guards felt their hearts buzzing either unwillingness and disbelief as they watched 28 existences that had broken past their shackles and held a Reality Passage...they watched as attacks bloomed in front of these beings such force that even they spat out blood from a distance!","They watched as after the passage of a single microsecond, golden blood overflowed as 28 shattered origins lay out in multiple locations!","\"....\"","Unbearable silence ensued as only the sound of space trying its best to heal could be heard.","Only the nonchalant Unnamed Kainos Emperor could be seen pointing his Spear of Reality forward as the rivers of golden blood cascaded onto him as if they were seeking a glorious home- the reality that this being had wiped out all of the Seventh and Eighth Firmament Enders in a few second settling in at this moment!","The eyes of the Unnamed Kainos Emperor were bright as he was showered with prompts of loot and the reward of multiple new Quasi-TABOO Nomological Edicts he had to closely look at soon.","As he felt his body continuously strengthened in ways he didn't know possible, his eyes locked onto the beings that even caused him to not focus on his prompts of loot at this moment...the Ninth Firmament Enders that were the masterminds of this assassination!","When he reaped the lives of Eighth Firmament existences, none of them were given the honor of being chosen to give the Resplendent Treasure Cache that Noah now had 5 of 6 uses remaining.","All uses were saved for even more powerful enemies!","And since there were terrifying Ninth Firmament existences right before him, it was only right he give them such an honor as if he could manage to take down any of them...the loot from Resplendent Treasure Cache would be something unimaginable!"]},{"number":1623,"title":"Chapter 1623: Chapter 1622 Chaos Breeds Opportunity!","paragraphs":["Chapter 1622 Chaos Breeds Opportunity!","Chaos!","A state of being and a perpetual destiny that all things seemed to fall to.","Cycles of Chaos had been going since unknown times as now, yet another Era of Chaos was ushered in - this time by the fateful actions of the Primordial Beasts whose only purpose was the reclamation and re-establishment of the singular main Reality!","Their forces lay in wait for countless years as their Legends and those in the Firmaments of Ascendancy moved at this moment, their actions making way for unbound destruction and glorious opportunities as in times of chaos...destiny could be snatched the easiest.","Existences that knew nothing of the schemes of the Primordial Beasts were just facing these changes as some welcomed them with open arms- destiny beginning to shine gloriously under these beings!","But due to the methodical planning of Enders, unbound destruction had already occurred as the most destruction was actually carried out within the very first few minutes of the attacks.","An unknown number of Emerging Realities fell as swarms of First to Sixth Firmament Primordial Beasts spread out across the vast explored regions of the Infinite Realities!","An even greater number of Prime Realities fell during these first few minutes as they were made the prime targets- with Seventh to Ninth Firmament Enders being dispatched and overpowering the surprised Overseers before they destroyed their Realities.","Before the more powerful Primordials could even react, disastrous Damage was done during this period of time!","But...the Primordials were still the Primordials.","They had reigned over the past eons as their power was undeniable.","In some regions of the vast Realities, Primordial Beasts found to their shock that armies were already assembled to protect Realities as if they knew Enders were coming in advance.","In some regions, the moment their attacks began within a Prime Reality that should have only had a Seventh Firmament Overseer, they suddenly found that an Eighth Firmament existence rose to defend their home!","In other regions, even if the information was as expected, the moment that the Enders began their attacks...the reinforcements arrived too quickly and with too much ferocity as they couldn't even destroy anything.","Near one such a region.","BZZZT!","Arcs of golden flames stretched out for light years as the shattered origins of three enormous beastial figures of Ninth Firmament Enders could be seen, over a dozen Eighth Firmament origins and even more a rank lower also lying dead and melting from the heat of the golden flames that roared out like and endless golden sea!","Standing amidst these flames untouched was a creature with golden fur all over its body, an illusory crown spinning above its head as along with this- there was a spinning golden sun releasing immense heat beside the crown! Four grand Reality Passages still spun behind this being as they showered his body with even more pristine glory.","The golden furred creature screamed of majesty as it had the form of a regal ape like creature- this being an important personage of the Cardinal Royal Bloodline of the Solaris Simians. Such a being released an aura at the Eighth Firmament of Ascendancy even though three Ninth Firmament Enders lay dead before his will, his golden eyes spinning with stellar light as he gazed at the nearby Prime Reality that nearly fell.","\"For them to be so bold to even target me during my vacation...don't they know the fury of a Solaris Simian Emperor can burn even Grotto Sanctums?!\"","WAA!","Immense power raged around this being as he...was just an example out of many across the vast Realities who were extremely powerful and special with their own unique means!","In another region, near a Continuum Apocalypse Reality. This content is taken from Freeᴡebnᴏvel.cᴏm.","Pure white and blue essence permeated around the region as it even painted the nearby Continuum Apocalypse Reality with such a hue- the core of this essence being a blinding figure that seemed to be purely made of light!","Yet the surroundings of this figure of light were covered by waves of deathly darkness, and an enormous Archaic figure of a blue eyed young man surrounded by over a dozen Seventh Firmament Undead that had dimmed Ascendancy Halos called out, along with countless other beings of lower rank.","They faced a shocking force of Primordial Beasts and existences of the Telos Bloodline before them, destruction already permeating throughout this space as the existence made of pure light called out to the blue eyed existence.","\"Stop playing around, Eckert.\"","Simple words echoed out as a devilish smile appeared on the blue eyed being, with his visage not even seeming that special as one could see his ten Ascendancy Halos beginning at White Tier to Purple!","Yet this being waved his hands after these words as the Ascendancy Halos of the Undead around him began to buzz, flying away from their bodies and coming towards him as his own Halos were switched with theirs!","In a matter of moments, Nine purple and 1 golden Ascendancy Halo could be seen on this being as he picked and chose from his Vassals, the scene thereafter turning even more drastic as his luminous blue eyes flashed to call upon the Undead Vassals, their bodies flying towards him and seamlessly sinking into him as his aura rose up crazily while his body enlarged for millions of miles.","His aura rose in waves as the Purple Halos he showed pulsed the more that he fused with Undead in the Seventh and Eighth Firmament- their color gradually becoming tinted with a hue of gold as the aura released approached far past what normal Seventh Firmament existences could display!","\"A Telos feeding on Apocalypse huh?! Let me give you an Apocalypse!\"","BOOOM!","Darkness and unbound malice spread out as this being moved in conjunction with an existence that starkly seemed much too pure to even be near other existences.","This was another example of unique creatures far exceeding the Boundary of their stages as their destiny was something that could only benefit from the coming Era.","Existences like this could scale the Firmaments with power and purpose as their destinies simply could not be ended so easily, the future still holding tremendous roles for them to play in these times of chaos.","After all, those with abundant destinies thrived the most in chaotic times!","In the past Age of Emperors, chaos had unfolded spectacularly as the one to reign it under his heel was the existence that had claimed the title of Emperor of the entire Age. The actions of those who obtained full authority and ruled over an entire Age were always grand and had long lasting consequences, with the actions of the past Emperor being what brought to fruition the splitting and proliferation of the vast Infinite Realities!","The splitting into the countless Realities...was something achievable only under the Authority of the past Emperor as his identity was seemingly connected to the one and only reigning Bloodline the past eons....","Primordials!"]},{"number":1624,"title":"Chapter 1624: Chapter 1623 Tearing Down the Visage of theNinth Firmament of Ascendancy! l","paragraphs":["Chapter 1623 Tearing Down the Visage of theNinth Firmament of Ascendancy! l","The splitting of the Infinite Realities due to the authority of the past Emperor!","What a glorious power.","What glorious authority.","What glorious possibilities!","Authority capable of making one be able to do such things was what everyone sought- with the goal of The Enders of Reality being exactly this as with the spread of their actions at this point in time- their targets were prolific geniuses of mainly Primordials and other powerful Bloodlines as everything was for the cause of reducing the possible Candidate Emperors from solidifying their authority!","Cardinal Royal Bloodlines were those targeted the most as the prized targets that had to fall with surety stemmed from Pure-Blooded Cardinal Royal Bloodlines.","Parties with a level of power five or ten times compared to their targets were sent forth as many would succeed...and many would also fail.","But even if they had to perish, the geniuses with a claim to follow the path of Emperors of the coming Kainos Era had to perish with them!","This was why...","\"You have to die.\"","BZZZT!","In the locked down enclosure, the pure White Dragon finally spoke after all the powerful existences watched the massacre of Seventh and Eighth Firmament Enders in mere microseconds, the other Ninth Firmament Primordial Beasts coming at its left and right as their bodies released vibrant waves of power.","The Pure White Dragon was actually the most powerful as it boasted 3 Reality Passages behind it, three other Enders having 2 Reality Passages as the remaining only had a single one!","This Dragon was gazing towards the lone being situated upon a multicolored throne and wielding a stellar spear of Reality while gazing towards them with a dangerous glint in his eyes, a fearless devilish smile painted over him as he seemed to have grand ideas!","All the eyes of the Ninth Firmament Enders were now locked onto him and not Empress Genevieve at this moment as when it came to their mission of stopping profound geniuses on the side of Primordials from rising...this being before them was a prime target as he had already solidified his authority.","Among those that had to die- he would have been at the very top!","The fact that they would obtain his authority after he died was just an enormous extra that would also benefit their Bloodline.","So the golden Ascendancy Halos around this White Dragon flashed with light as they sunk into its body silently, any other Ninth Firmament Enders that didn't take their True forms fusing with their Halos at this moment as they prepared to take on an astounding genius and get rid of him before he became a disastrous existence in the Age of Emperors!","\"You all...just know exactly how to push my buttons. Did I not say that this guy was mine?!\"","WAA!","The voice of an unknown species of Sacred Beast echoed out as the form of Empress Genevieve released waves of radiant luster, her figure ready to release even more attacks with a True Reality Damage Value above 100 if she needed to.","Beside her, the Pure-Blooded Cardinal Royal Humans had differing expressions as they also came to float to her left and right- many of them still moving to protect the Empress even though she took on a True Form that wasn't that of a Pure-Blooded Cardinal Royal Human!","This was because at this moment, they were in a battle of survival as any mysteries could be solved after they survived this perilous situation. So any doubts were pushed aside as they became ready to fight for their lives. Their party came to float between the Unnamed Kainos Emperor and the Enders who at this moment had risen to their height of power- the Essence around them seemingly resonating as the eyes of the White Dragon released dazzling light.","\"There is no need to worry, Primordial. After the Candidate Emperor of the coming Age has perished, you will follow...<Nine Beast Phantom Formation of the White Emperor>!\"","OOONG!","All the Ninth Firmament Enders spoke the last set of words in unison as their bodies shone, turning into stellar lights that moved into different positions in this locked down domain as thereafter...their bodies released a profound white light that connected together!","The Pure White Dragon stayed at the forefront as around it, an enormous illusory draconic head began to form. The ape like Beast and crimson bloody Spider were to its left and right as their bodies were covered by pure white long spanning wings, with the other Enders in different portions as all of them stood at a point that brought to life a formation with their bodies as conduits.","The <Nine Beast Phantom Formation of the White Emperor>!","It was bringing to life an enormous ancient white Dragon from the Olden Times as apart from its illusory appearance that was gradually becoming more real, a faint illusory crown had appeared above it!","The obsidian Scorpion was the last conduit as it was at the position of the tail, an illusory scorpionic-draconic tail forming to finish the formation of an existence that was known as the White Emperor many eons ago.","The formation they had cast was merely something that could call out a glimpse of the visage of this being as before everyone's eyes, a humongous ferocious looking ancient White Dragon with six pairs of wings and a sharp tail that could shatter hundreds of Realities appeared!","It's white scales glimmered with vibrant multicolored Runic Lines of Ascendancy and Runic Ecritures that read IMPENETRABLE among other words throughout, abundant essence surging all around it as it became entirely real in a few microseconds while behind it- five Reality Passages appeared as they surged endless types of Essence into it to make it even more real and powerful that it seemed like this form could be kept active for an extremely long period of time!","OOOM!","Essence raged as the Nine Enders anchored together in a formation to call forth the visage of a past Emperor, the eyes of this White Dragon Emperor opening at this moment as they released a piercing golden glow that gazed directly towards the Emperor on his throne.","It's visage was boundless in power as it easily exceeded the most powerful Ninth Firmament existences, but it's domineering aura actually lost out at the next moment as the Emperor situated majestically atop a throne raised his spear and pointed it towards the direction that had the Pure-Blooded Cardinal Royal Humans and the White Dragon Emperor!","\"This Emperor...\"","BZZZT!","Atop the multicolored throne, the Unnamed Kainos Emperor waved his Spear of Reality as it cut apart space beautifully- his voice coming out grandly as he addressed everyone fully at this moment!","\"This Emperor does not belong to anyone, nor can insignificant existences with such abysmal Destinies claim to be capable of taking my life.\"","...!","WAA!"]},{"number":1625,"title":"Chapter 1625: Chapter 1624 Tearing Down the Visage of theNinth Firmament! ll","paragraphs":["Chapter 1624 Tearing Down the Visage of theNinth Firmament! ll","\"This Emperor...does not belong to anyone, nor can insignificant existences with such abysmal Destinies claim to be capable of taking my life.\"","...!","WAA!","Boundless light exhumed from the Unnamed Kainos Emperor as he spoke, his Tyrannical will seeping out as it began to be felt closely by all those nearby!","Even the existences hidden by the folds of the Mirror Reality far in the distance who at this moment adopted stern expressions as they gazed forward- their gazes still calm.","\"He seems to just be awakening to his Bloodline, but his will should be drawn thin after matching these Enders. At the last point when his soul is already tired, we will descend for the kill.\"","The Archaic Devil Bird spoke coldly as the Nine Reality Horned Unicorn scoffed.","\"We could wipe all of them out right now, do we still have to move with care? I'm finding this Remnant Disaster that is trying to use the Primordial Bloodline as her mask more and more distasteful!\"","...!","Its words carried regality as the Archaic Devil Bird ignored its compatriot entirely, only speaking out soon after as if his words were final.","\"She merely carries a Lesser Primordial Bloodline and has not undergone the Baptism she would have taken if she succeeded in becoming the Candidate Ruler of the Pure-Blooded Cardinal Royal Human Bloodline. We shall wipe her out and these fools that followed her this whole time without knowing who she is.\"","Words of brutality echoed out as immense coldness could be felt from them!","These three hidden beings from the Olden Times were those following the Will of the Past Emperor so naturally, they had to have some connection to Primordials. Yet there seemed to be a large gap in status and mystery even amongst Primordials as how many of them knew the true history and were privy to the secrets of the past?","Such beings continued to lie in wait as their attack would be the truly inescapable danger that even the most powerful Ninth Firmament existence would fall to!","—","Noah's Spear of Reality pointed towards the enormous White Dragon Emperor that was ten times in size and stature than all other beings in this locked down domain, his eyes releasing beams of light as the moment his words finished, his throne floated forward!","He cared not for the angered expression of Empress Genevieve. He cared not for whatever reply the powerful group of Ninth Firmament Enders that had anchored themselves into a formation came up with!","He was currently feeling a surge of strength as he had made progress in two Limit Breaking Extreme Physiques, his body being further elevated by new features as at this moment- multiple bright Runic Mana Lines of Ascendancy were surging over his skin vibrantly as their description slowly became clear.","To understand their augmentation, we must first understand Noah's own level of strength currently. Due to the sheer number of concepts he held, the strength of his soul, his own Blood and Origin...and many more factors that augmented his strength, he could release a force equivalent to roughly 1 True Reality Damage Value with his own skills and attacks, with this number edging upwards slowly as he switched lesser Edicts for stronger ones from those that had fallen under him!","This was why the low Tier Fireball that had brought the end of multiple Enders had released an attack a bit over 100 True Reality Damage Values after being cast with the authority of a Black Tier Ascendancy Halo, but if he cast it again now, it might reach 200 or 300 True Reality Damage Values due to him gaining over 60 Quasi-TABOO Nomological Edicts from the dozens of Eighth Firmament Enders he had wiped out- with him not even being capable of fully adding all of them to his soul.","Concepts such as this were extremely overbearing as the boosts they came with were ridiculous, but he found his soul reaching an upper tier limit when he suddenly tried to increase the number of Quasi-TABOO Nomological Edicts from five to 65. His soul strength was more overbearing than even a Ninth Firmament existence, but the pressure of so many Quasi-TABOO concepts was too much as for this...he had to strengthen his soul through many means, but the quickest one currently was to sacrifice the many useless Minor, Greater, and Quasi-Insuperable Nomological Edicts that he didn't need with the authority of the Throne of Arcadian Tyranny!","And this...was exactly what his main body was doing right now in the Cosmic Holy Land.","While his True Sanguine Clone was seated on the Throne of Unnamed Tyranny, his True Body regally sat on the Throne of Arcadian Tyranny as under his command, thousands of Nomological Edicts along with their bloodlines began to burn!","The sight was utterly shocking as above the multicolored throne, one could see immense light surging as it coagulated into golden dew drops above Noah's head- these dewdrops then falling onto him as a wondrous feeling of exhilaration and power flowed within him thereafter.","And when this occurred...","BZZZT!","Even more Quasi-TABOO Nomological Edicts were capable of being tacked onto his soul as his strength surged ever higher, his True Sanguine Clone being capable of releasing even more terrific strength as he was scaling the Firmaments of Ascendancy at ridiculous speeds!","To test the limits of his strength and just what True Reality Damage Value he could reach on his own and with the Atlatl of Reality, Noah wanted to continue pushing his limits as this White Dragon Emperor that had just been called forth was something that almost exceeded all parameters of the Ninth Firmament!","And such a phenomenon was what Noah wanted to match with!","To ensure his survival though, he prepared in advance as he cast silently.","\"[Aura of Vigor], [Aura of Defense], [Aura of Mana], [Aura of Grace], [Aura of Might], [Aura of Serenity], [Aura of Discipline]...\"","Multiple Auras from the Minor Nomological Edict of the Bulwark that were classified as defensive skills were cast, his already resplendent figure actively showing multicolored transparent bubbles appearing around him as wondrously, each aura was Instant Cast from a Black Tier Ascendancy Halo as it carried 100 True Reality Defense Value!","With multiple stacked onto his body, an attack exceeding 1,000 True Reality Damage Value had to hit him as even if it came close, Noah would spam these defensive auras constantly as he had a portion of his soul focused on doing just this from now on until the battle ended.","After all, the cast of these Auras only cost mana as when it came to that...Noah could effectively say he could have a passive barrier of 1,000+ True Reality Defense Values at all times as in the Firmaments of Ascendancy, he might have the chance to truly be fearless!","He had to do this as the enemy this time was extremely powerful. The overlapping strength of 9 Peak Ninth Firmament Enders...what type of concept was that? It was a nearly impossible task to defeat them as surviving against them would be hard! But Noah wanted to try. He wanted to see what his constant and unending spam of defensive skills would do...and whether he could truly move about unhindered in the Firmaments of Ascendancy.","'Let's put it to a test.'","WAA!"]},{"number":1626,"title":"Chapter 1626: Chapter 1625 Tearing Down the Visage of theNinth Firmament! lll","paragraphs":["Chapter 1625 Tearing Down the Visage of theNinth Firmament! lll","With a steady heart, Noah's moved to affirm his beliefs by facing a ridiculously strong enemy.","His eyes glimmered with intense light as he could still see a description of the Runic Mana Lines of Ascendancy that filled him with even more confidence!","<Runic Mana Lines of Ascendancy>:: Runic Lines elevated from other concepts or inscribed by unique authorities tying back to the very Era one resides in. The Runic Mana Lines of Ascendancy complement and add on to all the sources of strength culminated within your Body, Origin, and Soul- allowing for all of them to surround your body with passive strengthening and defense. The Runic Mana Lines of Ascendancy are even more unique as they cut the required resources of all cast abilities by one-fourth, with this including the resource of Essence of Reality. A low number currently flows over your body as more information on their nature is being derived, with more functions being unlocked as the number of Runic Mana Lined increases. Current Runic Mana Lines of Ascendancy- 4. Current True Reality Boost(Defensive & Damage)- .4","A grand source of strength that directly augmented all his sources of power had arrived!","Having obtained 4 Runic Mana Lines of Ascendancy from four refinements of the Limit Breaking Extreme Mana Physique, Noah actually obtained an additional source of nearly half a True Reality Value!","The brilliant cerulean Runic Lines caused his body to feel a constant surge of strength as even though he didn't have stellar Reality Passages behind him, his own Infinite Resources under his System gave him the illusion of unceasing essence just waiting to be unleashed.","OOOM!","So his multicolored throne surged forward as with the Atlatl of Reality pointing ahead, it turned into a regal point of light that surged towards the enormous scintillating White Dragon Emperor fearlessly!","His throne flew across the ruptured space still not healed from his fireballs and Unstable Cosmos as it passed over Genevieve and her Pure-Blooded Cardinal Royal Humans, going against the visage of a past Emperor ten times his size as this creature had five billowing Reality Passages constantly washing down essence!","Against his domineering actions, the visage of the White Dragon Emperor seemed offended as the golden light in its eyes spun, its aurora of wings shimmering as its right claw thundered down like an ancient mountain that encompassed everything.","How much True Reality Damage Values were accumulated in such a strike that had Nine Ninth Firmament Enders contributing to its power?","More than that, this formation boasted the will of a past Emperor as while its claw thundered down towards the coming throne, its voice boomed out commandingly as Runic Ecritures flowed out from its sharp jaws.","\"Hand over your life!\"","OOOM!","Words filled with majesty as they carried a sharp attack meant to even subdue the soul.","Words akin to an undeniable command from the visage of the Emperor!","The soul attack smashed towards Noah before the two sides even connected physically as he felt an oppressive pressure trying to dwindle out his authority and even shake his will to try and evaporate his throne!","\"A mere will of a fallen Emperor...dares to try and extinguish mine?!\"","WAA!","His very authority and throne seemed to cry out at such a challenge- seemingly asking how dare a past will try to contend with the will of a Kainos Emperor?!","Noah's body and soul were connected to his throne as essence flowed through seamlessly, his aura surging as his soul faced the overpowering will of the White Dragon Emperor and tried to deny it.","He couldn't just evaporate it with his words though, this being a will coagulated from Nine Ninth Firmament Enders and the visage of an Emperor! His own soul had to be strong enough to overcome it as at this juncture, his main body in the far away Cosmic Holy Land paved the way forward as it was situated on the Throne of Arcadian Tyranny, tens of thousands of Nomological Edicts burned for the cause of strengthening his soul as he constantly felt this increased soul augmentation that allowed his authority to not fade even when faced with the combined soul attacks of multiple Enders!","Nomological Edicts gained from hundreds of Seventh Firmament Enders burned as multiple golden dew drops formed above the Throne of Arcadian Tyranny and surged into Noah, even the Soul Library being plundered for the Edicts always contained within it as Noah would continue powering up even in the midst of battle.","His soul received all the forming golden dew drops of pure soul power as he became bathed in a radiant golden light, the nourishment this time being excessively better than any devouring of Soul Crystals!","Feeling the surging waves of soul power, Noah's Atlatl of Reality became even sharper as it suffused with multicolored essence, his throne releasing liquefied waves of essence as it denied the descending will of a past Emperor while Noah charged forward, his eyes releasing astounding visage as he shouted out to overcome everything!","\"OOOOOOH!\"","Bursts of multicolored light bloomed as a seated Unnamed Kainos Emperor broke past the will of the White Dragon Emperor, his soul and Atlatl of Reality breaking past all obstacles as it was about to come in constant with the encompassing claw of this fearsome existence!","ROAAAR!","Feeling the impudence of such an action, the glimmering beastial form roared out while Noah released his own voice over and over again.","\"<Reality Piercer>! Reality Piercer! Reality Piercer! <Reality Piercer>! Reality Piercer! Reality Piercer!...!!!\"","The same ability was cast from the 10 Black Ascendancy Halos multiple times and layered on top of each other as they smashed onto the scales of the White Dragon Emperor with glorious dignity.","Noah's own True Reality Damage Value was accounted for as well as the Value from the Atlatl of Reality, and then there was the augmentation from the Black Tier Ascendancy Halos as each of the spammed attacks shockingly reached 300-400 True Reality Damage Values at this moment!","A Reality shaking impact occurred as at this moment, the multicolored Atlatl of Reality seemingly bloomed into dozens of spears of endless Realities, smashing onto the claw of the White Dragon Emperor as multiple defensive auras were ready to sustain Noah's life-force.","....BOOOOOOOOM!","Space quaked and cried out as billowing storms erupted, the wills of two Emperors smashing into each other for supremacy as Noah continued to rip apart the mysteries and visage of the austere Ninth Firmament of Ascendancy!!!"]},{"number":1627,"title":"Chapter 1627: Chapter 1626 Building the Ultimate Defense! l","paragraphs":["Chapter 1626 Building the Ultimate Defense! l","A throne made of multicolored light shot out across space to smash onto the scaled white claw of a White Dragon Emperor, the Unnamed Kainos Emperor seated the whole time as he wielded his spear forward and burst with trillions of Units of Mana!","HOOONG!","Like the blaring of a horn, the impact was deafening.","BZZZT!","The claw of the White Dragon Emperor carried the tremendous force of nine different Ninth Firmament Enders as their power easily exceeded 1,000 True Reality Damage Values and ranged upwards of 3,000, the moment of impact causing the many defensive multicolored auras around Noah to be eradicated one after another!","POP! POP! POP!..","Hundreds of True Reality Defense Values after another were wiped out even though Noah was spamming them constantly, the rate of replication of these abilities being exceeded by the damage that the White Dragon Emperor carried as it felt like every microsecond- the constant force of more than 1,000+ True Damage Values was being applied.","\"Impudence!\"","The will of the White Dragon Emperor roared out as its claw became wrapped in white lightning, putting Noah in further peril as even though his constant rate of spamming countered back with constant instant casts of Reality Piercer and Auras, he could not pierce the scales of this corporeal Dragon before him even though his will could withstand it!","The amalgamation of so many Enders under a singular formation with all of their Edicts and fused Ascendancy Halos all pummeling towards him...it was too much as any lesser existence at the Ninth Firmament would have fallen.","Yet he had shockingly faced the attack for a few microseconds without even being pushed back as when only 3 auras were left and the rate of reapplication could not keep up with the damage he was constantly receiving, he allowed the force of the White Dragon Emperor to push him back as the moment the last auras shattered, his figure was flung back across space in the same direction he came in.","BOOOM!","Like an arrow of light, he was shot back from the impact with such speed and haste that he smashed onto the opposite end of the locked down domain on the other side- his figure still seating on the Throne of Unnamed Tyranny when space broke and fissured as he smashed onto the walls of space!","Yet he was alive.","WAA!","His eyes flashed up gloriously as he looked at himself to see the Atlatl of Reality trembling as it pulsed with light, his hand holding it currently ruptured and bleeding as stellar Cosmos painted on it began to be repaired rapidly- these of his body in a similar state as fractures and split stellar skin could be seen throughout!","\"Haha...\"","He couldn't help but release a devilish laugh as even though he was pushed back, heavily injured, and outclassed on all levels- he didn't perish under the joined formation of nine powerful beings that called out the will of a past Emperor!","And this...was before he fused with his 10 Ascendancy Halos!","He was getting a better grasp of his limitations as well as how he should optimize his abilities, essence wrapping around his throne as after being shot back, he began making his way back towards the overpowering White Dragon Emperor that had burning white flames surging around its body.","Genevieve looked at this scene with somber light as seeing the state of Noah, her aged eyes flashed as her beastial figure opened its jaws yet again, releasing Resplendent rulers of Reality that almost seemed like stellar sharp bridges that made their way over!","\"Fight!\"","Her shout was resonant as the Pure-Blooded Cardinal Royal Humans joined the fray, their bodies releasing stellar waves of attacks as they tried to hide their shocks when looking at the magisterial figure of Noah seated upon his throne while fearlessly pointing his Spear of Reality forward.","Noah who at this moment felt his inadequacy when it came to defensive abilities as he began to make some changes to his concepts- his throne coming to stop in place as he didn't go into another close combat strike with the terrifying enemy, and he instead began spamming <Cosmic Thrower> from a distance as countless Unstable Cosmos carrying 200-400 True Reality Damage Values began to surge out endlessly!","His will blazed out with fervor as while this might seem like him overusing his resources to dish out crazy attacks, it cost him barely anything as the reason he did this was to keep the battle going as he collected information while also optimizing his abilities at the same time.","As for what he was optimizing?","'Take the Quasi-TABOO Tiers of the Nomological Edicts of the Beastial Reality Devourer and Sun Chaser...and transfer their tiers to the concepts of Bulwark and Antediluvian!'","HOOONG!","His dazzling Ascendancy Halos flashed as his own designed Minor Nomological Edict of Bulwark and Quasi-Insuperable Nomological Edict of Antediluvian that bolstered his life force and defense were forcefully taken from one Tier to another, the Quasi-TABOO Edicts Noah had just obtained being used as sacrifice to make this happen!","Stellar light exploded within his Origin as a verdant hue began to bloom out, the ceaseless life force of Yggdrasil surging out as the auras Noah had just been casting from Bulwark were fundamentally changed into something even more fantastical.","Prompts about the elevation of these edicts and their enhanced abilities flowed over Noah's mind as a few of them were of important significance!","<Due to the elevation of the Nomological Edict of Bulwark to Quasi-TABOO, the Flames of Bulwark have risen to a greater level as the ultimate abilities of Resource Shield Master and Runic Defender have been unlocked, along with the ushering of the Ultra Rare Bloodline of the Cosmic Armament...>","WAA!","All of his own specially designed Nomological Edicts granted stupendous Bloodlines so far as Tyrannical Emperor at Quasi-Taboo had given way to an Olden Bloodline while Sanguine Emperor had made it possible for Noah to forge his own Kainos Emperor Bloodline.","When his other Edicts were elevated to this level, even though their effects might not be as exaggerated as his most powerful Edicts- even they came with their own powerful Ultra Rare Bloodlines!","Bulwark was at a slightly lesser level as this was its result.","But Antediluvian...this Edict was made at the same time as the Dictum as Noah remembered calling out the words of these edicts hand in hand not too long ago!","Its elevation was even grander than Bulwark as it paved way for a stupendous type of Bloodline Noah had not gotten his hands on yet.","<Due to the elevation of the Nomological Edict of Antediluvian to Quasi-TABOO, the Flames of Antediluvian have risen to a greater level as the ultimate abilities of The Eonic Cosmic Yggdrasil and the Transcendent Plant Kingdom have been unlocked, along with the ushering of the Supreme Pure-Blooded Cardinal Royal Bloodline of the Infinite Willow Tree...>","...!"]},{"number":1628,"title":"Chapter 1628: Chapter 1627 Building the Ultimate Defense! ll","paragraphs":["Chapter 1627 Building the Ultimate Defense! ll","A Supreme Tier Pure-Blooded Cardinal Royal Bloodline!","There was the Pure-Blooded Cardinal Royal Human Bloodline Noah had come across as now, another Pure-Blooded Cardinal Royal Bloodline was revealed. Its name alone was domineering as from the Enders that Noah had devoured, his reserves of knowledge had increased greatly as he understood the shocking significance of this Bloodline.","The memories of the Enders- especially the Eighth Firmament ones- revealed a great deal of things as Noah was now privy to a lot more information on what these Primordial Beasts were doing!","The Eighth Firmament Enders had more access to information as from their plans, Noah saw that all of the 5 Pure-Blooded Cardinal Royal Bloodlines of the Primordials were targeted...except two of them.","The Pure-Blooded Cardinal Royal Bloodline of the Infinite Willow Trees was among them, and the Pure-Blooded Cardinal Royal Bloodline of the Reality Ursidae!","They each had their own uniqueness, but the Infinite Willow Trees were existences that had the word Infinite in their name as theoretically, the number of their branches could be infinite if they had the resources to make it possible- with their fighting power overpowering all others as it was considered among the top three most powerful races within the Primordials!","The Enders didn't target them this time around because unlike other Bloodlines, their race did not venture out far from their cluster of domains that were filled with verdant fantastical wonders, with their domains even shockingly being one of the few connected to a Grotto Sanctum their Legend resided in as angering them was tantamount to suicide if one wasn't prepared.","The Pure-Blooded Cardinal Royal Bloodline of the Reality Ursidae was something even more dreadful as they had their own stupendous perks.","But Antediluvian...had actually granted Noah a pathway into a Pure-Blooded Cardinal Royal Bloodline when his other Edicts had given him Primal Titan and Telos Bloodlines among others!","Once more, Noah's Origin buzzed as new abilities and sources of power unfolded within it, his figure still releasing incandescent Unstable Cosmos towards the towering figure of the White Dragon Emperor and the attacks from Empress Genevieve and others also landed on the visage of this Emperor!","While this occurred, Noah allowed the flow of information concerning the newly unlocked abilities and Bloodlines to flow into his mind.","First were the abilities from the concept of Bulwark.","<Resource Shield Master>:: The holder of the Flames of Bulwark can call upon every resource he controls to form a shield of this resource around his body and soul. Only Natural Resources like Mana, Destiny, Fortune, or Essence of Reality can call upon Resource Shields, with the resource or essence of Edicts not being applicable. The Resource Shields can be kept active as long as the resource is supplied, with the current quantification of the defense provided after taking into account the sources of strength from the Unnamed Kainos Emperor being 2.4 True Reality Defense Values for every actively kept Resource Shield...","\"....\"","A singular ability from Bulwark that stole the show!","Even the Ultra Rare Bloodline of the Cosmic Armament that this Edict granted could be looked down upon compared to what this ability granted!","Resource Shields dependent on the supply of that specific resource in order to be kept active.","Under his Infinite System...Noah had Infinite Resources!","WAAA!","A shocking finding as Noah had no need to even cast defensive layers of abilities over and over again as he could keep a Resource Shield of Mana, a Resource Shield of Destiny, Fortune, and in the most dangerous moments, even something like the Resource Shield of the Essence of Reality. Even though Fortune and Destiny weren't infinite... his reserves of these natural resources were so vast that he didn't see a problem with the short-term fights he normally had.","Each Resource Shield would have 240+ True Reality Defense Values as paired with the newly elevated Auras, Noah should be capable of withstanding 1,000+ True Reality Damage Values just from these Shields alone!","This was just a single new finding under Bulwark as there was still one more that would bolster Noah's defenses even more.","<Runic Defender>:: A life preservation ability that allows you to brand up to Five Runic Ecritures of Defense onto your Origin and Soul. Each Runic Ecriture of Defence grants 3 True Reality Defense Values as when added to the 2.4 Value that you can currently achieve, a single Ecriture can grant you 5.4 True Reality Defense Values. To brand a single Runic Ecriture of Defense costs 1,000 Units of the Essence of Reality and 10 Trillion Units of Mana...","His eyes flashed with a verdant essence of life force as he read yet another shocking ability.","Five Runic Ecritures of Defense could be applied to him as another layer of protection, each one having 5.4 True Reality Defense Values that would add up to 27!","'That is 2,700 True Reality Defense Values when cast through the Authority of the Black Tier Ascendancy Halos...'","Noah's mind buzzed as even he was shocked for such a possibility to be allowed for him to abuse!","This 2,700 Value was a number that would be the last layer of protection for his life.","Unless he received an instantaneous attack that eradicated this number and the number of True Reality Defense Values he had from his Resource Shields and Auras...he would not perish under anyone!","This was just from the transference of a Quasi-TABOO authority from an Edict forged by someone else to one that he designed on his own.","The designs of other beings could not even compare as even if they had access to Bulwark- could they truly utilize things like Resource Shields, Auras, and Runic Defender if they didn't have his Infinite Mana and Infinite Resources?!","Thus, Noah's power and defending capabilities were raised to another level as we hadn't even gotten to what Antediluvian granted!","We had yet to even explore the Pure-Blooded Cardinal Royal Bloodline of the Infinite Willow Tree or what the abilities of The Eonic Cosmic Yggdrasil and the Transcendent Plant Kingdom granted!","\"More...\"","OOOM!","Seated atop his throne and releasing Unstable Cosmos that ruptured space when they exploded on the scales of the White Dragon Emperor, Noah spoke lightly even as he received an immense surge of the power he wielded just now.","Even with the immense defensive boosts he had just received, he still wanted to obtain more against the terrifying coagulation of Nine Ninth Firmament Enders that had yet to get fully serious and release their ultimate abilities.","He wanted no chance of failure as even with his Main Body beginning to pull upon the dry reserves of the Essence of Reality remaining to begin establishing the Runic Ecritures of Defense around him, Noah pulled from another source of essence to call out lightly to an ability from Antediluvian!","\"Transcendent Plant Kingdom...\"","...!","HOONG!","The multicolored throne he sat on instantly became overpowered by an incandescent verdant green light.","Behind it, immense life force and vegetation erupted as the light of Antediluvian began to spread out for countless light years- establishing a Domain of the Transcendent Plant Kingdom that would guarantee the life of the Unnamed Kainos Emperor!!!"]},{"number":1629,"title":"Chapter 1629: Chapter 1628 Merely a Remnant will! l","paragraphs":["Chapter 1628 Merely a Remnant will! l","An Astounding radiance and brightness erupted from the Unnamed Kainos Emperor as he sat on his throne, waves of verdant green essence permeating throughout as a Domain spread to cover the current domains laid down, superimposing itself with them as it screamed of the authority of this Emperor!","The ability itself was one of pure wonder as it was something that went towards guaranteeing the safety of the Emperor.","<Transcendent Plant Kingdom>:: A vast domain that momentarily calls forth a Transcendent Plant Domain which is closely connected to the natural forces of life and Reality. Under this domain, your affinity to your surrounding Reality is further increased as your regeneration of all Resources including the Essence of Reality is increased by 50%. Under the domain, your body will also be passively granted the Protection of the Plant Kingdom that grants 10 True Reality Defense Values. If broken, another Protection of the Plant Kingdom will be applied gradually over time. Enemies feel a sense of suffocation from this Domain as their resource regeneration is reduced and their authorities up to the Quasi-TABOO level are reduced by 30%. The cost of this ability is pure mana from the origin of the caster as to activate it, 200 Trillion Units of Mana are required. To maintain it every second required 1 Trillion Units of Mana every second thereafter...","A stupendous ability that Noah placed even higher than Runic Defender- even though it provided 1,000 True Reality Defense Values as he cast from the Authority of the Black Tier Ascendancy Halo!","The reason for this was nothing but the fact that it was one of the only high tier abilities Noah had that purely relied on Mana!","Even Runic Defender required the Essence of Reality for every Runic Ecriture of Defence, but Noah could cast and keep active the Transcendent Plant Kingdom for as long as he wished with Infinite Mana! Even if his reserves of the Essence of Reality ran dry, this ability would always be there for him.","Thus, he called it out with fervor as all the surroundings became painted with a hue of verdant green, only the surroundings of the Ninth Firmament existences denying the domain as the Flames of the White Dragon Emperor surrounding it tried to entirely burn away the green to not have any restrictions placed on it!","Vegetation began to bloom all around this locked down domain as multicolored Vines and flowers bloomed, large trees shockingly being seen taking root in space and growing out as they formed mesmerizing scenes of utter beauty.","The leaves were lush green and even shining gold on some, rivers of liquefied green essence also roaring out to fruition as they began to flow around the domain as with all the vegetation...it seemed as if a paradisiacal domain was growing out of the Throne of Unnamed Tyranny!","Scintillating illusory tendrils of green light surged from the domain to attach onto the throne, supplying the Emperor on it with power and might as the <Protection of the Plant Kingdom> was laid down.","Dazzling Runic Ecritures that stood for the word PLANT began to surround Noah in a shocking fashion, a layer of protection worth more than 1,000+ True Reality Defense Values bloomed around him in a stellar fashion!","After the Transcendent Plant Kingdom, the other unlocked ability from Antediluvian was the Eonic Cosmic Yggdrasil- a transformation ability that would grant Noah the form of a stellar Yggdrasil as his life force and protective capabilities would be boosted even further.","But he didn't adorn himself in this form as the Unnamed Kainos Emperor Bloodline currently coursing through him wanted to take the reigns and establish its supremacy that even against other transformation abilities...it wanted to say that it could rival them in power and utilization as the blood within Noah boiled!","BZZZT!","As Noah spread out the Transcendent Plant Kingdom and continued to shoot out endlessly Unstable Cosmos from his throne, the surging flames around the White Dragon Emperor formed into tornadoes and hurricanes as the attacks of the Pure-Blooded Cardinal Royal Humans were rendered useless amidst these storms- only Noah's exploding Unstable Cosmos and the sharp rivers of Reality rulers that Genevieve continued to spit out getting across.","\"Mere ants under the Authority of this Emperor...<White Storm of the Beginning>!\"","...!","Multicolored Essence of Reality flashed in the golden eyes of the majestic White Dragon Emperor as a terrible reality altering attack was thrown out!","A serious attack from this creature that was akin to Noah's ultimate abilities!","HOOOONG!","The surrounding space trembled and shook as even Noah's verdant domain trembled, the Flames around the White Dragon Emperor surging out as if they came to life and began to spin out crazily, destroying everything in their path as even space turned into an Unstable mess.","Beatrix and the expression of other Eighth Firmament Pure-Blooded Cardinal Royal Humans changed as their bodies felt immense danger from the coming storm, the middle aged Pure-Blooded Human coming to stand before them as his figure expanded out!","OOOOOH!","With a bellow, this being glimmered gold as he raised his hands, forming an illusory Cosmic circular domain that wrapped around everyone behind him.","Meanwhile, Empress Genevieve opened her jaws as the same rulers of Reality she used to attack came to wrap around her- surging over her body in a circular fashion as her black and white fur increased in their luster, with her eyes being entirely furious as she only batted her eyes towards the direction of a ridiculous Candidate Emperor of the coming Era!","How would he defend against an ultimate attack that caused billowing white storms of Flames to rage out everywhere- an attack that was more than likely within the range of 1,000-3,000 True Reality Damage Values due to the layering of power from Nine Ninth Firmament Enders?!","SHAAA!","The Throne of Unnamed Tyranny was filled with a myriad of colors as it was now surrounded by Runic Ecritures that represented the Protection of the Plant Kingdom- this alone guaranteeing the absorption of 1,000 True Reality Defense Values.","But more than this, multicolored circular barriers of light began to rise as the enhanced auras from the now Quasi-TABOO Nomological Edict of the Bulwark were called out, all of them amounting to more than 1,000 True Reality Defense Values!","Then, there was a single Runic Ecriture of Defence that Noah had managed to cast that granted 540 True Reality Defense Values, four more on the way as soon as Noah recovered 4,000 Units of the Essence of Reality.","And after all this...he waved his Spear of Reality as he called upon his Natural Resources to enact Shields that could be kept active for as long as he lived!","Resource Shields that could be kept active with that specific resource, with Noah not being worried about the usage of Destiny and Fortune as even though they weren't limitless- his reserves were simply insane.","Multiple extra layers of glimmering circular barriers surrounded him as after all of these preparations...the raging <White Storm of the Beginning> descended onto the unshakable Throne of Unnamed Tyranny!"]},{"number":1630,"title":"Chapter 1630: Chapter 1629 Merely a Remnant will! ll","paragraphs":["Chapter 1629 Merely a Remnant will! ll","How was it possible?","This was the question ringing out over and over again in the mind of Genevieve as she stared at the Resplendent figure of the one she knew as Alexander in the corner of her eyes!","His throne was connected to a brand new verdant domain that supplied him immense waves of protection, even more layers of multicolored bubbles of light surrounding him as from the might alone, one would think a supremely powerful Ninth Firmament existence was casting all of these abilities.","'So how could you be doing this?!'","Maddening rage circled within Genevieve's mind as she felt like she was played with!","This being had acted weak as even now, no Reality Passages could be seen behind him as he shouldn't have broken his shackles yet.","And no other beings could confirm this more than Genevieve as she could still see the shackles around the body of this being- shackles that now when she looked closer, they seemed to be distinctly different from everyone else's!","'Looser?'","This was the first word that came when she looked at the shocking sight only her eyes could see.","He had the same shackles any existence who had not reached the Eighth Firmament of Ascendancy would have, and yet his shackles shockingly seemed loose as even though they were there, they seemed ready to simply fall off of him whenever he wished!","'What kind of being can break their shackles whenever they want...and you still don't?'","More and more questions buzzed from the mystery that was this being as Genevieve couldn't help but try to contain her rage. Would someone really dare to play tricks with someone like her? Some who had lived for so many years and knew so many truths!","Thus being before her seemed to be genuine as if everything about him was true as displayed...","'I truly must get my hands on him then...even if I have to irreparably injure my soul to regain my TABOO concepts!'","...!","The regaining of TABOO concepts! Only then would Empress Genevieve feel confident to dominate against this mysterious creature and even find his main body!","But for now, she could only watch his unbelievable feats as while surrounded by radiant multicolored Shields and spinning Runic Ecritures filled with life force, the storm of Flames from the White Dragon Emperor descended.","HOOOOONG!","Ravaging and merciless, space and time seemed to be torn from these flames as they erased everything.","Even the figure of the Ninth Firmament Cardinal Royal Human protecting Beatrix and the others struggled as the Flames threatened to overwhelm him and the small domain he had protecting the others, his Origin burning with stellar Essence of Reality as he called out.","\"PURE! BLOODED!\"","BZZZT!","The austere character of PURE bloomed and revolved over his head as even such a powerful Ninth Firmament existence struggled within this storm that was the combined and enhanced attack of nine supremely powerful beings!","'Yet you...'","But the figure of the Unnamed Kainos Emperor floated atop his throne calmly as he even laid back on it as the storm descended..","His many multicolored Shields flickered, with some even fading as the moment the Flames should have erased the last set of shield, more seemed to propagate at that moment as the terrifying white flames melting everything didn't reach him!","Flames carrying with them heat equivalent to the destruction of any range of 1000-3000 True Reality Damage Values depending on which region you were standing in!","It was a type of attack that the truest upper tier of the Ninth Firmament could ever manage to release, and yet this being laid back on his throne as he faced it, his eyes releasing arcs of multicolored light when he realized it couldn't break through his last layers of defenses and he could apply more Shields before enough True Reality Damage came through.","\"Haha...\"","His boisterous laughter shockingly began to resound while he was surrounded by terrible storms of Reality rending flames!","\"This...is my will!\"","RUMBLE!","His words cut through the <White Storm of the Beginning> as even his Transcendent Plant Kingdom constantly regenerated, the Throne of this being moving from its anchored position and beginning to shoot forward towards the enraged visage of a fallen Emperor.","\"My will...a mere remnant like you would never be able to match it!\"","....!!!","Purely coincidental.","A point in destiny that was purely coincidental occurred as Noah had no idea of the true identity of Genevieve apart from her being from the Olden Times, and yet he utilized the word Remnant while addressing the fallen will of the White Dragon Emperor as when these words rang in the ears of the Empress...they thundered as if they were directed to her!","Even the three hidden existences in the mirror dimension paused slightly as even though nobody had any idea they were there, their illusory crowns spun as the words of the Emperor on the Throne seemed to challenge any and all past Emperors- his will challenging telling them that they could not compare!","As for Noah himself, he affirmed that he could handle something as shocking as a rough range of over 2,500 True Reality Damage Values at this moment. As long as the number didn't exceed this and the damage was carried over a few seconds, he could spam his Shields and Auras to offset it within moments.","It meant he could move freely as on the side of Defense...he could be considered to have exceeded any normal parameters as his True Sanguine Clone could have a level of safety so long as it was careful against this great enemy!","Now that Defense was covered...the time for truly overpowered offensive maneuvers came.","He had <Apocalyptic Erasure> that was further enhanced due to the elevation of Apocalypse to Quasi-TABOO, but this was just an ability that contended against the concepts of other beings as if they couldn't stand his will and soul, he could target the life and origin of their Existence, their memories, or their comprehension in Laws, Daos, and Edicts to all be under his control to erase.","He needed something that didn't just contend against concepts, but a pure offensive heavily damaging ability that would have a high quantification of True Reality Damage Values that could also be augmented by the Atlatl of Reality and utilized under the Authority of his Halos!","He could forge such an ability through forming another Quasi-TABOO Nomological Edict...or he could just design the ability right then and there with <Skill Creation>.","He could even design an entire Skill Tree of heavily offensive targeted abilities based on others he had before, but edited to be capable of releasing power equivalent to the shattering of Realities!","As for what could make such a thing possible?","This was where the newly obtained <Reality Resource Points> that Noah had attained as loot from the elevated Resplendent Treasure Emperor came in!"]},{"number":1631,"title":"Chapter 1631: Chapter 1630 Keystone Ascendant Skill Tree! l","paragraphs":["Chapter 1630 Keystone Ascendant Skill Tree! l","In Noah's life, Skill Points had become Cosmic Resource Points, and now they became Reality Resource Points!","The skill points themselves were heavily used for Skill Trees and the elevation of skills, with the Cosmic Resource Points being even more wondrous as one could even assimilate their daos or complete their Edicts with them, along with the creation of ridiculous abilities.","Now, there came <Reality Resource Points>.","<Reality Resource Points>:: A tremendous accumulation of Authority that is capable of Reality altering feats. A single Reality Resource Point allows for the completion of any Edict up to the Quasi-TABOO level, along with the complete change and elevation of any skill trees. A new type of skill tree known as a [Keystone Ascendant Skill Tree] can now be formed through Reality Resource Points, with the abilities cast from such a skill tree having increased affinity to the natural laws of Reality. The Reality Resource Points can also be permanently consumed to nourish the soul or to grant .01 True Reality Values permanently...","\"Something that opens up a new world of possibilities...\"","Noah's voice echoed out from his main body as his True Sanguine Clone withstood a ravaging storm of Flames from the White Dragon Emperor, this battle seemingly coming to a standstill once more under Noah's thoughts that were currently moving at high speeds while in the Cosmic Holy Land to achieve things before even an instant passed in the outside world!","His thoughts were now focused on Reality Resource Points and what he could make out of them, the core thing now being the upgrade to skill trees that through Reality Resource Points...Noah could now make [Keystone Ascendant Skill Trees].","Keystone! The central principle or idea that anything depends on, or some might even know of the idea about keystone species who affect their environment disproportionate to their relative abundance! Now, such an idea was applied to Noah's skill trees.","<Keystone Ascendant Skill Tree>:: A unique concept that significantly affects the usage of specific Edicts and Reality altering concepts under the user. 5 of the strongest concepts under you can be chosen as the base sources of essence for a skill tree, with their Essence becoming fused seamlessly and holding increased affinity to the Natural Laws of Reality. When the abilities of the skills within the skill trees are cast, the possible reality altering effect released is something that wouldn't have been achievable before. Skills from previous skill trees can be taken and modified to birth new ones as they become Keystone Ascendant Skills that are only able to be cast through their specific 5 selected base Edicts...","This was the wonder before Noah's eyes!","This was also the answer for him to further elevated himself as forging a heavily offensive pathway would be a breeze as it would combine 5 of the strongest Quasi-TABOO Nomological Edicts he placed as the base!","Even stronger defensive capabilities can be called forth through a Keystone Ascendant Skill Tree in the near future as for now, Noah's first order of business was something heavily offensive.","OOOM!","His will surged within his soul as it searched the many concepts within them, wanting to combine old skills as well as forge new ones as at his fast rate of thought processing, he was done within mere moments.","But before he started...","\"Grant Cessation, Commandment, Resplendent Treasure Emperor, Forgemaster, and Amelioration the tiers of Quasi-TABOO...\"","BZZZT!","Five of the newly gained Quasi-TABOO Nomological Edicts from the Enders that Noah considered weak were shredded of their tiers as Noah's own concepts were elevated to Quasi-TABOO!","His soul surged with fervor and power as many abilities were elevated as along with it...multiple Ultra Rare Bloodlines were also born!","They were all on the same Tier as the Ultra Rare Bloodline that Bulwark had granted when it reached Quasi-TABOO as nothing ecstatic as the Pure-Blooded Cardinal Royal Bloodline of the Infinite Willow Tree was granted. But...there was something unique with the now Quasi-TABOO Resplendent Treasure Emperor that had to be delved into later.","After this, Noah proceeded with the birth of the first Keystone Ascendant Skill Tree!","\"Design the Keystone Ascendant Firmament Cataclysm Skill Tree...take the Quasi-TABOO Nomological Edicts of Apocalypse, Tyrannical Emperor, Sanguine Emperor, Cessation, and Commandment as the base. The skills to be altered and modified are Fireball, Sever, Sword of...\"","His thoughts moved rapidly as his soul became covered by a unique authority, his ideas being analyzed as soon enough- a message arrived in his mind!","<The cost to bring the Keystone Ascendant Firmament Cataclysm Skill Tree into fruition is 1,000 Reality Resource Points. You currently have 1,233 Reality Resource Points.>","...!","He had obtained an abysmal number of Reality Resource Points barely over 100 from the Seventh Firmament Enders, but these points had jumped up greatly from the deaths of the Eighth Firmament Enders as he had more than enough for what he needed to do now!","\"Proceed.\"","His command was given as the unique authority of Reality Resource Points glimmered and manifested as a multicolored light that wrapped over Noah's Origin and soul, etching unique Runic Ecritures within him as they were giving birth to a wondrous new concept.","A fantastical new concept as in no time...","<The Keystone Ascendant Firmament Cataclysm Skill Tree has been successfully designed!>","OOOM!","Austere waves of essence flashed out as Noah's mind received a burst of new information.","<Keystone Ascendant Firmament Cataclysm Skill Tree>(0/20):: An Ascendant Skill Tree born with the concepts of the Quasi-TABOO Nomological Edicts of Apocalypse, Tyrannical Emperor, Sanguine Emperor, Cessation, and Commandment as the base, with all abilities under this skill tree having Increased Affinity with the Natural Laws of Reality as when cast, Essence of Reality will naturally be mobilized from the surroundings to aid in their formation. It is created with the idea that all abilities from this skill tree will bring Cataclysm onto any existences ascending the Firmaments and to even stand a chance of challenging those who have exceeded the parameters of the Firmaments. Abilities include [Ascendant Reality Fireball](0/5), [Ascendant Sword of Reality](0/5), [Ascendant Reality Sever](0/5), and [Ascendant Noxious Rain](0/5).","A bloody new concept that would paint countless Realities with crimson gold blood bloomed at this moment!"]},{"number":1632,"title":"Chapter 1632: Chapter 1631 Keystone Ascendant Skill Tree! ll","paragraphs":["Chapter 1631 Keystone Ascendant Skill Tree! ll","A Keystone Ascendant Skill Tree that utilized the essence of five Quasi-TABOO Nomological Edicts and fused them seamlessly to achieve Reality altering skills! One that had the effects of Apocalyptic Erasure from the Nomological Edict of Apocalypse and the boosts of all the other Quasi-TABOO Edicts as its effects...would simply be disastrous.","This was another pathway that had opened up before Noah through the Loot he gained from the authority of the Resplendent Treasure Emperor, his mind greedily gazing at the reformed abilities and new abilities under this skill tree that were now attached with True Reality Damage Values.","[Ascendant Reality Fireball](0/5):: An extremely dense vacillating Reality made of up volatile essences of 5 Quasi-TABOO Nomological Edicts that had been condensed into an immense ball of Flames is called forth. It has a homing quality that transcends across Realities and dimensions as the target will always be hit as long as they remain in your mind during the process of casting. The moment that the Ascendant Reality Fireball makes contact with the enemy, it multiplies into five vacillating Realities that explode to release a Nova of Flames and Death. The ability can currently deal 2 True Reality Damage Values as it costs 100 Units of the Essence of Reality and 100 Trillion Units of Mana to cast...","The F rank Fireball that was learned when Noah first awakened was reformed into an ability that called forth a vacillating Reality condensed into an extremely dense and horrific sun, this ability currently dealing 2 True Reality Damage Values as if one looked closely, they could see the numbers (0/5) in parenthesis next to the name of the ability!","Similar to the mere skill points of the past, Noah could utilize the Reality Resource Points to elevate just how ridiculous this skill could be! And the results when he did so...","[Ascendant Reality Fireball](5/5):: An extremely dense vacillating Reality made of up volatile essences of 5 Quasi-TABOO Nomological Edicts that had been condensed into an immense ball of Flames is called forth. It has a homing quality that transcends across Realities and dimensions as the target will always be hit as long as they remain in your mind during the process of casting. The moment that the Ascendant Reality Fireball makes contact with the enemy, it multiplies into five vacillating Realities that explode to release a Nova of Flames and Death. The ability can currently deal 10 True Reality Damage Values as it costs 50 Units of the Essence of Reality and 50 Trillion Units of Mana to cast...","\"...\"","The True Reality Damage was increased from 2 to 10 as the cost of activating the Ascendant Reality Fireball was halved!","It meant that without any other boosts, this single ability when cast under the Authority of the Black Tier Ascendancy Halo...easily reached over 1,000 True Reality Damage Values.","'And this...should be the most straightforward skill within this skill tree, yes?'","Noah's eyes released dazzling light as his mind continued computing on overdrive, going over to pump the rest of the skills and the entire Keystone Ascendant Firmament Cataclysm Skill Tree with Reality Resource Points before he read on!","[Ascendant Sword of Reality](5/5):: From the folds of space, an enormous Sword of Reality made of up volatile essences of 5 Quasi-TABOO Nomological Edicts descends. The Sword of Reality has a homing quality that transcends across Realities and dimensions as the target will always be hit as long as they remain in your mind during the process of casting. The Sword of Reality has a unique feature as it contains its own Reality Altering Affix that makes its size and mass five times larger than its intended target. The ability can currently deal 20 True Reality Damage Values as it costs 100 Units of the Essence of Reality and 500 Trillion Units of Mana to cast...","[Ascendant Noxious Rain](5/5):: An Area of Effect ability that covers any domain that the Unnamed Kainos Emperor lays out. The walls of the Dream Dimension as pulled upon with the aid of Infinite Dream as your consciousness has its operations reduced by half, but the result is a Noxious Rain from the tears of Nightmare Abominations of the Dream Dimension descending unto your enemies for as long as the skill is active. A single drop of the Ascendant Noxious Rain carries 2 True Reality Damage Value. Anyone designated as an enemy will face the Noxious Rain for 10 Microseconds as a single cast of this ability allows it to remain active for that long, utilizing 100 Units of the Essence of Reality and 500 Trillion Units of Mana to cast...","[Ascendant Reality Sever](5/5):: Undoubtedly one of the fastest if not the fastest ability within the Firmaments of Ascendancy. It allows for one to release an extremely condensed ray of vacillating Realities for as long as their resources can handle it, this ray being capable of severing even the walls of dimensions to reach their intended target. When a ray of Reality Sever makes contact with an enemy, it has a chaining feature that allows it to strike up to one hundred nearby enemies as with every chain, the damage increases by 1%. Every time an enemy is hit by a Reality Sever ray, an Ascendant Reality Fireball also blooms as with every additional enemy the ray jumps onto, the number of Ascendant Reality Fireballs released upon contact increases by 1. The ability can currently deal 30 True Reality Damage Values as it costs 1,000 Units of the Essence of Reality and 500 Trillion Units of Mana to cast and keep active every Microsecond, allowing for the chaining effect to continue repeating on the same enemy or multiple nearby enemies until their Origins perish or your resources run out...","\"Glorious...\"","The stage was set.","Abilities so ridiculous that one would shake their head at them were born as just the singular ability of Ascendant Reality Sever caused one to take a few minutes to admire!","This...was just a single aspect of the Keystone Ascendant Firmament Cataclysm Skill Tree!","There was something else to be mindful of even after the design of such a ridiculous Keystone Ascendant Skill Tree.","Noah had gained the card of the Infinite Willow Tree Pure-Blooded Cardinal Royal Bloodline that he had yet to touch. He also still hadn't fused with his Ascendancy Halos to achieve his strongest form!","All of these were still factors to consider when accounting for just how much True Reality Damage Values he would be able to deal when the time came- with the Reality being that he still hadn't touched any of these cards he held!","This was because the danger he felt with his clone perishing out of this event...had not yet faded.","Either the Visage of the White Dragon Emperor still had many things to reveal or...there was something even more disastrous than the Amalgamation of the strength of 9 Ninth Firmament Enders of Reality!","If Noah attained his strongest form now, it meant he couldn't have any other cards to play when the truly perilous time came!","So he bid his time.","So he waited for whatever was lying in wait to reveal itself as he forged a terrifying Keystone Ascendant Skill Tree that was revealed at this moment to traumatize any being that remained alive enough to watch its abilities!"]},{"number":1633,"title":"Chapter 1633: Chapter 1632 Let's not waste any loot! l","paragraphs":["Chapter 1632 Let's not waste any loot! l","In an infinitesimally small region space within the vast Boundary Between Realities.","Spatial fluctuations could be felt as the figures of two beings were seen soon after, the two of them being entirely identical as their heads carried a grandeur of solidified crimson gold and blue crowns!","Their figures alone showed astounding visage as these two were True Sanguine Clones of Noah...two of the three newly unlocked Higher Existence True Sanguine Clones that Noah had gained with the upgrade of the Sanguine Emperor to Quasi-TABOO as its abilities were elevated. From the three True Sanguine Clones Noah could call out, this number had now been elevated to Six.","These two extra Clones appeared in the region of Unstable space next to the hidden rift into the Azure Forsaken Treasure Reality as they instantly surged into it- their appearance here being for two purposes.","One was to increase the pace that Noah explored and obtained the Modus Operandi hidden within this Azure Treasure Reality, and the other was to collect the Loot of Reality Crystals from the Clone that had been exploring this Reality with Natalya this whole time as Noah...would greatly need his reserves of the Essence of Reality to be regenerated if he wanted to use his newly forged abilities from the Keystone Ascendant Firmament Cataclysm Skill Tree fully!","The transference of loot with the restrictions of the Forsaken Treasure Reality couldn't be bypassed at this moment with the Atlatl of Reality that Noah couldn't let go of during a great battle, so this action effectively meant that three of Noah's True Sanguine Clones would be wrapped in the Azure Forsaken Treasure Reality to rapidly unearth the remaining pages of the Modus Operandi of the Azure Treasure Emperor, with another True Sanguine Clone currently facing the will of a Dragon Emperor under a locked down domain.","This begged the question...where would Noah be utilizing his two other remaining True Sanguine Clones that could display battle power at times that exceeded the original body?","—","A devilish storm born from the will of White Dragon Emperor raged, pulling apart verdant stellar trees growing in space and burning the lush vegetation blooming all around from the Transcendent Plant Kingdom of the Unnamed Kainos Emperor that continued to heal just as quickly as it was destroyed!","The figure of Empress Genevieve was covered by sharply spinning rulers of Reality that protected her against the White flames burning everything, the figure of her Ninth Firmament Cardinal Royal Human Guard being worse for wear as this being had a solemn expression while his domain of stellar light protecting the other Pure-Blooded Cardinal Royal Humans behind him trembled.","This was a storm cast from the will of 9 conjoined Ninth Firmament Enders. It wasn't a joke as even someone of such a powerful Bloodline like a Pure-Blooded Cardinal Royal Bloodline could not withstand such a ridiculous attack!","Yet...","\"Haha!\"","The boisterous laughter of a certain Candidate Emperor of the coming Age of Emperors could be heard as he floated grandly on his throne while pointing a Spear of Reality that released countless Unstable Cosmos forward!","Unstable Cosmos that when they came in contact with the unbreachable scales of the White Dragon Emperor- they exploded into Novas of Reality due to the Reality Nova Jewel currently attached to the Spear of Reality.","While all of them struggled, this being was shockingly carefree while surrounded by glimmering Shields of Essence that seemed capable of withstanding the explosions of thousands of Realities!","HOOOONG!","The raging storm died down as along with it, devastating crevices and Unstable space was born, the eyes of the White Dragon Emperor glaring with majestic malice carefully at the unaffected Seventh Firmament throned being who actually withstood an attack from it!","Even the Ninth Firmament Royal Human Guard was breathing hard as he arrived to his knees, his body having been tinged by a few white flames as this being had gone to not only protect himself- but also the Eighth Firmament Cardinal Royal Humans that could shockingly not contribute much to the current level of battle.","Even Beatrix was breathing heavily while looking towards Genevieve with a seemingly saddened expression, her body ravaged by wounds like all the remaining Eighth Firmament Pure-Blooded Guards as even under the protection of another, they could not escape heavy damage to their Origins!","If an attack of such a caliber was released again, a few of them might just perish as if there were any drastic actions to be taken to absolve them of the current perilous situation, now was the time.","They all knew this as the pristine White Dragon Emperor knew it even more, not even batting his eyes towards the Eighth Firmament Pure-Blooded Guards as its focus remained on Noah and Genevieve!","It might not have paid attention...but a certain Emperor did.","\"Hmmm...\"","His laughter ended as while his Transcendent Plant Kingdom bloomed dense and lustrous vegetation all around him, he stared at the distraught bodies of some of the most powerful Eighth Firmament existences one could come across.","Of Pure-Blooded Cardinal Royal Humans who held 2 Reality Passages each as their power was unrivaled in the Eighth Firmament, with two of them even being capable of withstanding a single Ninth Firmament being on their own!","Such existences were...","\"Too much of a waste if you do not perish in my hands...\"","RUMBLE!","His Tyrannical will surged out!","He gazed above his throne as he saw the dense lustrous vegetation still blooming around him, pulling upon 100 Units of the Essence of Reality and 500 Trillion Units of Mana to call out.","\"Ascendant Noxious Rain.\"","BZZZT!","The eyes of the White Dragon Emperor flashed with intensity.","Empress Genevieve's eyes flashed with anger as her observatory awareness felt the figure of Noah pull upon an immense authority that shockingly even exceeded to touch upon another dimension as from the highest points of space within this locked down domain...","TA! TA! TA...TRAA!","The sound of rain began to fall as along with it, the gazes of all beings except the cold eyes of the Unnamed Kainos Emperor became somber!","When the eyes of the Eighth Firmament Pure-Blooded Cardinal Royal Humans gazed up, they trembled as they saw countless purple silver drops of sharp rain drops descend down at speeds akin to the fastest bombs!","Countless rain drops that were falling and continued to fall as each one carried more than 200 True Reality Damage Values! One must recall how a mere shout from Noah that dispersed 100 True Reality Damage Values had injured and killed Eighth Firmament Enders as now, countless raindrops that each carried more than double of such damage smashed towards everyone.","The larger an existence was...the more rain drops would fall onto them.","With each one coming down with the exploding might of 200 Realities...","HOOOOONG!","Shocking rivers of crimson gold blood erupted! Along with them was the shout of a wrathful Empress!","\"You dare?!\"","WAA!"]},{"number":1634,"title":"Chapter 1634: Chapter 1633 Let's not waste any loot! ll","paragraphs":["Chapter 1633 Let's not waste any loot! ll","\"You dare?!\"","WAA!","An ability that pulled upon the Dream Dimension to call down a Noxious Rain that were the tears of Nightmare Abominations from this dimension! This was what Noah called down as such a rain coveted all the regions of the locked down domain!","ROAAR!","The White Dragon Emperor had its white scales shining with scintillating light as the Purple silver drops descended on it the most as it covered the largest surface area out of everyone.","The body of Empress Genevieve was swirling with even more rulers of Reality as one had even shot out to wrap around a heavily injured Beatrix!","But golden rivers of blood still bloomed as the already injured Origins of the Eighth Firmament Pure-Blooded Cardinal Royal Humans could not withstand the drizzling raindrops as their bodies were covered by hundreds of such dew drops in a single microsecond!","That was hundreds of dew drops that carried the force of 200 exploding Realities as these beings could do nothing but stare in shock as they perished!","Perished from an attack thrown out by the being their Empress was bringing along as Genevieve herself had spoken out wrathfully.","Yet against such anger, the eyes of the Emperor upon the throne raised languidly as he locked his gaze with the luminous wrathful eyes of Empress Genevieve and spoke out calmly.","\"I dared.\"","...!","TRRR!","Drizzling Noxious Rain continued to fall as the surrounding reality was thrown into utter chaos, microseconds passing as the duration of this shocking ability would end soon! Amidst it's eerie and shocking waves, the voice of the Unnamed Kainos Emperor continued to ring out.","\"They would have perished in the next few attacks anyways, so I simply cleared the battlefield of pests that cannot contribute anything!\"","WAA!","With a domineering gaze, he spoke out while watching bountiful prompts blooming over his eyes!","<The ownership of the Quasi-TABOO Nomological Edict and Flames of the Body Forging Emperor has been granted.>","<The ownership of the Quasi-TABOO Nomological Edict and Flames of Gigantomachia has been granted.>","<The ownership of the Quasi-TABOO Nomological Edict and Flames of the Skeleton Refiner has been granted....","Golden glimmering prompt after prompt cascaded over his eyes of him obtaining Edicts, Reality Resource Points, and even more wondrous loot in the form of Shards of a Seed of Reality!","The Pure-Blooded Cardinal Royal Human Guards were another Tier of beings as each held multiple Quasi-TABOO Nomological Edicts, with Noah gaining more from them than all the dozens of the Eighth Firmament Enders he defeated before as he felt over 90 Quasi-TABOO Nomological Edicts surging towards him as the robust origins of these existences shattered.","Even though he was tempted to utilize Resplendent Treasure Cache on these supremely built beings, he still held himself back as the golden light of the Cache shone the most possibilities on the Ninth Firmament existences!","'Existences like you...'","Noah's eyes had moved to the maddened looking Ninth Firmament Royal Human Guard who had just spoken down at him now too long ago, this being staring towards him with more hatred than even the White Dragon Emperor as he looked at his fallen comrades while his body also faced heavy injuries from Noah's attack.","Even the Empress was maddened as her voice still came out while her body released waves of power!","\"You..!\"","\"Me? Why put up this act, Empress?\" Noah sat back on his throne languidly as the Noxious Rain let up and only left behind devastation, the enormous body of the White Dragon Emperor rising up once more as its scales barely looked dented even after suffering countless drops of 200 True Reality Damage Values!","\"Would you have even let them live when they clearly see you are not truly a Pure-Blooded Cardinal Royal Humans at the depths of your soul? Why must we act like the both of us had not seen the destiny of these beings ending here today?!\"","...!","His languid voice turned Tyrannical as he actually spoke back against Genevieve, the figure of this Sacred Beast species shaking from pure anger as Beatrix was barely protected by her visage, this Olden Emperor wanting to explode right here and now!","I have killed your subordinates. Should you not be thanking me now?","These were the words Empress Genevieve seemed to hear as her eyes erupted with utter wrath, her illusory crown spinning rapidly as her visage had taken an attack!","She truly wanted to explode at this being right here and now but...","\"You must perish!\"","BZZT!","The will of the White Dragon Emperor raged out once more.","Now was not the time as they still faced a great enemy!","The will of this enemy raged out as the coagulation of Enders saw Noah's increasingly ridiculous abilities and the authority of candidacy shining over his head, its astounding destiny told it this being truly had to perish here today!","Otherwise, an enormous sense of trepidation that it couldn't explain rose as it sensed even the destinies of the Endless Primordial Beasts becoming affected if this being wasn't cut off here and now.","Every moment that passed, this being seemed to reveal more and more disastrous power as the destinies of the collective Enders that called down the visage of the White Dragon Emperor came to a single conclusion.","This being had to be defeated as quickly as possible!","BZZZT!","Vibrant Essence of Reality began to accumulate on the dazzling white scaled chest of this majestic creature.","A resonating hum rang out at the same time as its jaws began to open, these jaws hiding immense pulsing stellar light as the strongest and most widely known attack a dragon could lay out was charged up at this moment!","It was Dragon's Breath...but at a scale that would make the strongest existences in the Ninth Firmament weep.","The expression of Empress Genevieve changed as her jewel-like eyes remained cold, Beatrix pulled close to her while the Ninth Firmament Royal Human floated beside her as well with a solemn maddened look!","A critical moment had arrived in the battle as the Unnamed Kainos Emperor layered more and more defensive Shields and Auras onto himself while voicing out at the terrifying build up of Essence of Reality from the jaws of the White Dragon Emperor.","\"Could you not have waited a few microseconds longer?\"","Just a few microseconds. Enough for his clone to return from the Forsaken Treasure Reality and give him some Reality Crystals that would replenish his reserves for him to go utterly crazy!","With the White Dragon Emperor throwing out another deadly ultimate attack now, Noah would be cutting it close as the moment this attack arrived...would also very the time he could fully utilize the strongest skills from his Keystone Ascendant Skill Tree as it was time to do something he had wanted to do for quite a while.","'Set the targets for the Resplendent Treasure Cache...'","...!"]},{"number":1635,"title":"Chapter 1635: Chapter 1634 Wiping Out Ninth Firmaments in Microseconds! l","paragraphs":["Chapter 1634 Wiping Out Ninth Firmaments in Microseconds! l","From the Dual Empowerment and Corruption of the Resplendent Treasure Emperor, its abilities were greatly elevated as Noah had even received the wondrous boon of having the number of times he could utilize Cache increased from 3 to 6!","Since he had already used it on the Gazer, he had the counter of 5 out 6 chances remaining.","Then just moments ago...he had elevated Resplendent Treasure Emperor to Quasi-TABOO along with 4 other Edicts, new boosts blooming out once more as one of them was the elevation of status from Destiny Goblin King to the Supreme Bloodline of the Destiny Goblin Emperor!","Along with this was another change in the Resplendent Treasure Cache ability.","<Resplendent Treasure Cache>:: The Resplendent Treasure Cache is an ability that will become available during a Nexus Event and can be utilized for a total of Nine times in your lifetime, each time against a single target. Its activation allows for the parameters of Reality to be exceeded greatly as the defeat of the selected enemy brings to fruition a [Resplendent Treasure Cache] that contains a wide assortment of Loot that is dictated by the momentary Increase of +50,000,000% Increased Loot Quantity and +5,000,000% Increased Loot Rarity. These Reality altering effects can only be activated by immense reserves of the Essence of Reality and are only applicable against the single selected enemy as the products one can obtain from the formed [Resplendent Treasure Cache] vary. Current chances to utilize Resplendent Treasure Cache- (8/9)","The addition of three more chances appeared before Noah's eyes as Increased Loot Quantity went from 10 million to 50 million for this singular ability, with Increased Loot Rarity also being multiplied five times!","With this wondrous elevation in place, there lay many possibilities on what the Cache would bring out as there could be even more glorious things than Olden Orbs of Transmogrification, Breath of Reality, and Reality Jewels!","SHIIING!","The targets were marked in Noah's mind for exactly which Ninth Firmament existences would be the ones to grant him the Loot from the Resplendent Treasure Cache, his figure shining with waves of incandescent multicolored light that was overpopulated with verdant green due to the Transcendent Plant Kingdom- his spear painted forward as the White Dragon Emperor roared out!","\"<Breath of the Endless White Seas>.\"","...!","The surrounding space tumbled fearfully as the jaws of this visage of an Emperor glimmered with multicolored light, bright and burning clusters of condensed flames so potent that they seemed liquefied surging out as a singular glorious pillar that covered everything.","Everything!","Liquefied flames in the form of Dragon's Breath as seeing how they were tearing apart and melting the surrounding space, Noah measured it out to be over 3,000 True Reality Damage Values!","A truly terrifying attack as it has entirely surpassed what common Ninth Firmament existences could dish out, Noah curious to see how Genevieve would survive this as her body began to glow with devilish obsidian skull marks similar to MADNESS that she fused with.","As for Noah? He watched as the billowing pillar of liquefied flames came calmly.","His defenses were already in place as even if he was within an inch of his life, he had affirmed that this Clone would survive. He had no need to even fuse with all his Ascendancy Halos yet as for now, he waited for a True Sanguine Clone to leave a certain restricted Reality!","'1...2...3...!\"","HOOONG!","As the billowing liquefied Breath surged out to cover everything, Noah counted down as the bells of destiny rung.","His figure was 2 microseconds away from being hit by the <Breath of the Endless White Seas>, but he knew that the attack he would throw out would reach his enemy first!","This was because at this moment, the Clone he had been waiting for appeared outside the Forsaken Treasure Reality. The Expansive Space he shared was freed of restrictions and pulled upon as the Reality Crystals were even shattered within this space, billowing seas of multicolored Essence of Reality surging out to fill Noah's soul!","A single soul, multiple bodies.","When restrictions were cast aside, everything connected to the main body could be freely grasped by his Clones as Noah felt his soul filling with the Essence of Reality- his mind moving rapidly as he went to cast the fastest skill in his arsenal!","<Ascendant Reality Sever>.","SHAA!","In slowed down time, one could see a shockingly sharp ray blooming from the tip of Noah's Spear of Reality.","A ray of a vacillating Reality that glimmered with a stellar light- an ability that a single cast of it allowed for it to chain on 100 enemies within a single microsecond!","And for every microsecond that Noah held this ability, this chaining effect would continue as he could deliver 3,000+ True Reality Damage Values to his enemies simultaneously in the single microsecond!","This wasn't all as every attack would bloom with a Reality Frost Nova that with the capabilities of the Atlatl of Reality, it could deal a range of 200-400 True Reality Damage Values. Then...there was the feature of Ascendant Reality Sever that allowed for Ascendant Reality Fireballs to bloom on every enemy hit, with their number increasing for every successfully chained enemy as each of these fireballs also carried 1,000+ True Reality Damage Values, with each of their explosions also triggering another set of Reality Novas.","It was simply an obscene and disgusting sequence of skills that when everything was accounted for, over 4,000+ True Reality Damage Values would be delivered to every enemy, this damage only increasing the longer that Noah kept the Ascendant Reality Sever skill active!","'Let's us tear apart the visage of an old Emperor...'","SHAA!","Like a mere flash of light, the severing light that could tear apart dimensions shot out faster that even though it was cast after the terrifying liquefied Dragon's Breath, it reached the White Dragon Emperor first as a shocking sequence of events happening in the next few moments that would cause even the hiddenly watching existences to look on with serious expressions!","It was a multi-target skill, so Noah simply had the figures of the Nine Enders of Reality that made up the entire White Dragon Emperor in his mind when he cast it.","The severing ray of light first hit the tail of the White Dragon Emperor as it shockingly pierced through the visage as if it was bypassing dimensions, smashing into the body of the obsidian Scorpion as horrific Reality altering Ascendant Fireballs bloomed along with a direct hit to its Origin that all totaled to more than 4,000 True Damage Values!"]},{"number":1636,"title":"Chapter 1636: Chapter 1635 Wiping Out Ninth Firmaments in Microseconds! ll","paragraphs":["Chapter 1635 Wiping Out Ninth Firmaments in Microseconds! ll","4,000 True Reality Damage Values!","One must remember...a normal Ninth Firmament could release and receive a range of 100-300 True Reality Damage Values.","The Ninth Firmament Enders here were all top tier as they might be able to withstand even 500 Values, with the Visage that combined their wills and power granting them further protection as their Defenses rose above a thousand!","They could dish out much more damage than what each of them could individually receive due to their combinations of wills.","But when the visage of the White Dragon Emperor was smashed into as they received this damage themselves individually...a horrendous and unbelievable reality played out as Ascendant Reality Sever smashed into the tail where the Scorpion was and then chained to the crimson Spider, and then to all the remaining Ninth Firmament Enders contained within the formation that made the White Dragon Emperor!","The Ascendant Reality Sever could barely be seen as it chained across the Origins of these powerful enemies, bringing with them utterly shocking Damage as by the time the ray of Reality smashed onto the pure White Dragon Ender that was at the head of the enormous White Dragon Emperor...the whole visage of this will they called down developed ruptures as the untouchable scales fractured and began bursting with illusory golden red blood.","Its anchors that made it had their Origins rocked by immense Damage as the coagulated will was affected by extension, any powerful Ninth Firmament being capable of doing nothing but falling if they met 4,000 True Reality Damage Values onto their Origins!","And yet Ascendant Reality Sever was kept active as its last target had not even been reached for its first microsecond!","There was still one being that Noah designated as an enemy apart from the Nine Ninth Firmament Enders...the already injured Pure-Blooded Cardinal Royal Human Guard that had faced the collective attacks of the Nine Enders being the last target.","BZZZT!","Sever smashed into the Origin of this being with such haste and ferocity when he was shockingly already defending against the Dragon's Breath that had nearly reached them, such an unexpected attack creating for a saddening Reality for this being!","A truly saddening reality as when Ascendant Reality Sever reached him, it already had its Damage augmented by 9% as he faced the strongest attack yet!","Truly saddening as within this battlefield...the first Ninth Firmament existence to fall would be none other than him.","...!","Nobody was even able to react.","Empress Genevieve's instincts had rung out warning bells even though she wasn't placed as Noah's target, her consciousness vibrating with power as shock coursed through it when she watched a terrifying blow link from the head of the White Dragon Emperor and smash into the Origin of her strongest guard- a ray of Resplendent Unstable Reality instantly piercing and ripping apart the soul contained within the body and origin of this being as under the effect of Apocalyptic Erasure, everything was already decimated before 10 Ascendant Reality Fireballs bloomed to entirely rip apart the origin and body of this being!","BOOOOOOM!","A shocking explosion rocked out.","A glimmer of unseen gold bloomed as the first target of the Resplendent Treasure Cache was triggered, illustrious pillars of golden light that only Noah could see shooting out and beginning to condense into a dazzling treasure chest!","It was around this same time that the Dragon's Breath actually reached Genevieve, Beatrix, and Noah's coldly gazing figure, but the shock in everyone's hearts was just beginning as the ability of <Ascendant Reality Sever> was still kept active, going on to chain towards its 11th target that turned out to be the Obsidian Scorpion once more.","The Ender that with the first strike had barely survived due to the Protection of the White Dragon Emperor's will faced even more horrific damage than the first time, the already unremarkable origin being shredded apart entirely along with its soul as this being also died even before it got to understand what just happened!","It wasn't the only one as the Crimson Spider was next, its Origin facing the same fate.","BOOM! BOOM!","One by one, every Ender that the unstoppable ray of light delivering over 4,000 True Reality Damage Values reached a second time perished without a shadow of a doubt!","Every Ender...but the most powerful pure White Dragon who let out a maddened roar and collected every part of the remaining visage of the White Dragon Emperor unto it.","\"OOOOOOH!\"","A bellow full of shock and disbelief echoed out as the scales that made the visage of the White Dragon Emperor fell apart one after another, this illusory figure fully shattering into a mass of golden blood and authority as the bloodied body parts of 8 Enders could be seen strewn out across Unstable space!","The powerful Dragon's Breath was halted and stopped as the pillar of Liquefied flames passed through and was withstood against by Noah's body and Genevieve's unique power, never being released again as when a microsecond passed, the whole battlefield had instantly changed drastically as only the maddened roar of the pure White Dragon Ender could be heard.","\"I am the descendant of the White Dragon Em-\"","SHAA!","Ascendant Reality Sever was kept active for the third microsecond.","The only targeted enemy was the pure White Dragon Ender as after chaining onto him last, the dangerous vacillating ray returned onto him once more as over 20 Ascendant Reality Fireballs bloomed with this last chain, this attack being 20%+ more powerful than its initial cast as just the 20 Ascendant Reality Fireballs each delivered 1,000 True Reality Damage that when compounded together...","HOOOONG!","Bloomed out like a blaring horn that entirely erased any roars, screams, or wills of any ancient being as space was entirely torn apart and ravaged so much that even Unstable spatial storms didn't form...this whole region shockingly being turned into a pure white space!","\"....\"","An eerie silence descended as anyone watching had no words.","Immense shock spread out as even the existence of the Olden Times was shocked!","Her mind buzzed as her eyes could not be taken away from the spotless white space that stretched out for a few light years.","A pure white space that had faced such disastrous Damage that it turned out this way- and it was even something that had a name that she knew very well!","\"<A Legend's Visage>...!\"","WAA!","A Legend's Visage.","A type of state and title that only those in the process of forging their Reality to become Legends could achieve.","The Process of forming a Reality was so arduous that the genius Destined existences from the Ninth Firmament could spend millions of years barely seeking their Visage to become Legends- and it was these beings who were widely known to be untouchable by those in the Firmaments while not truly having the status of Legends.","Beings who only held a Legend's Visage and could release attacks in this state that could wipe out any beings in the Firmaments of Ascendancy!","A state where their strongest attacks released immense damage that didn't just turn space tumultuous and cause spatial instabilities to form- but attacks that entirely erased the natural laws of Reality around that area that a blank white space forms!","The last chain of <Ascendant Reality Sever>...had actually collectively released such a level of damage as it left even the Origin of an Olden existence shaken!"]},{"number":1637,"title":"Chapter 1637: Chapter 1636 Loot! Glorious Loot!!! l","paragraphs":["Chapter 1636 Loot! Glorious Loot!!! l","<A Legend's Visage>!","If ever you happened to pass by a region of space that was void of the natural laws of Reality, you had to watch out and be extremely respectful as an Existence that had attained the Visage of a Legend could be nearby.","\"This...\"","The luminous eyes of three ridiculously powerful existences hidden behind the veils of the Mirror Dimension were serious as they looked at this White region of space, their eyes on the existence upon the throne carrying immense and unexplainable light as things did not go how they had foreseen!","This was because what they saw didn't match with what should be possible.","The existence before them had yet to break the shackles of the Seventh Firmament of Ascendancy and form his Reality Passages.","So...how could he manage to achieve a level of attack that released such horrendous True Reality Damage Values that it imitated the state of A Legend's Visage?!","It was a dreadful question with no answer as the norm was for any existences in the Firmaments of Ascendancy to run and be extremely respectful if they ever chanced upon such a being.","Yet the three existences carrying the Will of the Past Emperor only gazed at each other with luminous eyes as at this moment- there was still no fear in their eyes.","Seriousness, yes...but no fear!","—","Genevieve's glorious beastial form floated in space silently, Beatrix being the only thing by her side as the locked down domain they were in was entirely silent.","The domains laid down by the Enders that had now perished began to crumble and fall apart as only the Transcendent Plant Kingdom of the Unnamed Kainos Emperor remained!","The enormous party of Enders that consisted of Seventh, Eighth, and Ninth Firmament Primordial Beasts was entirely wiped out as when one looked at the situation closely, they would come to realize that all of them had perished under a single being.","All of them had perished to the will of the Unnamed Kainos Emperor!","HOOONG!","Incandescent waves of verdant green weaved out as the Transcendent Plant Kingdom had its vegetation covering everything, this sight reflected clearly in the jewel like eyes of Genevieve that had currently lost all light.","His attack played in her mind over and over again as she even questioned what would happen if it were to come towards her!","The answer...was one that caused her to turn utterly furious as her very origin and soul bubbled forth with madness!","She was truly an old existence.","She had seen the rise and fall of countless Emperors in the Olden Era, even catching a glimpse of the being that had obtained authority over other Emperors of the last Age.","The things she knew were truly too abundant as the moment she observed Noah eradicating existences that she would have had trouble with in a matter of microseconds, she moved decisively as her pride had been truly insulted today!","'Retrieve a TABOO Nomological Edict...no matter the price.'","BZZZT!","Her soul shuddered as it cried out painfully, but her gaze was cold and commanding as it left no leeway.","Behind her, her Reality Passages fluctuated as shockingly, more and more began to appear as if they were locked away this whole time!","The actions she was taking now would be detrimental to her in the future, but she had to do this now as if she didn't, she might as well not consider herself a worthy Emperor for the Age to come!","With a cry of agonizing pain, a portion of her soul was decimated as thereafter...","BOOOM!","A shockingly obscene aura began to leak out from her.","A maddening aura that no beings in the Firmaments normally got their hands on!","—","A maddening aura of power spread out from Empress Genevieve as Noah's enthroned figure watched on coldly, his eyes actually following prompts that had risen after his last attack caused a ruptured area of blank white space.","<An Astounding Achievement! You have released an attack capable of destroying the Natural Laws of Reality as you approach a stage that only truly powerful existences can stumble upon. Your Affinity to the Natural Laws of Reality rises as there is much to learn from the re-establishment of natural laws after their destruction. Your Maximum Reserves of the Essence of Reality have been increased by...>","OOOM!","Incandescent waves of light flashed in his eyes as a large portion of his will studied the blank white space that contained nothing.","There might be benefits for him to obtain even there as a portion of his focus was also on the maddening light being released by Genevieve, where some might ask why he had not included her and Beatrix as targets for the Ascendant Reality Sever.","The memories and experiences of such an existence would be invaluable as anyone would rashly do whatever they could to even try and kill them, but Noah had not even tried! Whether he could have succeeded or not was not entirely known with the unpredictable nature and cards that could fall out of the hands of this being, but Noah did not even try. This was because he was waiting for something like what was happening at this very moment!","'Why would I get rid of you before you obtain your TABOO Nomological Edicts once more?'","...!","Yes!","Noah had not touched Empress Genevieve yet precisely due to this as he wanted this being to continue growing and reclaim her TABOO concepts and whatever else she had hidden from the Olden Times, and he wasn't let down as she shockingly released an overpowering aura of a concept that seemed to cause the very surrounding natural laws of Reality to tremble!","'Good!'","Noah's eyes were ridiculously bright at such a moment as there was another thing that caused him to be happy, and that was the overabundance of Loot that was flowing over his eyes.","Loot that was purely from Ninth Firmament existences as their blood and Bloodlines surged towards his throne to all go towards refining his Physique!","[+55,495,725 Cosmic Filament Cores obtained...] DING! The effects of Loot Multiplier are applied...[+ 55 Seeds of Reality are obtained.]","[+76,536,947 Runic Dao Line Enhancers obtained...] DING! The effects of Loot Multiplier are applied...[+ 76,530 Evolutionary Kainos Runic Lines of Ascendancy are obtained. ]","[+989 Trillion Skill Points obtained...] DING! The effects of Loot Multiplier are applied...[+989 Reality Resource Points obtained.]","[1,000 High Tier Reality Crystals have been obtained.]","There were no Blood Pearls in the form of loot as all the True Blood and Racial Bloodlines of these beings surged towards Noah in this starkly silent and eerie space.","But the loot that was given...ah! It was too wondrous!","Seeds of Reality.","Not Shards, not pieces...but complete Seeds of Reality could be obtained from Ninth Firmament existences!","<Seed of Reality> :: A rarely seen coagulation of essence into a perfect structure that allows for grand reality altering possibilities. A single Seed of Reality can be utilized to give birth to 100 Billion Cosmos, granting one the full number of Cosmos to fulfill this condition of those seeking Reality if their Origins and souls are unshackled and can withstand the raging essence within the Seed...","A singular multicolored ocular Seed that cascaded with stellar light could allow a being to forge all of their required 100 Billion Cosmos. So long as they weren't bound by restrictions like Noah currently was at 10 Billion Cosmos!","So long as they had broken their shackles and achieved Reality Passages...and their Souls were strong enough to bypass the shackles between the Eighth and Ninth Firmament of Ascendancy!"]},{"number":1638,"title":"Chapter 1638: Chapter 1637 Loot! Glorious Loot! ll","paragraphs":["Chapter 1637 Loot! Glorious Loot! ll","Noah had truly gained 55 Seeds of Reality as after affirmation from RUINATION, these wondrous forms of loot could also be Quadruplicated as it meant Noah could meet the requirements of 100 Billion Cosmos over two hundred times if it was allowed!","And all of this loot...was before Noah even opened the glittering Treasure Chests as just from his other abilities alone, there was still much more to come.","<The effects of Absolute Looter are applied>","<The Flames and Bloodlines of the Quasi-TABOO Nomological Edicts of Flame Spider Emperor, Obsidian Emperor, Beastial Draconian, Unshakable Beast, Mountainous Terror...have been granted>","<The Flames and Bloodlines of the Insuperable Nomological Edicts of...>","<The Flames and Bloodlines of the Quasi-Insuperable Nomological Edicts of...>","Quasi-TABOO, Insuperable, Quasi-Insuperable!","From the 10 Ninth Firmament existences to fall, Noah felt over 300 Quasi-TABOO Nomological Edicts and counting trying to surge into his soul as the vast majority had to be pushed into the Soul Library first!","This was because even as he continued to purge Minor, Greater, and Quasi-Insuperable Nomological Edicts to strengthen his soul through the Throne of Arcadian Tyranny, he was still receiving too many Quasi-TABOO Nomological Edicts at once as his soul was still expanding and strengthening rapidly to be able to contain all of these concepts.","But he continued to collect all of these wondrous loot while Genevieve was unshackling herself in his now verdant domain, watching with utter coldness as the strewn golden blood of 10 Ninth Firmament Enders surged into his Body for the purposes of refinement.","Noah collected all of the racial Bloodlines under these beings for three purposes of refinement...except a single Bloodline that stemmed from the only non-Primordial Beast killed in the past microseconds!","<The Supreme Tier Bloodline of the Pure-Blooded Cardinal Royal Human has been granted.>","OOOM!","His Origin cried out gleefully as it collected the second Pure-Blooded Cardinal Royal Bloodline...leaving behind only three for Noah to seek.","As he marveled at the information and uniqueness of the Pure-Blooded Cardinal Royal Human Bloodline while comparing it to the Infinite Willow Trees, Noah's eyes landed on the dangerous beastial form of Genevieve and an entirely ashen Beatrix that was locked onto him!","\"You have hidden yourself deeply, Alexander.\"","WAA!","The Archaic voice of this Empress from the Olden Times rang out as her aura continued to rise, billowing waves of a terrifying concept raging around her as she took a drastic action because of this being before her! Around her, one could see the shocking scene of 18 Reality Passages, far greater than before as they ceaselessly pumped her with tremendous waves of inexhaustible essence!","\"Tell me...what is more believable? The fact that you have always had power at the very peak of the Ninth Firmament of Ascendancy since you met me, or you truly were and still are at the Seventh Firmament of Ascendancy...yet to break your shackles and you can already take down peak Ninth Firmament existences?\"","...!","Each possibility was more terrifying than the last, with Noah listening to the words of this terrifying being with a minute portion of his soul as most of his focus...was currently with his Main Body that had relocated multiple glimmering illusory Treasure Chests to appear before him in the Cosmic Holy Land.","The battle had ended with the death of all Ninth Firmament Enders simultaneously as Noah knew there would be a brief respite before the true danger revealed itself, with him wanting to use this time to increase his power as much as possible as the solution now...lay in the randomized bountiful loot from the Resplendent Treasure Cache!","So as time barely moved in the outside world, Noah's main body was looking at 5 dazzling illusory Treasure Chests that gave off a glint of multicolored light, but they mostly shone of wondrous rays of gold.","All 5 were currently vibrating and pulsating with fervor as they seemed to be asking to be opened, holding boundless glory within as Noah had chosen his targets delicately!","10 Ninth Firmament existences had fallen under his Ascendant Reality Sever, and he had utilized 5 of the remaining 8 chances he held to utilize Resplendent Treasure Cache in his life.","He had three other chances remaining as this was the number his destiny advised him to leave behind, where he didn't even know when the next time would be that the count of Resplendent Treasure Cache would be increased or even replenished!","Previously, he had opened only a single Cache from the death of the Gazar as he had received ridiculous things like a single Olden Orb of Transmogrification, 10 Reality Jewels, Flasks of Life and Death, a few Blueprints of Enlightened Primordial Relics...and more. But what would he be getting now that the target of these 5 Resplendent Treasure Caches were Ninth Firmament existences? Now that the Nomological Edict of the Resplendent Treasure Emperor had been elevated to Quasi-TABOO, Double Empowered, and Corrupted?!","With a heart expectant of enormous glory, Noah gave the command as the first Resplendent Treasure Cache was opened.","OOOOM!","Like a golden gate rising, the illusory chest opened as rays of golden pillars bloomed with it, fantastical prompts beginning to bloom before Noah's eyes!","<100 Olden Orbs of Transmogrification have been obtained.>","<500 High Tier Soul Crystals have been obtained.>","BZZZT!","Boundless golden splendor rose and fell as glimmering ancient Olden Orbs were deposited into his Expansive Space along with even more brilliant High Tier Soul Crystals!","He had only received a measly number of Medium Soul Crystals from the Cache before as today, he received hundreds of High Tier ones, with the prompts continuing!","<1000 Ascendant Breaths of Reality have been obtained.>","<100 High Tier Naturally Formed Primordial Treasures have been obtained>","<1,000 Ascendant Flasks of Life and Death have been obtained.>","<The Quasi-TABOO Relic <Dimensional War Beads> has been obtained.>","...!","<The Blueprint of the TABOO Relic <APEX> has been obtained.>","\"Ah...!\"","Pure wonder was unfolding before Noah's eyes as he could barely contain himself when he received a Quasi-TABOO Relic that stood above Enlightened Primordial Relics and Sui Generis Enlightened Primordial Relics, but he was further taken off guard when he received the Blueprint for a TABOO Relic!","APEX.","A gloriously fitting name that Noah was just now finding out exactly what it was, his mental waves fluttering with sheer wonder as bountiful information and prompts bloomed before his eyes.","And this....was still just from the first Resplendent Treasure Cache!"]},{"number":1639,"title":"Chapter 1639: Chapter 1638 No Need to Hide! l","paragraphs":["Chapter 1638 No Need to Hide! l","Bountiful loot cascaded out of the Resplendent Treasure Cache as there were a great deal of things, the one most worthy of mention being a Blueprint of a TABOO Relic by the name of APEX!","Noah's mind focused on this and a few others to better grasp just what had landed on his lap.","<Blueprint of the TABOO Relic, APEX>:: A Blueprint that details the formation of a Relic normally wielded by those who have built their own Realities and can oppose natural laws of Reality without the utilization of the Essence of Reality. Its forging requires 500 Ascendant Breaths of Reality, 500 Naturally Formed Primordial Treasures, A Sui Generis Enlightened Primordial Relic, 1,000 Reality Moonstones, and 10,000 Units of the Golden Sand from the Dream Dimension. More information on its uses can only be obtained once forged...","Quasi-TABOO <Dimensional War Beads>:: Pulled from an unknown Dimension, this pair of War Beads grants their holder +10 base True Reality Damage Values to all attacks and skills. They are extremely unique to come across as they were forged from 50 Naturally Formed Primordial Treasures, 10 Dimensional Crystals...","\"...\"","There was no specification on the TABOO Relic APEX, but the mere details of the Quasi-TABOO Relic <Dimensional War Beads> were utterly disastrous for all of Noah's enemies!","It granted a base of 10 True Reality Damage Values to all of his attacks and abilities as something like the Ascendant Reality Fireball that had 10 Damage Values could now display 20! It meant that once utilized through his Halos...it could reach upwards of 2,000 True Reality Damage Values alone!","The elevation of all other abilities worked the same way as in the Cosmic Holy Land, Noah waves his hands to call out the Dimensional War Beads.","SHAA!","Crystalline silver in color, a set of half moon earrings with stellar spinning circles of Reality at their very center could be seen- these earrings flashing out to instantly attach themselves onto Noah's ears as they looked like minute flashes of light on him that one might not even see unless they were looking closely at him!","'Hmmm...'","He felt waves of new power course through the Dimensional War Beads and wrap around his soul, entirely changing his Damage output and making him many times stronger than before as he ascertained that Resplendent Treasure Caches was the way to go to achieve what he wanted!","The TABOO Relic APEX was something he had to quickly find a way to forge, where he felt like he would obtain all the needed components quickly except two- the Reality Moonstones he didn't even know about along with the Golden Sand from the Dream Dimension.","He had only utilized his Infinite Dream to spread his will across Realities so far as he hadn't fully delved into the Dream Dimension himself, but this now seemed like something he had to do as he looked forward into the future!","\"Very well..open the remaining Resplendent Treasure Caches.\"","BZZZZT!","Fantastical splendor shot out as pillars of golden light, 4 other Resplendent Treasure Caches beginning to open and filling the Cosmic Holy Land in the beautiful allure of loot.","Only a total of 5 Caches were obtained by Noah as he utilized the ability on the Ninth Firmament Pure-Blooded Cardinal Royal Human and the 4 strongest Ninth Firmament Enders, but in his heart...he knew he would be getting a chance to use this ability again very soon.","As the rays of splendorous golden light rose to greet him with new prompts, we turn our gazes back to the infinitesimally small region within the vast Realities where he and Empress Genevieve were staring coldly at each other.","The body of this Empress shone with shocking authority that at this moment...fully finished its arrival after countless shackles were forcefully broken to retrieve it!","When it fully settled in, an astounding change occurred on this being as Noah's eyes rose in surprise, gazing upwards to look at the illusory crown above Genevieve's head actually begin to solidify at this moment!","A solidifying of authority that meant one had done something astounding enough to be considered a Candidate Emperor for the coming Kainos Era! Noah had achieved his solidification of authority through making a Bloodline comparable if not greater than those of the Olden Times, naturally gaining his candidacy as this Bloodline was termed of the Kainos Era.","Now, Genevieve had done what she always knew she could achieve if she paid a high enough price- and she had paid this heavy price to extract an old concept as the achievement of a TABOO Edict while an existence was still in the Firmaments of Ascendancy...was another method to obtain Candidacy for the coming Age of Emperors!","There were many methods out there as each required one to be an astounding genius that stood out amongst geniuses, with Genevieve being simply a cheater who had already lived through an entire Era before that things were much easier for her.","\"Well? Which Reality is true, Alexander King?! That you are an existence at the Seventh Firmament of Ascendancy who can release the same level of attacks as a Legend's Visage?!\"","Her voice boomed out as her recent actions seemed to have caused her to regain her pride.","Her lustrous white and black fur flowed like stellar rivers as her crimson gold horns forming the Ecriture MADNESS pulsed with power, her solidifying crown giving her an overpowering new aura as whatever TABOO Nomological Edict she had unlocked...it had come with its own unique Bloodline that was undoubtedly identified as a Kainos Emperor Bloodline!","The figure of the injured Beatrix had her eyes flattering with fervor as she bowed towards Genevieve as if a subject was paying respects to their reborn queen, Noah watching this scene calmly as his Black Ascendancy Halos began to pulse with activity...beginning to edge towards his body that was still seated upon the throne.","\"I am that and more. But you...my dear Empress, you disappoint me!\"","RUMBLE!","His voice boomed out with even more majesty and grandeur as while surroundings with dense stellar vegetation, one could see his black Ascendancy Halos flowing towards him as if he was about to fuse with them!"]},{"number":1640,"title":"Chapter 1640: Chapter 1639 No Need to Hide! ll","paragraphs":["Chapter 1639 No Need to Hide! ll","Noah's Ascendancy Halos had bloomed with activity once more as they truly seemed like they were about to fuse with him!","Empress Genevieve saw this scene as her eyes turned entirely cold, her enraged voice ringing out.","\"I disappoint you? This is why you are going to obtain your true form now? Do you truly think you stand a chance to kill me? Do you dare make me your enemy?!\"","...!","The surroundings warped at her mere voice as whatever TABOO concept she had unlocked that had granted her a Kainos Bloodline was utterly dreadful, such a thing that only Legends normally held having shocking implications on the power of an existence in the Firmaments of Ascendancy that held it.","At her words, Noah's eyes were shockingly tinged with more disappointment that only caused Genevieve to burn with even more coldness, his voice echoing out.","\"I had thought an existence that has lived as long as you would have made sufficient preparations...that I could actually rely on your power to overcome the perils to come, but I was wrong!\"","WAA!","\"You do not even know right now that an even greater peril is coming...how can I not be disappointed? No, Empress Genevieve. Me fusing with my Ascendancy Halos...it is not for you.\"","...!","His words were akin to a clap of thunder echoing in the hearts of the souls of all beings nearby as Beatrix shuddered frightfully, the words being understood by her and Genevieve right away as their eyes became entirely somber while spreading out their auras to look around them!","\"It makes me both disappointed and happy...because I also continue to affirm that my destiny is far above and beyond even someone like you to be able to sense the enemies who have not yet made a move even now. You all...do not need to hide any longer!\"","HOOONG!","His words caused majestic waves of destiny to burst forth like a dam, his visage turning glorious and shocking while on his Throne of Unnamed Tyranny as his Ascendancy Halos sank into his skin and fused with him.","His eyes gazed upwards to a certain region of space that had absolutely nothing, but his astounding reserves of Destiny and fortune told him of a confounding sense of danger there!","BZZZT!","His body danced with profound waves of essence as he began to transform.","His Maximum Reserves of the Essence of Reality also stably stopped at exactly 100,000 after his achievement of being capable of entirely wiping out the natural laws of Reality came to be, the blank white region currently trying to reestablish its natural laws as if one studied this and comprehended the weaving of reality itself...the benefits were boundless!","But there were a vast array of existences over the countless Ages of the past who could erase the very natural laws of Reality and bring about blankness...but those that were able to comprehend something from this blankness were very few.","Back in the Cosmic Holy Land, Noah's main body also popped an Ascendant Flask of Life and Death as all of his resources and vitality were recovered- his body achieving the most optimum state as he had a full 100,000 Units of the Essence of Reality to play around with!","His soul felt pristine as with the fusion of the Black Tier Ascendancy Halos, his True Sanguine Clone began to undergo a transformation as pairs of wings made of pure light erupted from his back and flashed behind his throne, his eyes actually being met with a prompt at this moment that caused his mind to buzz.","<Under the fusion of your Ascendancy Halos, you can attain your True Form that traces all the way back to your roots. Due to the remodeling of your body and soul when awakening your Unnamed Kainos Emperor Bloodline, your true nature is what you choose. Possible True Forms for you to select from are: Human, Unnamed Kainos Tyrant, Arcadian Tyrant, Samsara Universal Origin, Samsara Cosmic Origin, Pure-Blooded Cardinal Royal Human, Pure-Blooded Cardinal Royal Infinite Willow Tree, Destiny Goblin Emperor...>","A prompt that told him he could shockingly choose his own True Form appeared.","As he sensed the profound essence of vitality around him from the Transcendent Plant Kingdom, the choice this time around was natural!","'Infinite Willow Tree.'","HOOOONG!","Pure unadulterated splendor rose in cascading waves.","The Pure-Blooded Cardinal Royal Bloodline that was among the very few that stood at the peak among Primordials!","Just what quality did they have to trump even above Pure-Blooded Cardinal Royal Humans?","Today, Noah would find out!","Shockingly verdant green essence proliferated throughout as from the Throne of Unnamed Tyranny, countless branches filled with stellar colored leaves sprouted out.","Numerous and shining with pristine sharpness, they were attached to a single trunk that stably wrapped around the Throne of Unnamed Tyranny, this trunk that all branches stemmed from being rainbow colored and giving odd sparkling majesty that would cause others to unconsciously kneel!","BZZZT!","The domain that was already filled with vegetation and stellar trees growing from space proliferated even more, many light years becoming filled with blooming forests at this moment as at the center of it all, a dazzling Infinite Willow Tree could be seen anchoring everything.","With a rainbow colored trunk and countless stellar branches that tore apart space itself stemming from it, a solidified crown enlarged and shone with utter splendor above it as one couldn't see the features of eyes or anything similar to a human!","Simply a tree.","Simply...a stellar Infinite Willow Tree whose branches continued to grow endlessly until now.","<You have taken the form of the Infinite Willow Tree while fused with your 10 Black Tier Ascendancy Halos.>","<All attacks and abilities are now cast with a single authority while in this form, allowing your base values and skills to obtain a multiplier of 500 to your True Reality Damage Values and True Reality Defense Values.>","...!","<As an Infinite Willow Tree in your True Form, you are further granted an additional multiplier of 250 to all abilities that increase True Reality Damage Values.>","A shocking true form was taken while Noah called out domineeringly for the hidden enemies to reveal themselves- the boosts of this form alone making it so that the horrendous Damage he achieved after 20 stacked boosts of Sever...he could now more than likely achieve with a single attack!","Repeatable attacks matching those who had grasped A Legend's Visage...what did that mean for the level of power that he had achieved?!"]},{"number":1641,"title":"Chapter 1641: Chapter 1640 Merely a Dead Thing! l","paragraphs":["Chapter 1640 Merely a Dead Thing! l","The boosts from fusing with his Ascendancy Halos and taking on the Infinite Willow Tree True Form were explained.","A multiplier of 500 to all cast skills and abilities, with an additional multiplier of 250 to any abilities that provided the True Reality Damage Values.","This alone was ridiculous enough, but it wasn't everything. There was then the Infinite Willow Tree's form itself!","Noah's consciousness was spread out in a fantastical fashion as he felt like he could see everything around him with even more clarity- even a semblance of the natural laws of Reality becoming clearer!","Wherever his Infinite Willow Tree branches passed, he felt like he had utmost control in that area as the most shocking this was truly in the name of this bloodline itself.","Infinite. So long as he provided mana...the branches he could release were infinite as he could grow and expand to a shocking size. Whether this feature had a limitation or if it was truly as it seemed was unknown, but Noah would test the limits!","OOOOM!","The Transcendent Plant Kingdom trembled as Noah's will spread out, his branches extending and multiplying even further with his voice coming out at the same time.","\"You have hidden and watched all this time...surely expecting us to work up more of a sweat against the peak Ninth Firmament Enders.\"","...!","\"It seems like something very cowardly and weak but hey, who am I to judge? The question is how much longer do you plan to remain in hiding.\"","His words were provocative as they seemed to be coming from all directions!","Anywhere that his Infinite Willow Tree branches were spreading out to- his voice could be heard.","\"...\"","Silence reigned in the verdant domain.","A deafening silence that seemed to reject the words that this Unnamed Kainos Emperor was speaking out, and yet his infinite branches weaved out with confidence, tearing apart space wherever they passed as they waited!","Genevieve's eyes were also filled with seriousness and as always recently- a sense of anger due to the ongoing actions.","The silence didn't remain too long.","\"Interesting.\"","RUMBLE!","A single word.","A single word, but it was filled with shocking power as in the next moment the area above the verdant domain split apart like a mirror.","Like a dazzling mirror shattering, this area broke apart one after another as in mere moments it reflected three reality shaking figures behind it!","Wrapped in the veil and barrier of the Mirror Dimension, the watching existences revealed themselves with utter calmness and ease.","\"It is truly interesting to come across an existence that can mimic the bloodlines of others so well.\"","Noah's awareness shone with utmost splendor as he landed his awareness on the being speaking. Enormous in stature and grand in its visage, it was the archaic bird that he knew nothing about at this moment. Only that it looked regal and ferocious with its crimson stellar fur wrapped around it, and the dazzling illusory crown rotating above it.","An illusory crown that was shared as a feature among its two other compatriots!","One was a humongous Unicorn shining with the allure of reality, and the third being was a fantastical eye with long spanning wings behind it shining with that lure of gold and white.","Olden Emperors.","Those were the enemies hiding in the dark! Utterly dreadful existences that Noah could sense were still in the Ninth Firmament of Ascendancy, and yet at the same time, something about them felt entirely different from how he sensed Genevieve and the other ninth filament existences.","Even in the shockingly robust memories of the Enders that he had just defeated, he could not find any information about the species, power, or faction that these three existences could belong to. And when he turned to the Quasi-TABOO Nomological Edict of the Dictum Emperor to utilize Premium Reader or its other abilities...he saw that these beings were shielded by a powerful force!","What was even more shocking was the fact that the crimson gold bird had its eyes revolving with the austere silver light that controlled the barrier of the Mirror Dimension before them.","The capability to interfere with the Mirror Dimension like this was something that very few existences in the Firmaments of Ascendancy could ever hope to achieve, and yet this being was doing this naturally as Noah gazed at them while continuing to speak out calmly.","\"You have been watching in hiding this whole time. Will you shed this veil of cowardice and come forward to state your purpose now?\"","His words kept their tyrannical demeanor while even Genevieve was watching the three figures above with extreme coldness, her eyes releasing a knowing light as her voice actually rang out to intercept before anyone else could speak.","\"You fools were here for me were you not?\"","WAA!","\"An Archaic Devil Bird, a Nine Reality Horned Unicorn, and an Eclipsing Celestial Void Eye. Such an assortment of failed Emperors can only be collected from the Archaic Beastial Grotto Sanctum by a single fool that I know of....has that coward Golden Eye become tired of the free Grotto Sanctums given to him by following the will of a ridiculous existence that he now makes it his job to send his lackeys after those seeking Destiny?\"","RUMBLE!","Her words carried shocking secrets as the revolving eyes of the Dimensional Archaic Devil Bird locked unto her with increasing intensity.","\"For you to know of us and even attribute what you see to our master...you must have been truly someone special in the ages past.\"","Its feathers flashed a splendrous radiance as its voice continued","\"Yet look at you now....not even the Visage of a Legend surrounds you even when you used to be a Legend in the past yourself. To the point that today, you will even fall to the hands of beings that have yet to achieve reality! How wondrous and mysterious the tides of destiny are...\"","WAAA.","The impetuous words of an Olden Emperor rang out as Genevieve's eyes adopted stern wrath!","In the past seconds in the past day and even now. Every single thing continued to anger her and test her limits.","Someone like her...a past Legend!","A past Emperor that used to reign over vast domains!","\"It seems that I have been truly gone for too long...to the point that nobody even remembers me.\"","BZZZT!","Her figure began to crackle with astounding power, but the clashing wills of Emperors were prideful as when they met, they wouldn't allow one voice to occupy everyone else's for too long!","\"Why should you be remembered? A Mere Disaster Remnant...a dead thing that should have remained dead, and yet you still latch on trying to find a future glory. A mixed species that cannot even stand a chance to regain her former glory...why should you take Candidacy in the coming Age of Emperors to just fail again?\"","...!"]},{"number":1642,"title":"Chapter 1642: Chapter 1641 Merely a Dead Thing! ll","paragraphs":["Chapter 1641 Merely a Dead Thing! ll","\"Why should you take Candidacy in the coming Age of Emperors to just fail again?\"","...!","Bold and domineering words rumbled out as after the Dimensional Archaic Devil Bird, the Eclipsing Celestial Void Eye spoke next!","\"We will do you a favor today and strip the rights of candidacy from you and this...anomaly here as well.\"","The subject of Noah didn't seem understandable to even them as he was actually termed an anomaly by these beings!","CRACK! CRACK!","As they spoke, the barrier of the Mirror Reality expanded further and further, seeming impenetrable to others unless they had a unique power to bypass it. Intense auras began to leak from the body of the Dimensional Archaic Devil Bird and the bodies of the Nine Reality Horned Unicorn and the Eclipsing Celestial Void Eye.","Noah and Genevieve heard the words as Noah simply absorbed them as information, while Genevieve's striking figure actually erupted in laughter, her rage hidden within being palpable!","\"A mixed species Disaster Remnant? Me? Haha, laughable!\"","BZZZT!","The air turned cold.","The verdant domain Noah had laid out this entire time instantly became tinged dark as from Genevieve's black and white furred body...rays of intense darkness began to leak out.","\"It seems that I have taken a side role for too long.\"","As she spoke, her body splintered and cracked, golden blood beginning to flow as it seemed like it was an outer shell that was now breaking- something hidden within and coming out at this moment!","\"Very well. I will remind everyone....just what a real Emperor is.\"","HOOONG!","\"Arrogant things like you used to merely gravel at my feet in the past! Today, I will teach you all to remember that!\"","BOOOM!","Space splattered and broke as Genevieve's transforming form blazed forward. Her outer shell broke as revealed within was a pure white-furred creature who still held crimson gold horns that read out MADNESS.","Her head was more draconian, even though it was still filled with white fur- with her eyes wide and dazzling obsidian in color as rivers of reality could shockingly be seen revolving within these eyes!","What was most unique was the fact that around this pure spotless white body, Obsidian flames that melted space itself bloomed and began to rotate around her as these flames were made from Runic Ecritures! They burned bright as they seemed to be made of burning Runic Ecritures, each of these flames resembling figures of different races and species as all of them swirled around Genevieve's body while...respectfully releasing hymns!","OOOM!","As if the representation of these races and species within the black flames were those who paid respects to this being in the past, and now they were once more paying their respect as fantastical sound waves that seemed like Hymns of profound respect rang out, the souls of those nearby coming under great pressure.","The Dimensional Archaic Devil Bird, Nine Reality Horned Unicorn, and Eclipsing Celestial Void Eye looked at the scene with slight surprise in their eyes.","Could they have actually been wrong in identifying this existence?","Their cold eyes remained the same as they watched this being thunder towards the walls of the Mirror Reality.","There were unique creatures. So unique in their power and unique in their specialized abilities that one of these was the fact that they could interfere and manipulate the veils of the Mirror Dimension.","This was something that very few had managed to do, especially those in the Firmaments of Ascendancy!","Their enemies could release their attacks as much as they wished while they could simply remain hidden behind the veils of the Mirror Dimension....and the attacks of others could never reach them!","But this was just one factor of their strength.","The other factor was the feeling that Noah had been receiving every time he gazed at these beings. Yes, they were still at the Ninth Firmament of Ascendancy, but they felt entirely different because they were at a stage far above any others.","BOOOM!","Behind the veil of the mirror dimension, space trembled as dozens of Reality passages appeared behind these beings, each of them boasting over 15 Reality Passages.","But this was not all!","It was the fact that in the next moment, the eyes of the Dimensional Archaic Devil Bird flashed as a ray of dimensional light shot out from them and towards the rushing figure of Genevieve, something shocking occurring wherever these rays of light passed.","The space they tore across terrifically turned entirely white as the laws of Reality themselves were torn.","It was a sign of...A Legend's Visage!","This was the feeling of power that this being gave off!","ROAAR!","The Nine Reality Horned Unicorn released glorious splendor from its shimmering horn as a pillar of incandescent light shot out from it as well, this attack also erasing any natural laws of reality wherever it passed as a blank white space could be seen left behind.","The celestial eye blinked once as unseen waves of soul power barreled out, doing the same exact thing to the surrounding space as through their attacks...each of these three beings were confirmed to have all reached the state of a Legend's Visage!","Their attacks were each actually over twenty thousand True Reality Damage Values at this moment as they all thundered towards a singular Genevieve.","A singular Genevieve that was actually unfaltering in her newly enacted form that was filled with pure white fur and the flaming figures of dozens of races paying homage to her.","She spoke coldly to these attacks that could decimate any Ninth Firmament existence!","\"Scatter.\"","...!","A mere word.","Yet this word carried with it the authority of a newly unlocked TABOO Nomological edict. A concept that only those at the stage of Legends could utilize!","A concept that denied the very natural laws of Reality themselves and was thus termed TABOO. Against attacks that eradicated the natural laws of reality and a concept that entirely ignored them...what would the result be?","BOOOOOM!","A shocking fantastical explosion rang out as Noah witnessed the results of this clash firsthand.","As for what he saw? It was...a cancellation!","Blank white space bloomed as reality itself was shredded apart, ruptures spreading out as they tried to heal themselves ever so slowly.","It turned out that while utilizing a TABOO concept, one could effectively be considered to have attained a Legend's Visage as they could perform feats that could shred apart the natural laws of Reality Judy like them!","This was why Genevieve had retrieved a TABOO concept no matter the cost.","This was why at this moment, the two sides looked at each other dangerously without accounting for what the vibrant Infinite Willow Tree still spreading its branches out endlessly was planning!"]},{"number":1643,"title":"Chapter 1643: Chapter 1642 You Shall All Perish!","paragraphs":["Chapter 1642 You Shall All Perish!","The eyes of the Dimensional Archaic Devil Bird released bountiful splendor as its voice echoed out.","\"You have already recovered some of your core concepts...this makes things difficult, but still within reason for a Disaster Remnant.\"","...!","\"Why did your pride seem hurt by being called a mixed species? Even with this new form that you have taken, it doesn't seem like any of the important pure species that I have learned of in the past as I have to ask...why does a thing like you carry so much pride?\"","WAA!","The words of all existences with the Bloodline of Emperors seemed to be filled with pride and power, one side always trying to tear the other down.","Emperors!","We have to get a grasp on this word and exactly what it stood for, with it being given different respect within every Age that passed.","In history, Eons have passed as with the turning of time, many Ages have come and gone as each Age of Emperors had its own distinguished existences rising and falling.","Those that still remembered history considered the recent eons all part of the Olden Times, with multiple Ages of Emperors rising in this Era as the last Age of Emperors was brought to an end by the being who had attained Authority and aided in the splitting of the Infinite Realities!","When this being ended the last Age of Emperors, he also effectively ended the Olden Era that had spanned countless years due to the drastic actions as for many years after that...it was a time of calmness as if Destiny was coiling and preparing this whole time.","The calm before the storm. An accumulation of destiny and fortune over countless years occurred after the end of the past Age of Emperors and the Olden Era as it all seemed to be in preparation for a glorious new Age of Emperors and an even more glorious Era...the Kainos Era!","Yet during this period of time that was still a gap between a past Era and a new one, astounding beings that had qualifications to be Emperors rose.","They forged astounding concepts that granted them illusory crowns or even connected to Bloodlines of the Olden Times similar to Noah's Olden Bloodline of Arcadian Tyranny!","They had the qualifications to be Emperors...yet they rose at a time when it was not the Age of Emperors.","Some were astounding enough to live for billions of years and survive to achieve Reality as they were now greeted with the coming of the Kainos Era and a new Age of Emperors, while others had perished in the river of time before even meeting this new Era!","The Dimensional Archaic Devil Bird, Nine Reality Horned Unicorn, and the Eclipsing Celestial Void Eye were such existences who had obtained Olden Bloodlines at a time when it wasn't any Age...but they now stared at two existences that represented the arrival of a new age.","They had as their targets two existences that had solidified their crowns as they affirmed that a new Age of Emperors had begun...that the coming Kainos Era was now being ushered forth as they had to get their hands on this destiny or be astounding enough to obtain Candidacy on their own!","As existences who had reached A Legend's Visage...this was actually not too hard.","But then there was the fact that for them to walk the path of Emperors...it had to be painted with the Blood of countless other Emperors.","For one to obtain authority over any Age...they had to have dominated and killed many Candidate Emperors to obtain their authority!","The three existences that had grasped A Legend's Visage...they wanted to start on their paths today with these two Candidate Emperors as the sacrifice to begin painting their path.","OOOM!","Genevieve stared coldly at these existences hidden behind the veils of the Mirror Reality.","\"Why don't you come out of your veil? And I will show you exactly who I am if you are so young to not even know my form!\"","WAA!","Silence reigned as the two sides measured each other before erupting into a shocking battle.","Each one had in their hands shocking capabilities that would cause any other beings to run in fear, their wills causing the very surrounding space to shudder as amidst all of this, the Infinite Willow Tree that had sprouted from the Throne of Unnamed Tyranny released cascading waves of power as the Spear of Reality that had briefly disappeared during the transformation reappeared at this moment.","It didn't come back alone, though, as it carried a vibrating light of crimson and gold that went on to bloom into the dazzling figure of RUINATION!","\"You all...do not need to be at a standoff.\"","BZZZT!","With a voice filled with unbound tyranny, Noah's endless branches surged forth as they covered countless light years in a mere instant.","Its rainbow-colored trunk let off waves of splendor from its throne as all the surroundings were filled with verdant spatial vegetation that made this whole area seem like a Mystical forest, the figure of RUINATION coming forward to grasp onto the rainbow-colored trunk of the Infinite Willow Tree as her tiny body surged with bountiful Essence of Reality!","Her emotionless face was firm and serious as she shouted out valiantly.","\"YAAA!\"","The instant her bellow reverberated forth, the numerous branches of the Infinite Willow Tree that had spread out to cover countless light years to bring all of the present existences into their shadows glimmered brightly.","These branches glimmered as in the next moment, their tips caused the fracturing of space akin to a mirror shattering!","A glorious action that pulled upon the Mirror Dimension and established something even larger than the wall that the Dimensional Archaic Devil Bird had enacted!","Among the countless willow branches that had surged forth, some had gone on to touch the veiled wall of the mirror dimension floating before the three existences as with their appearance, this veil fluctuated and very soon cracked away!","\"There we go.\"","HOONG!","The glorious voice of the Unnamed Kainos Emperor echoed out.","\"No walls to hide behind, no dimensions to scurry off to.\"","As he spoke, his branches continued to extend out as they saw the eyes of the three Olden Emperors very clearly!","These beings had turned utterly serious with the shattering of the veil of the Mirror dimension- staring at Noah in a newfound light as they heard his voice continuing.","\"I do not know your history...and I've only glimpsed your aims here now. But just from the mere fact that you chose to turn your killing intent towards me and not just your target here today...this means I shall ignore whatever your Origins are as today...you shall all perish!\"","RUUUMBLE!","A declaration!","A statement from an Emperor of a new Era towards those who were still in the past Era!"]},{"number":1644,"title":"Chapter 1644: Chapter 1643 The Obscene Ascendant Dimensional Essence Shards! l","paragraphs":["Chapter 1643 The Obscene Ascendant Dimensional Essence Shards! l","The very veils of dimensions were torn by the Unnamed Kainos Emperor as another newly enacted Candidate Emperor of the Kainos Era looked at this scene with shining eyes!","The two of them faced three existences that had achieved A Legend's Visage as the stage was set for the shocking battle.","Far from this location, in the hidden veils of space that contained the Infinite Reality...an Assimilation of Prime Realities was nearing an end.","The effects of Infinite Dream were fully supplemented into the Infinite Reality as 100 Souls returned, the last one pulling and assimilating a vast Prime Reality with many bountiful domains.","The most powerful inhabitants of the Infinite Reality watched this scene as it was reenacted under the illusory light of Little Henry, where their souls were able to expand their comprehension by watching this phenomenon while also seeing the changes to their surroundings firsthand!","The Assimilation of the Prime Realities propagated an astounding result as the concentration of pure essence within the Infinite Reality exceeded all possible limits, multicolored seas of essence beginning to form and painting the countless stellar bodies in many Universes, Cosmos, and Domains with an austere aura of a paradisiacal land.","The figure of Little Henry was privy to all this as after reenacting what he saw, his Little body felt a pull of destiny as he disappeared into the veils of space to leave behind everyone who was still dazedly staring at their changing surroundings!","SHAA!","Little Henry crossed many light years in an instant while following this pull of destiny, his small figure coming out of the rifts of space to shockingly realize that he was outside of the Boundary of the Infinite Reality and was actually staring at its bright and endless river that was far bigger than anything else he had seen.","Beside him was the being that had tugged on the strings of destiny, Little Henry seeing the dazzling figure of a stellar being whose very skin shimmered of Cosmos.","\"Father.\"","The son barely a few days old paid his respects as he did something as shocking as leaving his Reality by himself!","\"Let me see your form.\" Noah spoke towards Little Henry with a smile as he finished watching the expansion of the Endless river of Reality that was his home, his son's very skin beginning to change and taking on a similar form to him as a little boy whose entire body was made up of purple-blue stellar bodies covered by a hue of gold appeared. He seemed to be aging and growing up rapidly as he didn't look like a chubby baby from just days ago, devilish handsomeness already beginning to bloom already.","This was the effect of Interlinked Royal Lineage that was swallowed by Noah's Quasi-Venerable Unnamed Kainos Emperor Bloodline- granting all of Noah's Lineage his Bloodline as when one looked at Little Henry, they would be able to see that his illusory crown was half solidified!","Half the Candidacy to be an Emperor of the coming Kainos Era was granted to Little Henry purely because of the actions and prestige of his father.","It was an astounding Reality as Little Henry received information about it similar to his Father, where he now looked towards him with utmost respect as he spoke.","\"The vast Realities hold countless opportunities, with chaos blooming out at this moment as Primordial Beasts start a war with Primordials that have ruled for eons.\"","\"Those that can make use of this chaos to rise are those who will rule in the coming Era...so I wanted to ask you, my son. Do you want to rule? Do you want to forge your own path in these vast Realities?\"","WAA!","Noah asked a question that he knew an answer to as the same blood of an Emperor that flowed in his veins also flowed in his son's body!","\"With our destiny, we should be capable of breaking past many restrictions and limitations as what we can do is only limited to what actions we take. Since you have the Blood of an Emperor, you have the right to forge your own path as I do not want you to feel like you have to remain under my shadow...or even entertain the thought that you cannot exceed me.\"","...!","Waves of destiny circled the stellar bodied father and son as their mere talk was something that would have astounding effects on the vast Realities out there.","Little Henry's eyes were absolved of any conflict as he looked respectfully at his father and voiced put firmly.","\"I want to try.\"","THRUM!","Seas of Destiny bloomed and weaved out.","A Child of Destiny...the son of the Unnamed Kainos Emperor...such a being also chose to step out and make his own path in this coming Age of Emperors!","\"Good. As far as I know...in any Age, a single Emperor can rise Supreme and obtain authority. But this is yet another established norm and restriction that you should not let weigh you down, where you should do all that is within your power to seek your own authority!\"","As Noah spoke, he waved his hands and caused the appearance of 10 Seeds of Reality, 20 Olden Orbs of Transmogrification, clusters of Reality Crystals, Ascendant Flasks of Life and Death...and bountiful more loot that he was concurrently receiving as his main body continued to open the Resplendent Treasure Caches.","\"Elevate your destiny-based Edicts to Quasi-TABOO to sufficiently protect yourself and your roots. Take Kazuhiko, Cthulhu, the Emperor Penguin...and any others who wish to explore the vast realities and forge their own path. In the midst of this war, you all can obtain many opportunities as who knows how many Emperors will rise within our little Infinite Reality?!\"","OOOM!","His words were utterly terrifying as after all the laid out loot, he waved his hands one last time to call out the Serendipity of the Cataclysmic Reality. An Enlightened Primordial Relic was handed down to his son as seconds prior, Noah had received another transport type Relic from the Resplendent Treasure Cache that exceeded this Tier by a few levels!","Little Henry looked at all of these things as he locked eyes with his Father.","Similar to him, Little Henry and the others would send out their Clones as they sought out the wonders and mysteries of the Infinite Realities and built their own paths.","\"After being given so many things...it would be shameful of me if I cannot make something out of myself! Father, at the very least...I will bring you the Origin of a Legend in a few months- no, weeks, at most!\"","...!","The chubby stellar body of Little Henry shone with luster as he spoke respectfully and with conviction!","Noah nodded with a smile while patting his son's head, gazing out to the vast unknowns. There were too many things in the vast Realities that even he could not cover. Too many Bloodlines and Realities...too many treasures.","It was time for those within his Reality to expand their wills and seek these opportunities themselves, and his son would be at the forefront of it while his own will continued seeking for even more opportunities!","His son would be another Candidate Emperor of the coming Age of Emperors...and who knew what the results of everything would be as this new age was ushered in?!"]},{"number":1645,"title":"Chapter 1645: Chapter 1644 The Obscene Ascendant Dimensional Essence Shards! ll","paragraphs":["Chapter 1644 The Obscene Ascendant Dimensional Essence Shards! ll","As Little Henry came to a decision with one of his Clones, Noah also conferred with his mom and his women on what they wished to do with other Clones as his main body continued to be swapped by astounding things in the Cosmic Holy Land.","With the end of the first Infinite Dream and the ridiculous expansion of the Infinite Reality, Noah wanted to start the second Infinite Dream as soon as possible, but his main body could not slumber just yet!","He was currently watching the beautiful golden prompts of the 4 remaining Resplendent Treasure Caches that revealed fantastical opportunities.","<10 Random Quasi-TABOO Reality Jewels have been obtained>","<The Sui Generis Enlightened Primordial Relic <Adornment of the Sinner> has been obtained.>","<The Quasi-TABOO Relic <Iridescent Reality> has been obtained.>","<The Blueprint of the TABOO Relic <PIONEER> has been obtained.>","<500 Olden Orbs of Transmogrification have been obtained.>","Shockingly bountiful prompts that foretold of too many surprises rose before his eyes as he gained enough Olden Orbs of Transmogrification to birth 500 Quasi-TABOO Nomological Edicts and also obtained another Blueprint of a TABOO Relic!","Since it only told him how to forge it and not what shocking specifics it would hold, Noah's eyes only breezed over its required materials and how hard it would be for him to forge it before he continued ahead.","The Quasi-TABOO Reality Jewels were something like the Reality Nova Jewel but even more dreadful, and there was a Sui Generis Enlightened Primordial Relic that held a unique name, while the Quasi-TABOO Relic <Iridescent Reality> was the reason Noah had passed down his Serendipity of the Cataclysmic Reality to his son!","<Iridescent Reality>:: A Quasi-TABOO transport type Primordial Relic in the form of a mesmerizing Reality. It has the capability to lay down anchors across all previously crossed regions and teleport to these regions without the use of any resources, and it can also traverse into Common Dimensions under the user's discretion. Features under the Iridescent Reality include...","A vast Reality as a transport vessel for him to stand on!","It contained wondrous features and capabilities that could even allow it to cross Common Dimensions that when Noah focused on this closely...he found the Dream Dimension and Mirror Dimension were the only ones listed so far, these being the ones he had encountered so far.","As a part of his mind focused on these details, more prompts on the collective loot of the remaining 4 Resplendent Treasure Caches continued to rain down!","<3 Ascendant Dimensional Essence Shards have been obtained.>","<The Sui Generis Enlightened Primordial Relic <Wand of the Necrowizard> has been obtained.>","<3,000 High Tier Soul Crystals have been obtained.>","<The Quasi-TABOO Relic <Aegis of the Warring Emperor> has been obtained.>","<5,000 Ascendant Breaths of Reality have been obtained.>","<800 High Tier Naturally Formed Primordial Treasures have been obtained>","<4,000 Ascendant Flasks of Life and Death have been obtained.>","<20 Consumable Quasi-TABOO Relics <Pandemonium Infused Dimensional Aether Orbs> have been obtained>","<The Blueprint of the TABOO Relic <FORTRESS> has been obtained.>","\"Ah...\"","It was...just so beautiful.","Loot so wondrous and dazzling that one would feel immensely happy just from looking at it!","Bountiful reserves of Ascendant Breaths of Reality, another Sui Generis Enlightened Primordial Relic, Ascendant Flasks of Life and Death, and a number of High Tier Naturally Formed Primordial Treasures that were many times more than what Noah had currently obtained in the explored regions of the Azure Forsaken Treasure Reality!","Then, there were the new forms of loot he hadn't come across before.","Two brand new Quasi-TABOO Relics- one that was shockingly a consumable and the other being a defensive one as Noah called out the <Aegis of the Warring Emperor> to grasp onto a brilliantly purple shield the same size as him, golden runic lines etched throughout it as Runic Ecritures distinctly floated a few inches off this shield! Its material didn't seem like metal as it looked free flowing and dazzling to the eyes, where one might even mistake it for a purple portal or rift with the way that it pulsed with essence.","When Noah held onto it, he felt his body Infused with bountiful power as his True Reality Defense Values experienced a change, his eyes very quickly locking onto the description of this new loot and the others on the same stage as it.","Quasi-TABOO <Aegis of the Warring Emperor> :: A purple shield born from actualized Runic Ecritures that were melded with many other materials. It is part of the Warring Emperor Set lost in the rivers of time. It grants a base +20 True Reality Defense Values to the wearer that is applicable to all cast abilities. The Aegis was formed from 100 Defensive Runic Ecritures, 60 Naturally Formed Primordial Treasures...","Quasi-TABOO <Pandemonium Infused Dimensional Aether Orb>:: A dimensional bomb in the form of an Unstable coagulation of essence that is capable of dealing 50,000 True Reality Damage Values when activated and thrown out. A single microsecond exists during the time of activation as within that period of time- run very, very far away.","Quasi-TABOO <Ascendant Dimensional Essence Shard>:: A shard from an unknown dimension that can be bound to a single skill. The bound skill is altered in such a way that it does not require any resource requirement to cast anymore.","...!","A ridiculous loot appeared on top of the entirely too ridiculous Aegis of the Warring Emperor and the 20 Pandemonium Infused Dimensional Aether Orbs!","The Aegis of the Warring Emperor bolstered Noah's defense similar to how the Dimensional War Beads had bolstered his Damage Values, with the Pandemonium Infused Dimensional Aether Orbs being utterly disgusting by being bombs that could reach attacks twice as powerful as a Legend's Visage.","Then, there were the three <Ascendant Dimensional Essence Shards>.","Even Noah was speechless when looking at their details!","'Aren't they...a bit too much?'","Noah turned introspective as he made a silent prayer for all of his future enemies.","For anyone to have a bleak enough destiny to turn towards his direction if they weren't multiple levels above him...such beings were too unlucky when Noah was getting his hands on objects like the Ascendant Dimensional Essence Shards!","They seemed entirely too broken when one took into account the fact that Essence of Reality was such a limiting resource to all recent abilities and coming abilities, and yet these Ascendant Dimensional Essence Shards could actually overcome this on any skill they were placed on!","\"Can they...\"","<They sadly cannot be Quadruplicated, Master. Unique types of Essence lie within that I cannot replicate.>","The voice of RUINATION rang out in Noah's behind just as he asked as he sighed in understanding.","Even 3 of these Shards were already dreadful as for how Noah would use them?","BZZZT!","His Origin and Soul underwater imperceptible changes the moment he called out a single circular crystal that swirled with a dazzling gray light!","Noah's mind was already made up for which skill would get its resource requirements nullified at this moment as the others would follow later.","As for what ability was altered? His enemies were about to feel it the most!"]},{"number":1646,"title":"Chapter 1646: Chapter 1645 Merely an Impetuous Genius!","paragraphs":["Chapter 1645 Merely an Impetuous Genius!","\"You? Do you truly believe you can be the cause of us perishing?\"","WAA!","In the verdant domain filled with stellar plants, the authority of the Olden Emperors carrying the Will of an important personage rang out, defiantly and with disdain replying to Noah's assertion that they would perish here today for aiming their killing intent towards him!","\"The Disaster Remnant I can understand and accept the boastful words of as she had history and has been a genuine Legend countless years past. But you? An unknown existence that has merely attached onto a single unique aspect of the Firmaments to barely near our levels...a mere nobody like you dares to claim dominance over us?!\"","...!","The luminous revolving eyes of the Dimensional Archaic Devil Bird spun dreadfully as 30 Golden Ascendancy Halos bloomed from it, the same scene repeating itself on the glorious bodies of the Nine Reality Horned Unicorn and the Eclipsing Celestial Void Eye!","The golden Halos were uniquely surrounded by bountiful white Runic Ecritures and threads of fortune and destiny that gave them a mesmerizing light, the mirror-like domain around them trembling as the singular Eclipsing Celestial Void Eye spoke next.","\"In many Ages of the past, existences like you with a slightly bountiful destiny have tried to crawl up the hierarchy. Having an abundant destiny and believing yourself to be higher than all others as you think that means a direct path to Authority...this is a falsehood we shall help you correct today.\"","...!","\"Foundation trumps everything...and even though you shield yourself well with the few concepts you have comprehended, I can see that you are a very, very young soul. Had you hidden yourself and developed more Quasi-TABOO concepts or even tried to forge TABOO concepts. Had you given yourself just a few millions of years strengthening your soul...paired with the unique aspect of unlocking the authority of Black Tier Ascendancy Halos, you might have truly stood a chance at becoming a reigning Emperor whose name would be spread far and wide. But...\"","BOOOM!","Waves of austere majesty exploded out as after each of their 30 Golden Ascendancy Halos were released, something shockingly outside the norm occurred!","Their Halos...didn't go towards fusing with their bodies.","They terrifyingly shifted towards the other blooming Golden Halos as in a shocking fashion, the Ascendancy Halos of these three beings began to fuse with each other!","\"...you let your astounding Destiny get to your head. You believed yourself and your destiny to be more triumphant than the fact that others before you have lived for billions of years longer and built a foundation that you cannot even compare to. Had you quietly used the little accumulation you've built to break past your restrictions and forge your Reality Passages, formed another 20 Black Tier Ascendancy Halos, truly reached the Ninth Firmament of Ascendancy and touched upon the veil of Reality like us...even I would be fearful of you then! But the current oyu who is merely filled with potential...I have seen many like you fall because of your inflated egos and your impatience that simply cannot control itself, wanting to be under the limelight as quickly as possible!\"","WAAA!","\"Past Emperors planned well and bid their time for countless years before they finally erupted with their foundation and placed everything below their feet. You...chose to do the opposite and simply revealed yourself much too early.\"","One would think it was still the Eclipsing Celestial Void Eye still talking, but its voice had shockingly begun to resonate with the Dimensional Archaic Devil Bird and Nine Reality Horned Unicorn as these beings began to flicker from corporeal and incorporeal!","As this occurred, their voices seemingly merged into one as they caused the very surrounding space to tremble.","\"That is why your name will not be known. This is why you will become another astounding genius among the bones of many other dead ones just like you as you lot...just cannot seem to get the idea of patience cemented in your bloated Destined brains. You will merely be lost in the ravages of time as a memory of nobody among other countless nobodies.\"","HOOONG!","Their words finished as the bodies of the three beings turned into particles of light that cascaded together to form a singular being.","Similar to what the Ninth Firmament Enders had done, but what they were doing was something far, far above that as a shocking aura began to bloom!","Genevieve's cold eyes gazed forward seriously as Noah...his figure as an Infinite Willow Tree shimmered with immense light as his will solidified around him, showing the illusion of a devilish smile full of dominance!","\"Me? A nobody?\"","His words came out in a seemingly pondering fashion as the transformation of the three powerful existences neared its end. The pride of these past Emperors accused Noah of foolishness and impatience as their undeniable wills thundered down the judgment that he would amount to nothing in these vast Realities- that he didn't have the judgment of a True Emperor!","Had he moved with haste? Had he not made preparations?","Just from the mere fact that it was a Clone indistinguishable from the Original standing before their eyes now, Noah very well understood that he had made sufficient preparations!","As for hiding himself and waiting millions of years before coming out?","'What need have I to lie in hiding? Does that seem like the demeanor of a True Emperor?!'","RUMBLE!","His Bloodline churned as if it seemingly agreed with him, his soul being strengthened passively as he was the same being that was even sending his few days old son out into the vast Realities after confirming his protection with 20 Orbs of Transmogrification to birth 20 Quasi-TABOO Nomological Edicts!","He had been exploring the vast realities even before he attained such a level of Edicts as he cared for his son so much that he gave him 20.","Was he truly someone that did not prepare and think ahead? The answer...was no!","BOOOM!","His will exploded out with power even as the glorious aura from the three fused Olden Emperors spread out.","He trusted in his Destiny.","He had already conferred with the Dictum Emperor and his other concepts.","He knew it would be perilous...but as always, the most opportune moments came with peril as he would gain things that would be equivalent to billions of years' worth of effort by other beings in mere moments!","\"We shall see whether I am an impetuous genius...or whether you all are simply cowards that will never amount to much even with billions of years of history!\"","HOOONG!"]},{"number":1647,"title":"Chapter 1647: Chapter 1646 Illusoryllusory Legend! l","paragraphs":["Chapter 1646 Illusoryllusory Legend! l","The wills of the different Emperors clashed to subdue each other inherently even before the battle fully bloomed as neither side gave in!","Noah let his own will be known as at this moment, the shocking action of fusing their Ascendancy Halos that the Dimensional Archaic Devil Bird, Nine Reality Horned Unicorn, and the Eclipsing Celestial Void Eye had taken bore fruit.","The form of a terrific creature whose head was a dazzling golden crimson eye with a curved horn extending out at the very top appeared, this horn pointing to an enormous illusory crown above. Behind it, 30 dazzling Reality Passages could now be seen as they pumped down endless essence that other beings would explode from just accepting! This wasn't a result it could achieve by itself...only through this fusion!","Its two front limbs of this creature were morphed into long spanning wings while its back limbs were pillars of Flames, its body reminiscent of a fusion of a four-legged creature and a winged one as it was half filled with golden fur and half filled with crimson feathers as to top it all off, 10 pairs of aurora wings erupted from its back!","What was most astounding was that this abomination...had something extremely striking that caused Beatrix who was protected behind Genevieve to turn utterly ashen.","This striking feature also caused Genevieve's eyes to turn somber as Noah's awareness only watched out emotionlessly!","It was....","\"An Illusion Reality.\"","RUMBLE!","The uniform voice of three beings into a single one rang out as the head of the creature that was entirely an eye opened to release a dreadful light that ruptured the surrounding natural laws and caused white rifts to spread out.","The most astounding feature was actually the fact that from head to toe of this existence- there was the unforgettable scene of an illusory Reality releasing glorious splendor!","\"We saw the battle prior where you seemed to show more and more strength as time passed. So for taking care of the two of you efficiently, we have taken not just our strongest forms, but we even collectively pooled everything together into a single body.\"","...!","\"There will be no sudden jumps in power during battle, no surprises or shocks that catch anyone off guard. There will only be your deaths. This is what preparation and resolve from an immense foundation that has only been built up for millions of years looks like.\"","In a shocking turn of events, the three beings that were already terrifying fused with each other into an abominable creature that shockingly displayed an illusory Reality across their bodies! Did this truly mean what it stood for?!","Genevieve turned towards Noah's position as her experienced eyes saw many things, flashing with coldness and ingenuity as she sent him a mental message before seemingly deciding something huge.","\"So? You have been boasting this whole time of your destiny being greater than everyone else's. Do you think you can escape your Clone being killed by an existence imitating the will of a genuine Legend, or will you lose a portion of your authority here today?\"","WAA!","Her words were exceedingly cold as Noah had been expecting them, replying with ease while watching the terrifying being about to move above them.","\"Are you contemplating your own survival with me included in your calculations? Are you seeking help without asking for help?\"","\"I can survive just fine. It will merely require me to unlock a few more things that I do not wish to do right now.\" Coldness remained in Genevieve's words as she continued!","\"Is this not what you were waiting for? Is this not why you didn't aim your attack towards me?\"","Noah had his own Destiny, but Genevieve also had her own vast destiny and intuition as she finally saw through some things and caused Noah's will to release a devilish smile!","\"Good, you are finally catching up as this may not be disappointing after all. Two newly born Kainos Emperors against three Olden Emperors fused into the false will of a genuine Legend...let's see what the results would be!\"","HOOONG!","Unseen waves of destiny weaved out as the figure of Genevieve flashed, the dense stellar vegetation of the Transcendent Plant Kingdom making way as she came to float beside the radiant multicolored Infinite Willow Tree that had its branches spread out everywhere.","The existence that had formed an Illusion Reality looked at this coldly as it even spat out dreadful words!","\"That's cute.\"","WAA!","\"The will of a Legend is undeniable...even if it is a false one like this. For taking care of any Disaster Remnant and an impetuous little genius who believes he is above all...it is more than sufficient!\"","...!","Utter confidence and surety was filled in the words of this being that was the accumulation of three others who had lived for extremely long periods of time!","Beings with immense foundation and preparations that individually, they were already at the stage of a Legend's Visage where each of their attacks could easily surpass 20,000+ True Damage Values. What about now when they fused together and displayed the false will of a Legend?","\"You should have hidden for a few more years before coming out, kid.\"","With boundless contempt and resolve, the body of the Illusory Legend moved and pressed down with a force to crush everything!","An undeniable force that when Noah did the calculations- it amounted to a bit more than 100,000 True Reality Damage Values.","Undeniable!","It tore across the dense stellar vegetation as it didn't even try to break the veils of mirror reality Noah had made through RUINATION all over the domain, straightforwardly going towards him and Genevieve to wipe them out!","'Hooo....'","Noah's soul felt immense calm and serenity as everything he had felt with his destiny came to be.","An unavoidable threat that he had to face head on or his clone would perish along with a significant portion of his authority.","A threat that would also pave the way towards something grand if he overcame it!","All he had to do...was be capable of withstanding 100,000 True Reality Damage Values that this being would be emitting out with his attacks!","On his Origin and soul, he had the Dimensional War Beads and Aegis of the Warring Emperor equipped as his skills achieved Enhancers of 10 and 20 True Reality Damage and Defense Values respectively, where after he laid out his Resource Shields, Auras, and the Runic Ecritures of Defense on his soul that each had different skills with a range of 5-30 Values...he could shockingly achieve close to 30,000 True Reality Defense Values with his stacked Shields and Auras.","But this....would not be enough!"]},{"number":1648,"title":"Chapter 1648: Chapter 1647 lllusory Legend! ll","paragraphs":["Chapter 1647 lllusory Legend! ll","Even after he overlayed all of his defensive shields and Auras among other things, he could only multiply them with the 500 Multiplier and achieve a total stacked defense of 30,000 that he could replenish every microsecond if it was broken.","But this was not enough to withstand more than 100,000 True Reality Damage Values that would be raining down every microsecond!","So Genevieve was taken into account as with her unlocked TABOO Nomological Edict and her being capable of dispelling the attacks of these three terrifying beings before, she should be capable of defending a range of 20,000-30,000 True Reality Damage Values.","That left over 50,000 Damage Values from this terrifying being for them to stop...or they would be turned into mere meat paste of stellar lights.","This was why even now, Genevieve's expression was somber as her will was ready to tell her soul to rip apart more restrictions forcefully...but she waited just a few more microseconds as her will was directed to Noah!","The one who had been most calm even amidst everything.","He should have accounted for many things as what else could he pull out?","BZZZT!","The surroundings fluctuated in a wondrous fashion as from the dense stellar vegetation beside the Infinite Willow Tree, the auras of two more existences rose!","With spinning solidified crowns and adorning the austere forms of Samsara Cosmic Dao Origins...it was two more True Sanguine Clones that had taken different True Forms!","Noah's main body was the one that held all authority, with his Clones being capable of accessing this authority as they called out the authority of the Ascendancy Halos he could wield.","His two other Clones pulled on this same authority and fused with it, attaining their True Forms with differing boosts from the Infinite Willow Tree as this...was Noah's answer to how he could overcome this terrifying situation!","A question was posed as to where Noah's remaining True Sanguine Clones would be some time back. If one Clone wasn't enough to withstand the damage, Noah would simply have two more by his side as this was exactly what he did!","HOOOONG!","The bodies of the two newly appearing True Sanguine Clones were truly too mesmerizing as every part of their bodies represented clusters of Cosmos- seemingly like a moving and breathing cluster of Cosmos had come to life as the two moved like circular stellar bodies while already surrounded by all the Resource Shields and Auras possible!","Their defenses were also even greater than the first True Sanguine Clone in the firm of the Infinite Willow Tree as...","<You have taken the form of the Samsara Cosmic Dao Origin while fused with your 10 Black Tier Ascendancy Halos.>","<All attacks and abilities are now cast with a single authority while in this form, allowing your base values and skills to obtain a multiplier of 500 to your True Reality Damage Values and True Reality Defense Values.>","<As a Samsara Cosmic Dao Origin in your True Form, you are further granted an additional multiplier of 250 to all abilities that increase True Reality Defense Values.>","The same base 500 multiplier to all values, but it didn't have an additional 250 multiplier tacked on for Damage Values as the form of clusters of Cosmos actually granted an additional 250 multiplier to Defense Values!","It meant their defensive capabilities rose an extra ten thousand from Noah's Infinite Willow Tree Clone as they reached a bit over 40,000 True Reality Defense Values.","\"Fucking ridiculous.\"","HOOONG!","Genevieve cursed beside him as she saw the two new entrants with the same shimmering solidified crown, stopping irrevocably hurting her own soul as her body lit up with countless rulers of Realities- ready to defend against the Illusory Legend coming down to wipe out everything!","It truly was ridiculous as just to maintain one's true form, immense Units of Mana and Essence of Reality were required as Noah's expenditure currently was 3,000 Units of Essence of Reality every microsecond for all three Clones.","It was an expenditure others couldn't bear but he...he had Ascendant Flasks of Life and Death ready if ever his Essence of Reality dipped lower than 10,000.","His preparations were done. Everything on his side was complete as now, all that was left was to watch the fruits of his labor!","\"I told you that I do not want surprises and sudden change of events.\"","OOOM!","The booming voice of the Illusory Legend hammered down along with its will, its head that was a giant golden crimson eye pointing down and releasing a dreadful light that formed into a sharp spear that could end thousands of Realities coming down even faster.","Damage exceeding 100,000 thundered down as Noah's three Clones and Genevieve defended.","\"YAAAA!\"","\"OOOOOOH!\" The Infinite branches of the Willow Tree shimmered as they wrapped around everything with incandescent barriers, the True forms of two Samsara Cosmic Dao Origins dazzling with brightness as they also brought their stacked defenses nearby!","Genevieve released dozens of glimmering Reality rulers to wrap over all these layers of defenses as within a microsecond, the terror thundered down.","...BZZZZT...BOOOM!","An apocalyptic impact echoed out as astounding whiteness bloomed.","The Natural Laws of Reality were torn asunder as they stretched out for light years, the will of the Illusory Legend coming down breaking through many layers of illusory rulers cast by Genevieve and Shields and aura called out by Noah until just a few barriers that could take on a bit over 10,000 True Reality Defense Values remaining...and this terrifying figure bounced off of these remaining barriers!","HOOOONG!","A fantastical glimmer of light flashed in the next second as all the broken Resource Shields and Auras bloomed again as more illusory rulers from Genevieve bloomed out, paving way for a fantastical reality as with four True Forms each capable of laying out attacks of a Legend's Visage defending...they had actually withstood an attack against an Illusory Legend!","\"Merely an Illusory Legend.\"","RUMBLE!","Three voices from Noah's Clones came out in synchrony as the eye-head of the Illusory Legend flashed sharply in the area where white space was trying to reform its natural laws!"]},{"number":1649,"title":"Chapter 1649: Chapter 1648 Improbable! l","paragraphs":["Chapter 1648 Improbable! l","Genevieve observed the impact thoroughly as she filled the Reality rulers she sent out with the pristine authority of a TABOO concept that ignored the natural laws of Reality themselves, and she shockingly saw that she was only capable of withstanding 30% of the damage coming down from the Illusory Legend as the other 70%...was all taken by the ridiculous existence before her who seemed to be capable of freely calling out two other bodies.","'Such a thing as expenditure of resources exists you know?'","Her experienced mind identified the impossibilities this being was showing this whole time as she heard him mock the rebounded existences freely while each of his three bodies released an astounding ray of light.","\"Merely an Illusory Legend!\"","WAA!","The disdain against an existence that had given itself a false reality!","Genevieve let these words sink in as she didn't correct Alexander at this moment.","If he developed the wrong mindset on what the power of Legends was, then so be it!","Legends were not something that could ever have the word 'merely' attached to them. Their power against those in the Firmaments of Ascendancy was akin to a dragon and the earthen sand that such a creature could stand on...they weren't even on the same plane of existence!","If they wanted to step on those in the Firmaments of Ascendancy, those beings could only be stepped on! The so-called Illusory Legend standing before them...it was only something that three Peak Ninth Firmament existences on their way to forming a Reality could imitate. It barely had one-twentieth of the will of a Legend as they were not comparable.","'Survive this...and I will show you what the visage of a True Legend actually feels like soon enough.'","WAA!","Her cold eyes moved as her pure white furred body bellowed out, her own attacks filled with a TABOO concept blaring out as they struck back against the Illusory Legend!","—","Ascendant Reality Sever.","An ability that should cost Noah 1,000 Units of the Essence of Reality along with trillions of Units of Mana, and yet when he cast it from three True Sanguine Clones simultaneously...it cost him utterly nothing!","This was because an Ascendant Dimensional Essence Shard had been utilized on this ability as the resource cost for it was utterly nullified.","So an ability that now had a base True Damage Values of 40 due to the Dimensional War Beads could be cast and kept active with no restrictions as when one thought about its chaining feature and progressive increase of Damage with every chain...a killer skill capable of tearing down anything with sufficient time was born!","His Infinite Willow Tree form had a 750 multiplier for his Damage Values as this meant 30,000 True Reality Damage Values for the first strike of Ascendant Reality Sever, with its progressive strikes becoming horrifically deadlier as on the 20th chain, its Damage would be further increased by 20% as 20 Ascendant Reality Fireballs would also be triggered along with multiple Reality Novas.","Ascendant Reality Fireball that now had 20 Damage Values due to the Dimensional War Beads meant that each one would explode with 20,000 True Reality Damage Values as 20 of them would deliver a force in the hundreds of thousands of True Reality Damage Values.","\"...\"","It was utterly ridiculous and something that shouldn't be possible! And the 20th chain would be within 20 microseconds as if Noah's calculations were accurate, this battle should end even before the 20th chain was reached!","And this was if one only accounted for a single Ascendant Reality Sever.","This was because there were also his two other Clones in their Samsara Cosmic Dao Origin forms who could release slightly less potent attacks due to their 500 multiplier to Damage Values- but it was still a base of 20,000 True Reality Damage Values from Sever as when one thought of three Ascendant Reality Sever rays smashing onto them and chaining onto their bodies over and over again with their own Ascendant Reality Fireballs...it was a true nightmare that would be experienced by a few beings today!","HOOONG!","After withstanding over 100,000 True Reality Damage Values from a single attack of the Illusory Legend with the help of four existences at the stage of a Legend's Visage, the counter attacks flew out and smashed onto the figure of the Illusory Legend with fervor.","BOOM!","White space bloomed as the fusion of three existences felt the Reality rulers that Genevieve spammed hit a natural defensive barrier of authority surrounding it as this transparent barrier only fluctuated, with the three sharp rays of vacillating Realities each dealing even more shocking Damage that caused its natural barrier to fluctuate dangerously!","But at the end of it all...","\"You cannot break past my defenses...which means this battle is over after I break past yours!\"","WAAA!","After the attacks landed, the Illusory Legend prepared to release multiple ultimate skills when all of sudden, the extremely fast rays of vacillating Realities that should have hit its transparent shield and faded seemingly returned to chain onto him again with even greater ferocity, along with even more bountiful rulers of Realities filled with the authority of a TABOO concept!","'Hmm?'","BOOOOOM!","They exploded out with an even greater force as multiple Ascendant Reality Fireballs that were bloomed out, the tens of thousands of additional True Reality Damage Values from Genevieve's rulers of Realities going forward to cause the single eye of the Illusory Legend to frown.","The collective damage was actually more than double the first strike as specifically, the ones causing the most damage were the three rays of vacillating Realities that its caster shouldn't have been possible to progressively release such an attack as a mere Legend's Visage in just another microsecond- the cost of resources alone being too much as to release such strikes, the Origin of the being casting these abilities should be drained by now!","\"Truly impetuous, your resources will dry up before you can even defend against the next attack! <Cataclysmic Firma-\"","BZZZT!","Before the words of this being finished and his ultimate ability rolled out, its singular eye-head opened wide as it sensed within a short time span of a microsecond...the same three rays of vacillating Realities came back to chain for the third time.","\"...\"","Each ray of Ascendant Reality Sever released three Ascendant Reality Fireballs as each of them exploded out with 20,000 True Reality Damage Values that when all nine exploded at once....","OOOOM!","The ruptured white space that was shredded of the laws of Reality cried out as merely on the third chain of attacks...the innate defensive barrier surrounding the Illusory Legend trembled unstably!!!"]},{"number":1650,"title":"Chapter 1650: Chapter 1649 lmprobable! ll","paragraphs":["Chapter 1649 lmprobable! ll","'Improbable.'","This was the first thought that rang out in the collective mind of the Illusory Legend as the scene before its eyes truly was an improbability.","Any ability with such a high Damage output had to come by through great means- and such means should not be available through the hands of the being currently casting them!","But...what was happening now was a culmination of events, concepts, and abilities that had been prepared for quite some time...with everything erupting all at once to cause the current reality-altering battle.","First, the concept of the Sanguine Emperor had to be wondrous enough to allow for Clones of a single body to carry even more power than that body itself, being so unique that the authorities of Ascendancy Halos of the main body could be called upon and utilized by the Sanguine Clones as if they were their own persons!","Then, sufficient resources had to be available for all these Clones to be supplied to take their True Forms as another wonder was the Tier of Ascendancy Halos themselves being Black even though there were no TABOO concepts to cause it. Through the improbable authority released by these Halos and the ridiculous Reality that the existence who held them actually had enough resources to do what he did, a ridiculous multiplier was achieved for all his cast abilities!","Then...there were the abilities themselves that only came to be due to an inflated Loot Quantity and Quality from the concept Resplendent Treasure Emperor- causing the birth of Reality Resource Points that made way for a Keystone Ascendant Skill Tree which contained ridiculous Reality altering skills.","It was these skills being utilized right now as only with all of these different factors in place did we arrive here at this moment in time!","At a moment in time where an existence that was the accumulation of three wills and had lived for billions of years found himself saying the words 'Improbable' as all those factors coming together and causing this to happen just weren't feasible!","BOOOOOM!","And yet it occurred.","Before the Illusory Legend could even release a second attack after the first one, his surroundings were shredded into blank whiteness as this glorious figure was actually knocked back.","With his whole body from head to toe shining with an illusory light of a Reality- he was actually knocked back by the attacks of an existence that had yet to break the shackles of the Seventh Firmament of Ascendancy!","Even though there was the Essence of a TABOO concept also smashing onto its innate barrier of Defense and eating away at it, the major work was done by the three Clones of the Unnamed Kainos Emperor!","After the third chain of attacks, the fourth chain arrived as it came with even more astounding ferocity that didn't even allow one to pause for breath.","\"Billions of years of planning, accumulation, and foundation!?\"","OOOOM!","The booming voice of the Unnamed Kainos Emperor rang out from his three Clones in unison as the voice revoked the past words of the Dimensional Archaic Devil Bird, Nine Reality Horned Unicorn, and the Eclipsing Celestial Void Eye that had tried to impose their wills and tell him that he should have hidden and built his foundation, that he was too impetuous of a genius that he would die here because of his impatience!","The Infinite branches of the Willow Tree surrounded everything as the enormous body of the Illusory Legend smashed into them, the fourth chain of three Ascendant Reality Severs thundering out at this moment!","The collective mind of the Illusory Legend buzzed as with its Origin lighting up with essence of reality to defend against an improbable attack that truly did not add up, its senses blared out with even more as in the fraction of a microsecond, it was able to observe the ridiculous source of danger as hidden among the countless branches of the Willow Tree that it had been thrown back into, there were 10 glimmering purple blue Crystals the size of Cosmos that pulsed with obscene danger.","10 Pandemonium Infused Dimensional Aether Orbs were activated at this moment to land along with the fourth wave of chained Ascendant Reality Severs as it was an utterly devastating attack where the explosion of the Pandemonium Infused Dimensional Aether Orbs alone would total 500,000 True Reality Damage Values!","Obscene!","Disgusting!","That was the only way that this move could be described as in the next moment, a shocking explosion followed by a huge bellow resonated out.","BOOOOOOOOOOM....GOOOOOOH!!! Follow current novels on Freewebnᴏvel.com.","A roar of disbelief and extreme pain as this moment had to be broken down in its fraction of a microsecond that it occurred in.","A dreadful force of essence filled with Pandemonium and Aether along with the authority from an entirely different dimension had exploded out as instantly...the innate Boundary of Defense that was built by the Illusory Legend was shredded to pieces.","It was only then that the fourth chain of Ascendant Reality Severs landed along with the authority of a TABOO Nomological Edict as unbelievable and simply incredulous Bursts of Damage rocked the target at that moment!","Damage so horrendous that the false image of a Reality that the three fused beings had achieved was torn apart irreparably as in the next moment, the single Illusory Legend body could not remain the same anymore!","HOOONG!","Blank whiteness spread through as the nearby laws of Reality quickly tried to reform and come back together, the image of three bodies screaming in disbelief while being torn apart from a single body being seen with clarity at this moment.","In that microsecond.","It felt like time had come to a stop.","Golden rivers of blood of Olden Emperors flowed as silently, the Infinite Willow Tree branches returned and collected these rivers of blood while activating the single high cost skill under Noah's arsenal that required 20,000 Units of the Essence of Reality- it was <Hematopoietic Progenitor>!","But this wasn't seen by everyone.","They only saw the split-apart bodies of the Illusory Legend back into the forms of Dimensional Archaic Devil Bird, Nine Reality Horned Unicorn, and the Eclipsing Celestial Void Eye as these three beings felt the full Tyrannical will of the Unnamed Kainos Emperor release from the nearby Willow branches, his voice thundering out as he let them know which of their Wills would reign Supreme in the end!","\"Fuck your foundation!\"","The booming voice of the Unnamed Kainos Emperor rang out just as the fifth chain of Ascendant Reality Severs arrived, multiple vacillating Realities exploding out as the chain of attacks released True Reality Damage much similar to the 10 Pandemonium Infused Dimensional Aether Orbs onto the three Olden Emperors, eradicating any part of their souls that they had so effortfully built the past billions of years!","BOOOOOM!"]},{"number":1651,"title":"Chapter 1651: Chapter 1650 Extracting the Bloodlines of Olden Emperors! l","paragraphs":["Chapter 1650 Extracting the Bloodlines of Olden Emperors! l","There were the Infinite rivers of Realities...and then there were Grotto Sanctums and fantastical Dimensions that very few could explore.","The Bloodlines who had managed to reign control over Grotto Sanctums and fully explore Dimensions gained tremendous opportunities, with one of the singular forces known by all powerful existences remaining the Primordials!","At this point in time, important personages throughout the Bloodlines under them were targeted as some perished, but an even larger amount showed their prowess with some individuals even skipping levels to take down powerful parties of Primordial Beasts.","The Primordial Beasts had an edge in the beginning due to their timing as many Prime and Emerging Realities perished, but then...the reigning will of the Primordials moved!","From the Primordial Temples!","From the Grotto Sanctums!","Specialized existences that had never been seen by the eyes of others moved out as the Primordial Beasts and the many other Bloodlines they had managed to get in an alliance with for this attack...they began to be reminded just why Primordials still reigned as Golden blood began to flow with even more ferocity!","In a certain region that had a small cluster of Prime Realities.","Known as the Pure Lands where multiple of the Pure-Blooded Cardinal Royal Bloodlines frequently moved around in- this place was actually a major target for the Enders and their Bloodline allies as a major force of hundreds of Ninth Firmament Primordial Beasts and other allied Bloodlines had led Legions of beings in the Firmaments of Ascendancy to wage a great battle that had already destroyed some of the Prime Realities here!","Yet at this point in time, austere quietness prevailed as not a sound of battle could be heard.","What could be seen were seas of crimson gold blood that had coagulated from countless existences in the Firmaments of Ascendancy, those responsible for this being a small Legion of important personages adorned in pure white robes!","Their robes were pristinely white while being free of blood- each of them vibrating with immense power and innumerable flashing Reality Passages as they were all at the Ninth Firmament of Ascendancy!","The ones in the lead at this moment were in their human forms as they stared at the endless seas of crimson gold blood forming, a particularly distinct being that stood out with an air of superiority and a solidified stellar crown above his head speaking out at.","\"Schemes, plots, and plans...in the grand scale of power- none of it means much.\"","Devilishly handsome features of someone fairly young could be seen on this being, with his body uniquely showing an illusory Reality flickering in and out of existence!","He stood at the forefront of a small Legion that had eradicated hundreds of Ninth Firmament existences and all their legions as another white-robed existence came forward to speak to the Candidate Emperor of the Kainos Era at the forefront.","\"Sire, we have received another distress call.\"","\"Mmm...\" This being nodded languidly as he waved his hands, the small Legion behind him coming to attention as with his eyes releasing a luminous light of an Emperor, this being commanded out.","\"Let's go.\"","HOOONG!","A brilliant white flash of light wrapped over this small Legion as it disappeared towards another location- this Legion being just one of the many dreadful weapons that Primordials had sent out!","It was a Legion of specialized powerful existences from the core power of Primordials- existences that made up small but powerful forces as they were known as Primordial Adjudicators!","When they made a move, Realities wept as the souls of their enemies would not see the next day!","—","In another location across the vast Infinite Realities.","Dazzling rivers of Reality could be seen interweaving with each other in a majestic fashion as they seemed interconnected- endlessly circling a vast space that blazed with an incandescent golden light that was vaster than the size of thousands of Realities!","Within a core location of this golden space encircled by many Realities.","Hazy condensed golden seas of essence permeated the surroundings similar to the changing environment of a certain anomalous Reality, and in a unique area of space that spanned for countless light years- one could see an enormous round shape that they could mistake for an astounding circular Reality!","Yet this humongous mass glimmered with a vibrant authority reminiscent of Realities themselves as it was actually a prestigious creature that opened its eye at this moment!","A singular mass of a vast eye countless light years large in size. Its figure was shrouded by a hazy golden light as all of its features could not be fully made out, but this eye released shocking reverberations of mental waves at this moment as an ancient voice could be made out from them.","\"Perished? Against a mere Disaster Remnant?\" This chapter is updated by Freewebnᴏvel.cᴏm.","OOOOM!","Astoundingly vast pillars of destiny erupted out with the ancient voice as Bursts of information flowed towards it, its entire body becoming enthroned by mystery as the voice continued to ring out.","\"No...not the Disaster Remnant. Who exactly...\"","BZZZT!","More waves of destiny flew out as this being had just locked onto the complete perishing of three astoundingly powerful Olden Emperors in the Firmaments of Ascendancy that were sent out, and a shocking authority of TABOO Nomological Edicts swirled around him as due to some unknown means, it was actually hard to grasp the identity of the offending party!","\"Interesting.\"","It was actually difficult.","\"The authority of the Disaster Remnant is actually masking them also...\"","...!","The same reason why the identity and location of the Disaster Remnant could not be pinpointed as even this being could only pull on strings of others to ascertain that such an existence would be getting besieged in a certain location. A similar sort of shielding seemed to now be covering the identity of the offending existence who had wiped out Will Bearers!","A veil seemed to exist that would have normally cut off all traces, but the being in question peering through was still the Olden Emperor of the Golden Eye!","HOOONG!","His authority raged out as his authority spread out to cover vast destinies and distances, searching for any traces that could match or link the identity of the offending party.","The authority covered everything as it even delved into the destinies and databases of many Bloodlines, eventually flowing into the database that was the Primordial Blacklist.","\"Oh?\"","The will of the Olden Emperor of the Golden Eye was pulled towards a string of destiny that seemed closely similar to the one it could not grasp near the Disaster Remnant.","Towards a name on the Blacklist that had yet to make major waves!","\"Osmont...?\"","WAA!"]},{"number":1652,"title":"Chapter 1652: Chapter 1651 Extracting the Bloodlines of Olden Emperors! ll","paragraphs":["Chapter 1651 Extracting the Bloodlines of Olden Emperors! ll","Dreadful.","This was the only word that could explain the sequence of events in a certain enclosure of space that culminated in the attack that tore apart the natural laws of Reality for many light years as the tyrannical will of an Emperor controlling three bodies was imposed throughout!","Blank whiteness was spread throughout as amidst this torn space trying to weave its laws back together, the dazzling branches of an Infinite Willow Tree could be seen pulsing mesmerizingly while taking in the golden True Blood of three extremely powerful Olden Emperors that just had their wills extinguished!","Nobody had been the wiser about this beforehand, but the eyes of an extremely old existence locked onto these actions at this moment in time as she also looked at the improbable results of the battle before her.","A battle against truly powerful existences that was perilous to their lives, and it had ended in a few microseconds!","The actions of the one responsible were all under heavy watch from the pure White-furred Genevieve that denied the status of a mixed breed Disaster Remnant, her soul currently on very high alert when staring towards the anomaly of an existence that had just eradicated an Illusory Legend through unexplainable means!","She was on high alert only briefly as she pulled on the many concepts within her Origin and closely looked at her destiny before her eyes flashed with understanding...and her defenses lowered.","The multicolored rotating rulers of Reality wrapping around her and Beatrix faded as one could now clearly see her form with her solidified crown, the Flames of different races bowing and paying homage to her still rotating around her body.","\"Hmm? The Empress trusts me so much to stop being on high alert?\"","An authoritative voice filled with calmness rang out as the rainbow colored branches receded backwards and space healed, the Unnamed Kainos Emperor speaking out as he still held hoped Genevieve would forcefully harm herself by unlocking more of her potential!","He was able to theorize that for her to achieve her prior glory, she had to successively open up barriers and restrictions in their own times or means that if she forcefully broke them to achieve things like TABOO concepts that she didn't have the qualifications for now...she had to pay a high price.","He wanted her to continue paying this price as she achieved her former glory- akin to him fattening up a sheep for slaughter!","\"Your attacks became progressively stronger after each one. If you were planning on going against me as well...you would have simply tried when those three fools perished!\"","The mind of this past Olden Emperor was sharp as her figure floated forward fearlessly, going towards the center of the Transcendent Plant Kingdom where an enthroned Infinite Willow Tree could be seen bounded side by side with two more True Sanguine Clones in Samsara Cosmic Dao Origin True forms.","\"Which leads me to believe that there is something that you want...Alexander King.\"","Her figure came to float beside him with cold and emotionless eyes as after she had ascertained Noah did not show killing intent towards her now, she grew truly bold!","SHAA!","Essence flashed as Noah's two other True Sanguine Clones stared at Genevieve coldly before disappearing, Noah's Infinite Willow Tree form also fading away into gorgeous multicolored lights as 10 dazzling Ascendancy Halos came back to rotate over his body and reveal his Cosmic humanoid form in all of its splendor- this same Cosmic humanoid form currently looking at Genevieve with a devilish smile.","He tapped on his throne as his consciousness was receiving wondrous loot prompts for the eradication of three Olden Emperors as well as the formation of three brand new Resplendent Treasure Caches that were due to his actions of utilizing all three remaining chances of this ability on these enemies!","He didn't even leave a single chance as if he could increase the number of times he could use it in a matter of days, he knew he would simply do it again one way or another as the allure of loot from A Legend's Visage was too dazzling.","There were these three gorgeous Treasure Chests that his main body would unlock, and there was also the infusion of golden True blood that was already collected and sent back to the main body as 60,000 Units of the Essence of Reality were utilized to begin the process of Hematopoietic Progenitor that would allow him to extract and obtain three more Olden Bloodlines!","While his main body oversaw all of this and the coming influx of hundreds of fairly high tier Quasi-TABOO Nomological Edicts...his enthroned True Sanguine Clone was focused on a certain Empress as it was time to decide her direction from here.","Noah's stellar eyes looked over her form curiously as he tapped on his throne while speaking calmly- as if he hadn't just wiped out two existences that were close to achieving the stage of Reality!","\"Tell me...what do you think the result would be if we fought? You and this Clone of mine.\"","...!","His words felt grand and elevated as Genevieve's will reacted strongly against him, the surrounding space shaking as Noah only smiled further at this!","\"Your non-answer tells me you understand how incredibly difficult it would be to extricate yourself, with my own destiny telling me that if I push you to the point of death...the last thing you unlock before death might also jeopardize this Clone of mine! That...is why we are still here.\"","\"...\"","A wrathful silence ensued as the healing space trembled from their clashing wills, anger as always bubbling with Genevieve as she actually had another existence talk to her in such a manner! Her! A Legend that was adorned and showered with respect in the past!","While controlling her boundless wrath at the current situation, her true form released rays of burning light as it faded, her Pure-Blooded Cardinal Royal Human form returning as she stroked the crimson gold skull of MADNESS before she asked once more against her very pride.","\"What...do you want?\"","BZZZT!","Noah's tyrannical will thrilled as it saw this ancient existence actually hold herself back as she knew if conflict broke, Noah would at most lose a Clone while there lay a possibility of her losing her life!","TAP!","\"What I want...\" Noah continued tapping on his throne as his eyes actually gazed away from Genevieve and into the remolding space behind her- his gaze looking at a certain direction that if they followed, they would reach a certain astounding Bloodline Domain.","\"I want to get my hands on the Runic Ecritures of Modus Operandi under the Pure-Blooded Cardinal Royal Humans...and it just so happens that you are a Future Candidate that should be one of the few remaining alive after the assassinations by Enders. Getting your hands on such a thing...should not be too hard!\"","...!","Noah's will was laid out as his future plans began to set themselves!","For the purposes of achieving the Realm of Reality and breaking past the shackles while forming the largest number of Reality Passages possible...this Clone would continue the journey into the lands of the Pure-Blooded Cardinal Royal Humans to fish amidst the chaos, a Modus Operandi or as he ascertained from the memories of the Royal Humans he killed- multiple scripts of Modus Operandi lying in the hands of this Bloodline!"]},{"number":1653,"title":"Chapter 1653: Chapter 1652 Extracting the Bloodlines of OldenEmperors! lll","paragraphs":["Chapter 1652 Extracting the Bloodlines of OldenEmperors! lll","As his True Sanguine Clone stared down against the ancient will of Genevieve, his main body was overseeing the coming boons from the deaths of the three Olden Emperors!","Bountiful prompts he could never get tired of rose over his eyes.","[+23,384,559 Cosmic Filament Cores obtained...] DING! The effects of Loot Multiplier are applied...[+ 23 Seeds of Reality are obtained.]","[+50,247,485 Runic Dao Line Enhancers obtained...] DING! The effects of Loot Multiplier are applied...[+ 50,247 Evolutionary Kainos Runic Lines of Ascendancy are obtained. ]","[+1155 Trillion Skill Points obtained...] DING! The effects of Loot Multiplier are applied...[+1155 Reality Resource Points obtained.]","[3,000 High Tier Reality Crystals have been obtained.]","The Origins of the three existences that had reached A Legend's Visage were similar in the number of their forged Cosmos as since they were fewer...Noah obtained fewer Seeds of Reality!","But the strength of their Souls and reserves of Essence of Reality were vastly different that he obtained more Reality Resource Points and Reality Crystals compared to the group of Enders.","Then...there were the concepts that these three Olden Emperors held, where just the three of them collectively had more Quasi-TABOO Nomological Edicts than all of the Ninth Firmament Enders combined as Noah was receiving an influx of hundreds that were first directed to the Soul Library while his soil adapted to them while it was being constantly strengthened!","<The effects of Absolute Looter are applied>","<The Flames and Bloodlines of the Quasi-TABOO Nomological Edicts of Nine Horned Reality Emperor, Dimensional Eye, Surpassing Gaze, Archaic Emperor...have been granted>","The flow of hundreds of Quasi-TABOO Nomological Edicts should have stolen the show for Noah, but it was actually something else entirely as one of the major gains before the opening of the Resplendent Treasure Caches was the extraction of the Olden Bloodlines that these existences held!","<Through Hematopoietic Progenitor, the Olden Bloodlines and authority of the Olden Emperor of Speculum, Olden Emperor of Pallidity, and the Olden Emperor of Advertent Tyranny have been obtained.>","BZZZT!","The blood of the Olden Emperors had coursed through his True Sanguine Clone and reached his main body as with the sacrifice of tens of thousands of Units of the Essence of Reality, the wondrous effects of three new Olden Bloodlines being achieved by him came to be!","And yet...this wasn't everything as wisps of vibrant information bloomed within Noah's mind.","<The Authority of Emperor Bloodlines are unique as when one defeats another, the authority is merely stolen and supplemented to their own. You have gone beyond that to attain their very Bloodline itself as new possibilities arise.>","OOOM!","His body and origin felt like they were burning as bountiful nee sources of power bloomed.","<The Authority of Emperors and their collected Bloodlines can be permanently absorbed into the Unnamed Kainos Emperor Bloodline as their core abilities are retained while elevating the Kainos Bloodline further, with the possibility of elevation from Quasi-VENERABLE to a VENERABLE Kainos Bloodline being made an eventuality as you absorb more Authority and Bloodlines of Emperors...>","...!","A glorious path once more opened up before Noah as the choice was clear. This chapter is updated by Freewebnᴏvel.cᴏm.","A collection of average Bloodlines of Emperors that even he had defeated, or the forging of a singular Bloodline that trumped over everything else?!","The choice didn't even have to take a microsecond!","\"Assimilate the Olden Bloodlines of Speculum, Advertent Tyranny, and Pallidity.\"","HOONG!","Olden Bloodlines were extracted and made his own as before they could even settle...everything about them was taken to be assimilated under his Kainos Emperor Bloodline as at this moment, Noah's Origin began to bubble with unbound regality as an already ridiculous Bloodline began to be elevated even further!","—","Boundless strength flowed within his main body as he ascertained all the new gains and watched the assimilation of Olden Bloodlines, his three True Sanguine Clones in the Azure Forsaken Treasure Reality finally making great stretches of progress around this time as with them utilizing the authority of Ascendancy Halos and increased power, they swept through the Treasure Islands of this Reality with haste.","There were many dazzling floating islands with rainbow colored bridges connecting each of them, the serene sight of piles of gold freely lying everywhere being pleasing to the eyes as any Soul Crystals were dug up along with any loot that Noah came across.","Within each floating island, another unique Destiny Goblin or two could be found as after Noah swept across 11 Treasure Islands, 17 Seventh Firmament Destiny Goblins followed him obediently- making their sweeping of this Forsaken Treasure Reality even faster!","This was how they arrived into the last Treasure Island.","At the very depths of the glimmering floating landmass with golden vegetation etched throughout it, within the innermost cavernous space- Natalya and Noah followed by a party of Destiny Goblins stared at the figure of an enthroned creature that was far different from the others- this existence boasting powerful waves of power at the Eighth Firmament of Ascendancy as it wasn't as Noah expected!","It wasn't an upgrade from the Destiny Goblins to a Destiny Goblin King waiting for them, but a different creature entirely as they came face to face with an enormous golden slug-looking creature that had dazzling jewels and Crystals stemming off of its body.","Around this creature, a Destiny Domain Space surrounded it as two golden pages releasing an air of ancientness could be seen surrounded by Naturally Formed Primordial Treasures, Soul Crystals, and other unknown glimmering loot!","<Ultimate Amalgamation of Greed>:: A collective of fortune and greed into an existence at the Eighth Firmament of Ascendancy...","The identity of the creature was revealed as Noah looked at curiously, while Natalya had a somber expression at the heavy aura this existence revealed.","There were no Ascendancy Halos or anything emitted from it, its golden sluglike body filled with treasures merely lying on an old golden stone throne as it stared dangerously at the intruders.","\"Master, this is the ultimate concentration of Greed and destiny within this Reality, with its sole purpose being the preservation of its domain space as it is a soulless creature...\"","A leading Destiny Goblin behind them spoke out as Noah nodded lightly, Natalya seeming worried as she gazed at the two pages of the Azure Treasure Emperor's Runic Ecriture of Modus Operandi that they could not get their hands on unless they defeated this Eighth Firmament creature!","She...had no idea of the true extent of the being currently with her!"]},{"number":1654,"title":"Chapter 1654: Chapter 1653 Azure Treasure Emperor's ModusOperandi!l","paragraphs":["Chapter 1653 Azure Treasure Emperor's ModusOperandi!l","Noah's two other True Sanguine Clones were finished with the exploration of the other unexplored Treasure islands as Natalya had yet to see them, so she had no knowledge of just how ridiculously advanced Noah's level of power had become within this past day as she simply gripped the Heartsplitter Bow tighter while speaking to him.","\"It cannot be too easy at the end as it is not a Destiny Goblin appearing that you can easily overcome, but this powerful creature. We might be capable of bringing it down with long distance attacks while the Destiny Goblins attract its attention, but it will still be extremely dangerous!\"","She spoke seriously as even though she felt it was dangerous, she truly couldn't allow their exploration to stop here as two more pages that would complete a Modus Operandi were right there!","She vowed to get it even if she had to fight with her last breath as there was also another reason for her confidence...the dazzling stellar looking being whose very figure seemed to be made of Cosmos.","When he had abruptly taken this form a while back, Natalya did not probe as to her, it didn't matter what race this being was! They were each on this path because they were searching for something, and they were now this close to getting their hands on something that many Bloodlines would fight to death over.","She turned towards him to hear his thoughts and plans as she still saw him as carefree as ever, his face actually having a light smile as he spoke while raising his hand- the glimmer of Ascendancy Halos rising around him.","\"No plans or ganging up on it will be necessary.\"","...!","Confusion swept over the Overseer's expression as before she could ask, her origin shuddered as her eyes were drawn to his finger!","Her very origin quaked as she felt a horrific ray of stellar light be released from the finger of this Peerless Forger before her, this ray being something that could make any existence in the Seventh Firmament of Ascendancy tremble!","<Ascendant Reality Sever>.","BZZZT!","A ray of vacillating Realities barreled out and cut apart space as it entirely superseded the innate defensive barrier around the slug like Ultimate Amalgamation of Greed, this creature's fat muscles barely rising before it exploded into a mass of golden flesh and light.","BOOOM!","\"....!\"","Natalya's heart trembled at such a scene while the Destiny Goblins behind her instantly fell to their knees at such a show of power- paying respects to Noah with fearful excitement at their Master's unfathomable power!","An Eighth Firmament Ultimate Amalgamation of Greed...destroyed with a single flashing ray of light!","\"That...how did ...?!\"","Natalya had been faced with many surprises while traveling with this being, but nothing was more dreadful than this as she confirmed once more with her awareness and soul that the being before her truly was still in the Seventh Firmament of Ascendancy.","She couldn't probe any Reality Passages or see any indications to say otherwise...so how were the sequence of events that this being undertook even possible?! Natalya locked onto him with any move he made as she sought answers.","Yet Noah wasn't even gazing at her as his eyes curiously looked at a prompt before him.","<The Ultimate Amalgamation of Greed has perished under your hand as your Destiny and Fortune is elevated greatly.>","<The Ultimate Passive Skill Destiny Domain Space has been granted. It allows its user to spread out a single domain space around a certain area as with the passage of time, unique treasures will naturally form in this domain. The more fortune and destiny an existence has, the faster and more abundant the treasures that form over the years are.>","...!","A ridiculous prompt rose over Noah's eyes as he now seemed surprised as well, Natalya having to look at him with even more incredulity as she wondered what the hell he could be surprised about!","'The passive formation of loot over time in a Domain? This is just...'","Noah shook his head at what seemed to be the ultimate present of this Forsaken Treasure Reality apart from the Azure Treasure Emperor's Runic Ecriture of Modus Operandi, observing his elevated destiny and fortune as he waved his right hand, his authority barreling out as it caused the two floating ancient pages and all the other loot in the domain space to flow towards him!","Natalya looked at this in a daze as she finally voiced her words out.","\"How...are you capable of releasing power that can eradicate Eighth Firmament existences? Did you...have this when the Gazer was coming for us?\"","Her eyes were filled with disbelief and skepticism as she began to question everything she knew about this existence- but her destiny didn't tell her anything about him being harmful to her as she was further confused!","Noah grasped the two golden pages in his hands as he smiled while speaking plainly.","\"No, I held power at the first and third Firmament when you met me and as we moved. Over the past day, I've just had my first body make some progress by powering up a little bit...and I can do this much now.\"","\"...\"","Silence reigned in the surroundings after these words as even the Destiny Goblins stared at Noah blankly!","Yet he had a bright smile on his face as he got what he wanted as he didn't bother with this.","\"Two more pages of the Modus Operandi...with this, it can be completed!\"","His heart felt grand achievement for rapidly exploring this Reality and getting his hands on such a treasure, but Natalya was still lost as her confounded voice echoed out once more.","\"Don't we still have a few more Treasure Islands to explore and obtain the other pages...?\"","\"Oh, my Clones took care of that.\"","...!","A voice rang out from the entrance of the cavernous space of this Treasure Island as another stellar form of Noah that looked exactly the same as the one Natalya had been traveling with appeared, another one following closely behind while followed by a few Destiny Goblins as each of them carried two pages of the Azure Treasure Emperor's Modus Operandi!","Natalya Rostova looked at this scene with utter daze as the Destiny Goblins scrambled to pay their respect, the Clones meeting up with all the loot of the Azure Forsaken Treasure Reality as with it...a complete Modus Operandi could be obtained!"]},{"number":1655,"title":"Chapter 1655: Chapter 1654 Azure Treasure Emperor's ModusOperandi ! ll","paragraphs":["Chapter 1654 Azure Treasure Emperor's ModusOperandi ! ll","The figures of three stellar Clones met on the last Treasure Island as they held everything required to bring to fruition a unique treasure that always remained behind locked doors of all powerful Bloodlines.","Natalya stared at the scene before her in disbelief as from the three Noahs, a few ancient gold glimmering pages flew out until 12 shining points of light formed!","\"The Azure Treasure Emperor's Runic Ecriture of Modus Operandi...let's see what you have in store!\"","BZZZT!","Noah's eyes released luminous light as he observed everything with great concentration, the 12 ancient pages having been pulling the moment they neared each other as in a chain reaction, strings of golden light shot from each as they connected to each other.","ZIP!","These strings then pulled the pages together as one by one...they were stacked on top of each other akin to archaic metal doors closing every microsecond!","Until in mere moments...","HOOONG!","Pristine light of authority and power spread out as when it dimmed ever so slightly, the hidden wonder within was revealed.","Surrounded by a natural golden Halo of light, a smooth golden scroll that had the Runic Ecritures meaning <AZURE TREASURE> could be seen floating silently!","It seemed like an entirely blank scroll with the only words being AZURE TREASURE, but Noah could feel this single scroll filled with such astounding waves of destiny that the entire Forsaken Treasure Reality could not even compare.","The Destiny Goblins were bowed down while paying obeisance, and the figure of Natalya stared at the glimmering golden scroll with complex eyes as it was everything she wanted!","A Runic Ecriture of Modus Operandi could not even be preserved in memories as to learn it, one had to come in direct contact with it.","This was how Noah had learned the Low Tier Defective Celestial Modus Operandi...and he now reached out to grasp onto the dazzling scroll that had been achieved with a decent amount of effort!","WAA!","His fingers reached out for it, but the page itself shockingly seemed alive as even before Noah fully unfurled his hand- the page floated over by itself!","\"Oh?\"","Such a scene could barely be thought of for long as in the next instant that Noah came in contact with it, boundless information surged into him as yet another method for one to break their shackles and begin rotating their Origin akin to a genuine Reality showed itself!","HIGH <Azure Treasure Emperor's Runic Ecriture of Modus Operandi> :: A unique understanding of the revolution of Reality that incorporates the weaving of destiny and fortune with the rotation of all stellar bodies. The immense focus on destiny and fortune with the revolution of Reality was studied by the Azure Treasure Emperor long after he had achieved Reality, this High Tier Runic Ecriture of Modus Operandi being a penultimate design he managed to forge after 1 billion years. The Destiny and Fortune of existences that open their Reality Passages with this Modus Operandi will experience an immense curve as the resultant Passages formed are termed <Destiny Reality Passages> that reinforce greater concentrations of Destiny, Fortune, and Essence of Reality. This Modus Operandi can guarantee up to 20 Destiny Reality Passages for the most talented existences with a bountiful foundation, with this number scaled upwards depending on the destiny and fortune of the existence breaking their shackles. The method of plucking destiny and fortune while rotating the stellar bodies is...","A wondrous Treasure landed in Noah's arms as after information about it flowed into his mind, something else also came as Noah heard a deep voice filled with age surge from the golden scroll towards him!","His eyes flashed with sharpness as he allowed it in after examining it, a booming voice ringing out in his mind.","<I forged this Modus Operandi to try and use destiny and fortune to guarantee the seat of Emperor, and I still failed. I hope the Destined existence to put all of its pages together in this little Treasure Reality has a greater destiny than mine to use this tool and achieve something special...>","An old voice filled with solemnity and sadness echoed out as it seemed to hold great attachments and regrets, causing Noah to gaze at the pristine golden scroll within his hands as he sighed!","It was a truly stupendous tool, but even the Emperor that forged it had perished.","It guaranteed 20 Reality Passages for the most talented of beings as when Noah read on the revolution of the stellar bodies within one's Origin, the same phenomenon that had occurred when he first grasped the Low Tier Defective Celestial Modus Operandi played out again as with his permission, his Cosmos rotated in a certain manner for just a microsecond before he stopped them- this mere moment of rotation causing a shocking illusion to flash behind the True Sanguine Clone in question as it nearly caused Natalya to drop the Heartsplitter Bow within her hands!","Behind Noah's figure- ever so briefly...30 dazzling illusory Mountainous-like Reality Passages formed.","\"...\"","Not 20 as the High Tier Modus Operandi stipulated- with Noah's destiny and fortune scaling this number up by 50%!","The Reality Passages didn't glow with the stellar color of purple blue similar to all the ones Noah had seen before- with the illusory Reality Passages appearing behind him being gold in color as they shone in a mesmerizing fashion!","If Noah chose to proceed and break his shackles at this moment, he could actually build 30 Reality Passages as this number must have increased due to his destiny and fortune- as well as his increasingly robust foundation as he broke all sorts of limitations.","\"Destiny Reality Passages huh...\"","Noah nodded his head after affirming this, his actions nearly causing those around him to go crazy as Natalya had an utterly defeated look of disbelief on her face.","\"You...can break your shackles at any time and achieve such a feat?\"","Her eyes flashed with longing as she asked, imagining the austere sight of golden Reality Passages as Noah's figure nodded, his eyes shining sharply as he began to float towards her.","\"I can. But that is me, and you are you. I have other plans for myself, but you can go ahead and learn this Azure Treasure Emperor's Runic Ecriture of Modus Operandi in order to break your own shackles!\"","WAA!"]},{"number":1656,"title":"Chapter 1656: Chapter 1655 Azure Treasure Emperor's ModusOperandi ! lll","paragraphs":["Chapter 1655 Azure Treasure Emperor's ModusOperandi ! lll","Noah was straightforward as without Natalya, he would have not been led into this Forsaken Treasure Reality as he would not bully the being who had initially found it!","Natalya's gaze hardened as she gazed at Noah and then the glimmering gold scroll, her hands reaching towards it as an influx of information similar to Noah flowed into her- her eyes shining brightly an instant later.","\"If your talent is stupendous, 20 Destiny Reality Passages are possible. How many Reality Passages does the Primordial Legend that you want to kill have?\"","Noah voiced out freely as the golden scroll naturally floated back into his hands.","Natalya's eyes released a sharp luster at this question as she voiced out with confidence.","\"Less than 10.\"","...!","\"Mmm...and what do you think of your talent and foundation? Do you think you can forge more than 10?\"","An important question that caused the burning light within the eyes of Natalya to dim.","Everyone knew themselves the most as Natalya understood her foundation and destiny best apart from anyone else, and she could give a confident answer at this moment as she stayed quiet!","Noah looked at such a scene as his eyes began to curve, a devilish smile coming onto his lips as he spoke calmly.","\"I have a way that will guarantee you achieving at least 15 if not more Destiny Reality Passages.\"","WAA!","His words caused Natalya's eyes to flutter, locking onto him as her origin buzzed.","\"How...\"","With a devilish smile, a Tyrannical aura had already begun leaking from Noah as he spoke.","\"As you've noticed, I'm a little exceptional in the things that I do as even now, not just Eighth Firmament existences...but even average Ninth Firmament existences cannot compare to me. Whatever revenge you have to take, whatever Legend you have to kill...I can confidently say that you can achieve this under me within a few months, if not weeks.\"","...!","Boastful words echoed out as they occupied the mind of Natalya Rostova entirely!","\"Under you?\"","\"Yes. Be one of the many Generals under me that shall explore these expanses of Realities...and breaking your shackles to form more than 15 Reality Passages should be easy as your enemies shall become my enemies!\"","A talented existence under him who had enough fortune to locate a Forsaken Treasure Reality and a possible enemy at the level of a Legend that could be a source of wondrous loot in the future...how could Noah let such a chance slip away!?","There was more to his intentions apart from this as for now, the will of the Tyrannical Emperor echoed out as the past Overseer of the Isles of the Gilded Forge received a bright prompt proposal before her very eyes that told her to pledge her Fealty to a single being.","\"...\"","Silence reigned in the surroundings as for those proficient in destiny, they would already know the choice to make in this shocking situation as the eyes of Natalya moved from Noah to gaze at the over a dozen Destiny Goblins skill kneeling towards his three bodies. Her own goals flashed before her eyes as when superimposed with all the things she had seen with him in their time...the choice was clear!","With a heavy heart driven only by revenge, the figure of Natalya Rostova bowed towards Noah while speaking out stellar words.","\"I pledge Fealty to the Tyrannical Emperor.\"","BZZZT!","Waves of essence bloomed out as yet another Destined existence fell under Noah's banner.","Her eyes gradually expanded with more shock as with the pledging of Fealty, she felt the strengthening of her body and soul as well as the eruption of her seas of destiny just from being connected to this being!","Before she could express her shock though, she felt her surroundings glimmer with scintillating lights as Noah's voice echoed out.","\"Good. Let's wrap things up here and I'll bring you to the base of operations. There, I'll give you a few Limit Breaking Tools and get you ready to break your shackles...I want to see the process of forging Reality Passages and a revolving Reality in a crystal clear fashion.\"","...!","Ridiculous words left his mouth while his body began to buzz with essence that began to permeate outwards- covering the cavernous space they were in and spreading even further outwards as Natalya held in her shock while asking.","\"What...are you doing now?\"","\"Mmm, just forming a connection with this Forsaken Treasure Reality as when it's assimilated to my own Reality, I wonder what will come of it...\"","OOOM!","Ridiculous words followed by vibrant Essence erupted out, the golden scroll floating near Noah shining with pulses of light as uniquely, it made the spreading of his essence and the connection to this Treasure Reality much easier than it would have been if Noah had tried this before!","While being gradually covered by a hazy golden light, the Azure Forsaken Treasure Reality began to fall under the Authority of a certain being as it would be pulled towards a stellar growing Reality!","—","In a region of space filled with dense vegetation.","The Transcendent Plant Kingdom glimmered with intensity and fervor as two Kainos Emperors gazed at each other wordlessly, waves of destiny surging around them both as they seemed to be having their own battles!","Off to the side, Beatrix had a heavy expression due to the silence after such a long period of time that her expression eased greatly when her Empress spoke in the next second.","\"Very well. A Modus Operandi for you so long as you continue to use your 'astounding destiny' in a land where Legends live. Let's go to the Pure-Blooded Domains and see whether destiny will carry you against the eyes of Legends!\"","WAA!","The dominating words of Empress Genevieve ended as the enthroned Noah smiled, the Transcendent Plant Kingdom beginning to fade around them along with his Throne of Unnamed Tyranny.","Beatrix sighed inside as she knew very well what the cold eyes of her Master were thinking as they gazed at the one they knew as Alexander!","She had far surpassed a level of intrigue and anger as at this moment, she wanted to rip apart this being's main body to pieces as quickly as possible no matter the price! But she couldn't yet locate him as she had begun to rush her awakening already by unlocking concepts her soul was not yet ready for, and Beatrix worried for what she might do next if this being before them continued to show anomalous capabilities that forced the Empress to continue unlocking concepts much too early.","'Let us not lose sight of the ultimate prize....Empress.'","Beatrix had this thought as she planned to talk to the only being she cared for when the time was right. Because now...the reigning will of an existence that had just wiped out too many Ninth Firmament existences still imposed down around them.","\"If you've been evading the eyes of Legends this whole time, why can't I?\"","A gaze of boundless confidence stared at the dark haired Genevieve, this Empress staring back in turn at the stellar cosmic being as she snapped her hand to bring back a cuboidal vessel they had been utilizing all this time!","\"Oh, let me do the honors this time around.\"","BZZZT!","Noah's will surged out as above them and eclipsing everything, a transport type Quasi-TABOO Primordial Relic in the form of a dazzling Reality appeared as <Iridescent Reality> was called out.","Glorious in stature and putting everything else to shame, Noah's stellar figure floated to land atop the seemingly endless vessel that looked like a stable glass structure holding a Reality filled with countless Cosmos, a thin multicolored barrier surrounding it all around in a circular fashion as when he arrived, Noah called upon the feature of <Pocket Reality> of the Infinite Reality to begin erecting structures within this Quasi-TABOO vessel. Futuristic structures where one could find lodging, expansive high rise glass buildings with open roof pools, bubbling golden springs filled with hazy mist where one could go and relax, huge forges and grills to cook Primordial Beasts...everything that one could imagine for relaxation arose on top of the <Iridescent Reality> as its size alone was vaster than many Cosmos!","The figures of Genevieve and Beatrix arrived onto the Quasi-TABOO vessel as they looked at the paradisical sight atop it, their eyes flashing coldly as they gazed at the Unnamed Kainos Emperor who at this time had erected a singular crystalline stellar throne at the very center of this vessel that he went to sit on, gazing towards them in a carefree manner as his voice echoed out.","\"Make yourselves at home as we head out to our false home. Towards the Pure Blooded Domains where even Primordial Legends can be seen!\"","...!","Towards the Pure Blooded Domains.","Towards the belly of the beast!","SHIING!","With dominating visage, the vessel of the Unnamed Kainos Emperor followed the memories of defeated enemies as he went towards one of the innermost domains of Primordials where occasionally, the Visage of genuine Legends could be seen!"]},{"number":1657,"title":"Chapter 1657: Chapter 1656 Immense Gains! l","paragraphs":["Chapter 1656 Immense Gains! l","A sense of calmness and prosperity spread out over the Infinite Reality as this seemingly settled down.","Seas of different types of Essence were still constantly being forged throughout the stellar bodies of this expanding Reality, but the effects of the first Infinite Dream had ended as everything calmed.","A perilous battle that would have been lost if sufficient preparations weren't made was also won as the gains from this battle propelled Noah into a level of strength that only very unique existences at the Ninth Firmament of Ascendancy could display!","The gains from this battle had to be properly digested as there were truly too many things.","From the first five Resplendent Treasure Caches, Noah still had two Dimensional Essence Shards to utilize and allow for the Reality Altering nullification of resources for two abilities.","Many possibilities rose in Noah's mind as among them was <Limit Breaking Mana Refinement>, an ability that required 10,000 Units of the Essence of Reality in addition to trillions of Units of Mana to cast! If he nullified the resources for this ability, he could effectively refine his Origin and soul to achieve the Limit Breaking Extreme Mana Physique that boasted a strong foundation to allow for even more Reality Passages to form during the time when he broke his shackles!","Yet he was also currently at the stage of having reserves of 100,000 Units of the Essence of Reality, and he had thousands of Ascendant Flasks of Life and Death that recovered all Resources entirely as if he consumed a single one. To completely refine the Limit Breaking Extreme Mana Physique, a bit less than 1 Million Units of the Essence of Reality were required in total as this amounted to the usage of 10 Ascendant Flasks of Life.","A measly number compared to what he had as due to his rapid pace of progression, even something like 1 million Units of the Essence of Reality was an achievable resource in a short period of time! Due to this, even though this ability required ten times the amount of essence compared to Sever- it wasn't chosen to utilize a Dimensional Essence Shard over.","But there was an ability similar to it in terms of how many units of the Essence of Reality it ate up- Noah's destiny strongly pointing towards it at this moment as it was RUINATION's feature, <Concept Corruption>!","It required 10,000 Units of the Essence of Reality as it also wasn't a limited use ability like <Limit Breaking Mana Refinement>, with Noah needing to corrupt all of the new Quasi-TABOO Nomological Edicts he held as if one did the math, the required Units were in the millions.","Noah could even go further if he nullified the resource requirement for this ability as he could corrupt the thousands of INSUPERABLE Nomological Edicts he had gained from the Seventh, Eighth, and Ninth Firmament Enders, along with the few hundred from the followers of the Will of the Past Emperor!","Even though they placed Quasi-TABOO Nomological Edicts in their Halos, they had lived for too long as they also held many Insuperable and even Quasi-Insuperable Nomological Edicts. If Noah freely Corrupted even Insuperable Nomological concepts and then placed them in the Soul Library for his people...the amount of power he could raise with them was ridiculous as the ability of <Concept Corruption> was at the very forefront for the utilization of Dimensional Essence Shard.","The mention of the followers of the Will of the Past Emperor caused Noah's expression to turn slightly somber as even at this moment, he continued to sift through the billions of years of memories of three existences who had their own stories- his soul relishing on arguably one of the most important loot out of all this!","Memories.","The memories of the Dimensional Archaic Devil Bird, Nine Reality Horned Unicorn, and the Eclipsing Celestial Void Eye....they were something that caused Noah to want to tread even more carefully in the future as they told off too many disastrous secrets and built a brutal and fantastical world that Noah was being given a glimpse of at this moment.","From the memories of these three beings, Noah learned of the Primordial Will Bearers- existences who were under the Authority of a Legend as they moved with their orders.","The three Will Bearers Noah had faced were under the Olden Emperor of the Golden Eye, with Noah finding something dreadful whenever memories of this being rose in the long history of the Dimensional Archaic Devil Bird and others!","The visage of this Legend...was clouded by a misty light whenever they appeared in the memories as Noah couldn't even discern who they were or what they looked like.","And this applied to all Legends that these three Primordial Will Bearers had been lucky enough to come across- everything about them was clouded even in the memories of others!","This...showed a mere glimpse of the power of Legends as Noah planned ahead for many contingencies and possibilities.","HOOONG!","Amidst his thoughts though, he was awoken to the appearance of the last Reality that was fusing into the Infinite Reality for the next few days until he initiated Infinite Dream once more.","Noah's will had spread over the Forsaken Treasure Dimension as what should have been an impossible task became easy whenever Noah grasped the golden scroll of the Azure Treasure Emperor's Runic Ecriture of Modus Operandi, this loot acting akin to a master key that made all connections flow as at this moment, Noah saw the unique sight of a dazzling river of Reality over ten times larger than even Prime Realities begin stacking up over his Infinite Reality and beginning to fuse with it!","BZZZT!","Arcs of golden light began to bloom as the Azure Forsaken Treasure Reality was pulled in to be assimilated into the Infinite Reality, its restrictions being broken apart as its Treasure Islands and Domains disappeared into fantastical light that all surged towards the core of this Reality.","Along with this, the brilliant luster of 20 True Stars of Conquest began to form as they caused Noah's eyes to smile dangerously! Others didn't see this as his people were stumped to see an even greater disruption at this moment when everything should have already been done.","A clone of Little Henry, Amelia Osmont, Adelaide, Barbatos, Halcyon, Athena, Emperor Penguin, Sword Emperor, Steel Mikhail...nearly all of Noah's closest women and most powerful generals could be seen within the Novus Universe as they watched this shockingly unfolding sensation once more with their vast consciousnesses, but they were on for a surprise at this point in time as Noah took the inhabitants of this new reality and teleported them into the Novus Universe after he felt the breaking apart of the spatial restrictions!","SHAA!","The dazzling figures of Destiny Goblins bloomed before everyone along with the return of Noah's Clone, the eyes of his people lighting up at his presence as many even shot towards him!","But they all came to a stop in the next instant as apart from the Destiny Goblins, they saw Noah's figure floating beside a curvaceous and utterly exquisite crimson golden haired Natalya Rostova who was clutching her Heartsplitter Bow tightly.","\"....\"","Silence reigned as Noah's people looked at this being with slight surprise, the reactions of others being more prominent as one could see Barbatos's figure shaking her head while voicing out prominently the moment they appeared.","\"Ah...don't tell me it's another woman. Little Fish, don't you think you have enough?!\"","...!","Barbatos showed a playful teasing expression as she acted dismayed, the gaze of Amelia Osmont becoming stern while the Little Henry she held in her arms looked at the scene of his father floating down with even more respect!","Barbatos's words nearly halted the introduction as Noah shook his head with a smile while floating forward.","\"No such thing. I merely bring another general in our ranks....she will more than likely be the first in this Reality to break past her shackles and reach the Eighth Firmament of Ascendancy, so watch closely and gain something when this happens!\"","WAA!","The past Overseer of the lands of the Primal Titans in the Isles of the Gilded Forge arrived into a new land filled with mystery, a fantastical Reality also being assimilated into the Infinite Reality at the same time as its results were bound to be astonishing!"]},{"number":1658,"title":"Chapter 1658: Chapter 1657 lmmense Gains! ll","paragraphs":["Chapter 1657 lmmense Gains! ll","The Azure Forsaken Treasure Reality was quite different from Emerging or Prime Realities as what was assimilated from it more than anything was its unique authority.","20 resplendent True Stars of Conquest formed as each one was suffused with waves of milky white light, descending towards Noah's body and sinking into him freely!","Austere golden waves of destiny bloomed at the very center of the Infinite Reality as the changes due to this Forsaken Treasure Reality were displayed in Noah's mind.","<The feature of Treasure Destiny Domain Space has been added to the Infinite Reality.>","<The feature of Spatial Restriction has been added to the Infinite Reality.>","...!","The Assimilation of a Forsaken Treasure Reality actually granted two new features, Noah's soul beginning to peruse through them as he found <Spatial Restriction> to be unique in that it allowed Noah to impose restrictions similar to a Treasure Reality where the inhabitants could not freely teleport!","He could apply this towards the whole Reality or to specific sections, or even apply it to certain groups of people. It was something unique that Noah planned to play with later as the second feature to be gained was something similar to the ability Noah himself had gotten when he defeated the Ultimate Amalgamation of Greed.","<Treasure Destiny Domain Space>:: Three Destiny Domain Spaces can be enacted in the Infinite Reality as over time, the formation of Naturally Formed Primordial Treasures, Soul Crystals, Resource Crystals, Mana Stones...and many other unique types of loot shall take place.","More methods for him to attain loot and strengthen his Reality overall as when the Assimilation of the Forsaken Treasure Reality finished, one of Noah's Clones took the task of communicating with his family while also preparing to show them something very few would get to experience- the breaking of shackles from the Seventh Firmament to the Eighth!","The new entrant Natalya Rostova would be the subject of examination as Noah began giving her Limit Breaking Elixirs he could forge with ease at this moment to start the preparations.","This was just one of the numerous things Noah would be overseeing in the next few days.","He had many, many other things that he had to do...and this calm period of time after such a perilous battle was great to get them out of the way. Especially with the time delay of the Cosmic Holy Land, mere a day or two passing in the outside Realities would mean Noah achieving all that he wanted in the Cosmic Holy Land!","As for what had to be done?","\"The deconstruction of all obtained Cosmic Daos into the maximum allowable Runic Dao Lines. Then their enhancement with Evolutionary Runic Kainos Lines of Ascendancy...and then proceeding with the Limit Breaking Extreme Mana Refinement that will change all Runic Lines into Runic Kainos Mana Lines of Ascendancy!\"","These were just among the first set of actions Noah would take.","After this, there was the spreading of Shards of a Seed of Reality to quickly raise his strongest generals into Seventh and Eighth Firmament existences after Natalya- this being especially the case as his Reality now had a Runic Ecriture of Modus Operandi that its inhabitants could utilize!","In this coming closed off session for the next few days, Noah was planning to have his Clones take care of everything with his people while his main body focused on completing his Physiques, strengthening the soul through the Soul Crystals and extinguishing of unneeded Nomological Edicts, optimize his 600 slots of Flames of Edicts in his Ascendancy Halos to all be entirely Quasi-TABOO, then make all of these concepts into Ruined Concepts by corrupting them, utilize the remaining Affixes of Reality through RUINATION, refine Limit Breaking Elixirs and Pills, forge Relics, set up his own Destiny Domain Space...there were frankly too many things to be done as they would all be taken care of in this coming period of time in the Cosmic Holy Land!","Many choices like this went over Noah's mind as his main body was currently situated on the Throne of Arcadian Tyranny while he utterly burnt and desecrated Minor, Greater, and Quasi-Insuperable Nomological Edicts with the authority of this Olden Bloodline in order to strengthen his own soul!","His strongest Bloodline was also undergoing constant reforming and strengthening as three new Olden Bloodlines were becoming incorporated into the Unnamed Kainos Emperor Bloodline- this process taking time as Noah would find out the gains from it soon enough.","While this occurred, he stared at three glimmering Resplendent Treasure Caches he had yet to open as the biggest gains out of the last ones included three Blueprints of TABOO Relics.","<APEX>, <PIONEER>, and <FORTRESS>!","He had obtained the Blueprints of such terrific items as each had drastic material requirements, with Noah being blessed by having many of these materials through the very same Caches or having already obtained them from the Forsaken Treasure Reality!","Yet each Blueprint had a single or two items that Noah did not have on hand and nor could he get easily.","For two of the Blueprints of TABOO Relics- their last material even required Noah to delve into the Dream Dimension and the Mirror Dimension!","This was a task for the very near upcoming future as for now, Noah was curious about the loot in the three Resplendent Treasure Caches that came from beings far stronger than Ninth Firmament Enders.","\"Now, what will you three hold?\"","BZZZT!","Golden splendor shot out as three Resplendent Treasure Caches began to open, dazzling prompts rising before Noah's eyes as just the first few caused his mind to buzz!","<The Quasi-TABOO Relic <Gloves of the Starry King> has been obtained.>","<800 Olden Orbs of Transmogrification have been obtained.>","<5,000 High Tier Soul Crystals have been obtained.>","<The TABOO Relic <LETHE> has been obtained.>","HOOONG!","Everything came to a stop.","\"...\"","The other golden prompts of the Resplendent Treasure Cache faded as finally, something undeniably shocking had come up before Noah's eyes.","A TABOO Relic!"]},{"number":1659,"title":"Chapter 1659: Chapter 1658 LETHE! I","paragraphs":["Chapter 1658 LETHE! I","Noah's Expansive Space was nearly endless in size as if anyone ever got their hands on it, they would die of greed just from the sheer number of ridiculous treasures and loot within this space.","From dazzling Orbs that allowed one to obtain Quasi-TABOO Nomological Edicts to mountains of Soul Crystals and Reality Crystals, to even an assortment of Quasi-TABOO Relics!","His Expansive Space contained a great deal of things as Treasure mountains rose everywhere, all of Noah's loot constantly being placed in this space if he gained it from enemies or when he opened his Treasure Caches.","This meant that when he received the prompt that spoke of a TABOO Relic, this Treasure appeared in his Expansive Space right away as it brought drastic changes even in this space!","HOOONG!","The nearby Quasi-TABOO Relics trembled as of they had wills, unconsciously being pushed aside as a mass of stellar obsidian darkness descended.","Orbs of Transmogrification, Naturally Formed Primordial Treasures, Soul Crystals...any other loot nearby was pushed aside for miles as the grandeur of the TABOO Relic ridiculously occupied an empty space as the other loot weren't even allowed to near!","BZZZT!","Whatever Relic was hidden in the stellar obsidian darkness released arcs of profound soul shaking light as it floated majestically, showing its glory amongst all other loot until a microsecond later- the glimmering will of the Unnamed Kainos Emperor called upon it.","\"...\"","Silence descended as this ridiculous Relic actually didn't answer the call of its new owner!","RUMBLE!","It was a shocking action for the Unnamed Kainos Emperor to not be able to even call upon his items in his own Expansive Space, his shocking will and authority barreling down with ferocity in the next moment.","\"You cheeky little thing...you better come out now and be obedient before I collect a dozen more TABOO Relics in a few weeks and leave you to collect dust!\"","...!","Words of shocking authority that carried a form of undeniable truth- a truth that told this domineering Relic these words would be adhered to if they didn't get what they wanted.","SHAA!","A microsecond later, the mass of stellar obsidian darkness disappeared as a TABOO Relic answered the call of its owner.","In the Cosmic Holy Land.","Noah's vibrant eyes gazed at the Relic that had actually snubbed him in the beginning as information began to flow in his mind while this TABOO Relic floated towards him.","LETHE!","This was the name of this TABOO Relic as such a word had the meaning of a state of forgetfulness or oblivion, such meaning only giving Noah an indication of what this Relic would hold as his eyes pierced across the stellar obsidian veil surrounding it and saw it with all of its glory!","His eyes were first met with the distinct light of 9 pulsing obsidian rivers of Reality- their illusory light actually free flowing across what seemed to be a shawl!","A shawl, or better known as a cloak or mantle!","An air of ancientness surrounded it as it seemed to be there and not there every other microsecond, Noah having to steel and focus his soul just to make sure that the TABOO Relic was still before his eyes.","What was most astounding was the fact that this stellar dark cloak with the light of 9 obsidian Realities had 10 spinning multicolored rings of light around it that constantly gave off a heart throbbing authority!","Multicolored rings of light that were very reminiscent of...Ascendancy Halos!","OOOM!","With haste, Noah's eyes released piercing rays of light as they took in all the information about this Relic and displayed it brilliantly in his mind.","[TABOO <LETHE>:: A tool of ultimate possibilities due its confounding nature and capability to alter the natural laws of Reality passively. It is a Relic at the level of TABOO as it required special authority to merely equip, the base of such authority being a TABOO concept. The activation of its abilities can only be done through essence or authority that stems from TABOO. It is a tool that grants its user the <Veil Of Lethe>, a constantly adapting passive ability that shows others what the user wants them to see and hides what should remain forever unknown. This includes their Realm, Destiny, the strength of their Souls and Concepts, Bloodlines...any concepts of Reality that define an existence. Furthermore, the <Veil of Lethe> carries its Reality altering effects onto selected enemies as they begin to act carelessly and with heedlessness towards you, such actions of forgetfulness eventually leading them to their oblivion. This veil can withstand even the inquisitive glare of penetrative TABOO concepts when enough Mana and Essence of Reality are provided as LETHE also holds the unique authority of ten <Malleable Ascendancy Halos> that can be commandeered by the user to act as their own additional authority once equipped, with these Malleable Ascendancy Halos mimicking the highest tier Halo currently achieved...]","[...Even though its uses are more auxiliary, LETHE also contains the ability of <Shield of Oblivion> that can be enacted by 1 Quintillion Units of Mana and 100,000 Units of the Essence of Reality through the authority of TABOO, this ability granting a reality altering shield that can grant a base 100 True Reality Defense Values. Remaining features include <Character Selection>, <Memory Alteration>, <Oblivion>, and <Concept Edit>. It is a Relic of extreme power as its utilization can allow one to better understand TABOO and even aid on their path to enact more of such concepts, with results varying depending on its utilization.]","\"...\"","Unbelievable details flowed over Noah's mind as if it was anyone else, they would be too awestruck to even continue on for the next moments!","Yet Noah's eyes released beams of light as while staring at the cloak that glimmered with 9 illusory obsidian releases and undulated with 10 Halos of multicolored light, his body erupted with oppressive pressure as 10 dazzling Black Ascendancy Halos bloomed.","This was because the ridiculous Relic before his eyes...was something that one couldn't even adorn and utilize to its full extent as the authority of TABOO had to be there for one to play around with this TABOO Relic!"]},{"number":1660,"title":"Chapter 1660: Chapter 1659 LETHE! ll","paragraphs":["Chapter 1659 LETHE! ll","An authority of TABOO was required as wondrously, Noah had such an authority even though he didn't have a TABOO concept!","BZZZZT","Domineering arcs of light bellowed out as the TABOO Relic LETHE finally undulated with less light as Noah's authority bounded out, its glorious visage beginning to flow towards him as his hand beckoned towards it now with the authority of his Black Tier Ascendancy Halos that held the Authority of TABOO!","They were Halos that one could normally only achieve with the Flames of TABOO concepts, and Noah Infused his essence through them to command this Relic before his eyes as it moved behind him and went on to clasp onto his back!","—","Around this same moment in time.","Within a cluster of innumerable Realities.","The gaze of a LEGEND was a terrifying one to have directed at you, with it being silent most of the time as their concepts of TABOO acted in such a way to not cause a reaction with one's destiny!","This meant that a LEGEND could be tracking down an existence without their knowledge as when they were found and the Visage of a genuine LEGEND crashed down, they wouldn't even know how they died.","The only way to counter such a gaze was with your own protective TABOO concepts and authorities as normally, only LEGENDS could counter LEGENDS.","This was why at this moment, a terrifying will of the Olden Emperor of the Golden Eye had locked on to a particular existence as even though the culprit was masked around the authority of a Disaster Remnant that was naturally hard to grasp due to these beings' history, other lines of destiny were grasped from the Primordial Blacklist as from this- many things could be stipulated!","\"Noah Osmont...your will is stipulated across multiple Realities as karma connects you to the Primal Titans. Seventh Firmament of Ascendancy? Rubbish...\"","The shocking visage of the Golden Eye couldn't even be seen properly as this existence gazed at multiple golden strings that had begun to feed him information, with him manipulating their Origin as his goal was to eventually find out everything about the existence that had killed his Will Bearers and then locate them!","\"Now...where can I find you- oh?\"","BZZZT!","Heavy obsidian sparks erupted out as the golden lines that the Olden Emperor was pulling upon shattered and fizzled out.","\"...\"","Out of nowhere!","Just when the Olden Emperor of the Golden Eye was about to make some headway into the identity and position of an existence that was already hard to track due to unknown factors!","Yet now, everything about him faded as no feedback of information was coming across even though multiple TABOO authorities were active at this moment...but it felt like they were being stopped by an unshakable veil.","BZZZT!","An unshakable veil that even when the authority of the Golden Eye raged out with more intensity, it remained unshaken!","It was the Veil of Lethe.","\"Curious...does he have a LEGEND protecting him, or...?\"","The will of a terrifying existence was confounded as the Veil of Lethe had passively acted to confound its first target!","A LEGEND had lost a trace at an opportune time that would have caused some troubles to a certain existence unless his destiny had begun to quickly alert him while contending against the authority of TABOO...and such an occurrence had occurred more than once in the past where just as tremendous possible peril was about to descend, it was unconsciously evaded within a difference of seconds or even microseconds.","How could this be explained? Was it purely due to the unconscious augmentation of Destiny altering things naturally and steering events in such a way? Or was it something else entirely?!","—","<Veil of Lethe> was a passive ability that one received if they equipped LETHE, but it could draw upon Mana and Essence of Reality as required if an inquisitive TABOO authority was geared towards your direction!","HOOONG!","Noah shockingly felt such a pull the moment he utilized the authority of his Black Tier Ascendancy Halos to adorn the obsidian cloak onto his back, thousands of Units of the Essence of Reality instantly beginning to be drained from him along with trillions of Units of Mana.","\"Oh?\"","His eyes flashed with solemnity as while his body was erupting with untold grandeur due to adorning a TABOO Relic, the feedback from LETHE told him that the passive Veil of Lethe was now actively stopping the piercing gaze of an existence as if Noah didn't coincidentally happen to obtain this Relic and equip it...","\"...\"","Would a Clone of his have been found? Or would his main body and Infinite Reality be revealed? These questions caused Noah's excitement for the TABOO Relic to take a backseat briefly as he reevaluated everything, with his destiny having affirmed to him that through his TABOO authority of the Black Tier Ascendancy Halos, he would be masked against even Legends so long as he didn't have them heavily focus their attention on him!","This was the only assurance that had allowed him to continue into the Pure Blooded Domains where one might run across a LEGEND.","But it seems like such a LEGEND had actually focused on him as Noah could only think of a single being that was connected to the Will Bearers that he had eradicated! And yet...the Veil of Lethe had cut off anything that this being had attached to as after a few microseconds, the usage of Essence of Reality was stopped as the veil calmed down.","The singular feature of this TABOO Relic had already shown its ridiculous usage as for any worries about Noah becoming entangled in the sights of LEGENDS...they could all be forgotten as the number of things he could mask now were too many!","For an example.","BZZZT!","A hazy dark Veil of authority wrapped around his body as it extended upwards at this time, going on to extend past the solidified crown of the Unnamed Kainos Emperor.","A crown and authority that showed itself clearly at all times as it disdained being hidden!","Noah couldn't change the reality of this solidified crown, but he could set the authority of LETHE to alter the perceptions of others when they stared at him as he commanded the authority of this TABOO Relic to not show what floated above him! That was all.","WAA!","If someone were to be looking at Noah at this moment, they would notice his dazzling solidified crown fading from sight in a wondrous fashion.","A Relic...that was capable of even silently hiding an authority that disdained being hidden!","This wasn't all as LETHE wasn't just a TABOO Relic.","It was also a Limit Breaking Tool!","Ten Malleable Ascendancy Halos came with this Relic as they were multicolored when the cloak was unequipped, but the moment Noah adorned it...","SHIING!","They turned a dangerous shade of black as horrifically, Noah's body erupted with an even more domineering authority as 20 Black Tier Ascendancy Halos began to undulate around him!","\"...\"","10 were blank and without any Flames of Edicts as 600 concepts had to be conjured up and placed within to fully complement its authority.","But the sheer possibility of this affirmed that on this day, Noah had broken past the limitation of the number of Ascendancy Halos that a Seventh Firmament existence could have as from 10, he currently wielded 20!","And all this...was just a single aspect of the TABOO Relic LETHE as more than all of this, there was the <Shield of Oblivion> that if Noah cast while fused with just 10 of his Ascendancy Halos with the true form of a Samsara Cosmic Dao Origin, he could achieve 75,000 True Reality Defense Values from this shield alone without even placing any other modifiers in the picture!","And he...had many modifiers to think about as the actual True value was unknown due to the fact that he now held an additional 10 Black Tier Ascendancy Halos.","This was only half of what LETHE could do as apart from all this, there were still four features another hadn't even delved into yet!","---","<Author's Note>","Rendition of Noah powering up with the concept of Reality Passages!"]},{"number":1661,"title":"Chapter 1661: Chapter 1660 LETHE! III","paragraphs":["After the already shocking capabilities displayed by LETHE, there were still a few other features that remained!","<Character Selection>:: The holder of LETHE can design a specific identity and reality to present to others, with multiple differing identities with their own unique concepts being capable of being designed and chosen at will. A base Bloodline can be set for the Character to be designed as concepts are built around it, the result being something that cannot be differentiated by even existences with TABOO Nomological Edicts unless they know what they are looking for. Years' worth of history and destiny about a character can be designed that will be what others find if they decide to gaze towards your direction...","<Memory Alteration>:: Under the authority of LETHE, the memories of targets can be altered in unique and unknown ways as if they cannot defend themselves, an existence could be made to lose memories of those closest to them or believe you were their closest most trusted person...","<Oblivion>:: Through resonance with the Relic and the user, the Relic can fully fuse into your body as an increased authority of TABOO is granted. In the case of LETHE, the unique concept of Oblivion is applied to its authority as it grants all offensive abilities an additional base of 100 True Reality Damage Values. This ability requires 100,000 Units of the Essence of Reality and 1 Quintillion Units of Mana to cast, and then requires the same number of resources to keep active every 5 microseconds.","<Concept Edit>:: The concepts under the user of LETHE can be modified in different ways, with the cost always being varying Essence of Reality depending on the changes. The Ultimate Skills of Flames of Edicts can be altered, or even the core meaning of an Edict or Dao...","Wondrous new features that might seem ridiculous to some or average to others...and it was all due to how one used them!","Concept Edit and Memory Alteration had the potential to be ridiculous Reality altering skills if used in certain ways, with Memory Alteration even being something that could heavily affect the Destiny of many beings if used properly.","Then there was Character Selection that allowed Noah to design multiple characters with years worth of histories and destinies- such a thing being much needed as he couldn't just have Legends try to peer into him and find nothing. A detailed false history would cause others to glance at him once and look away while finding no history and information will only cause any passing LEGEND to focus on him!","Then, there was the <Shield of Oblivion> that granted 100 True Reality Defense Values and only needed to be cast once with its 100,000 Units of Essence of Reality Resource Cost, with this number needing to be paid again only if the Shield was broken so that it could be reenacted!","Lastly, there was <Oblivion> that granted 100 True Reality Damage Values to all Offensive Abilities and required 100,000 Units of the Essence of Reality to cast as to keep it active, this resource along with Mana had to be paid every 5 microseconds!","If Noah was fused with his 10 Halos, equipped the Dimensional War Beads, and then fused with LETHE through <Oblivion>- Ascendant Reality Fireball would actually be capable of releasing a base 120 Value that when multiplied by a 750 multiplier...90,000 True Reality Damage Values could be reached.","\"...\"","And this wasn't even accounting for what the additional 10 Ascendancy Halos from LETHE would grant once Noah's soul was strengthened enough from burning concepts and absorbing soul crystals!","The idea alone could make someone gaze at everything in disbelief as they countered the probable damage with Ascendant Reality Sever as well, and just what the mere concept of a tenth Chain of Sever that would bloom 10 Ascendant Reality Fireballs would mean.","Unheard of damage Values in the hands of an existence in the Seventh Firmament of Ascendancy as one wondered...when Noah eventually broke his shackles and ascended to the Eighth and Ninth Firmament, would he be capable of reaching Damage Values that were the norms for those who had an established Reality?!","WAA!","Grand ideas without an abundance of information!","Noah let such thoughts free as after affirming the ridiculous capabilities of LETHE, he adorned this cloak as he looked like a stellar Cosmic existence that had now placed a shawl glimmering with 9 black illusory Realities behind his back, 20 Black Tier Ascendancy Halos undulating over him up and down as it was enough to frighten any weak minded existences in the Firmaments of Ascendancy.","With this in place, the remaining Loot from the Resplendent Treasure Cache finally resumed after being pushed aside the past few microseconds.","<The Sui Generis Enlightened Primordial Relic <Belt of Endless Space> has been obtained.>","<6,000 Ascendant Breaths of Reality have been obtained.>","<The Sui Generis Enlightened Primordial Relic <Chainsaw> has been obtained.>","<The Quasi-TABOO Relic <Helm of the Warring Emperor> has been obtained.>","<50 Flasks of Liquified Realities have been obtained.>","<2,000 High Tier Naturally Formed Primordial Treasures have been obtained>","<1 Ascendant Dimensional Essence Shards has been obtained.>","<100 Dream Stones have been obtained.>","<The Blueprint of the TABOO Consumable Item <Kainos Orb of Transmogrification> has been obtained.>","There were multiple new things to rise before Noah's eyes, but he honed in on one of these new forms of loot that particularly caught his eye while controlling himself to not yet hone in a certain TABOO Blueprint, his eyes first landing on the Flasks of Liquified Realities!","<Flasks of Liquified Reality>(50):: A single Flask contained the broken and ground down Reality into the form of a glorious liquid that can only be enjoyed by existences capable of doing such an action. They have no restriction on the number of flasks that can be taken by a single person as drinking a single Flask of Liquified Reality increases one's Maximum Reserves of Mana by 1 Quintillion Units, Maximum Reserves of Essence of Reality by 1,000 Units, and the Maximum Reserves of Destiny and Fortune by 1 Trillion Units.","...!","A fantastical Limit Breaking Tool appeared as even the Limit Breaking Elixirs Noah had forged...one could only have a limited maximum amount before their usage ran out!","But not the Flasks of Liquified Reality. This chapter is updated by Freewebnᴏvel.com.","Can one imagine that? Turning an entire Reality into a liquified mass that you then drink? How would that feel coursing down your tongue? How would your origin feel at the Cosmic Filament level as it is bathed by the liquid form of a genuine Reality?!","Ah!"]},{"number":1662,"title":"Chapter 1662: Chapter1661 LETHE! IV","paragraphs":["Chapter1661 LETHE! IV","10,000 was a hard restriction for the maximum reserves of the Essence of Reality that was set for those in the Seventh Firmament. 100,000 was another limitation above that that was set for those on the Eighth Firmament!","It didn't mean that most existences in the Eighth Firmament reached the 100,000 cap- just that the most astounding and genius of existences had this as their limitation.","This was the limitation Noah faced now while still in the Seventh Firmament of Ascendancy...so what could stop him now if he swallowed multiple Liquified Realities to break apart this limitation!?","It was an action that would further build his foundation to ridiculous levels as he exceeded all known boundaries before even breaking his shackles.","The Resplendent Treasure Caches from the three Olden Emperors always went above and beyond to surprise as after a TABOO Relic and something like Liquified Realities, a single Dimensional Essence Shard was replenished as there was even another item from the set of the Warring Emperor- this time a Helm!","Unlike the Aegis of the Warring Emperor that granted the 20 True Reality Defense Values, the Helm of the Warring Emperor granted 5 True Reality Damage Values and 5 True Reality Defense Values as it wasn't as domineering.","But if Noah gained the third item from the Warring Emperor Set...his destiny told him there would be a boon to look out for as one of the Set Effects should be achieved at that time!","Then, there were the Dream Stones and the last item Noah controlled himself to gaze at last- the Blueprint of the <Kainos Orbs of Transmogrification>.","<Dream Stones>(100/100):: Crush a single Dream Stone in your hands and fall into a Dream that lasts a million years. Dream Stones are rare materials found across the Dream Dimensions as they temper the disposition and soul of an existence, allowing them to live a million years with the passage of mere hours in the outside Cosmos. An existence before and after crushing a Dream Stone could be vastly different in their thought process as the strength of their soul will experience varying levels of elevation depending on what they accomplished in their Dream...","<Blueprint of the Kainos Orb of Transmogrification>:: The methodology to craft an Amalgamation of authority privy only to the Kainos Era, with its usages indicating a relation to TABOO. The materials required to forge it are 1,000 Naturally Formed Primordial Treasures, 5,000 Ascendant Breaths of Reality, 5,000 Mirror Essence Crystals, and 50,000 Units of Golden Sand. More information of the usage and applications of the Kainos Orb of Transmogrification will be available once forged....","Stupendous new forms of loot appeared as the Dream Stones had their own wonders, and then there was the Blueprint of the Kainos Orb of Transmogrification.","\"Another pathway towards TABOO, is it?\"","A devilish smile rose on Noah's face as he read all the materials required to even forge a single Kainos Orb of Transmogrification, a decent amount of work laid on his plate to find even more materials at this moment!","BZZZT!","His body even released pulses of profound light at this time as the Assimilation of three Olden Bloodlines into his Unnamed Kainos Emperor Bloodline continued, Noah turning his sight to the many tasks he had to accomplish.","With the materials he had on hand, it was also possible for him to bring to fruition a goal that he thought would take weeks to achieve!","\"RUINATION.\"","WAA!","The crimson gold humanoid figure of the treasure with spectacular capabilities appeared, emotionless on the surface as always but...one could see a hint of excitement hidden deep within the endlessly red eyes.","\"There are many things to do...but why don't we get started with you?\"","...!","The cards were set.","A great number of materials and means were laid out before Noah's hands as he had many tasks to do, proceeding first with the elevation of RUINATION as there were many other tasks that required to make use of all the things he had gained!","Now, it was time to utilize everything as by the time his True Sanguine Clone reached the Pure Blooded Domains...his power would be entirely different from what it was now.","Within the Cosmic Holy Land, many actions began to be taken as in the outside Realities, time passed.","War bloomed across the vast realities as within a certain hidden Infinite Reality, there was only calmness and peace as the inhabitants within were isolated from any form of conflict!","They would never know the effort and sweat that went to make all this happen as only those in the vast Realities suffered as many Bloodlines became entangled in conflict- each side seeking supremacy as a new Era ushered in.","Due to the level of power of the beings involved, countless events and things could occur within a single second- much less a few hours that they could fill many pages of one were to write them down.","Such events bloomed as the river of time and destiny flowed...a mere 2 days passed just like this. The source of this content is Freeᴡebnᴏvel.cᴏm.","Merely 2 days...yet the changes to the Hegemony of many Bloodlines and Realities were greatly different as past all of this- there were the biggest changes that would occur with the being that had hidden himself in his Reality to utilize the many boons he had on him!","—","Across the vast Realities.","A vessel in the form of a flat Reality was tearing across the Boundary Between Realities, beautiful structures akin to a fantastical small metropolis being seen atop this vessel as the aura of three prominent beings could be felt!","Atop one of the tallest skyscrapers, an exquisite scene of a grill could be seen. The glistening golden meat of Ninth Firmament Primordial Beasts could currently be seen simmering as the Unnamed Kainos Emperor poured golden liquid over it that caused crimson flames to rage even higher around it- a shocking smell erupting out that would cause anyone to drool!","To the opposite end of the skyscraper, the figure of Empress Genevieve adorned in a free flowing white fluffy cloak and the tight golden wrappings would be seen- her figure putting most ruling queens to shame as Beatrix could be seen dressed similarly to her left.","The two of them were staring at the scene of Noah freely grilling Enders while they neared the Pure Blooded Domains, but their eyes weren't on the meat that was even affecting their senses as they were instead staring above the head of the Unnamed Kainos Emperor.","\"You have lost your crown.\"","...!","The eyes of Empress Genevieve were exceedingly cold as she finally spoke about the disappearance of the solidified crown on top of Noah.","Yet Noah continued grilling freely as he replied back.","\"I will never lose my crown.\"","WAA!","A play of words as the Unnamed Kainos Emperor asserted that he would never lose his authority...even if they could not see it!","Genevieve's lips curved into a sneer at this reply as she gazed out from the Quasi-TABOO Relic Iridescent Reality and into the vastness of space they were crossing.","\"You know that in the Olden Times, any existence who was capable of hiding their Authority as an Emperor was called a coward...and also someone that was feared as one would never know when they would make a move.\"","She seemed to be thinking of the past as she spoke, Noah's voice coming to ring in her ears as it took her out of her memories.","\"Does the Empress think of me as a coward or someone to be feared?\"","BZZZT!","Dazzling waves of destiny erupted from the stating of these words as Noah even turned away from the meat he was grilling to gaze at the Empress while waiting for her reply.","But...","HOOONG!","Before the conversation could even continue, a burst of violent spatial essence could be felt towards the distance that the Iridescent Reality was actually going Towards.","\"Hmm?\"","The eyes of all three beings atop it gazed forward as since they were nearing the Pure Blooded Domains, they would naturally start coming across terrifyingly powerful and important existences!","But the aura and destiny of the ones that could be felt up ahead...was something entirely unexpected.","The Unnamed Kainos Emperor was arriving into new lands as along the way, an unexpected welcome party came across them!"]},{"number":1663,"title":"Chapter 1663: Chapter 1662 A Meeting and Progress! l","paragraphs":["Chapter 1662 A Meeting and Progress! l","Three personages had been on the road for the past two days as they neared the Pure Blooded Domains at this moment, the Iridescent Reality flowing freely with stellar bodies as when it felt the vibrant force coming up ahead, it slowed down and calmly came to a stop.","The Pure Blooded Domains were different compared to the stretches of the Boundary Between Realities in other regions under the Authority of other Bloodlines, where one could routinely see vessels and the auras of existences floating throughout as there were even check points and stations to eventually cross as one delved in further!","This was because once they entered the periphery of these Pure Blooded Domains, they could have access to the lands of the Pure-Blooded Cardinal Royal Reality Ursidae, Infinite Willow Trees, and Humans along with the two other profound Primordial Bloodlines stretching their influence across Realities.","The 5 Pure-Blooded Cardinal Royal Bloodlines held the most power among Primordials, with the normal Cardinal Royal Bloodlines like the Royal Wolf Bloodline or Royal Spirit Bloodlines were considered second class.","Most Legends that have propagated outside the vast Realities stemmed from the 5 Pure-Blooded Cardinal Royal Bloodlines, with their history among the Primordial being deep and entrenched throughout as it was even rumored that the last True Emperor who had obtained authority had stemmed from these 5 Bloodlines!","Eons of history, and immeasurably powerful.","These were the lands Noah was entering as at this moment, the profound coagulation of auras they felt spatial essence from began to materialize before their eyes.","\"Hmmm?\"","Noah's eyes sparkled as he gained even greater interest, his will seeing the appearance of a small Legion of white robed Primordials who were mostly in the Ninth Firmament of Ascendancy, with the front most beings actually letting out power as A Legend's Visage at the Ninth Firmament of Ascendancy!","A few hundred beings...all in the same stage!","It was a profound party to come across as Noah had a fair knowledge of such small Legions from the memories of the Pure-Blooded Cardinal Royal Humans he had decimated and the Will Bearers of the Olden Emperor of the Golden Eye.","There were a few specialized groups hidden as the core power of Primordial Bloodlines.","One was the Will Bearers that acted under the Authority of Legends, dispatched to eradicate vestiges of existences, Disaster Remnants, or particularly heinous existences on the Primordial Blacklist.","Then there were small Legions like the one that rose before them.","\"Primordial Adjudicators...\"","BZZZT!","The words stemmed from Empress Genevieve as she and Beatrix closely gazed forward at the coming party and actually recognized some of the beings within it, seeing those with authority clearly as among the sizable Legion of Ninth Firmament existences, there was one fairly young man floating at the forefront with a dazzling solidified crown above his head, and a cosmic toppling young woman with a cold expression that had an illusory crown above her head!","Her skin was tanned with a bronze hue as dazzling hair flowed to her shoulders, her eyes covered by a multicolored stellar hue as the White robe was barely able to hide the curves underneath them, and her expression was akin to an empress that oversaw vast Grotto Sanctums with everything under her feet.","The man floating next to her had an astound identity as he had crimson and gold hair dancing with soul shaking light, his skin fair and his eyes entirely black as if they could swallow everything!","His visage was more astounding and wild than anyone else here as it seemed just from a flick of his fingers or a blink of his eyes, he could tear apart the Natural Laws of Reality!","But even though this was an astounding personage who had even attained authority as a Kainos Emperor, Empress Genevieve was staring at the dark haired brown skinned beauty beside him as she called out with genuine surprise.","\"Nefertiti...\"","WAA!","The uttering of the name caused a sharp light to cross in the eyes of the dazzling woman as she replied coldly.","\"It is Adjudicator Nefertiti. How many times must I remind you of this, Genevieve?\"","Boundless authority leaked from her as she held profound power at the Ninth Firmament of Ascendancy!","\"It's Empress Genevieve...\" Genevieve spoke while actually going forward and tapping the solidified crown above her with a smile. \"It's not the young woman who you barely gazed at in the past when you left everything behind. With this, you might actually have to call me Bloodline Master.\"","...!","The two spoke as if they knew each other, and they truly had a deep history as the Primordial Adjudicator Nefertiti stemmed from the Pure-Blooded Cardinal Royal Humans!","But over a million years ago, she had left all her authority within her Bloodline to join the Legion of Primordial Adjudicators under a single being.","One of the beings talked about in the core circles of Primordials as one of the true Candidate Emperors of the coming Era due to his profound disposition and power- and this was further proved by the fact that he had already attained his solidified crown!","He had many titles, but one of the most known ones...was Adjudicator Ezekiel.","His eyes were calm even while seeing a fellow Kainos Emperor, only flashing with brightness at the Quasi-TABOO Relic they stood one while his gaze passed by Beatrix and then Noah!","\"Hmm?\"","Ever so briefly, his gaze passed on Noah just for an extra second before it faded, the voice of Adjudicator Nefertiti ringing out to cover everything once more.","\"Bloodline Master...merely an authority in name for cowards to fight for! It is why I left it behind for you and that weak naive girl who should have been ahead of you, but you seemed to have not perished amidst this blooming chaos and even made great gains!\"","She was also gazing at the solidified crown above Genevieve as it truly represented too many things.","For a Candidate Emperor of a Pure-Blooded Cardinal Royal Bloodline to have Candidacy to become a True Emperor of an Era...their ascension was nearly guaranteed as boundless glory awaited for them!","But shockingly, Adjudicator Nefertiti actually referred to those acting as figureheads of Bloodlines an authority in name for cowards!","This was because genius Primordials at the Eighth and Ninth Firmament of Ascendancy truly had many options to choose from for their destiny, and some believed that the most opportune destiny lay in other paths and positions as they even disdained the figureheads that would be tasked with overseeing the day to day of workings of their Bloodline.","\"A weak, naive girl...\" Empress Genevieve said these words as the image of one a young girl with exceeding disposition and beauty appeared in her mind, with her eyes trembling with light an instant later as they rose to gaze towards another direction in space!","Their party and the party of the Primordial Adjudicators were facing each other, but they felt a third part with yet another profound aura come towards their left as another entrant party appeared at this meeting today!","They moved quickly as golden robed existences making up a small Legion similar to the first party they had met appeared, this one having a single young woman at the forefront that held dazzling white hair and fair skin, her eyes glazed over by illusory Realities as she held a shocking disposition that could make average Ninth Firmament existences have their souls shatter from her mere look...even though she herself seemed like a precious creature that evoked feelings of protection the moment one saw her!","\"Weak and Naive...it is always great to hear you talk about me, Big Sis Nefertiti.\"","WAA!","With astounding visage, the last entrant of this meeting today appeared.","An insignificant meeting that shouldn't hold too much importance as the vast majority of participants didn't even gaze towards the direction of Noah who was watching everything with shining eyes.","None of them gazed at him even though under his eyes, beams of profound loot light were filling everything in his sight as all the existences before him were termed as possibilities of loot!","None of them gazed towards him...but they would come to know him soon enough!"]},{"number":1664,"title":"Chapter 1664: Chapter 1663 A Meeting and Progress! ll","paragraphs":["Chapter 1663 A Meeting and Progress! ll","Multiple new existences came across Noah at this moment in time as nearly all of the new beings barely spared him a glance.","Adjudicator Nefertiti and the newly appearing woman she referred to as weak and naive who was actually her sister of the same familial Bloodline, but of a different mother...they only faced each other at this moment as no other beings mattered.","The hundreds of Primordial Adjudicators within their legions at the Ninth Firmament of Ascendancy only kept their heads straight like perfect soldiers as they also didn't even spare a glance towards Noah!","But a single being had spared him a glance and even gave a thought about him.","Standing beside Adjudicator Nefertiti, it was Adjudicator Ezekiel whose black eyes seemed capable of devouring everything.","He couldn't help but gaze at Noah as under his inquisitive mind, he noticed the sense of profound calmness and even curiosity that this being had when he gazed at the unfolding situation around them.","Since he was with Genevieve, he should know her status and the status of the beings she addressed. He should know about Primordial Adjudicators and more than anything, he should know a great deal about Adjudicator Ezekiel that stemmed from a Pure-Blooded Cardinal Royal Bloodline at the same level if not higher than the Infinite Willow Tree Bloodline!","There was the Pure-Blooded Cardinal Royal Human, Reality Ursidae, Infinite Willow Tree, and another pristine Bloodline that made up the core power of Primordials was a species that always reigned Supreme even within Beasts in extremely low worlds that barely had a mimicking trace of their grandeur.","A species commonly mentioned in myths and legends...with the Bloodline that Adjudicator Ezekiel belonged to being the perfect fusion of two of such mythical species that bore fruit to the Pure-Blooded Cardinal Royal Bloodline of the Dragon Phoenix!","Not merely a stupendous Bloodline of Dragons or Phoenixes, but a perfect Bloodline that was of pure blood! Even the Reality Ursidae were only equal to them as they were a ruling class that deserved respect across the vast Realities.","More than this, Adjudicator Ezekiel and Nefertiti's titles were further elevated as they were the progeny of powerful families within their respective Bloodlines- families filled with Legends that oversaw Grotto Sanctums and much more.","They were existences that had long since exceeded all parameters of power at the Ninth Firmament of Ascendancy that even those at the stage of A Legend's Visage were looked down on when compared to them, as they had long since the qualifications to break past the shackles of the Firmaments of Ascendancy and reach the stage of a LEGEND whenever they wished!","But they did not. They forged their foundations further and were existences who sought to exceed any limitations and restrictions as they built such strong foundations that the moment they broke into the stage of Reality...their power would be propelled upwards so crazily that common Legends would be like children to them.","This was how high the status of the leaders of Primordial Adjudicator Legions was! So high that if they came across actual Legends...these beings actually acknowledged them with respect as they knew it was merely a choice for them to achieve the same stage!","Genevieve had not yet reached such a stage before, but her solidified crown and current realm meant she would ruse to this when she was recognized after her return to her Bloodline.","So this existence beside her...","How could he be surrounded by such prestigious personages and look utterly calm and even show curiosity?","This was the thought that the perceptive Adjudicator Ezekiel had as when any beings looked at the figure of Noah, their wills felt the aura of an existence at the Ninth Firmament of Ascendancy stemming from him!","Of course, this was only what others saw as this was a <Character Selection> done by Noah- with the identity of Alexander following Genevieve being taken to the Ninth Firmament of Ascendancy while also being a genius Enlightened Peerless Alchemist.","A single set of eyes were on him as this Destined meeting continued.","The new entrant was a white haired young woman that had a figure and face sculpted so well that one would only wish goodness towards her. What was most shocking was the fact that she was the third existence to now appear here who had her own solidified crown, the other two only being Genevieve and Adjudicator Ezekiel!","She was known as Adjudicator Katelyn!","This being led her own Legion of Primordial Adjudicators as she only looked at Genevieve and her party briefly before locking her gaze on her sister and Ezekiel.","\"You've come back into the Domains of Pure-Blooded Cardinal Royal Humans, does that mean...\"","\"I am merely passing here to finish eradicating any more Primordial Beasts as my duty ordained me...and to affirm with my own eyes if the weak willed girl had actually attained a solidified crown!\"","...!","Nefertiti replied coldly as the shoulders of Katelyn slumped ever so slightly.","\"I see.\"","Immense heartache and disappointment seemed to be hidden within her two words as she stayed silent briefly before she went on gaze at the figure of her sister closely.","\"Then you should have seen everything...and should now be on your way.\"","WAA!","Words that should have been cold, but one could see the glazed eyes filled with illusory Realities were filled with emotion as when Nefertiti saw it, her multicolored eyes seemed to get even angrier!","\"Until now...you still cannot keep your emotions in check. Still naive!\"","...!","\"Let's go!\" She reached out to hold on to the hand of Adjudicator Ezekiel as her eyes sent her a message, the calmly laid back existence that even Legends would show respect to nodding as a surging spatial light went on to cover their Legion...and they very quickly disappeared from everyone's eyes.","\"...\"","Silence reigned in the surroundings as the glazed eyes of Adjudicator Katelyn fluctuated with emotion before she gazed towards Empress Genevieve and spoke as if what just happened had not occurred.","\"Sis Genevieve, you seem to have lost your Guards and even arrived at a higher stage. Let's head back...some of our brothers and sisters have actually perished in the past days.\"","...!","The repercussions of the actions of Primordial Beasts began to show themselves at this moment as Genevieve and Noah arrived in the Pure Blooded Domains and were received by a powerful party of Royal Human Primordial Adjudicators, but not before they had met a party of a Pure-Blooded Cardinal Royal Dragon Phoenix Primordial Adjudicators who actually had a sub commander that was a Royal Human!","A small meeting that might have been considered insignificant right now, but countless Grotto Sanctums would bleed from the weaving of Destiny around these beings and those they would entangle with when the Age of Emperors reached full bloom.","—","Far away from the Pure Blooded Domains, within the Infinite Reality.","Noah's main body could be seen floating in the space of the Novus Universe within the depths of the Infinite Reality, his figure alone being a feast for the eyes as one could see his whole body covered head to toe with dazzling cerulean blue Runic Kainos Mana Lines of Ascendancy, his body even further being surrounded by multiple Runic Ecritures passively rotating around him as they read <MANA>!","This was, of course, the mere visage of the completed Limit Breaking Extreme Mana Physique that was carried to completion- one of the many wondrous changes in the past two days that caused the Noah of then and now to be akin to two different people.","His gaze was stellar and profound as his eyes seemed like they had seen millions of years of history- an extremely contrasting look when looking at his actual age that was still edging towards 27!","He was staring at a party of his people before his eyes as atop the Serendipity of the Cataclysmic Reality, Little Henry could be seen having grown up at a fantastical rate in the past few days- where from a tiny chubby baby, he now looked like he was one or two years old as his chest showed an illusory sight of 10 Billion Royal Cosmos!","Bouncing on the head of Little Henry was a certain Universal Emperor Slime that showed a similar Realm of power- with the maximum 10 Billion Cosmos allowed at the Seventh Firmament of Ascendancy displayed as such a stage was actually portrayed by all the clones of beings Noah was sending off on the Serendipity of the Cataclysmic Reality Vessel.","Tiamat, the Obsidian Panther, the Leviathan...all of Noah's Animus Summons had made their return to power as in the past days, Noah had the completed Nomological Edict of the <Imperious Animus Emperor> elevated to Quasi-TABOO and was able to elevate the stages of these beings easily with Shards of a Seed of Reality, this being at an even faster rate of mere minutes compared to Kazuhiko, Barbatos, and all the other generals that took a few hours to absorb their Shards of a Seed of Reality to obtain their 10 Billion Cosmos!","Each of them ridiculously stood at the Seventh Firmament of Ascendancy as they were about to set off to seek their own destiny in the chaotic Infinite Realities, but before they did so...Noah wanted to show them something.","\"You will decide for yourself how much you want to build your foundation before breaking through, and we will have Natalya show us the process of breaking one's shackles and forming Reality Passages today.\"","WAA!","Something as grand and glorious as breaking apart one's shackles was being used as a teachable moment, many beings in the surroundings who weren't on the Serendipity of the Cataclysmic Reality also watching closely as Adelaide and others who didn't care to explore outside watched on with interest!","The newly joined Overseer Natalya Rostova had eaten up the Limit Breaking Tools Noah had given her these past two days as she was ready to be the first existence to break past their shackles and form Destiny Reality Passages from the Azure Emperor's Runic Ecriture of Modus Operandi!","\"RUINATION...\"","Noah's mesmerizing voice rang out as he looked to his side where one could see the figure of a unique Relic.","Her humanoid form had entirely changed as she was currently adorned in a crimson gold robe that flashed dangerously with a Runic Ecriture reading <RUINATION> behind it, the aura of a Relic she released having long since exceeded Sui Generis Enlightened and gone straight to a Quasi-TABOO Relic after the upgrades in the past days as her capabilities had entirely changed!","\"...set up a Mirror Reality to contain everything.\"","She received Noah's command as she moved her dazzling fingers, reality itself Breaking into countless mirror like shards as a shocking show was about to start in the Infinite Reality!"]},{"number":1665,"title":"Chapter 1665: Chapter 1664 A Meeting and Progress! lll","paragraphs":["Chapter 1664 A Meeting and Progress! lll","The Infinite Reality under Noah was extremely vast, yet the figure of RUINATION adorned in a bright crimson gold cloak with the Runic Ecriture of RUINATION written behind it merely tapped her fingers as in the next moment, the Boundary of this vast Reality became covered by mirror like layers of shattered space as aside from being veiled...the whole Reality was entirely shifted into a special pocket of the Mirror Dimension!","This was just one of the enhancements that had occurred under RUINATION's advancement to QUASI-TABOO, where her control of the Mirror Dimension even exceeded Noah's own control that he had begun to play with through the abilities gained from the Assimilation of the Olden Emperor of Speculum that stemmed from the Dimensional Archaic Devil Bird who could manipulate the Mirror Dimension.","HOOONG!","An air of power was released frightfully from RUINATION after such a move as everything settled, Noah's stellar eyes coming to focus on Natalya along with everyone else as he spoke.","\"Go ahead.\"","He seemed to hold ultimate confidence as while being in the middle of everyone's gazes, Natalya breathed out while nodding- the method of revolution of her Cosmos as written in the Azure Treasure Emperor's Runic Ecriture of Modus Operandi flashing before her mind as her origin surged and began to move.","...!","Halcyon, Athena, and many other distinguished existences nearby watched with rapt eyes as Natalya went on to close hers.","OOOOM!","She felt the stellar bodies within her that sought for direction.","She felt her origin that wanted to know how to move to mimic a genuine Reality!","Normally, the Origins of many existences would be sluggish and not move at all as their foundation wasn't the best, but Natalya had exceeded the number of her Maximum Reserves of the Essence of Reality and even greatly elevated the strength of her soul to be above any average Seventh Firmament.","For her, it was only a few seconds of a delay before her origin began to move.","BZZZT!","Arcs of profound light instantly began to form around her as it seemed swirls of black holes bloomed, absorbing light and mass itself around them as her figure remained stable!","Noah watched the process with sharpness as bountiful information was being discerned by him as well- the scene of the Illusory black holes being seen closely as next, they began to spin and form quasars as after that, they became swirling Galaxies!","5...8...12...18!","18 swirling illusory Galaxies appeared around Natalya as they even ate up the surrounding space, these Galaxies tinged with a golden hue as next up...they began to fracture and expand into countless Galaxies.","HOOOONG!","Essence and destiny raged madly.","From the surroundings, a nearby sea with the Golden Essence of Destiny surged forward and went to fill the now 18 illusory clusters of Galaxies, but it still wasn't enough!","\"Reality Passages...\"","Noah began to speak as his hands moved, vibrant golden Essence of destiny and fortune erupting from him endlessly as he actually aided in the formation of the Destiny Reality Passages before him- this move even being something that would greatly benefit Natalya as it was the destiny Essence of the Unnamed Kainos Emperor that went on to help her, this being something that would make her future even more splendrous!","\"Are something that one can forge whenever they break their first shackles imposed upon them. Three is enough to consider you a genius who has a fairly good chance to become a Legend as 5 means you are a monstrous being who can easily become a Legend in time!\"","WAA!","\"Yet the first being in our Reality...shall form 18 Reality Passages when she breaks her shackles.\"","BOOM!","The 18 clusters of Galaxies shattered into profound golden light that began to spin and erect outwards from Natalya's body after receiving such robust Essence of destiny, forming sharp swirling edges that seemed connected to Natalya by a thin line as they expanded outward to form dazzling illusory mountain like Passages of a Reality!","From black hole to Quasar, to Galaxy, and then Galactic Filaments, they then formed into Reality Passages that connected to Natalya and began swirling to suck Essence from the surrounding reality itself!","All of this essence...surged towards the single being who had broken her shackles as her origin was already rotating a certain way.","And as it rotated, Essence of all types began to gush out of her 18 newly formed Reality Passages that all surged into her body, making her skin glisten like an ancient spiritual existence! This bountiful Essence sunk into her muscles and bones as they were being reformed in real time, being turned into crystalline Treasure like objects as Cosmos began to bloom in her Origin by millions, very quickly breaking past the limitation of 10 Billion and beginning to edge upwards!","\"If your foundation is profound enough and you have a similar number of Reality Passages when you reach the stage of a Legend...very few of such beings could stand before you.\"","WAA!","Noah's body pulsed with the countless Runic Kainos Mana Lines of Ascendancy as multiple Runic Ecritures that read ancient words of <MANA> rotated around him majestically, the TABOO Relic <LETHE> still wrapped over his back as it made him look like a taboo Emperor that should not be seen by the eyes of others.","He watched the successful formation of 18 Destiny Reality Passages as he learned more from it than even his Vassals that watched it, many possibilities blooming in his mind as he watched how the Passages formed from beginning to end!","They constantly gushed out multicolored waves of essence that ceaselessly sunk into Natalya who finally opened her eyes at this moment, Pearls of light released from them as her Ascendancy Value was crazily climbing up above 100 Million.","\"I succeeded...\"","OOOM!","Rainbow colored light of pure essence gushed from her mouth as she spoke, her body barely being able to contain and refine the rushing waves of essence surging out from the mountain like Destiny Reality Passages as Noah and the other smiled when they saw that in the corner of her eyes...tears had begun to fall.","\"With this...it is possible! With this, that Legend...!\"","As she felt the boundless waves of essence, she couldn't help but choke with multicolored tears in front of everyone as she remembered how her own father had been butchered by another Legend before her eyes! That Primordial Legend had die. And she would...","\"I will..!\"","\"We will.\"","HOOONG!","Noah's voice boomed out as everyone stared at the dazzling 18 Destiny Reality Passages around Natalya, the eyes of this being falling onto Noah as she experienced immense gratitude in her tears.","\"We will pay back any of those that have wronged our people. You will not be alone in this. If a Legend has to have their Reality shattered, then so be it!\"","RUMBLE!","\"If multiple Legends need to perish, they dually perish! If entire Grotto Sanctums have to tremble and cry...they shall do so.\"","The will of the Unnamed Kainos Emperor raged out with even more fervor as it seemed to have grown wilder than two days ago, the wills and souls of all beings in the surroundings who were watching everything feeling a sense of wildness and exhilaration as they bellowed out with destiny raging around them!","OOOOOH!"]},{"number":1666,"title":"Chapter 1666: Chapter 1665 A Meeting and Progress! V","paragraphs":["Chapter 1665 A Meeting and Progress! V","Seas of destiny raged as many existences saw the breaking of shackles, Natalya Rostova alone and a single other being seeing the boosts of Reality Passages being quantified in real time by the Infinite Reality as even Noah raised his brows at the capability of the Destiny Reality Passages!","It made him all the more expectant when he forged his own Modus Operandi to break his shackles and observe just what ridiculous scenes he would cause.","\"Exceed the limits of your souls, bodies, Edicts...exceed all the limitations imposed on others as this is the only way to gain true power. With the chaos stretching out across Realities, countless opportunities await as you all have the chance to go out and seek them!\"","WAA!","There were too many Realities.","Too many Bloodlines and Domains!","Noah could not cover them all as now, it was time for his forces where a single one had power exceeding any common Seventh Firmament Overseer to head out and seek their own fortune.","\"We won't let you down, father!\"","OOM!","The vibrant voice of Little Henry traveled out as after witnessing the formation of the Destiny Reality Passages, the hunger for greatness only grew as every part of his soul sought to see what was out there.","Noah let out a light smile as he nodded and waved his hands.","\"Finish the preparations and set off...I myself will have to slumber into an Infinite Dream soon...\"","His words seemed ancient and Archaic as he spoke, the many existences around him nearly being lost in them before they awoke from their stupor and moved to do their own tasks!","Meanwhile, Noah himself reflected on the astounding changes he had gone through in the past 2 days.","First were the astounding changes after actually reaching the limit of Runic Dao Lines on his body with nearly every part of his stellar skin becoming etched with Runic tattoos, and then the elevation of these Dao Lines with Runic Kainos Lines of Ascendancy that after the Limit Breaking Extreme Mana Refinement...they all further elevated into Runic Kainos Mana Lines of Ascendancy!","They pulsed and coiled over his body like countless ancient snakes as his stellar Cosmic form could only distinctly be made out amidst the brilliantly shining cerulean blue lines if he didn't dim them just a little. Their power was so unique and potent that when the 100 rounds of refinement finished, Runic Ecritures reading <MANA> began to naturally rotate around Noah as each one actually granted Resource Regeneration that included Essence of Reality!","The quantification of the boons was much more wondrous to visualize.","<Runic Kainos Mana Lines of Ascendancy>:: Runic Lines that stem from the extreme refinement of the body, origin, and soul with mana and the Essence of Reality. The Runic Kainos Mana Lines of Ascendancy complement and add on to all the sources of strength culminating within your Body, Origin, and Soul- allowing for all of them to surround your body with passive strengthening and defense. The Runic Kainos Mana Lines of Ascendancy are even more unique as they cut the required resources of all cast abilities by half, with this including the resource of Essence of Reality. Your body has experienced extreme refinement with the Essence of Reality and Mana your affinity to the Natural Laws of Reality is increased by 25%. Conceptual Runic Ecritures begin to naturally form around you as the surging Runic Kainos Mana Lines of Ascendancy further grant a daily passive regeneration of 50,000 Units of Essence of Reality, and they effectively double the regeneration of the Essence of Destiny and Fortune. Current Runic Kainos Mana Lines of Ascendancy- 100. Current True Reality Value Boost(Defensive & Damage)- 100","Their usage was stupendous as apart from causing his body to seem like an ancient being made entirely out of energy, they came with many unique perks.","The reduction of the required resource was now much more prominent from one fourth to half...where ridiculous abilities like <Oblivion> that cost Noah 100,000 Units of the Essence of Reality would actually be cut in half due to the vibrant Runic Kainos Mana Lines of Ascendancy!","Furthermore, there was the ridiculous daily passive regeneration as the most astounding thing of all....was the 100 True Reality Damage and Defense Values boost that was akin to the boosts of a TABOO Relic!","It was even more dreadful with the Runic Kainos Mana Lines of Ascendancy as they didn't require huge units of the Essence of Reality to activate and simply granted a 100 base boost to Damage and Defense...making Noah's offensive output an even more horrific concept.","This was just a single one of the many astounding changes that had occurred in the past days, with the strengthening of his soul and the number of Concepts he squeezed into himself being something dreadful to even imagine!","—","Across the vast expanse of the Boundary Between Realities.","The Legion of Primordial Adjudicators led by Ezekiel tore across space as swirling essence wrapped around their group, heading towards another destination quietly as their dreadful power was kept in like a sleeping beast.","Adjudicator Ezekiel and Adjudicator Nefertiti were at the very forefront as a hazy golden barrier of light wrapped around them to isolate them from everyone else, Ezekiel looking ahead with his abyssal stellar eyes as he spoke while thinking of many things.","\"You never told me why you dislike your sister so much.\"","His voice carried immense authority as someone like him who even common Legends showed respect towards wouldn't bother talking to existences he didn't look at in high regard, with there obviously being some form of connection between these two beings!","Nefertiti's eyes also gazed afar at the swirling space around them as her dark skin shone, her eyes thinking back to many years ago as she spoke lightly.","\"My father took a concubine from a unique Dimension as she was the ultimate result, being born with an Innate Physique and Bloodlines so profound that even powerful LEGENDS envied her.\"","...!","As she spoke, the memories she dredged up seemed to make her angry as she continued to speak with frustration.","\"We were inseparable while growing up...but an incident occurred that made me realize just how naive and weak willed she was. Given the chance to obtain something that even Grotto Sanctum Masters would fight for, she...she actually turned it down while using me as the reason for it!\"","WAA!","Flames of anger and pain rose in the eyes of Nefertiti as the hazy golden veil around them became even thicker, the nearby Ninth Firmament existences not being able to see anything between Ezekiel and Nefertiti as she continued.","\"I didn't want to leave you...these were the words that naive girl who could have had entire swathes of Grotto Sanctums under her feet by now said to me. She really ignored her destiny for...for what?\"","Her words finished quietly as Adjudicator Ezekiel silently listened.","Waves of destiny surged up and down around them as silence reigned until the archaic voice of the Dragon Phoenix Ezekiel echoed out.","\"The time is coming for me, you, your sister...all of those who have been building their ultimate foundation and accumulating destiny until now. The time for us to explode with fortune and exceed any of the established Legends as we contend for supremacy. The strings of destiny of the Age of Emperors will pull everyone in whether they like it or not...\"","WAAA!","\"When the dust settles...you might never see that naive girl you loved so much in the past.\"","BOOM!","Arcs of light exploded from Nefertiti as she came to angrily gaze at Ezekiel due to his words, but his gaze was focused as he only stared ahead, rivers of illusory Realities flashing in his eyes as he was one of the few riding the rough waves of destiny to hegemony!"]},{"number":1667,"title":"Chapter 1667: Chapter 1666 The Pure Blooded Domains! l","paragraphs":["Chapter 1666 The Pure Blooded Domains! l","The Iridescent Reality surged forward silently as dozens of Ninth Firmament Royal Humans surrounded it.","The figure of Adjudicator Katelyn floated down towards Empress Genevieve as her dazzling white hair left behind wisps of Flames, her stellar eyes shining with clashing illusory Realities as she seemed entirely ethereal!","She seemed like an upcoming queen in her late twenties as her gaze alone carried shocking power, yet it seemed full of calmness and mercy as she finally took the time to gaze at everything after coming out of her thoughts about Adjudicator Nefertiti.","Her eyes glanced over to Beatrix who bowed down with respect and then towards the unknown figure of a man with a devilish charm who currently had a human form glittering dark hair...this being actually nonchalantly finishing the cooking of an enou4mlus thigh of a Primordial Beasts!","\"...\"","Adjudicator Katelyn blinked her eyes to make sure she was seeing right as Empress Genevieve saw this scene and snorted while voicing out.","\"Don't take heed of that arrogant guy. He is just an Enlightened Peerless Alchemist who can forge Limit Breaking Tools that I brought back from my journey- Alexander King!\"","...!","The brows of Katelyn raised slightly at this as she nodded, Noah's eyes and hers locking briefly as she gave a nod of acknowledgment that Noah returned in kind.","Thereafter, Adjudicator Katelyn simply turned towards Genevieve as she didn't even stay on the subject of Noah and instead spoke of other events.","\"Three Future Candidate Rulers in line to become Bloodline Masters perished...this list including Jordan, Aegon, and Brightspark.\"","Genevieve didn't show an ounce of her coldness and callousness as Katelyn spoke. In the domains of the Pure-Blooded Cardinal Royal Humans, she was an Empress that was now one of the few Candidate Rulers of this bloodline...and she had to act like it!","But she still replied with words of wisdom as she heard half of her competitors had died.","\"Their destinies simply were not meant to witness the coming era.\"","Katelyn turned to look closely at Genevieve after these words as she only nodded a while later, their surroundings beginning to brighten up at this moment as the authority of the Pure Blooded Domains they were entering began to show!","Near the large grill, Noah's hands moved as the meat was cut up into glistening pieces that floated towards his mouth, his eyes bright as he felt his Iridescent Reality pass through a form of a field!","'The Pure Blooded Boundary...'","A Boundary instituted by the terrifying existences of the Pure-Blooded Cardinal Royal Bloodlines as this Expansive illusory boundary stretched to cover the expanse of the lands they controlled.","When one passed it, they would truly enter the lands of the most pristine beings that ruled over the past eons.","BZZZT!","Past the barrier, the space of the Boundary Between Realities continued as now, the dazzling sight of anchored vessels and stations could be seen stretching out for countless light years as space didn't seem barren and filled with rivers of Reality anymore!","It seemed full of life and power as powerful auras of existences could be felt in the myriad of vessels floating silently, and even more hardened soldiers were in unique circular towers like stations when they merely gazed out towards the Pure Blooded Boundary.","\"Security is tighter due to the disruptions from Primordial Beasts, with the Legions of Primordial Adjudicators and Will Bearers sent out having pushed back their strongest forces so far.\"","Adjudicator Katelyn spoke as the Quasi-TABOO Vessel floated in, the scene within being one of wonder as past all the clusters of vessels and stellar circular space stations, one could see nearly lined shimmering Rivers of Reality flowing upright and endlessly stretching out in the distance.","This was unique as it wasn't how Realities normally were positioned, meaning a powerful existence had dragged genuine Realities and neatly arranged them near each other as if they were trees, Noah being able to see thousands of such endless rivers of Reality pulsing all around him!","He wasn't surprised by the shocking scenes he was seeing as they were in the memories of Pure-Blooded Cardinal Royal Humans who had already lived here for millions of years, much of the places here Noah already knowing the names of as at this moment...they were heading towards the first multicolored cluster of many Realities that had a specialized domain at the very center that was enacted by none other than a LEGEND!","Hundreds of Realities surrounded his one location as one could see surging circular golden light wrapping around it, this domain mimicking a Grotto Sanctum even though it was nowhere close to it.","'The White Outer Peninsula, was it?'","The outermost area where the authority of the Pure-Blooded Cardinal Royal Humans congregated. There were many other Peninsulas surrounded by clusters of Realities that were domains LEGENDS had enacted further in, but most of those entering the Pure Blooded Domains would first arrive into an Outer Peninsula as they could teleport to any other locations in the Pure Blooded Domains from there...so long as they had the proper authority!","\"I escorted you here because things are rapidly changing due to the starting war.\"","As they floated forward serenely, the voice of the dazzling Adjudicator Katelyn continued to ring out.","\"This also caused the tides of destiny to shift as the name of the one to become the Bloodline Master in the future has to be confirmed soon...with the Elders proposing sending you, George, Namur, and Rosanne into the Grotto Sanctum that will be used at the field where Commanders of Primordial Adjudicators and Will Bearers will seek their last glimpses of destiny before they become LEGENDS!\"","WAA!","She finally mentioned something of great substance as even Noah's eyes perked up at that and listened closely!","\"Oh? Have they already chosen the Grotto Sanctum they will allow the commanders to enter? Is it already explored or...\"","\"It is an unexplored Sanctum that was found by Legends of the Reality Ursidae, Infinite Willow Trees, and our Bloodline.\" Adjudicator Katelyn replied calmly as her dazzling eyes gazed forward.","\"So the opportunities within are boundless as nearly all existences at the stage of A Legend's Visage and above who can obtain a spot for this are planning to go.\"","\"Oh?\" Genevieve's eyes raised at Katelyn's words as she poked back with her own devilish words.","\"Does this mean that even you will be going in?\"","BZZZT!","Waves of destiny silently weaved as the Iridescent Reality vessel came to a stop.","Noah could not take it any further as they neared the entrance into the White Outer Peninsula, the figure of Adjudicator Katelyn not even turning back towards Genevieve as she replied to her question while gazing into the unknown- bright emotions rising in her glazed eyes as her fair hands moved to touch the solidified crown above her head!","\"I did not want to set that destiny for myself...but it seems I have to make a move this time around in order to make a certain person understand.\"","WAA!","\"In the unexplored Sanctum filled with enough destiny to birth the next generation of Kainos Emperors...even I shall delve into it!\"","...!","A deeply hidden aura bloomed out at her words as even the calm gaze of the Unnamed Kainos Emperor behind her tightened, but this was nothing compared to how much his destiny was currently raging about when the unexplored Grotto Sanctum that Commanders of Primordial Adjudicators and Will Bears would be entering was mentioned!"]},{"number":1668,"title":"Chapter 1668: Chapter 1667 The Pure Blooded Domains! ll","paragraphs":["Chapter 1667 The Pure Blooded Domains! ll","Due to the war, a Destined event that the Pure-Blooded Cardinal Royal Bloodlines undertook was brought to the forefront as those who had been accumulating fortune so far and building their foundation could finally take this chance to seek something that would make their advancement even more profound.","Noah's destiny spun wildly as he heard about this, pulling upon the memories of his defeated enemies as this instance became clear.","The last time such a thing had occurred was hundreds of millions of years ago as if the chance was rising again now, Noah had to obtain entrance into such a mesmerizing location!","He was already seeking entrance into a great deal of things as while his True Sanguine Clone with the Character Selection of a Ninth Firmament Enlightened Peerless Alchemist entering into the Pure Blooded Domains, his main body was about to enter into an Infinite Dream.","And it wasn't just for the purposes of his portions of souls seeking Realities...but he was also seeking conscious entrance into the Dream Dimension!","This was because he had to obtain certain materials in order to forge the Blueprints of TABOO Relics, and some of them could only be attained in the Dream Dimension and even the Mirror Dimension.","The Dream Dimension would be the hardest one to navigate as Noah...actually wasn't all too worried about the Mirror Dimension! This was all due to the Bloodlines of the Olden Emperors he had assimilated into the Unnamed Kainos Emperor Bloodlines, with the Dimensional Archaic Devil Bird holding the Olden Bloodline of Speculum granting a particularly unique ability that was seamlessly added onto his Kainos Bloodline!","Speculum was another word for mirror, and this Olden Bloodline had granted Noah the stupendous ability that the Dimensional Archaic Devil Bird had displayed before that was termed Mirror Manipulation!","<Mirror Manipulation>:: An innate ability of an Olden Bloodline that was influenced by the ravages of the Mirror Dimension. The boundaries between dimensions can be breached as you gain the capability to withstand the Mirror Essence within the Mirror Dimension and traverse through it. A small amount of control of the Mirror Essence can also be utilized by you to call forth the walls of the Mirror Dimension to surround your enemies. Every activation of this ability required 30,000 Units of the Essence of Reality and grants a 24-hour authority to utilize the Mirror Essence of the Mirror Dimension.","The assimilation of the three Olden Bloodlines brought a few new features onto the Unnamed Kainos Emperor Bloodline, but this particular skill was the biggest gain as it allowed Noah access into the Mirror Dimension apart from the ability of RUINATION!","After she was elevated to Quasi-TABOO, RUINATION had also attained similar means to peer into the Mirror Dimension, but Noah would not have gained the authority to utilize Mirror Essence himself unless he had the ability of <Mirror Manipulation>.","Many cards were in place as at this moment, Noah's main body returned to the Cosmic Holy Land while the Serendipity of Cataclysmic Reality set off with his son and many other powerful Vassals.","His figure was utterly mesmerizing as he went on to sit on his golden throne, his stellar LETHE draping over everything in the back with the glimmer of illusory realities as akin to an ancient king pondering upon the mysteries of reality itself, Noah thought back to his other points of advancements.","His soul.","OOOM!","The mere mention of it caused his surroundings to tremble at the sheer pressure as after the passage of two days, the strength of his soul had come to exceed any parameters as even those at the stage of A Legend's Visage could not be comparable to him!","He had burned so many Minor, Greater, Quasi-INSUPERABLE, and even a few hundred weak INSUPERABLENomological Edicts with the authority of the Throne of Arcadian Tyranny that this single action had already crazily stretched the strength of his soul. When he then devoured the many Soul Crystals that he Quintuplicated with RUINATION, the current terrifying result was achieved.","And that's right...he could utilize Quintuplicate with RUINATION after her elevation instead of Quadruplicate as this was another reason for his ridiculous rise in Soul Power and many other things. The description of this feature had to be looked at closely as it had more than just the feature of multiplying loot by five times at this moment.","<Quintuplicate> ::...This feature of RUINATION has been elevated even further as previously unreplicable items can now be utilized so long as they have a single aspect that RUINATION could not multiply before.","WAA!","Items that previously could not be multiplied.","One of these items...was the Olden Orb of Transmogrification!","After her elevation, the 1400 Olden Orbs that came from Resplendent Treasure Caches and could produce Quasi-TABOO Edicts became 7,000.","\"...\"","7,000!","A number that guaranteed a ridiculous assortment of only Quasi-TABOO Edicts would be enjoyed by Noah's hands as they were also the reason why at this moment, Noah's soul had 1,200 Quasi-TABOO Nomological Edicts branded to his soul.","From the measly restrictions where his soul couldn't even handle a few Quasi-TABOO Edicts, it had now grown to the ridiculous levels that allowed it to seamlessly withstand 1,200 of such concepts!","600 had their flames utilized under his own 10 Black Tier Ascendancy Halos, and another 600 had their flames of authority fused into the 10 Malleable Ascendancy Halos that were provided by LETHE.","With this, the number of Flames of Edicts he had making up his Ascendancy Halos entire exceeded any limits that even the most talented Ninth Firmament existences could achieve!","'And this..is just the beginning!\"","HOOOONG!","His will surged out madly as his soul began to pulsate, Noah pulling upon the Primordial Epitaph of his System as he prepared to expand his will even further.","\"Begin the Second Infinite Dream...and this time, there shall not be a mere 100 portions of souls stretching out.\"","WAAA!","His body was situated upon his throne as his eyes released a hazy luminous light, the essence of Reality blooming around him as Infinite Dream was called upon!","From Noah's soul, hundreds of twinkling lights began to shine as his domineering will swept out.","\"1,000 portions of souls...stretch out into the unknown!\"","...!"]},{"number":1669,"title":"Chapter 1669: Chapter 1668 lnto the Dream Dimension! l","paragraphs":["Chapter 1668 lnto the Dream Dimension! l","Pulsing waves of cerulean light emanated from Noah's figure as his Runic Kainos Mana Lines of Ascendancy danced in vibrant waves, his will surging out as 1,000 twinkling specks of light moved from his body and began floating out!","They disappeared silently into the surrounding space as they didn't just drill through its fold, but they flashed with a regal authority of Infinite Dream as they crossed into a pristine new Dimension.","Melded with the very space around them and yet at the same time entirely separate, the walls of the Dream Dimension were breached as Noah's soul released 1,000 portions of itself seamlessly!","For an existence to take a significant portion of their soul, and then spread it into 1,000 parts...this was an extremely arduous task that very few could handle. Dividing 1,000 portions meant 1,000 differently thinking souls with each of them seeking their own purpose. Even with Noah's ridiculously strong soul, this might not have been possible even now. But what did make it a possibility was the fact that Noah had utilized the Dream Stones that he had obtained from the Resplendent Treasure Caches.","The Dream Stones that allowed one to dream for a million years with a single use!","When Noah had used a single one of his dazzling stones, his consciousness was taken from his main body as he slumbered and experienced a shocking dream every single time.","He rose from humble beginnings having absolutely nothing, and yet by the end of the dream...he was always battling for supremacy!","In very few dreams did he live a simple life.","One of them a farmer. Another merely a king. A human, an elf, a dragon...any of the myriad of races had been lived by him!","Every single dream stone took a few hours to experience while it granted the soul one million years of experience. One million years of refining and fortification! And he couldn't consciously control any of these dreams as while in them, he truly felt like that was his genuine life as he didn't recall yesterday he was Noah during the dreams.","Every single day of these years felt entirely real as after Noah spent his time in the cosmic holy land and utilized over 50 dream stones, he had come out as a new man with his eyes shining their brilliant visage an existence that had seen too much.","It only took him a microsecond to reflect on the many dreams he had lived and on the many lives he had led as he came back to his singular real life with ease.","After the 50th Dream Stone, he stopped solely because his destiny told him to, the uses of these stones being more than how he utilized them in the beginning as they were still something he could do that would grant him even more boundless benefits with the remaining half of the stones.","But through them, his soul gained a sense of stability and strength that very few could achieve as even the existences that had already lived for hundreds of millions of years...all of these weren't spent just thinking and tempering their souls. So the portions of Noah's souls that set off right now...each one was filled with purpose as they were carried with the essence of the Dream Dimension along with the silent waves of destiny leading the way!","999 souls were carried silently to look for Prime Realities. Emerging Realities, and other unique realities that lay out there. But...there was a singular portion of a soul remaining that did not take the same route.","It was larger than all the others and while wrapped by the essence of the Infinite Dream, it dug deeper into the veil of the Dream Dimension as it did not seek other realities!","It instead sought to enter the depths of this unknown dimension.","HOOONG!","The Unnamed Kainos Emperor entered a deep slumber as he focused a major part of his will and power into this singular portion of soul, with him actually traversing across the veils of the Dream Dimension!","He felt as if he was stuck in a quagmire, his soul floating slowly as if countless chains were pulling on him.","Yet he continued relentlessly.","He felt close to piercing an unknown barrier- a layer of a bubble that he was ready to burst and pierce through as the moment he did so...he would be allowed into a new land of wondrous opportunities and untold dangers!","BOOM!","At this critical moment, his will surged out with intensity, smashing apart whatever restrictions that were suddenly placed to prevent him to forge forward.","This portion of his soul passed through one veiled barrier as it seamlessly entered into a brand new space!","\"...\"","Austere silence prevailed.","It might have taken him long to wake up in the past and have his portion of soul to observe his surroundings, but with his overly strong soul and fortified will- only a mere instant passed before the will contained within the soul woke up with fervor and began to look around.","The very air and surroundings felt different.","Every area around him was hazy and filled with gray sparkling misty light.","This misty light made it hard to move even a single step as one could feel themselves bound and shackled by an unknown force!","You couldn't see what lay in front of you nor could you see what lay behind you, and the more that you tried to struggle against this force, the heavier and more constricting the force became.","Against such a force, the answer was not aggressiveness and exploding out power.","OOOM!","Noah's soul calmed.","He pulled upon the Infinite Dream as his mana and thousands of units of the essence of reality surged into it, pulling upon the surrounding essence of the Dream Dimension to wrap around his soul.","The restrictions began gradually getting looser and looser as he began to move freely across the misty sparkling gray light.","At the same time, the soul fully awakened and formed into a body, bright stellar eyes coming in place as at this moment- the far-reaching sight of The Watcher and The Gazer were activated!"]},{"number":1670,"title":"Chapter 1670: Chapter 1669 Into the Dream Dimension! ll","paragraphs":["Chapter 1669 Into the Dream Dimension! ll","Noah's mission for this portion of his soul was to withstand and not fall from the perils of the Dream Dimension while locating tens of thousands of units of the Golden Sand that could only be found within this dimension.","He didn't know how powerful the existences he would come across would be, nor what other treasures might be waiting for him. But he did know that this soul would not leave until it either perished or came back with glimmering Golden Sand to help him forge yet another TABOO Relic!","He began to wade across the gray misty light and into the unknown as before he could even get too far, his soul began to feel wavelengths of dangerous essence emanating from different directions, this essence carrying with it a resonating voice that seemed to be repeating the same thing over and over again that surged into his mind with purpose!","<Dreams and Realities...what is reality, and what is a dream?>","HOOONG!","With ancientness, this voice felt thick and aged as it came in sequence while Noah floated across the thick gray mist!","<Are the vast Realities themselves not merely an extension of dreams...>","A penetrative will that seemed like an attack onto the soul itself surged towards Noah as if he wasn't able to bypass it and move to explore the Dream Dimension even more, the journey of this Clone would end very soon!","—","One thousand portions of his soul were sent out as this was not the end of Noah's plans. Even as his mesmerizing main body slumbered, there were still five other True Sanguine Clones that currently did not have any major tasks.","Now one by one, they moved to accomplish even more things!","One of the True Sanguine Clones floated in space with the figure of the dazzling RUINATION while adorning the cosmic form- this clone speaking out calmly at this moment.","<Mirror Manipulation>.","BOOOM...CRACK!.","Space shattered and cracked into countless edges of mirror-like shards as Noah looked around him before seamlessly stepping into these shards of mirrors, with his figure beginning to disappear into the unknown!","The figure of RUINATION followed close behind as she stepped in with even more ease, their destination being the wondrous and more than likely just as dangerous Mirror Dimension.","Here, Noah could find the Mirror Essence Crystals that were also required to form a TABOO relic, and this True Sanguine Clone along with RUINATION would take care of this task.","Around the same time, another True Sanguine Clone was wrapped in a spatial light as he actually disappeared from the Infinite Reality and traveled fast distances, crossing the folds of space to finally appear close to the border of the Primordial Royal Wolf Bloodline that he had he had taken the life of one of its princesses!","He had made an enemy of a Bloodline Master of this Primordial Bloodline in the past, where he only knew this existence to be in the Ninth Firmament of Ascendancy then. With his more recent knowledge, he could ascertain that they were more than likely A Legend's Visage or an existence with even more power who was close to becoming a Legend as when he did so...he would more than likely be replaced by another Bloodline Master as no Legend would wish to merely oversee the day to day workings of their Bloodline!","The clone had teleported to his region not just because this being was a target, but because he was the only one among the many targets.","This was because this True Sanguine Clone had the task of farming.","Yes. Farming!","OOOM!","Waves of destiny echoed out as they were pulled upon, a few strings loosened in relation to the veil of his own identity, but only in focus with this particular clone!","And he was loosening it for no other reason than the fact that after he reduced it to a certain level, the concepts of existences overseeing the Primordial Blacklist would be activated as those who sought to hunt him...would be directed towards him.","It was akin to setting bait as he now merely waited for the fish to come to him!","This was a task of this particular clone as, taking our eyes away from this one, we would come upon another True Sanguine Clone that was currently in the depths of the Blacksmith's Forge where at this moment, the glimmer of bountiful Limit Breaking Tools could be seen.","Dazzling elixirs that would even make normal Ninth Firmament existences drool were lying out in mountainous piles as nearby- another True Sanguine Clone could be seen hammering down as the allure of an enlightened Primordial Relic could already be seen forming!","Refining pills and elixirs, and even enlightened Primordial Relics or even Sui Generis Enlightened Primordial Relics generous primordial relics!","WAA!","This was what some clones were taking care of!","And then apart from all of this, the other clone that remained had the task of seamlessly forging even more concepts.","It didn't matter if there were Minor, Greater, or even Insuperable.","Any clone that didn't have a task to do was in charge of coming up with unique concepts that would soon after be corrupted by RUINATION and then elevated to Quasi-TABOO with an Olden Orb of Transmogrification just like all of the 1,200 nomological edicts that Noah currently had swimming within his soul!","And their job also went past this as after studying and comprehending over a thousand Quasi-TABOO Nomological Edicts, Noah also wanted to try naturally forming them.","He better understood what requirements they held and what conditions had to be met for someone to exceed Insuperable and begin coming towards Quasi-TABOO or even TABOO itself!","And of course, the answer lay in the affinity to the natural laws of Reality and how one Influenced these laws themselves as ultimately- the concept of TABOO was one that could ignore and eradicate the natural laws of reality and allowed one to instantly achieve the power of A Legend's Visage!"]},{"number":1671,"title":"Chapter 1671: Chapter 1670 The Bloodline Library! l","paragraphs":["Chapter 1670 The Bloodline Library! l","The myriad of Primordial Adjudicators following them stayed back as the figures of Adjudicator Katelyn and the party of Empress Genevieve entered the White Outer Peninsula.","A mere mimic of a genuine Grotto Sanctum that a LEGEND had enacted- a land that was surrounded by hundreds of Realities as inside of it...boundless splendor could be seen.","Even though one could consider it a small sized False Grotto Sanctum, it was still a Domain that twisted and folded space as the sheer space itself within it was too extensive to wrap your head around!","Vast.","This was one of the renowned features of Grotto Sanctums as a single one could have space within it equivalent to hundreds of Realities.","SHAA!","Passing through the barrier, uniquely established rules wrapped around the bodies of Adjudicator Katelyn, and the Empress- the two of them carrying the highest recognized authority here as the established rules were extended to the other beings in their party...a spatial light wrapping all of them up and sending them to a certain location in the White Outer Peninsula!","If other beings with different authorities entered this false Grotto Sanctum, the established laws would recognize them and also teleport them to the areas that they were granted access to as for the recent entrants...they were instantly teleported to one of the core areas of this False Grotto Sanctum where true Royalty and distinguished Primordial Adjudicators were allowed.","The area inside was mesmerizing as their figures appeared above a Runic magic circle inscribed onto an expansive square like white slab where dozens of other teleportation magic circles could be seen!","Cylindrical golden pillars were situated on the left and right of this square as they shot upwards endlessly into a clear blue sky.","Yes- a sky!","Not endless stellar space filled with Cosmos or universes, but a vast blue sky one couldn't see the ends of as it stretched across all directions.","This was one of the unique features of a Grotto Sanctum- where even a false one was designed to mimic this domain where much of its space was actually covered by paradisiacal land or bodies of water instead of stellar bodies as it was akin to one gargantuan world- a world where occasionally, rivers of Reality could be seen coursing through it as one could enter them to find endless stellar space within.","So Realities themselves would only be mere pockets of space that one could enter within a Grotto Sanctum!","The area that the four new entrants appeared in was extremely infinitesimal compared to the vastness of this space, with the golden cylindrical pillars leading towards a massive rainbow colored tree that shone of illusory Realities- this tree shooting up in an endless manner as on its branches, crystalline glass like castles could be seen.","The auras of countless existences in the Firmaments of Ascendancy could be felt as it was akin to bright twinkling fireflies showing off their light, with hundreds of auras of the Ninth Firmament existences also prevalent as once more...this place was merely a small corner of the White Outer Peninsula that was a false Grotto Sanctum built by a LEGEND!","But this wasn't all.","\"Oh?\"","Genevieve raised her head up as pervasive and all around them, they could feel a calm and oppressive aura that made itself known to all. An aura that far surpassed any others in the Firmaments of Ascendancy as it felt like an unshaken sea constantly pressing down over their wills that they couldn't overcome.","This...was the will of a LEGEND.","Katelyn saw the surprise in the eyes of Genevieve and Beatrix as the former even asked.","\"This aura is...\"","\"Uncle Brightborn happened to be over this time around, you should go pay your greetings after you get settled and meet with the Elders.\"","Katelyn replied with a light smile as she felt the familiarity of one of the false Grotto Sanctums she had spent a lot of her life in, momentarily letting go of the painful thoughts in her memory as her observatory eyes now captured more things.","Things like the fact that Genevieve and Beatrix felt surprise when the aura of a LEGEND pervasiveness crashed onto their souls, and yet the existence they brought...he actually gazed up towards this descending aura as his eyes sparkled with defiance and challenge!","'Who did little Gen bring...for them to be so boisterous as to have such a reaction against the will of a LEGEND?'","This was the thought that crossed through her mind as her eyes refocused on the one introduced as Alexander King.","Her gazed eyes were hiding many things as beneath the multicolored light, there was an illusory light of shattered mirrors within them as this granted Katelyn a unique sight that specifically saw things only someone of her origin could decipher!","Being born of a unique existences in the Mirror Dimension and the Bloodline of a LEGEND, Katelyn had many things that even LEGENDS envied.","One of them was <Mirror Vision>.","An ability that allowed her to see any interferences of the Mirror Dimension and recognize any other existences that had connections or Bloodlines stemming from such a dimension.","She had long ago seen that this Alexander King actually held a thin trace of a Bloodline tracing back to the Mirror Dimension- a trace that even LEGENDS would not be able to find even if they looked with their TABOO Nomological Edicts!","She was only able to gaze upon it due to holding a Lineage from the Mirror Dimension as this was a point that had caused her surprise while wondering why he would hide such a thing- but that was all.","It didn't draw her interest too much as even the fact that he was an Enlightened Peerless Alchemist...didn't make her give him a special treatment as while they were rare, such distinguished beings existed in the Pure Blooded Domains!","Some even tried to form connections with her in the past by bringing their hard forged Elixirs or Relics!","So none of this drew her attention, but his defiant light while under the will of a LEGEND did as from his eyes...Katelyn was able to see boundless confidence.","A light smile couldn't help but appear on her face as she could recall only a single other being that had such an expression when they faced the will of a LEGEND.","'Perhaps someone exceptional hiding themselves?'","Only a passing thought in her mind as she saw lines of attendants in the Seventh and Sixth Firmament of Ascendancy adorned in matching golden attire appear from the Reality Tree ahead of them and come to their sides while bowing.","\"ADJUDICATOR! EMPRESS!\"","OOOM!","Their respectful voices echoed out as for royalty like Genevieve and Katelyn, average Sixth and Seventh Firmament existences with abysmal Destinies being mere servants to them as Katelyn nodded with acknowledgment while turning towards Genevieve.","\"After you freshen up, come to the Peninsula Observatory, that's where Uncle Brightborn is currently at.\"","She had spoken out and was about to move to her own matters when Genevieve's next words stopped her in her tracks.","\"Oh, I have to pay a visit to the Bloodline Library first. Then I'll head to meet Uncle.\"","...!","The Bloodline Library!","A location that could be accessed from any Peninsula across the Pure Blooded Domains where Cardinal Royal Humans controlled- one that contained large amounts of techniques and books that taught of unique ways to manipulate essence to unleash devastating skills...and also the vault that contained other techniques like the Runic Ecritures of Modus Operandi under the Authority of their Bloodline!","Why would Genevieve wish to visit such a place as the first thing after her return?","The starry mirror-like glazed eyes of Katelyn glimmered as a calm smile began to curve within them. She had been swamped with too many thoughts recently that she needed something to take her mind off other matters.","Her interest was piqued, her unique will focusing on Genevieve and the actions of her party!"]},{"number":1672,"title":"Chapter 1672: Chapter 1671 The Bloodline Library! ll","paragraphs":["Chapter 1671 The Bloodline Library! ll","Genevieve had a wild light flashing in her eyes as she ignored the nearby Sixth and Seventh Firmament attendants while flying towards another runic magic circle that would teleport them to another place entirely.","She was a Candidate Ruler that had already perused the Bloodline Library many times and seen all the Runic Ecritures of Modus Operandi within, and her mind buzzed with devilish thoughts as she wanted to see how Alexander would react to her straightforward way of doing things!","Would he slip up in the days to come as even now, the will of a genuine LEGEND was covering everything?","She held a TABOO concept among many other tools as no LEGEND could ever suspect her or turn their gaze towards her direction, and it had been this way since she was born as she had come across too many LEGENDS.","But what about this being who before he had shielded himself, she had seen he had an extremely young soul when they first met?","Would he continue to be exceptional and exceed if the attention of a LEGEND turned towards him? Or even...the attention of a terrifying Adjudicator that even Legends envied?","'Let's keep you busy just for a little bit.'","WAA!","Her wild thoughts surged as her will carried on.","'Let's fatten you up and give you the things that you want while you struggle to keep attention off of you...and the moment that I can unlock those two TABOO concepts...we shall see exactly where your main body lies as after that...!'","Deadly thoughts crossed her mind as she moved.","\"The Bloodline Library? Why head there at this time?\"","The puzzled voice of the drop dead gorgeous Katelyn rang out as Genevieve gave a light smile while pulling Beatrix and Noah onto another Runic Magic Circle that led towards the entrance of their next location as she replied lightly.","\"We are just going to browse. Thank you for escorting us, Sis Katelyn!\"","BZZZT!","Silver spatial light wrapped around them as essence from Genevieve activated another magic circle, their figures disappearing and leaving Katelyn behind with the many lines of bowing attendants and the enormous Reality Tree that spanned for many light years and held a great deal of crystalline castles and skyscrapers.","Katelyn's eyes shone with interest as a second later, her surroundings broke off into mirror like shards as with a flash, she also disappeared!","—","The Bloodline Library of the Pure-Blooded Cardinal Royal Humans!","An area that only those with a unique authority could enter, with the recent teleportation taking Noah and the two powerful women on top of a stellar golden bridge that stretched off into a rising illusory white door that held the inscription of a book.","All around the stellar golden bridge, fantastical glimmering space could be seen as this was one of the unique features of a false Grotto Sanctum. Passing through one teleportation could bring you onto a stellar pocket of space or into an area where you could view the vast endless skies and land of this paradisiacal domain!","The Bloodline Library in particular was actually the name of vast Forsaken Treasure Reality under the banner of Royal Humans, with it being accessed from any Peninsula so long as one had the proper authority.","\"You wanted the Modus Operandi, yes? Let's be forward about it and get it done then.\"","With an expression of coldness, Genevieve went towards the White door as Noah gave a light smile while looking around him, thinking about how long this back and forth relationship with Genevieve would last!","She kept him close as he knew she was a Disaster Remnant who was more than likely plotting something against the Royal Humans, waiting for the perfect time when she unlocked more of her concepts to fully trace everything about him and take care of him as he was a loose end.","It's just that...Noah didn't think such a time would ever come. The chance for this Empress to kill him...he would never give it!","As for Noah himself, he could use these circumstances to obtain the things he wanted as under her authority as a future Ruler- seeing the Runic Ecritures of Modus Operandi was easy enough.","'How different will it be? Will it come with a new Limit Breaking Extreme Physique or...'","His eyes released dazzling lights as their figures were sucked in by the white doorway and they disappeared yet again into a Forsaken Treasure Reality that was purely molded into a Bloodline Library!","SHAA!","The new area they arrived in was a straight hall that was lined up by countless long spanning shelves that stretched on for light years.","Built from the wood of Reality Trees, these shelves held thick books that held golden bindings that could only be opened by those with authority, with the space being so vast and filled with countless lines of shelves that one might get lost if they came here for the first time!","The aura of many Ninth and Eighth Firmament existences could be felt stretched out across this space that contained knowledge of countless eons, with Genevieve taking their party away from the countless shelves and towards a pulsating glowing white Orb of light placed on an elevated pedestal past nearby book shelves.","She reached into this Orb of light as she spoke calmly.","\"Open up access to the Bloodline Ecriture Repository.\"","OOOM!","A thin light flashed that went on to cover Genevieve before...","<Access Granted.>","Beautiful Runic words rose up before their eyes as to their right side, yet another white door of light formed.","Many barriers were required for one to go through, but Genevieve moved without care as wordlessly, she motioned for Noah and Beatrix to go in first while she followed behind last- their figures entering the Bloodline Ecriture Repository where Runic Ecritures of Modus Operandi could be found!","As they disappeared, a mirror-like reflection could barely be discerned not too far from them as veiled within the walls of the Mirror Dimension- an existence was watching the events playing out with an interested smile, her figure also disappearing soon after!"]},{"number":1673,"title":"Chapter 1673: Chapter 1672 OPPENHEIMER! I","paragraphs":["Chapter 1672 OPPENHEIMER! I","Many doorways were passed through as the white door they went through last led into the Bloodline Ecriture Repository!","A unique pocket of space that contained the Runic Ecritures of Modus Operandi that the Pure-Blooded Cardinal Royal Humans collected and made available to its royalty.","OOOM!","They appeared in a new space as they materialized to see 9 glimmering portals and stellar bridges leading towards them!","Their surroundings sparkled with glimmering hazy stellar bodies as this location was an extremely strict one that very few had free access to- only beings with extreme authority like Genevieve having access. Thus, there was currently nobody here now as Genevieve spoke freely.","\"Nine portals, each one leading to a different Runic Ecriture of Modus Operandi. If you are able to actually discern and understand any of them, their knowledge shall be yours to take! Now, go and choose...and make it quick.\"","...!","Astounding words echoed out as Noah's eyes released a marvelous light, surging waves of destiny coursing through them as only he knew just what big of a present was being handed to him!","He didn't think Genevieve knew herself what she was truly giving him access to as the collections of eons of years of history from a Bloodline like the Pure-Blooded Cardinal Royal Humans had born many things- these Runic Ecritures of Modus Operandi merely being one of the many reasons why they had such a deep foundation.","After being granted permission for such a thing, Noah didn't tarry as he took light steps to head towards the first glimmering portal on his right that shone with a green splendor.","SHAA!","With a flash of light, he disappeared and left behind the figures of Genevieve and Beatrix as the former scowled while speaking out coldly.","\"Getting so happy just from the possibility of seeing a few Runic Ecritures of Modus Operandi...he doesn't know that most beings only ever choose to gaze at one or two even if they have access to all!\"","...!","Yes!","The method of revolving one's Reality was unique as it couldn't have any mistakes, and if one observed different methods of revolution and mimicked the method of one Operandi with a different one or even trying to combine aspects of multiple Operandis- they might just find their Reality shattering in failure as they never broke past their shackles.","And if Noah gazed at all nine Runic Ecritures of Modus Operandi?","\"He might just destroy his own will and make it all the more easier for me to find him. And he might not even be capable of opening all of them...\"","A light of sharpness flashed in Genevieve's eyes as off to the side, Beatrix had a thoughtful expression as she truly wondered about her Master's plans!","—","OOOOM!","Austere waves of green light emanated all around Noah as the first portal led him into a space filled with verdant green essence, a shining scroll floating at the center of this space that Noah floated towards with haste.","A verdant scroll that he was now familiar with the shape of- looking somewhat similar to other Runic Ecritures of Modus Operandi that he had come across!","\"Let's see....\"","With a luminous gaze, he floated forward and reached out to touch the shining green scroll leaking ancientness as the moment he came in contact with it...","BZZZT!","Arcs of essence fluttered out as Noah was actually rebuffed back. The source of this content is Freewebnᴏvel.com.","\"Oh?\"","His gaze was questioning as he thought back to the eyes of Genevieve that carried a trace of sharpness, wondering what information this old existence had withheld as to read the Runic Ecritures of Modus Operandi in the Bloodline Ecriture Repository...one had to utilize specific means!","A thin barrier of light existed between Noah and the method of a wondrous Modus Operandi that he likely believed to be high tier, his destiny beginning to surge outwards to see what he had to do to solve it!","\"It's actually very simple.\"","RUMBLE!","A sonorous feminine voice rang out from thin air as Noah's shining eyes didn't show any surging waves, and they instead looked around calmly before they came to lock onto a certain position in space.","A position that instantly broke into countless mirror like shards as the seamless figure of a dazzling Adjudicator came out, her glimmering white hair brightening up the verdant space as her glazed eyes carried immense weight and power!","At such a level of a being actually coming into the picture in such a situation, Noah didn't panic in any way as he pulled his gaze from her to lock back into the shining verdant scroll before him, his voice coming out calmly.","\"Oh? Do you care to share this simple method?\"","...!","His words entirely caught Adjudicator Katelyn off guard as she had expected a much different reaction to this being who had been inappropriately allowed into a location that he should not be in by Genevieve!","Seeing his nonchalant demeanor, a light smile came to paint her lips as she nodded while floating forward.","\"All of the Runic Ecritures of Modus Operandi in the Bloodline Ecriture Repository have two methods for one to be capable of discerning the knowledge within them. I can tell you both...if you honestly answer me why Little Gen allowed you in here.\"","WAA!","Her body palpated with a shocking power as everywhere she floated, space fractured into glimmering mirrors like shards as she came to float opposite to Noah and the shining verdant scroll.","\"She and I made a deal, and she is just keeping up her end.\"","\"Oh? You made a deal with one of the future Candidate Rulers of our Bloodline?\"","A hint of surprise rose in her eyes as with the way he worded it, Katelyn knew that he would not share just what the details of this deal was!","She instead gazed at him up and down as she continued.","\"You give off the aura of the Ninth Firmament of Ascendancy, so you should've broken your shackles long ago. Why the interest in the Runic Ecritures of Modus Operandi in this Repository? You cannot even share them with any others unless they come here physically themselves.\"","Her glazed eyes shone with bright curiosity as after exchanging words so freely, Noah raised his eyes to focus on this existence once more.","He had been calm and laid back this whole time because his destiny did not ring any danger bells.","Yet he also knew he was dancing a fine line as one wrong move or word could mean a great conflict, where this was a battle of words and will instead of power!"]},{"number":1674,"title":"Chapter 1674: Chapter 1673 OPPENHEIMER! II","paragraphs":["Chapter 1673 OPPENHEIMER! II","The figure of Adjudicator Katelyn was floating serenely as essence from the Mirror Dimension freely surged around her- entirely under her control as she stared closely at the figure of the laid back existence who actually didn't bat an eye, and seemed to hold even more importance on the ancient green scroll between them.","No side had begun this confrontation with hostility as they kept it that way, with it merely being a battle of words and will taking place at this moment as force or abilities had nothing in play!","So Noah chose a set of shocking and incredulous words to come out of his mouth that would stop any more discussions- words that nobody would even believe as they were impossible.","\"I am merely planning to use them as a reference, with my aim actually being to forge my own Runic Ecriture of Modus Operandi.\"","...!","OOOOM!","A set of factual words...that nobody would believe!","This was especially so for an existence like Katelyn who knew more mysteries than even most Legends as at Noah's words...","\"Hah...\" She let out a light chuckle at them while shaking her head.","\"The ridiculous thing is the fact that even your reflection in my Mirrors says the words you are saying are true- even when I know they shouldn't be! This is interesting...actually, one of the methods to read them actually comes down to knowing about the being who forged this Runic Ecriture of Modus Operandi or any of the myriad of Runic Ecritures floating out across the Pure-Blooded Cardinal Royal Bloodlines.\"","The existence who had forged the Runic Ecriture of Modus Operandi currently floating before them!","Noah's eyes twinkled as he pulled upon the many years of memories from the Primordials he had killed, each of them having their idolizing thoughts directed towards a single being that could match a description of the one who had mass produced many different variations of Runic Ecritures of Modus Operandi that the Primordial Bloodlines took hold of.","\"The Last Emperor...\"","WAA!","The Last Emperor. The Past Emperor. The True Emperor! There were multiple titles for this being, bit his accomplishment were boundless as among a minuscule portion of them- there was his design of multiple Modus Operandi that Primordial Bloodlines treasured and forged their paths with!","\"Yes. One of the methods is to simply utter his name, and the Runic Ecriture of Modus Operandi will become free for you to browse. His name...is one that requires thousands of Units of the Essence of Reality just to say it!\"","...!","Katelyn spoke out with ease as afterward, her glazed mirror like eyes moved from the verdant floating scroll and onto Noah as she spoke once more.","\"If you do not know it, that is that. If you do...just know that I am not making a bid deal out of this because of Little Gen...and the fact that you hold a barely discernible trace of a Bloodline from the Mirror Dimension.\"","Her dazzling white hair shone brighter as she spoke, her fair hands coming to trace the magnificent green scroll before them as she continued.","\"Seeing someone with even a trace of my home's Bloodline made me sentimental you see, and it is only after I confirmed with your mirror self that you didn't hold any malice towards the Royal Humans that I made my decision. I...am still a Primordial Adjudicator though, and will not hesitate to do my job if ever see any changes from you, and I have my eyes on you now.\"","WAA!","Extreme calm and seriousness were contained in her words as Noah looked at this unique being and nodded.","\"Thank you...but, you never told me about the second method though.\" This chapter is updated by Freeᴡebnᴏvel.cᴏm.","\"...\"","Silence reigned as Adjudicator Katelyn blinked with slight wonder at the pace of this being, eventually shaking her head as the space around her began to break into mirror shards.","\"Merely Infuse 100,000 Units of the Essence of Reality into the barrier around it if you do not know the name. It is akin to paying homage to that great man as the scroll collects the Essence and stores it within itself.\"","She began to sink into the shattered mirror space as she spoke, her innocent expression changing slightly as she left behind a few last words.","\"Again, do not mistake my actions and kindness right now as naivety. The moment I sense something out of place, I will make a move!\"","SHAAA!","The Adjudicator made her will clear as she disappeared in the next second, leaving Noah to stare at the dazzling green scroll as his will bolstered itself.","The name of the existence who countless years ago had done an irrevocable action that put everyone where they were today!","Everything about the Runic Ecritures of Modus Operandi were shielded in the memories of others as Noah could never access the memories of the Primordials he killed who had been through this Bloodline Ecriture Repository, but could access the memories of their idolization of a single being.","His name was there as with thousands of units of the Essence of Reality welling up in his mouth, Noah's voice boomed out.","\"OPPENHEIMER!\"","RUUMBLE!","Only when 10,000 Units of the Essence of Reality were swirling in his mouth could he utter this name! Otherwise, one's very soul would always feel a heavy sense of undeniable authority as they found that they could not voice out anything about the identity of this being if they didn't have the sufficient essence of reality around them!","Oppenheimer.","The existence to have surpassed all other Emperors in the last Age of Emperors as his name shook the history books.","The existence to have utterly changed the way of life before and the way of life after as for the Ages to come, his influence would always be there!","The uttering of his name acted akin to a key as the verdant scroll before Noah's buzzed, an impenetrable barrier around it fading away as Noah's hands were finally able to land on it.","BZZZT!","Arcs of wondrous light bloomed as domineering waves of information surged into him, bringing with them yet another Runic Ecriture of Modus Operandi for Noah to add to his roster!","<Burgeoning Emperor's Runic Ecriture of Modus Operandi>.","WAA!"]},{"number":1675,"title":"Chapter 1675: Chapter 1674 OPPENHEIMER! III","paragraphs":["Chapter 1674 OPPENHEIMER! III","Bountiful information bloomed in Noah's mind as a wondrous Modus Operandi made its way to him, along with something else as well!","HIGH <Burgeoning Emperor's Runic Ecriture of Modus Operandi> :: A unique understanding of the revolution of Reality that focuses on the aspect of life and vitality. It came as a result of its creator waking up and seeing the blossoming of a Reality Tree unique to a certain domain, this epiphany allowing for the birth of a new Modus Operandi as it was left behind in this region since then. Aside from the method of revolution of one's origin, the complimentary Ultimate Skill of <Burgeoning Limit Breaking Extreme Physique Refinement> is included as breaking one's shackles after achieving this physique will guarantee a range of 10 to 30 Life Reality Passages depending on their foundation and fortune. The life force and vitality of all those who have gained access will be exponentially increased as the method of revolving one's Origin to bloom astounding life force includes...","Yet another High Tier Runic Ecriture of Modus Operandi similar to Azure Emperor, but the differences were still there!","Instead of Destiny Reality Passages, one could forge Life Reality Passages with this Modus Operandi as the possible ranges of formed Passages were larger.","Furthermore, it came with an extra addition of something else- a Limit Breaking Physique!","The <Burgeoning Limit Breaking Extreme Physique> was available to Noah as when he perused through its details, he found its gains similar to the Limit Breaking Extreme Mana Physique in terms of guaranteed Reality Passages, but as for the method of forging it...","\"Refined under the Vestigial Flames Mountain for a million years? Well...\"","Noah's brows tightened as he read the requirements for this Extreme Physique, many thoughts forming in his mind as he released the close contact with the green scroll before him- watching as it floated away as in seconds, another thin barrier formed around it!","The stellar space was entirely quiet apart from the buzzing of this ancient scroll, Noah floating back towards the same portal he had come through as he was finished here.","There were still 8 other Runic Ecritures of Modus Operandi for him to obtain as each of them would be an insurmountable reference for Noah to create his own Modus Operandi soon!","He enjoyed the fact that at the Seventh Firmament of Ascendancy, he could easily wipe the floor with Ninth Firmament existences. It was a unique feeling but...he still wanted to soon exceed the Seventh Firmament of Ascendancy and break his shackles so he could enjoy the feeling of Reality Passages!","Mountainous-like rivers of Reality constantly surging essence into his body and refining his very cellular structure.","It was something he wanted to get his hands on even more after he saw the details of the Destiny Reality Passages under Natalya!","For this, he continued forward as he was swept up in a spatial light to appear on the multicolored bridging pathways of the Bloodline Ecriture Repository where the figures of Genevieve and Beatrix looked at him in surprise.","\"That quick?\"","Genevieve's eyes shone sharply as Noah merely gave a light smile and nodded.","\"I'm somewhat talented.\"","He replied calmly as he went towards the next portal, not mentioning anything about the Adjudicator that had helped him as when it came to his being...Noah actually found her more unfathomable than Genevieve!","He had come to greatly understand his own Destiny, especially with the advent of the Dictum Emperor becoming Quasi-TABOO and the millions of years he had spent dreaming with Dream Stones.","He could now easily discern any fortune he had with other beings, whether they would come to be enemies, or whether they were potential allies for the future.","Genevieve uniquely fell on the side of the enemy where as far as Noah understood his destiny, there was no future between him and her as one of them would be perishing to the other!","Even more uniquely, Beatrix was a potential ally- with Noah having only seen this possibility available after she kept her alive and he then obtained LETHE.","Under LETHE, Noah had the capability of Memory Alteration as from the authority of a TABOO Edict...Noah was beginning to use it ever so slowly not to target Genevieve herself, but the closest confidant she held around her!","'With that, we shall peel your secrets sooner or later...'","His thoughts were wild and bold as we then came to Adjudicator Katelyn and some of the others Noah had seen lately!","Destiny seemed to indicate that Adjudicator Nefertiti would be a great obstacle and enemy.","Adjudicator Ezekiel...was actually similar to Adjudicator Katelyn as the both of them were pointed with the potential light of being allies, with this possibility flashing ever so often as with a single word or action, these beings could also turn to enemies!","Noah didn't know where all of these weavings of destiny would lead as more often than not, all of them would meet in the Unexplored Grotto Sanctum that only the most excelling Primordials within the Pure-Blooded Cardinal Royal Bloodlines were allowed to enter.","If Noah could make his way in there with the aid of his enemy who wanted to keep his clone close until she found his main body...his destiny told him that within that location, he would be able to break his shackles to achieve the most astounding results and propel upwards in the Firmaments of Ascendancy!","'But I have to lay out the foundation first...'","OOOM!","His thoughts were steady as he kept himself focused. Everything that destiny told was only a possibility as he had to make the future happen himself!","These were his thoughts as he passed through another portal and appeared before a crimson ancient looking scroll surrounded by another impenetrable veil.","His eyes flashed as essence gathered around his mouth once more.","\"OPPENHEIMER!\"","HOOONG!","The name of the Last Emperor reverberated out as it was followed by an ancient scroll landing in Noah's hands!","Oppenheimer.","The existence whose action set forth a change that even after countless eons, it could not be reversed.","Noah didn't know if all the 9 Modus Operandi under the Pure-Blooded Cardinal Royal Humans were made by him, but he had to have been an astounding individual as merely waking up and seeing the blooming of a Reality Tree like the one he had seen in the Outer Peninsula had granted him an epiphany that bore fruit to a Modus Operandi!","The one to have obtained the seat of a True Emperor was unfathomable as even Noah now made it his goal to learn more about this being and the history of what happened all those years ago.","The memories of someone like Genevieve or Beatrix would be indispensable to learn more about history among other means that Noah would take, his thoughts coming to a stop here as he felt the flow of information of another Modus Operandi.","This was another High Tier Runic Ecriture of Modus Operandi as it was termed <Evanescent Emperor's Runic Ecriture of Modus Operandi>!</p><p>It didn't contain another Limit Breaking Extreme Physique, but it held a similar number of possible Reality Passages as the other High Tier Runic Ecritures of Modus Operandi- Noah seeing how it wouldn't matter to others how many of these methods to revolve one's Reality they looked at, where even one was enough for them.</p> But for Noah, the more he obtained, the better! WAA! The crimson scroll he felt pulled back again after he let go as he looked past the beautiful stellar rivers of essence and rushed back into the portal, intent on observing all 9 Modus Operandis before anything happened as his will forged forward!","But for Noah, the more he obtained, the better!","WAA!","The crimson scroll he felt pulled back again after he let go as he looked past the beautiful stellar rivers of essence and rushed back into the portal, intent on observing all 9 Modus Operandis before anything happened as his will forged forward!"]},{"number":1676,"title":"Chapter 1676: Chapter 1675 Vestigial Flames Mountain! l","paragraphs":["Chapter 1675 Vestigial Flames Mountain! l","Empress Genevieve and Beatrix stood in the dazzling stellar bridges of the Bloodline Ecriture Repository as they watched a single being calmly go from portal to portal, reading over the methods that everyone only chose one of with excitement as if they each held great meaning to him!","\"Did he know the name or is he just using 100,000 Units of the Essence of Reality each time...\" Beatrix felt her head buzzing as she unconsciously voiced this out after Noah entered the fifth Portal.","If he didn't know the name of the Last Emperor and was spending 100,000 Units of the Essence of Reality this whole time, that would be a dreadful concept as Genevieve merely snorted while shaking her head.","\"He must have known the name. Don't make him seem bigger than he is.\"","Her mood seemed to have turned bad as she didn't expect to see Noah not even struggling, turning her head towards Beatrix as she came close and grabbed onto her head.","BZZZT!","Arcs of billowing and pristine TABOO Essence bloomed out to wrap around Beatrix in a shocking fashion as she trembled, but continued to withstand it!","\"I've imposed my own TABOO authority on you that should be there for the next few days. I have to go take care of the matters of rulership and check out just what changes we have to adapt to because of the ongoing war...so I need you to not let him out of your sight! This authority should not allow him to do anything against you as if he even tries, I will know.\"","Her eyes shone with sharpness as she began to float away towards the Runic Magic Circle that would lead one out of the Bloodline Ecriture Repository and back into the Bloodline Library, her stern voice continuing to ring out before she disappeared!","\"Remember...he must not leave your sight! The moment he tries anything, just pull upon that TABOO authority and I'll be there an instant later!\"","WAA!","She was the Candidate Ruler of an entire Pure-Blooded Cardinal Royal Bloodline. She had many things that had to be done for her to keep up appearances if she wanted to confirm the seat of Bloodline Ruler for herself- if she ever wanted to obtain the keys to attain her revenge against this Bloodline that had tried to kill her many eons ago!","So Beatrix was left behind to observe the Clone of a Candidate Kainos Emperor who had solidified his crown as she sighed deeply when she watched her Master disappear.","'Must we seek revenge? Must we include him as an enemy?'","She had grown careful after watching this being butcher Seventh, Eighth, and Ninth Firmament existences a few days back as she knew he had the power to wipe her out if he wished- where even the TABOO authority of her own master just granted her a little bit of comfort!","'Well, he won't make a move in here when the visage of a Genuine LEGEND is washing down. So watch I shall.'","She patted her golden attire as she stood tall, her hair flickering from a shade of crimson to gold as she seemed to be lost in thought.","SHAA!","Noah's figure returned from the fifth portal as he was making his way to the sixth when he stopped, seeing Genevieve not there anymore as he turned towards Beatrix with a devilish smile that instantly roused her into attention and care!","\"She has many things to do and can't babysit you all the time, finish up so we can leave without any incidents!\"","Her words only caused the devilish smile on the Unnamed Kainos Emperor to deepen as he nodded while moving onto the next portal.","\"...\"","Beatrix was extra careful around this being as she treated him with the level of danger she had seen before! All others that underestimated him had fallen under his heel.","Maybe it was because of her Master's pride and her position in the past, but Beatrix felt that even Empress Genevieve was still underestimating this being before her even after all they had seen!","She was also a LEGEND in the past who had achieved a great stage of power. But her soul wasn't as strong enough to withstand everything as she wasn't even an Emperor- her situation now only being due to chance that a servant like her was dragged through death with her Master. She needed many more years and resources to unlock her past glory as due to her own nature, she was very careful.","So she continued to watch the one she knew as Alexander King with utter care as he went into the Sixth, Seventh...until the Ninth Portals that each held a Runic Ecriture of Modus Operandi!","He came out of the last portal with an accomplished expression as before he could even speak, Beatrix's voice rang out.","\"Let's head out now before anyone else coincidentally enters. I'll show you to where we'll be staying-\"","\"Before that...\"","WAA!","Arcs of light emanated from Noah's eyes as he floated towards Beatrix, this Eighth Firmament existence reinforcing her body with power as she prepared to pull upon her Master's TABOO authority at any time!","\"Before that, let's go to the Vestigial Flames Mountain.\"","...!","The location that Pure-Blooded Cardinal Royal Humans went to strengthen their Physiques was mentioned as Beatrix looked towards Noah incredulously, recalling some of the Limit Breaking Extreme Physique Refinement Techniques that were contained in some of the Runic Ecritures of Modus Operandi as she quickly connected certain Refinement Techniques to the Vestigial Flames Mountain.","\"You...you need to be refined under excruciating pain with the Vestigial Flames for over a million years for just a single Physique, we don't have the time for you to be-\"","\"Just to take a look and see this process for myself, don't worry. Let's go!\"","Noah replied calmly while waving his hands, floating past her to initiate the Runic Magic Circle that led back to the Bloodline Library as Beatrix couldn't help but follow!","Others needed a million years to completely refine their bodies and obtain the Burgeoning Limit Breaking Extreme Physique. Did Noah really need to do the same?!"]},{"number":1677,"title":"Chapter 1677: Chapter 1676 Vestigial Flames Mountain! ll","paragraphs":["Chapter 1676 Vestigial Flames Mountain! ll","Within a Primordial Temple in the domain of the Cardinal Royal Wolf Bloodline.","A Seventh Firmament Primordial with an aged look and sparkling white hair spoke into a Medallion as he was being circled by thin golden lines of destiny and karma.","\"Sire, we've gotten traces of the one linked to the death of Princess Snow. How many forces shall we dispatch?\"","...!","Through the tying of destiny and fate, all the truly heinous criminals on the Primordial Blacklist could be traced down through the workings of Destiny. Primordial Seers were the prestigious beings tasked with such jobs as at this moment, such a Seer picked up on a trace of the one known as Osmont!","The communication Medallion this being held pulsed with light as he waited briefly before a strong message came out.","\"Our forces are already spread thin to guard the borders against Primordial Beasts...I shall spare a single Legion. What is the location?\"","\"Understood, it is...\"","The location of a certain clone of the Unnamed Kainos Emperor was set as the bait was ready, and the prey were already assembled and on their way as it was bound to be a fantastical affair!","Far from such events in the Boundary Between Realities- across the walls of Dimensions entirely.","Noah's 1,000th portion of soul had solidified into a body in the Dream Dimension as he waded through its shocking surroundings, everything changing around him constantly as at this moment, he had entered a region that seemed to be swirling with silver sand.","Distinct voices every now and then with no sources, but no structures, existences, or anything!","Just voices that seemed to carry tearing soul attacks as Noah still had no way of finding the unique material <Golden Sand> this whole time, even his astounding destiny pointing to different directions constantly.","That is until...","BZZZT!","A thick storm of dream essence began to coagulate in front of him as the silver sand danced even more chaotically, actually beginning to form into shapes as in the next instant...Noah saw a curved semilunar smile forming!","Then, the round shape of a head and two Jewel-like eyes made entirely of sand along with a nose that told the root of this creature also formed, a devilish and heavy pressure spreading out at this moment as Noah came to a stop.","OOOM!","Thin cerulean blue Runic lines began to emanate light from his body as Runic Ecritures reading <MANA> began to surround him, his eyes releasing a terrifying light as he felt a billowing soul attack come from all sides from the form of what seemed to be like the head of a cat!","An illusory interchangeable head of a cat with a devilish smile formed from the silver sand all around him, and it also came with a will as the curved smile opened to release a mesmerizing voice that could cause any weak Ninth Firmament existences to fall into an eternal slumber.","<A new thing foreign to the Land of Dreams...>","HOOONG!","The billowing waves of soul attack became even stronger as it spoke, Noah's soul beginning to pull from the authority of LETHE as thousands of Units of the Essence of Reality began to bubble, this formed body also blooming out with 20 dazzling Black Tier Ascendancy Halos that came with astounding authority to withstand the coming waves of attacks!","<You have been inflicted with the debuffs of Uncontrollable Slumber, Leaking Soul, Willess...>","<The effects of Uncontrollable Slumber, Leaking Soul, Willess...have been resisted.>","Prompts quantified the surrounding situation as waves of soul damage equivalent to thousands of True Reality Damage Values boomed all around him constantly, Resource Shield and Runic Ecritures of Defense beginning to fully swirl around him as even the Shield of Oblivion was called upon!","But everything that occurred actually caused the appeared devilish creature to smile more as its head twisted upside down, its voice continuing out.","<With such a strong soul and such age, you would do well in the land of dreams. Tell me, what dream do you seek here? What do you wish to accomplish?>","OOOM!","Noah's dazzling eyes faced the billowing attacks as the penetrative skills he had been casting this whole time finally returned with information about this phenomenon before him.","<Nightmare Sand Emperor>:: A nightmare dwelling in the dream dimension. Its nature is unique as it can appear as an existence in the first Firmament of Ascendancy, Ninth Firmament of Ascendancy, or even a Legend depending on the current accumulation of Dreams. It is immune to all physical attacks and can only be hurt by the authority of TABOO, making it a perilous existence to come across in the Dream Dimension. It is currently at the Ninth Firmament of Ascendancy as overcoming this existence stand a chance to grant boons...","A Nightmare Sand Emperor that might have even been a LEGEND if Noah had come across it at another time!","His eyes shone luminously as his will bellowed out in return.","\"I came to search for Golden Sand...and for anything that the tides of destiny bring!\"","WAA!","<For mere treasures? Disappointing.>","The smile on the Nightmare Sand faded and turned into a frown as the soul attacks became increasingly heavier, Noah's 20 Ascendancy Halos beginning to spin around him and giving off an obsidian glow!","<Dreams can make kings and Emperors. Dreams give reason for anything that others do across Realities and dimensions.>","..!","<Your dream is too small...merely some materials. Is this all your soul can achieve? Is this the extent of your Dream?>","BOOOOM!","Billowing silver rays of light shot out from the jewel like eyes of the Nightmare Sand Emperor as Noah felt his very will be tested!","\"My Dream?!\"","HOOONG!","Bountiful Essence swirled around him as whenever his authority was questioned, his soul unconsciously fought back with even more fervor as from LETHE, <Oblivion> was called upon as Noah felt his soul filling with shocking power, his 20 Black Ascendancy Halos swirling around him and becoming fused briefly as he released a wave of soul attack with his voice.","\"My Dream is not something the likes of you can question!\"","BZZZT...CRACK!","Like a billowing horn of Apocalypse, his voice shattered outwards and destroyed ant speckles of silver sand in its place!"]},{"number":1678,"title":"Chapter 1678: Chapter 1677 Vestigial Flames Mountain! lll","paragraphs":["Chapter 1677 Vestigial Flames Mountain! lll","Like a horn that called for the end, Noah's voice bellowed out and destroyed everything- even the sand formed Nightmare Sand Emperor shaking as a smile formed on it again.","<Interesting.>","Its will was voiced out one last time before an instant later, its illusory form began to fade until only a smile was left- this smile forming into a golden light that instantly shot into Noah's body.","HOOONG!","<An Astounding Achievement! You have withstood against the will of the Nightmare Sand Emperor and obtained the ultimate ability- Sandman!>","WAA!","A new skill bloomed in Noah's mind as destiny danced wildly.","From his fingertips, silver sand began to gather as the swirling silver sand around him began to feel clear and distinct, Noah actually making headway into the Dream Dimension at this moment!","While this soul relished in this accomplishment in the Dream Dimension, Noah's Clone with the Character Selection of Alexander King went through multiple teleportation Runic circles that connected the vast Pure Blooded Domains of the Cardinal Royal Humans- eventually leaving the first White Outer Peninsula they had arrived in as he went deeper to appear in another false Grotto Sanctum that was known by a single name.","The Vestigial Flames Mountain.","\"Again, what can you accomplish here? Master will be moving very soon as you will not be able to work on refining your Physique for even a single year at this time.\"","The voice of Beatrix continued to ring out as the two of them floated at the bottom of a truly vast mountain that was lit up with many different colored flames.","The mountain was so large that their figures were akin to small specks of sand, the entire structure seeming so large that one couldn't even see the top of it where a shocking level of heat was emanating out!","The auras of countless beings could be felt and seen near the bottom of the mountain as men and women in tight fitting attire or even with their bare bodies could be seen controlling the Flames around them and having them course over their skin, their bodies glinting with a golden light as they underwent refinement by flames.","SHAA!","Noah's eyes fluttered either a gold light as he identified the vast structure before him and compiled all of its information into a single prompt.","<Vestigial Flames Mountain>:: The core of a false Grotto Sanctum that was enacted by an Unknown Legend who had managed to harness the Core Flames of a genuine Grotto Sanctum. The Vestigial Flames atop this Mountain are unique as they have a positive effect on strengthening the body if one can withstand them, with the level of effect becoming more intense the higher up one travels on the Mountain as it also becomes unbearable for one to withstand. The top of the mountain contains the strongest Amalgamation of Vestigial Flames that even the body of a Ninth Firmament existence would disintegrate under its immense heat....","One could see yellow and orange flames swirling at the base of this mystical mountain, with the middle of the mountain surrounded by dazzling white flames as when one went higher, cold and deadly blue flames could be seen raging as even further above that, the sight of purple and gold flames roared out!","Most of the training Pure-Blooded Cardinal Royal Humans on this mountain were moving around at the very bottom Noah could see their auras ranging from the Third to the Seventh Firmament of Ascendancy- each of them trying to refine their Physiques before they had to break their shackles to guarantee a large number of Reality Passages.","But out of all of the beings moving within the Vestigial Flames Mountain, most could only complete a percentage of their Physique as even the strongest geniuses at the Seventh Firmament of Ascendancy could only withstand the White flames near the middle of the mountain- with this level of Flames only being capable of refining something like the Burgeoning Limit Breaking Extreme Physique by 50%!","Unless one was truly exceptional and managed to reach the stage of Blue Flames while they hadn't broken their shackles and were still in the Seventh Firmament, they would never be able to achieve a Physique.","The reason why it could also take a million years if not hundreds of millions of years was that the Vestigial Flames were truly too hot, with existences having to refine their bodies with them slowly and over long extended period of time.","Theoretically, if one could easily withstand these ferocious flames that came from the core of a genuine Grotto Sanctum, they could refine their Physiques much faster as this was actually what Eighth and Ninth Firmament existences did!","Even after they broke their shackles and couldn't add any more Reality Passages, they still came onto the Vestigial Flames Mountain to completely refine their Physiques as the strongest at the Ninth Firmament of Ascendancy could withstand the Blue Flames at the top with the even more exceptional Legend's Visage Tier beings managing to even touch the purple flames.","The shining gold flames that one could barely see towards the very peak....only Legends had been capable of stepping into them and coming out unscathed.","'This should definitely be interesting...'","Noah had such a thought as he reflected back to the 9 Runic Ecritures of Modus Operandi that he had obtained from the Bloodline Ecriture Repository.","From the 9 Modus Operandi, three of them had contained methods to refine one's Physique as there were different methods to refine all three- but if one was talented enough, they could actually utilize the Vestigial Flames Mountain for all three!","Of course, due to the singular Origin and body of beings, it was widely known that one's body could only handle a single Physique- with an astoundingly exceptional Royal Human being capable of completing two Physiques when they arrived at the Ninth Firmament of Ascendancy.","There were very few beings in history who had managed to forge all three Physiques under the Royal Humans as it was mainly the most powerful Legend's Visage or genuine Legends who came back to do this when they were strong enough.","The Burgeoning Limit Breaking Extreme Physique could be refined by any Flames on the Vestigial Flames Mountain, with higher flames increasing the pace and power of the physique!","The Second Limit Breaking Extreme Physique was known as the Chassis Extreme Physique from the <Chassis Emperor's Runic Ecriture of Modus Operandi>, with this refinement required one to eat and devour unique materials refined under flames...or the other method was to utilize the Blue Flames or higher leveled flames under the Vestigial Flames Mountain to achieve the same effect!","The third refinement technique was known to grant the Relegator's Limit Breaking Extreme Physique as it had its own first method of refinement that involved the Essence of Reality and bathing in medicinal baths with unique materials that only the Scions who would become Bloodline Masters or Leaders of squads of Primordial Adjudicators could manage to get their hands on...with its alternative refining method also being Blue Flames or higher on the Vestigial Flames Mountain.","Each Physique gave its own strengthening as they were the reason why the Pure-Blooded Cardinal Royal Humans were known for their pure physical force that could shatter Realities, will all Eighth and Ninth Firmament existences returning to the Vestigial Flames Mountain to complete as many Physiques as they could even if they wouldn't receive the benefits of the Reality Passages that these Physiques offered if they had attained them before they broke their shackles.","Now, there was Noah.","He had yet to break his shackles as he already had attained a Limit Breaking Extreme Physique from an Emperor's Bloodline, and his Origin and soul were elevated to the extremes as they were akin to a Ninth Firmament existence...even though he was still at the Seventh Firmament of Ascendancy!","So what heights would he be able to achieve under the Vestigial Flames Mountain?","Would he be able to forge all three Limit Breaking Extreme Physiques that only the most exceptional scions of the Pure-Blooded Cardinal Royal Humans or their Legends could forge as they could withstand the highest levels of Flames and had strong enough bodies to contain multiple Physiques?","\"Mmm...this should definitely be fun.\"","OOOM!","Noah's voice boomed out as he began to float towards the Vestigial Flames Mountain, Beatrix watching his figure with an exasperated expression as she voiced out once more, catching the attention of nearby Pure-Blooded Cardinal Royal Humans and some of those that were already refining their bodies at the bottom of the Vestigial Flames Mountain.","\"We really don't have years to be spending here, Alexander!\"","WAA!","Her sharp voice finally brought attention to their figures as some quickly recognized the status of Beatrix.","But Noah was unhindered as he didn't even turn around, his voice coming out boisterously as his already sculpted body rushed up towards the Vestigial Flames Mountain, utterly ignoring the base of it with low level flames and shooting towards the glimmering cerulean flames.","\"I will not need a million years. Merely a day should be enough...or just a few hours!\"","HOOONG!","Explosive waves of majesty and destiny exploded out as his figure shot out like a glimmering star and began to accumulate even more eyes of the countless beings training on the Vestigial Flames Mountain!"]},{"number":1679,"title":"Chapter 1679: Chapter 1678 What is He?! l","paragraphs":["Chapter 1678 What is He?! l","Off to one unseen corner of the Vestigial Flames Mountain, space folded in a mirror-like structure as a small crystalline creature with its body being round and entirely covered by large eyes was hiding quietly.","Its large eyes were covering everything in its line of sight as it relayed all that it saw towards another region within the Pure Blooded Domains.","In a Peninsula within the innermost region of the Pure Blooded Domains.","Atop an enormous Reality Tree, a crystalline castle the size of a Cosmos stood at the very peak as inside of this vast castle, the figure of Adjudicator Katelyn could be seen with size proportional to this dazzling building. She was currently standing in front of a large mirror that showed square segments of many seeds playing out- with a majority of them showing different areas in the Boundary Between Realities that showed parties of Adjudicator Legions or movements of Primordial Beasts.","Her glazed eyes watched everything as she sent commands frequently to different parties, but she took her eyes off the enormous mirror wall to gaze off to the side within a small round mirror that was relating a scene that a Mirror Beast was seeing of the Vestigial Flames Mountain.","She had attached a Mirror Beast to keep track of this small anomaly that Genevieve had brought back, her eyes occasionally glancing towards the scenes that the Mirror Beast relayed as at this moment, wondrous events were occurring on the Vestigial Flames Mountain!","HOONG!","Like a stellar light, an existent boisterously shot towards the region on the vast mountain where blue flames raged into stellar storms of utter wonder.","Their pure temperature alone could melt the toughest metals as only something as unique as the Vestigial Flames Mountain could actually have ground and vegetation that shone with crystalline light as they were all unaffected by the temperature!","For countless eons, the very ground and plants of this mountain had stood under the ravages of the different tiers of Flames as the ground near the peak of the Vestigial Flames Mountain was something that even weak LEGENDS would have trouble destroying.","\"That is...\"","The prominent Pure-Blooded Cardinal Royal Humans in their buff forms and sculpted muscles saw Noah's figure as they questioned who this being was and what he was doing!","\"Esteemed Beatrix just called him Alexander...\"","The voices of Sixth and Seventh Firmament Royal Humans echoed out as some perceptive ones had seen Noah while he still floated with Beatrix- where someone of her stature was given the title of Esteemed even though she was the attending of an Empress.","Someone of the Eighth Firmament of Ascendancy deserved respect as many would be cordially referred to as Esteemed ones, while respected Ninth Firmament existences were sometimes termed Tyrants!","\"Alexander? What could he be trying to do by rushing up like this?\"","A buzz of questions began to rise as more eyes were drawn over, Beatrix also floating closer to the burning heat of the Vestigial Flames Mountain as she was apprehensive of what was about to happen.","She had seen this being exceed expectations again and again as she learned his blunt words were more often than not actually something true!","When he told off the Visage of the White Dragon Emperor, he was not false in his claims.","When he faced the Will Bearers who had actually tracked down her and her Master, he was still unhindered!","So when he said he wouldn't need a million years to refine his physique and that it would at most take a day if not hours...Beatrix truly turned apprehensive as she could just dismiss these words.","SHAAA!","The billowing of Flames could be heard as the figure of Noah arrived in the vicinity of the raging blue flames, the clothes on his body slowly becoming disintegrated as his sculpted toned upper body was laid bare, with a hazy mist of essence coming to cover his lower blessed region as only his fair knees and below could be seen- akin to shimmering shorts of essence becoming adorned for his lower body!","The hair for this Character Selection was currently black as it twinkled with stellar light, his spotless fair hands reaching out as tendrils of blue Flames began to wrap around them and surge towards the rest of his body.","His eyes carried immense glory as he spoke out fearlessly.","\"<Burgeoning Limit Breaking Extreme Physique Refinement>!\"","...!","The countless beings who had their eyes drawn over by his actions watched on with even closer gazes as they realized this existence that gave off an aura at the Ninth Firmament of Ascendancy was actually beginning to refine his body with a Physique that all of them were currently trying to forge.","The simplest Physique that was collected under the banner of Pure-Blooded Cardinal Royal Humans as one could refine it simply with the Flames of the Vestigial Flames Mountain!","It was rare to see a Ninth Firmament Royal Human who had yet to refine their bodies with this technique, but they all affirmed this when they saw a dazzling white lotus beginning to form on the forehead of the boisterous being.","A White Lotus.","This symbol signified the First Layer of the Burgeoning Limit Breaking Extreme Physique that focused on vitality and life, with a brighter shade of white signifying the Second and Third Layers!","For one to achieve the complete Physique, they had to have completed all 10 Layers of the Burgeoning Limit Breaking Extreme Physique as the fourth to Fifth Layers were signified by a Blue Lotus of varying intensity, and the Seventh to Ninth Layers were signified by a Purple Lotus of varying intensity also!","The last and tenth layer was signified by an illusory Golden Lotus shining brilliant on the forehead of the existence that had achieved 100% completion of the Burgeoning Limit Breaking Extreme Physique.","This was fine and all, but all those that had their attention drawn were wondering why this Ninth Firmament existence was showing off refining they had all undergone- even if he could handle the more intense blue Tier flame! This was a given for his stage of power as even though they were curious now and showed slight respect because of his Realm, they would all move on to their own matters after a few hours as nobody would simply watch another being refine their bodies for the next hundreds of thousands of years!","This was why most of what could be seen on the Vestigial Flames Mountain was calmness and raging flames as no major waves were made here- the only times anything major occurred being when truly exceptional existences who stood out even at the stage of A Legend's Visage appeared...or genuine Legends themselves coming through to bathe in the highest golden flames at the peak of the Vestigial Flames Mountain.","\"His power is to be respected, but the act of refining is something we can all d-...!\"","Some truly prideful Royal Humans had begun to raise their buff Chests while speaking out, but they came to a stop an instant later as their focus was drawn on the White Lotus in front of the head of the one known as Alexander.","This White Lotus that signified the First to Third Layers of the Burgeoning Limit Breaking Extreme Physique...wasn't it brightening up much too quickly?!"]},{"number":1680,"title":"Chapter 1680: Chapter 1679 What is He?! ll","paragraphs":["Chapter 1679 What is He?! ll","Those who were about to look away were drawn in even more as even more eyes and wills focused over, many beings noticing the sculpted body of the one known as Alexander actually still rising up higher towards the peak of the mountain as cerulean blue flames rushed into his body!","At the same time, the White Lotus in front of his forehead represented the layers of the Burgeoning Limit Breaking Extreme Physique was becoming increasingly brighter at a pace that all of those who had refined knew...should be something that occurs after years of refinement.","Just to go from the First Layer to the Second, the average time of refinement was 100 years.","From the Second Layer to the Third...the average time was a thousand years! This continued on as the average to complete all layers was about 1 million years, where one would be extremely familiar with the Vestigial Flames Mountain after they spent this much time bathing in its flames.","Yet...why did it seem like this ascending being was changing the brightness of the White Lotus so quickly?!","—","Noah was currently absorbed in a very unique sensation as the sparkling blue flames of the Vestigial Flames Mountain surged into his Body.","The basis behind the refinement was for one to withstand the heat of the Flames as they carried out their unique quality to strengthen the very cells of one's body, with one slowly protecting themselves and absorbing the effects of these flames as overtime...all parts of their bodies would be refined!","Noah had taken in the flames with his clone as they circled over his body like tendrils of snakes and began to sink into it, directly beginning to refine both body and origin as these flames were instantaneously transferred to the main body that was slumbering in a throne in the Cosmic Holy Land.","The Clone essentially acted like a passageway between the Vestigial Flames Mountain and Noah's main body, raging flames being absorbed greedily and without any fear from Noah as a unique phenomenon occurred soon after he began!","The dazzling cerulean blue Runic Kainos Mana Lines of Ascendancy all over his main body in the Cosmic Holy Land began to light up as the completed Limit Breaking Extreme Mana Physique came to life.","This completed Physique had already refined Noah's body and built a unique structure of Runic Lines all over him, and the Vestigial Flames coming in shockingly began to be sucked into the pulsing Runic Kainos Mana Lines of Ascendancy at extreme speeds as their rate of refinement was being propelled to the extreme!","HOOONG!","They cried out for more of the Vestigial Flames as back on the pristine mountain, Noah's True Sanguine Clones began to hungrily devour in more and more flames as wherever his body flew past, he acted like a black hole that absorbed all the Flames there.","While others would slowly allow the tendrils of Flames to sink into their skin, he was hungrily taking in all the blue flames for miles as his figure continued to fly up the mountain!","But this wasn't all.","What would be the true reality-breaking concept here today was the fact that all the Flames were being absorbed by a clone that instantly transferred them into the main slumbering body that was the one to be refined...and this main body was within the Cosmic Holy Land that after the constant advancements of the Infinite Reality, the time ratio had long since exceeded 10,000:1.","This time discrepancy meant that Noah's main body would have finished using all the Vestigial Flames brought forth within a microsecond while barely 10,000th of a microsecond passed in the outside Cosmos!","This time discrepancy had to be accounted for as seeing the Flames being used up faster than they were coming in, the slumbering will of Noah's main body moved.","\"More.\"","HOOOOONG!","His will surged out maddeningly as the True Sanguine Clone in the Vestigial Flames Mountain put its hands out while calling even more flames towards it, its absorption surface area continuing to increase while its body flew ever so higher as it caused a shocking phenomenon to bloom out!","As if he was in the eye of the storm, all the surrounding blue flames of the Vestigial Flames Mountain were being called onto and surging into him relentlessly.","To match the time discrepancy, the Clone could take it over 10,000 more times the normal number of Vestigial Flames that all went towards refining the main body, the White Lotus that had appeared on his forehead brightening up rapidly due to this as over 10,000 microseconds of refinement could be done in the Cosmic Holy Land while only a single microsecond passed outside!","So his slumbering will still felt the coming flames were insufficient as it called out once again.","\"MORE!\"","OOOM!","Surging soul waves connected with the Clone ascending the Vestigial Flames Mountain as it warped space to instantly appear on the border between blue and white flames, its body still ferociously calling everything in the vicinity as even the raging purple flames that only the Ninth Firmament existences could withstand didn't bother him!","The stellar purple flames stemming from the very core of a Grotto Sanctum simply sank into his body endlessly as if their temperature was utterly nothing to him, his main body taking all of them in as they followed the path already laid down by Runic Mana Lines of Ascendancy to rapidly achieve the result of refinement.","All of these factors...were what made possible what happened next.","As the Pure-Blooded Cardinal Royal Humans on the Vestigial Flames Mountain watched on in horror at this being insanely absorbing boundless rivers of raging flames, they saw the White Lotus on his forehead go from dull white to shining white...and then into sparkling radiant white within a matter of seconds.","From the First and into the Second and Third Layers of the Burgeoning Limit Breaking Extreme Physique...in mere seconds!","OOOOOOOH!","The bellow of this being reverberated out as he continued to Ascend, entirely leaving the Boundary of the blue Tier flames and surging head first into the purple Tier flames that even Ninth Firmament existences had to be careful of, with the higher up he went meaning even more burning temperatures as if anyone even came close to the golden flames at the peak...they would normally be burnt away if they weren't LEGENDS or extremely powerful Legend's Visage Tier existences.","The Vestigial Flames Mountain was extremely vast that it was multiple times larger than many Realities, with Noah's single figure on the seas of purple flames being something as small as a raindrop.","Yet his small figure had begun causing visible changes on the infinitesimally small area within the sea of purple flames as a rotating force of a storm of Flames could be seen surging towards his figure if one looked from afar, the dazzling White Lotus on his forehead actually releasing pulses of light as it went from White...and into the glorious color of blue just 10 seconds after Noah began his refinement!","\"...\"","From the First to the Fourth Layer of the Burgeoning Limit Breaking Extreme Physique...it only took 10 seconds as his rate of absorption and advancement only increased!!!"]},{"number":1681,"title":"Chapter 1681: Chapter 1680 What is He?! lll","paragraphs":["Chapter 1680 What is He?! lll","'Fuck.'","This was the singular word that Beatrix could use to express what she was seeing past the midpoint of the Vestigial Flames Mountain at this time!","'He's doing it again...' Her eyes held a hint of helplessness as she witnessed this being very easily surpass established norms as even though he wasn't massacring Eight or Ninth Firmament existences while he was at the Seventh Firmament of Ascendancy, he was now surviving Flames that could burn normal Ninth Firmament existences while he crazily absorbed them for countless expanding trillions of miles.","When the White Lotus insignia on his forehead flashed from white to blue as he entered the Fourth Layer of the Burgeoning Limit Breaking Extreme Physique, Beatrix could do nothing but sigh at the ridiculousness as she sent forth a communication.","'Master, he is...doing something again.'","A message went towards Empress Genevieve who was dealing with other matters as countless Pure-Blooded Cardinal Royal Humans began to turn their eyes and wills towards the image of a single being who was absorbing dazzling and ferocious purple flames for a distance that had begun to enter into light years!","As if the Flames could not bother his body! As if the heat was meaningless to him!","Of course, all the Flames merely passed from the Clone and onto a slumbering body with a shocking will, everything being withstood by the Limit Breaking Extreme Mana Physique as the gorgeous purple flames crossed through the paths of countless Runic Kainos Mana Lines of Ascendancy and refined Noah's very cells.","His main body was being strengthened rapidly in a Domain of Time as the True Sanguine Clone reflected the changes occurring in a short period of time.","When the Blue Lotus bloomed, Noah's main body buzzed as from him, the Runic Ecriture that read <LIFE> began to bloom in an illusory fashion as it pulsed with intense vitality.","HOOOONG!","The same scene repeated around his True Sanguine Clone that had its sculpted chest laid bare, those seeing the Runic Ecriture <LIFE> finally affirming their shock along with the brightening Purple Lotus that this being had truly gone multiple layers in a matter of seconds!","\"What is this...\"","\"This should not be possible...\"","Prideful and powerful Seventh Firmament Pure-Blooded Cardinal Royal Humans and below they were refining their bodies on the Vestigial Flames Mountain had their minds shaken as they watched this scene, and thousands of other auras began to bloom soon after in the periphery of this mountain as other Royal Humans that were in other locations received word and teleported over.","The only question in their mind was who this Tyrant was as they had not heard of him until now!","The name Alexander was slowly making the rounds after Beatrix had called it out, with this information riding the waves of man's and entering the ears of others as they watched the small figure of the True Sanguine Clone moving like a stellar light, situated in the eye of the storm as ridiculously...it rose even higher towards the peak of the mountain where the Flames only became hotter.","If he continued going upwards...","\"No way...\"","A newly appearing Eighth Firmament Pure-Blooded Cardinal Royal Human voiced out in shock as even she would have been burnt to cinders by now.","\"Impossible!\" At the same time in another area of space, a group of Ninth Firmament Royal Humans appeared as they vocalize the same thought!","Yet the being ascending the Vestigial Flames Mountain did not heed their thoughts as he just continued to get higher.","The Purple Lotus on his forehead was brightening up at a rapid pace as from the Fourth Layer, it very quickly blinked a brighter shade of purple as it entered the Fifth Layer!","And Noah's incandescent figure truly wasn't stopping as he was even warping across space, moving light years to head closer and closer towards the peak of the Vestigial Flames Mountain where one could see terrifying golden liquid flames.","Golden flames that normally...only Legends utilized to refine their bodies safely- along with a select few powerhouses on the stage of a Legend's Visage who had unique constitutions.","An example of this was...","CRACK!","The fair woman that had stopped watching from the eyes of a Mirror Beast as a mirror portal opened and shattered to reveal her dazzling white hair as her eyes watched Noah's figure curiously.","A select few exceptional beings.","Many if not all were well known as the question that was now posed as they watched this being go towards the glimmer of golden flames was...","\"What is he?!\"","WAP!","Space warped and folded as many light years were crossed, the figure ascending the mountain having its rapidly rotating vortex of absorption actually landed on the region of golden flames as they began to surge towards him.","All those watching held their breath.","The moment these flames touched this being, he would either be burnt to ashes...or they would have seen the appearance of an exceptional being who had talent similar to those in groups of Adjudicators and Will Bearers!","The allure of raging gold flames roared out as they were defiantly pulled towards the bellowing figure, surging forth to attack and drown out his body as they very quickly turned into draconic snakes that surged and sunk into his very skin!","\"....\"","Silence reigned as the figure everyone was looking at didn't falter.","SHAA!","His body trembled briefly as at this time, the Clone had to stop and enact Runic Ecritures of Defense and Resource Shields before passing the terrifying golden flames to the main body.","So he stopped in place briefly as he readjusted, but the moment that the golden flames reached the main body and began to follow the path of Noah's very own Runic Kainos Mana Lines of Ascendancy...he began to move again as droves of obscene and terrifying stellar golden flames began to wash over him in full, the Blue Lotus in front of his forehead instantly changing into a dazzling blue light that within another second- it broke apart and turned into a Resplendent purple color!","\"....!\"","A few seconds after achieving the Third Layer of the Burgeoning Limit Breaking Extreme Physique, the Sixth Layer was reached as glorious green Runic Ecritures reading <LIFE> began to bloom around Noah in full force!"]},{"number":1682,"title":"Chapter 1682: Chapter 1681 A Shocking Foundation! l","paragraphs":["Chapter 1681 A Shocking Foundation! l","Speechless.","Those watching were utterly speechless as they observed an obscene amount of flames nobody should be able to handle at once disappearing into the body of a single existence as seconds later, he continued to break past the layers of the Burgeoning Limit Breaking Extreme Physique as he now raced past the Sixth Layer!","His figure never stopped as he fully entered the region at the peak of the Vestigial Flames Mountain that held only the allure of terrifying golden flames, his figure becoming bathed thoroughly with them as he looked like an ancient creature undergoing baptism.","He floated with utter majesty and regality as while countless flames raged into him, he bellowed out a roar of dominance and authority that caused even the coming flames to tremble.","OOOOOOH!","...!","His astounding will let itself be known as the Ninth Firmament Pure-Blooded Cardinal Royal Humans that had recently appeared to observe the shocking event turned somber.","In one corner of space, the figure of Adjudicator Katelyn could be seen as she tapped her chin while watching this scene, her eyes being surprised but not revealing any traces of shock.","She only had a single passing thought that would make any lesser beings tremble.","'He really does look and act similar to that guy as well...'","WAA!","Her thoughts were her own as nobody would be privy to them, her jewel-like eyes watching with curiosity as the figure of Alexander stopped to take in everything, tendrils of golden draconic flames constantly swirling into his body as he seemed like an untouchable existence!","The Purple Lotus shone brighter with every passing second as soon enough...","\"The Seventh Layer!\"","A somber shout echoed out from a Ninth Firmament Royal Human that closely observed the change.","And in another few seconds...","\"The Eighth Layer!\"","BZZZT!","The words contained disbelief even as they came out, but the changes were undeniable as more and more Runic Ecritures of <LIFE> began to bloom and surround the figure protectively!","Back in the Cosmic Holy Land, Noah was spending a significant amount of time having every part of his body refined by the golden Vestigial Flames, the blazing heat melting the nearby space as it surged into his very marrows and forged him like molten iron.","The Runic Kainos Mana Lines of Ascendancy truly made everything possible with getting a second Physique as when all of the countless lines over his body were filled with golden flames...yet another layer was torn as the Ninth Layer of the Burgeoning Limit Breaking Extreme Physique was attained.","OOOM!","Astounding power crackled on every part of Noah's body as the most fundamental change yet was occurring right now!","His very origin and Cosmos were painted and refined by the golden Vestigial Flames as his Royal Cosmos were burned with a golden hue, the power they emanated being terrifying as his Physique was further changed inside out.","Near the very top of the Vestigial Flames Mountain, Pure-Blooded Cardinal Royal Humans watched breathlessly as in the next moment, cylindrical rays of golden light began to shoot out from the Purple Lotus as it began to break down- this blinding light only increasing in intensity as in mere moments...","HOOOOONG!","A blinding, pure, and majestic Golden Lotus appeared.","It was full of life and utmost wonder as it surged with essence into the body below it, granting it a shocking significance as it meant the Tenth Layer of the Burgeoning Limit Breaking Extreme Physique was achieved!","One must know...not even a minute had passed.","So what took others a million years to do...Noah took less than a minute to accomplish!","Of course, it didn't just happen out of nowhere as many astounding factors had to be in play that no other beings could have achieved- but it was still a ridiculous achievement to have on his shoulder as the audience watching this event on the Vestigial Flames Mountain were utterly silent.","It wasn't that they hadn't seen an existence with a completed Burgeoning Limit Breaking Extreme Physique before- they had actually seen a decent amount of Ninth Firmament Tyrants achieve it over the billions of years!","They just hadn't seen one be completed in a minute.","What an astounding foundation one had to have to make this possible!","And if one could have built such a foundation before they broke their shackles and formed their Reality Passages? Ah!","Many shook their heads in amazement as they prepared to get to know who this being still surrounded by raging golden flames was, when they finally noticed the discrepancy as...","\"Why are the Vestigial Flames still surging towards him?\"","...!","Shock dawned in their eyes as it very quickly turned to understanding.","In the 9 Runic Ecritures of Modus Operandi within the Bloodline Ecriture Repository, there were 3 methods to refine one's Physique!","One entirely relied on any Vestigial Flames, while the Chassis and Relegator's Limit Breaking Extreme Physique could be attained with other means as the alternative was to start with Blue Vestigial Flames and the Physiques could be completed if one could withstand the golden flames!","This was why it was mainly known that Legends would take their time to make a trip to the Vestigial Flames Mountain to bathe in Golden flames and add these additional Physiques into their bodies and origins...but nobody had expected a Ninth Firmament existence to begin displaying such a scene today.","Those watching didn't even dare to pose the question of whether his body could withstand multiple Physiques as they could only watch breathlessly when the surging golden flames were beckoned by the magisterial figure to surge into his body with even more fervor.","Two Physiques were completed on his body as for his paramount foundation, he wouldn't stop here!","Two more would be forged today as just with them in place, tens of Reality Passages were guaranteed as the moment his main body woke from its slumber...his own Runic Ecriture of Modus Operandi would begin its design as he was becoming more and more ready to break his own shackles!","—","Meanwhile, another True Sanguine Clone was making progress in a unique dimension as this clone was accompanied by the exquisite figure of RUINATION.","A resplendent robe with the runic ecriture reading <RUINATION> draped over the back of this Quasi-TABOO Relic as she stood beside Noah while they were surrounded by crystalline mirrors all around them, with their path having been crossing through countless areas like this where the crystalline mirrors parted way as they forged forward.","The clone beside RUINATION was emitting wondrous waves of power at this moment as the pulsing of illusory Runic Kainos Mana Lines of Ascendancy could be seen on its body while Runic Ecritures reading <LIFE> and <MANA> surrounded him with constant hums as if they were paying homage to his body!","An illusory Golden Lotus representing yet another completed Physique could be seen on his forehead as both he and RUINATION had come to a stop while wading through the new environment of the Mirror Dimension.","They came to a stop because this time, they finally came across something different from the crystalline movable mirror like structures as before their very eyes, they could see a fantastical scene.","Looking entirely similar to RUINATION and Noah's devilishly handsome figure, two existences that could be termed their clones stepped out of the countless mirrors and stared at them with terrifying glares emanating glorious power!"]},{"number":1683,"title":"Chapter 1683: Chapter 1682 Chosen Emperor! l","paragraphs":["Chapter 1682 Chosen Emperor! l","Portions of Noah's souls were spread out across the veils of Dimensions under the Infinite Dream- these souls following the intricate weaving of the Dream Dimension with the vast Realities to achieve unbelievable results!","They crossed vast distances in short periods of time as with the pull of destiny, they landed into their respective Realities.","There were 999 portions of souls, and most of them would come to land within Emerging Realities as a few...would have the chance for even more fantastical Realities out there!","Dozens of souls were able to follow the weaving of destiny and the Essence of the Dream Dimension to land within Prime Realities, and then there was a single other notable soul that didn't land in an Emerging nor Prime Reality.","A single soul that after crossing the veils of Dimensions and crossing the folding of space with Dream Essence, it came to and began to wake as it saw its foreign surroundings.","Bleak.","This was the only word to describe everything around this area as while Noah's soul woke and spread its awareness out, he saw thin wisps of essence all around as the shocking thing was the fact that his soul felt immense restrictions pressing down from all around even though there was barely any essence in the surroundings!","SHAAA!","His soul formed into a body as seeing the stellar darkness all around him, Noah waved his hands as the authority of the Dictum Emperor and Commandment bloomed out- a golden book appearing along with wisps of Commandment as he voiced out.","\"Where am I right now?\"","<You have arrived into a Forgotten Reality, Master.>","...!","A Forgotten Reality!","A visage from the Olden Times- from a past Era that if anyone came across such a Reality that had survived countless eons...they would come to find many secrets hidden within!","As Noah's will began to propel outwards, he came across broken and shattered stellar bodies, barren space, and ancient structures until finally...","BZZZT!","\"Hmm?\"","His will enveloped a region that rebuffed him right away as it came across an aged domain filled with the Essence of vicissitude!","Olden structures rose and fell behind it as Noah couldn't get to see past this region, his eyes sharpening as he felt a billowing beastial aura emanate from this location.","Arcs of stellar light bloomed from his body as with a golden book in hand that had begun to write golden words on its pages, Noah went towards the source of power of a Forgotten Reality that he had just arrived in!","—","OOOM!","The unique air of the Mirror Dimension sang with incoherent sounds as the forming and shattering on countless mirrors could be heard at all times.","The Clone that had ventured into this Dimension finally came across something unique as in the Dream Dimension, Noah had rebuffed a Nightmare Sand Emperor and attained an ultimate skill, and the Clone that had pulled upon the strings of the Primordial Blacklist had a Legion heading towards him at this moment.","Then there were also the Clones forging Relics and Elixirs in the Cosmic Holy Land while utilizing the robust Sacred Herbs and Plants that were spread out over many Galaxies!","A change now happened for the Clone in the Mirror Dimension as he stared at the exact replica of himself and RUINATION, the details of these creatures rising before his eyes.","<Mirror Beast King>:: An Amalgamation of self and nonself concepts that is kept alive by the Essence of the Mirror Dimension. It can mimic the qualities and concepts of any existence to the extent that its soul can handle, with it being capable of taking on the identity of the existence it mimicked if they can entirely defeat the original. It can naturally mirror the concepts and abilities of its enemies the more it gazes and observes their Essence, until they reach a state where they are even stronger than their chosen target....","BZZZT!","Mirror Beast Kings! Existences that were at this very moment actually copying Noah and RUINATION, with their level of mimicking only rising over time as they became more familiar with the Essence emanating from the two of them!","Yet Noah only looked at the Mirror Beast King that looked just like him with coldness as he seemed to be looking at himself with something major being out of place.","His laid back look caused the Mirror Beast King mimicking him to growl out dangerously, its body beginning to give off terrifying waves of power at the Ninth Firmament of Ascendancy as a close replication of the Essence of Apocalypse and Resplendent Emperor among others began to emanate from it!","It was truly copying the concepts of its as such a beast posed great dangers in the Mirror Dimension for many, with it knowing one's concepts and moves the most as more often than not, they would attain victory and rise in power.","Yet Noah only looked coldly at this creature as he voiced out dominantly.","\"A mere King dares to mimic my qualities and concepts?!\"","HOOONG!","Only his will surged out as the Mirror Beast King roared out in a similar manner to match Noah, its eyes actually beginning to shine in devilish excitement as it sensed the overabundance of Concepts that Noah had- concepts that it was now mimicking rapidly!","Its soul cheered on at finding such an exemplary enemy with so many concepts to mimic as just when this Mirror Beast King was reaching even greater levels of power, its smile began to fade.","It realized the concepts it was mimicking from this being...there were simply too many and of too high of quality!","Too many Quasi-TABOO Nomological Edicts for its soup to hold! Too many intricate Primordial Epitaphs and Bloodlines that in a matter of moments...","\"Huh?\"","The body of the Mirror Beast King mimicking Noah began to balloon outwards unstably as its soul began to tremble and crack from the sheer number of Concepts it was trying to mimic!","The rage of mimicking was so fast that when this creature noticed, it was already too late as the soup strength of another being was the one thing Mirror Beasts could not replicate, and the soul of this creature simply could not handle the concepts of the body it tried to copy.","So before Noah even made a move...","BOOM...CRACK!","The figure of the Mirror Beast King inflated like a balloon as it exploded into countless mirror shards soon after.","\"...\"","Intense silence descended after such a reality as the remaining Mirror Beast King mimicking RUINATION shook with rising terror in its eyes!"]},{"number":1684,"title":"Chapter 1684: Chapter 1683 Chosen Emperor! ll","paragraphs":["Chapter 1683 Chosen Emperor! ll","<An Astounding Achievement! Your concepts have exceeded the mimicking abilities of Mirror Beast Kings as the implosion of one has extracted the ultimate ability- Mirror Beast Summon!>","A prompt rose before Noah's eyes that turned towards the remaining Mirror Beast King.","He still didn't make a move as the figure of RUINATION floated forward serenely. Her crimson gold robe fluttered in the unique space as her emotionless eyes came close until eventually, the Mirror Beast King that looked exactly the same as her was right before her!","The eyes of this Mirror Beast were shaking after the sudden death of its ally, and it actually remained frozen in place as the fair hands of RUINATION rose to land on its cheek, the authority of an undeniable Quasi-TABOO Relic that could easily manipulate Mirror Essence erupting out as the figure of the Mirror Beast King...began to shatter into shards of Mirror pieces soon after.","This was the stage of power that Noah had achieved.","This was his progress as after meeting creatures for the first time in the Mirror Dimension and defeating them, making headway to find what he needed would be all that much easier!","—","\"This is someone you brought over?\"","A voice filled with calmness echoed out within an expansive hall of a crystalline skyscraper the size of a Reality that was floating in space and surrounded by a sparkling multicolored circular shield of light that constantly gave out pulses of power.","Runic Ecritures constantly swirled over this dome-like structure containing the reality-sized fantasy skyscraper within, each of them vibrant with ecritures of defense that would make it hard for any Ninth Firmament existences to break through it!","This...was the Peninsula Observatory at the very deepest parts of Pure Blooded Domains of the Royal Humans that oversaw all the clusters of Realities in this region- a place that the most prided rulers and even at times LEGENDS could be seen moving within!","At this moment, the one who spoke was a middle aged man with boundless charm and power, a solidified crown spinning calmly above his head as he emanate intense authority and regality. He was draped with a golden emperor's robe as vibrant dark hair washed over his shoulders, his jaws sharp as his eyes were naturally curved into a smile that released sparks of power.","His aura was stably at the very peak of the Ninth Firmament of Ascendancy as he could overcome the thin barrier to Reality whenever he wanted, and he was actually repressing himself for the past billions of years as he took on the task of the Bloodline Master of the Pure-Blood Cardinal Royal Human Bloodline!","Yet even with such a stature, this being was actually standing at this moment as there was another existence sitting down and emanating multiple times more authority atop a crystalline white throne.","The Bloodline Master was standing beside this being as he addressed a respective Empress Genevieve who nodded at this moment with humility- seeming nothing like the prideful Empress who was a shocking personage in the past! He had asked a question while looking at a small illusory screen among millions of screens on the walls of the expansive hall they were in- this illusory screen showing the scene of the events occurring in the Vestigial Flames Mountain that showed a single existence swallowing raging golden flames.","\"Yes, Father. An Enlightened Peerless Alchemist who also happens to have great talent and destiny. I figured he would make a great commander under me and elevate our Bloodline even further.\"","...!","She spoke like a dutiful daughter as none of the hatred she had for the whole Pure-Blooded Cardinal Royal Human Bloodline was shown, nobody being the wiser that LEGENDS of this Bloodline had eradicated her and kept her body and Origin for their own use too many years ago!","She was biding her time as she acted in an exemplary fashion, being one of the few remaining candidates in line to obtain the title of the Bloodline Master as with such an authority, she could gain access to where her body and origin were being held for all these years as when that time came...","\"It is an interesting creature with an above average destiny. From the Celestial Vine Bloodline, hm? Have him undergo the Bloodline Baptism to tie him to us. Will you be taking him as one of your Guards to the Unexplored Grotto Sanctum?\"","BZZZT!","An even more authoritative voice rung out as it didn't stem from the Bloodline Master, but the being that had temporarily taken a seat on the white crystalline throne as this being...released shocking cascading waves of the undeniable authority of a LEGEND!","\"Yes, Uncle Brightborn. He was near the stage of A Legend's Visage as after refining his body in the Vestigial Flames Mountain, he should stably be there as he will ensure my safety while seeking Destiny.\"","...!","She spoke freely to a LEGEND who sat on the white throne curiously, this being actually not looking like an old or middle aged man as he seemed like a barely matured boy above 15 years of age! Yet the power he released was undeniable as his hair shone with a dark luster, simple black robes draping over him as he nodded.","\"Mmm. But...you already take it upon yourself to grant your people access to our Ecritures even without seeking permission, little Gen? You know that you haven't attained the title of Bloodline Master yet!\"","This being had a smile on his face as he spoke with a teasing expression, Empress Genevieve smiling shyly as she replied while bowing.","\"I apologize for my impudence, Uncle. I'll be more careful next time!\"","\"Haha, it is merely the Legacy that the great OPPENHEIMER left behind. It is no problem sharing it with our people. Now, onto the Legions that assassinated our Bloodline Candidate Rulers...\"","The topic quickly moved on to what they considered important matters as Genevieve nodded while seemingly listening with all her focus, but her mind was actually swirling with thoughts and plans surrounding the one being they had just talked about.","Alexander King!","Such beings like him existed in the past as they held their own title and standing.","Very few beings knew such things as it was rarely talked about publicly, but these beings were truly special as they stood above many others, and Genevieve had affirmed her beliefs to Alexander being such a being after observing him all this time and his recent actions as she now fully attached to him a certain title.","Chosen Emperor!","Beings that were exceedingly blessed by Destiny that others could only look on in envy at the things they accomplished- they were known as Chosen Emperors as they were the ones who held the most lead in attaining the authority of a True Emperor.","Such beings were extremely special, but they were also great targets precisely due to their identity.","Killing such beings...was incredibly hard due to their Destiny as Genevieve knew this very well!","And this was precisely why Genevieve had cemented him as a target.","After everything she saw, she still only further solidified her mind to devour the entirety of this being! Yes, she had her pride as an existence that even had LEGENDS for servants in the past as she had underestimated Alexander greatly in the past. Other beings would even choose to forge an alliance with an existence that had such a Destiny, but Genevieve still chose the option of conflict!","This was because the boons of swallowing a Chosen Emperor was obtaining their Destiny and talent for yourself as if Genevieve got her hands on this and paired it with the foundation and knowledge she had...the seat of the True Emperor of the Kainos Era might actually be achievable.","\"....\"","It would be extremely hard.","Killing Chosen Emperors was something only powerful LEGENDS had managed to achieve, and it was mostly through schemes and betrayals!","But after seeing everything she had about Alexander King...Genevieve wanted to take on this task as she would do whatever it took to achieve it!"]},{"number":1685,"title":"Chapter 1685: Chapter 1684 Chosen Emperor! lll","paragraphs":["Chapter 1684 Chosen Emperor! lll","Empress Genevieve put a heavy task before her as she knew this extremely well. This was because she had seen how this being had played with Ninth Firmament Enders and Will Bearers with ease while utilizing this body that was a mere clone!","And apart from this clone, he had also shown 2 other Clones that had appeared to finish up the whole battle a few days ago.","Genevieve put all of this into account and then the main body of this being as well...and she still took on the task of locating and devouring this being with a level of self-confidence as even with all the astounding reserves of Destiny and resources that were at the hands of this Chosen Emperor, she knew herself best!","She knew the resources she held and what power she could call forth...so long as certain conditions were met.","There was still something she could do that would ensure victory even against a Chosen Emperor as obscene as this with all his resources and secrets- something that would allow her to wipe out anyone that had yet to forge a Reality!","'Very few can dance expertly on the river of Destiny...and I have been dancing for a long time. Let us see who shall remain on the stage when the dust settles!'","WAA!","Her thoughts were dominating and wild as she affirmed her will, watching the scenes of the Vestigial Flames Mountain where the being in question was actually going towards refining the other two Limit Breaking Extreme Physiques right here.","Physiques that due to him completing them before he broke his shackles would guarantee a crazy number of Reality Passages.","'Something so ridiculous is reminiscent of the foundation of those in the Olden Times, and it should near the current publicly known Chosen Emperors as well...'","Yes! There were a few beings living in these vast realities at this point in time who were known to be Chosen Emperors as they could move countless beings with a single wave of their hands.","Some were the strongest combatants below the stage of LEGENDS, and then there were genuine LEGENDS themselves that were Chosen Emperors.","Before Noah reached such a stage as well, Genevieve hoped to strike at that time as for now, she focused on the two figures of regal beings before her and what they brought to attention!","\"This time, it won't just be us as the Scions of the other Four Pure-Blooded Cardinal Royal Bloodlines will also be joining this venture.\"","The LEGEND who had the body of a mere 15 year old spoke as above the head of this being, a sparkling solidified crown similar to the one above the Bloodline Master was spinning beautifully.","His figure emanated constant power and authority as light and space seemed to be warping around his body constantly, his dominant eyes shining with the light of an illusory Reality as he tapped his finger on the White crystalline throne before continuing.","\"This is why I dropped by here to brief you all. I've already talked to Little Katelyn and the others on what they need to look out for in this Unexplored Grotto Sanctum, and now you are the last one, Little Gen.\"","SHAA!","Vibrant destiny erupted out as Genevieve nodded with seriousness while facing the gaze of a LEGEND whose eyes flashed with ingenuity!","\"I understand, Uncle Brightborn. What do I need to be on the lookout for?\"","Within the Unexplored Grotto Sanctum filled with opportunities and destinies where those at the peak of the Ninth Firmament who had been accumulating destiny and establishing their foundation could go on to break their last shackles and achieve the stage of Reality!","This was the purpose of all those entering, but this was still a Grotto Sanctum that LEGENDS normally explored.","\"Places such as these have untold dangers within them precisely due to how packed they were with fortune and destiny, where even its surrounding atmosphere is so packed with unique types of Essence that some of the entering beings will choose to and can finally break into Reality the moment they arrive. So your enemies won't just be A Legend's Visage...but you will more than likely come across Genuine LEGENDS trying to hinder you.\"","...!","The LEGEND Brightborn spoke of such matters calmly as Genevieve nodded and continued to listen.","\"This is why you all must group together and reinforce each other. With the capabilities of someone like Katelyn in the lead, you all will be capable of escaping from a LEGEND as the moment any of you find the chance to break through, you can move much more freely. For you it is even more difficult as this journey can help you build your ultimate foundation...but you can choose not to break through if you still seek the title of Bloodline Master when you return.\"","A myriad of thoughts came out from the LEGEND as he advised on the journey to come, eventually arriving at the true topic and purpose of his visit today as he spoke of what he told Katelyn and all the others since he arrived.","\"Lastly...and the thing I want you all to be on the lookout for, is this.\"","BZZZZT!","Arcs of multicolored light bloomed out as Brightborn waved his hands and caused a blindingly dazzling item to appear in his hands.","It sucked in all the surroundings grandeur as it announced itself to be more majestic than even the aura of the LEGEND holding it- the item being a circular crystal that held a swirling multicolored river of Reality constantly swirling within it!","\"A Grotto Nacre...\"","OOOOM!","The mere mention of this wondrous piece of art in his hands caused it to buzz and reinvigorate the Origins of all those here as it released a wondrous multicolored light, even the eyes of the LEGEND bring covered by a mesmerizing light as he held onto this circular pearl of multicolored light and continued.","\"The reason that many LEGENDS explore Grotto Sanctums and fight over them are these Grotto Nacres, and you all will actually have the chance to obtain these treasures that may not be of much use to you now- but are indispensable when you are LEGENDS!\"","...!"]},{"number":1686,"title":"Chapter 1686: Chapter 1685 From Dream to Reality! l","paragraphs":["Chapter 1685 From Dream to Reality! l","\"If you come across a Grotto Nacre or anything like it and bring it out, you can turn it into to me to get anything you wish for.\"","...!","WAP!","The pearl holding a swirling multicolored crystal faded away from few as the LEGEND Brightborn finished his words.","Grotto Nacre.","It was an item that Genevieve was familiar with as she also sought such items in the past herself after the proliferation of Realities!","'Why would I hand them over to you when I can utilize them myself?'","She sneered inwardly as she thought, but she kept her outward gaze of respect while nodding.","\"I understand. The path this time will be dangerous, but I don't see any complications...even if the time comes that we have to fight off the other Bloodlines!\"","...!","The other Bloodlines participating in this prized event. It didn't just involve the Reality Ursidae, Infinite Willow Trees, and the Royal Humans whose Legends had located the chosen Unexplored Grotto Sanctum- it would also include the Scions of the Dragon Phoenix Bloodline and lastly, the Primordial Bloodline that occupied the unshakable top position...the Pure-Blooded Cardinal Royal Astral Bloodline!","Existences whose very origins stemmed from stellar concepts and constructs as traversing through the stages of power was easy for them.","Winged celestial beings whose very bodies exhumed the light of Cosmos and Realities as on the leaderboard of Primordials, they stood at the very peak!","The 5 Pure-Blooded Cardinal Royal Bloodlines were all under the banner of Primordials, but they still had loyalty to their own Bloodlines as when they entered the Unexplored Grotto Sanctum, conflict would break out amongst themselves as some might even face death from their very own people.","Among those who would be entering, the most feared and respected were the Scions of the Dragon Phoenix Bloodlines for their brutality, the Scions of the Reality Ursidae for their unreasonable and immovable righteousness, and the Scions of the Astral Bloodline that were simply because they were the face of Primordials that even other Primordial Bloodlines feared going against them.","The Infinite Willow Trees were also extremely powerful as they would have made it among those most feared, but their nature was more gentle and reclusive as they kept to themselves- making it so that one would rarely have conflict with them unless they really sought it!","Pure-Blooded Cardinal Royal Humans were in between as even with their robust Physiques, they weren't the most feared amongst the Pure-Blooded Cardinal Bloodlines.","But even with this knowledge, Genevieve's mind still focused on the Scions of the Astral Bloodline.","'If I happen to isolate one of them or even a Reality Ursidae, it would also be extremely helpful to devour them...'","...!","These were the thoughts crossing Genevieve's mind as if she could devour these beings as well and create a stupendous foundation, she could also take another path and forgo her candidacy to become a Bloodline Ruler as she forged her Reality and became a LEGEND within this Unexplored Grotto Sanctum- which would also grant her a level of authority to access where they hid her body!","There were many paths one could take as the workings of destiny would decide which one would be followed, the specifics of the upcoming expedition continuing to be discussed within the Peninsula Observatory as outside of this location, events continued to unfold.","—","In the Vestigial Flames Mountain, Noah was near the very peak as his body constantly devoured Golden Vestigial Flames- beginning to refine the Chassis and Relegator's Limit Breaking Extreme Physiques as he was truly going on the path of building his ultimate foundation!","An unsurpassable foundation that even the most talented Primordials could not compare to- and then exceed that even further!","For this, Noah didn't just plan on completing the Physiques he had obtained so far as going past that- he wanted to forge his own Physique that would help him attain the largest number of Reality Passages before he broke his shackles.","A Physique to topple all others as he just had to base the body, Origin, and Soul Refinement that he had been seeing so far with something entirely his own.","The Essence of the Dictum Emperor and Tyrannical Emperor were dancing wildly in his mind for the possibilities of how he could do it as he experienced the refinement of golden flames atop the Vestigial Flames Mountain, and the answer actually led to the Third Construct of his Infinite System!","He had Infinite Resources and Infinite Dream...and he now wanted a Physique that would continue to refine his body endlessly.","Why did there have to be a stopping point at 100% refinement?","Why couldn't there be continued strengthening and refinement over time?!","WAA!","The thought alone caused wild waves of Destiny to churn chaotically as what was left behind was figuring out a feasible way of doing it.","Nearly all of the existences in the Firmaments of Ascendancy played with Systems in a certain way- whether it was by the passive strengthening of their bodies and souls, methods of altering reality to boost abilities in a certain field, or in unique ways like Noah was doing to forge his Infinite System with droves of the Essence of Reality and Mana.","Barely any of the Systems of the beings Noah had killed so far had come close to matching the ones he had made or something as unique as the Necromancer System or Idle Gaming System that Eckert had- showing how wide of a range there was to the effectiveness and power of Systems! For other beings, it was merely auxiliary to their power as it didn't play a major part in their lives, and for other beings like Noah- it could fundamentally change how they operated and how they snatched Destiny!","At this moment in time, all that was left was for Noah to ponder on exactly how to forge a technique of Limit Breaking Extreme Physique Refinement into his concept of System as it would be harder and more arduous than the previous constructs he had made.","But with his Destiny, he could already see that it was possible...and there was a certain dimension he could utilize to aid him in doing just this.","The dimension where there was little distinction between false and real, between dream and reality!","The answers for the endlessly refining physique lay...in the Dream Dimension!"]},{"number":1687,"title":"Chapter 1687: Chapter 1686 From Dream to Reality! ll","paragraphs":["Chapter 1686 From Dream to Reality! ll","In the hazy space filled with silver spicules of sand.","The figure of Noah's 1,000th soul could be seen as his fair hands were dancing mesmerizingly, the silver sand in the surroundings falling under his control with ease as they rose and fell under his will!","This...was all due to <Sandman> that he had attained after withstanding the will of the Nightmare Sand Emperor.","<Sandman>:: An ability that grants the authority of Dream Manipulation, with the user gaining a level of control of the Sands of Dreams within the Dream Dimension. With this authority, they can also intrude upon, shape, and manipulate the dreams of others. When proficient enough and a sufficient price is paid, the user's manipulated dreams can even affect outside Reality as the barrier between what is real and what is false becomes a thin distinction. The inhabitants of the Dream Dimension are more visible to you as Lines of Dreams can be drawn from you and what you dream to achieve. Sandman is only a preliminary ability for those proficient in traversing the Dream Dimension, and there are ways possible to obtain even higher authorities that can make dreams indistinguishable from reality...","A wondrous ability that allowed Noah to move across the Dream Dimensions more easily, and the one that made him recall the words of the Nightmare Sand Emperor over and over again!","<Dreams can make kings and Emperors. Dreams give reason for anything that others do across Realities and dimensions.>","Dreams could make Emperors as they even gave reason for every action that an existence took!","A father dreams of taking care of his family and keeping them safe, so he goes to work day in and day out.","A man dreams of wealth, power, and women...and so he moves to make such a thing achievable!","A woman dreams of having power and authority to not need protection from others...so she does everything to make that possible!","Everyone has dreams as they base what they do on these abstract concepts, with some failing to achieve their dreams as others...eventually achieve everything as they make their dreams into Reality.","Noah wanted to make his dreams into reality in the truest sense as he affirmed it was somewhat difficult for him to forge the Infinite Resources and Infinite Dream Construct- but he was able to do it as he already had concepts that contributed to their making.","The concept of an ever evolving Physique that affected the number of Reality Passages he would form, his Origin, his current strength and future strength, and ultimately the type of foundation he would forge...it was a task that required too many achievements as large reserves of the Essence of Reality would not be enough to bring it to fruition!","And this was where the Essence and concept of the Dream Dimension came in.","The Essence of a Dimension that could make one's Dream into a Reality would be what Noah would include in the Primordial Epitaph for the second Construct of the Infinite System!","It was also something he had to use in the near future as he also developed his own Runic Ecriture of Modus Operandi.","All knowledge and laid down rules stated how the breaking of one's shackles opened the pathway to a certain number of Reality Passages.","Did Noah also have to abide by these restrictions? Did he truly have to put a cap on the number of Reality Passages he could have?!","OOOM!","Destiny flowed and ebbed powerfully with these thoughts as Noah's eyes in the infinitesimally small region of the Dream Dimension shone.","\"First, let's locate Golden Sand...\"","<Sandman> was activated in full as Essence of Reality began to be pulled upon from the far away slumbering main body, Lines of Dreams emanating from Noah as they shot into the mass of silver sand and sought out the treasures of the Dream Dimension!","—","In a region of space within the Boundary Between Realities.","Another one of Noah's clones could be seen floating in space calmly, situated in a meditative position as his hand was resting on his chin while looking forward expectantly.","He had been waiting like this for quite some time as his body released hidden waves of destiny, the direction he was looking at being where his destiny told him his targets would come from as soon enough...","OOOOM!","The allure of an enormous cerulean disk like vessel could be seen tearing apart through space, moving unknown light years every second as within moments, it covered everything in Noah's field of vision.","It gave off the aura of a Primordial Relic as atop this disc like vessel, one could find waves of immense coldness permeating throughout as dozens of figures of Seventh Firmament cerulean blue Royal Wolves could be seen!","Their bodies gave off ferocious glints as their fur sparkled in the dark space, a wolf larger than all others standing in front of this small Legion as he stepped out with regality and looked at Noah.","\"Noah Osmont! You shall be questioned and then killed for contributing to the death of Princess Snow. Make it easier by revealing the rest of your associates...and we will make it painless!\"","HOOOONG!","The Legion sent out by the Royal Wolf Bloodline had arrived after Noah dropped some leads for them to follow, and Noah looked at the force made of 50 Seventh Firmament Royal Wolves as it would have definitely been overkill for any other Seventh Firmament Blacklister.","But for him...","\"Mmm, I will also make it painless.\"","BZZZZT!","While still seated in a meditative position, Noah's hands motioned downwards while his body erupted with just 10 dazzling golden Ascendancy Halos.","For the enemies before him, he didn't even need a tenth of the true power he could dish out currently as the Limit Breaking Extreme Mana Physique alone granted an extra 100 Base True Reality Damage Values to all his attacks, LETHE granted another 100 through OBLIVION, and now the newly refined Burgeoning Limit Breaking Extreme Physique that caused Runic Ecritures of <LIFE> to swirl around him...this also granted another 100 to True Reality Damage and even 150 to True Reality Defense Values!"]},{"number":1688,"title":"Chapter 1688: Chapter 1687 From Dream to Reality! lll","paragraphs":["Chapter 1687 From Dream to Reality! lll","<Burgeoning Limit Breaking Extreme Physique>:: Refined under the Vestigial Flames of a Grotto Sanctum Core, your body has been reborn from Flames as your very cells exude immense vitality. Runic Ecritures of <LIFE> begin to naturally form and rotate around you as each one passively protects you from incoming True Reality Damage Values and grants 10% Total Vitality and Health Regeneration every microsecond. Due to the Extreme boundaries your body has reached under this refinement, a base 100 True Reality Damage Values and 150 True Reality Defense Values is granted to all abilities and attacks...","A stupendous boost from the Burgeoning Limit Breaking Extreme Physique as Noah expected a similar level of boost from the Chassis and Relegator's Limit Breaking Extreme Physiques that he was still refining with the Golden Vestigial Flames at this very moment!","As he looked at the huge figures of Royal Wolves before his eyes, he merely utilized the authority of 10 Ascendancy Halos as he didn't even show their true colors, beckoning down with his mere finger as far above the glacial disc vessel, space began to rupture as something terrifying was called down.","\"<Ascendant Sword of Reality>.\"","BZZT!","An ability that at its base value, it only dealt 20 True Reality Damage Values. But when accounting for the additional 100 Values from the Runic Kainos Mana Lines of Ascendancy and an additional 100 from the Burgeoning Limit Breaking Extreme Physique, along with the boosts of the Quasi-TABOO Relics that Noah wore...it was to even think about as his TABOO Relic's boosts were not yet even counted!","But he did not even need to activate <Oblivion> as just from a single cast with the authority of 1 Ascendancy Halo that held a 100x multiplier...the damage exceeded the minimum threshold for one to be capable of erasing the natural laws of Reality.","One didn't even have to destroy their minds imagining the damage output with all of his 20 Ascendancy Halos fused to him and what their ridiculous total multiplier would be as just this...was more than enough for dozens of Seventh Tier Existences.","OOOOM!","The space above them tore and cried out as the tip of a sword blazing with the light of a Reality pierced through, enlarging with every microsecond as before it even arrived, it already bore down immense weight and pressure towards their targets!","The cerulean blue fur on the Royal Wolves rose up in fright as they were only able to send their wills and eyes up to look.","To look and see an enormous Ascendant Sword of Reality horrifically tearing apart space and making it a blank white wherever it passed, a sword five times their size as it locked them down where they couldn't even move a muscle!","The whole space shuddered and cried out as it was akin to a page being cut, the glacial vessel the Royal Wolves were on mere a mere drawing on paper as when the Ascendant Sword of Reality came down, it smoothly smashed into and cut them as if it was merely a sharp object passing through paper.","SHAAA!","An eerie sound of space being torn and turned white and the Origins of many beings shattering at once could be heard as without even moving from his spot, Noah had merely motioned with his hands as he decimated a Legion of Seventh Firmament existences.","The allure of beautiful prompts if loot rose over Noah's eyes as Shards of a Seed of Reality rolled in along with Reality Crystals and bountiful Bloodlines of Edicts that were devoured into his Unnamed Kainos Emperor Bloodline naturally, along with their Edicts that Noah could burn to elevate his soul even further!","The elevation of his soul would always continue as time passed, with him having to become even stronger as he didn't just want to stop at being capable of dividing 1000 portions of his soul when he utilized Infinite Dream.","He wanted to be able to send out thousands of portions of souls as to elevate his Infinite Reality to the next stage, thousands of fused Realities were needed!","So these dozens of Seventh Firmament existences with their many Minor, Greater, Quasi-Insuperable, and Insuperable Nomological Edicts...Noah actually considered them high tier loot simply because of the tools they provided for him to strengthen his soul.","\"Ah...\"","Billowing spatial storms ensued with utter chaos as Essence of Reality naturally seeped from the seams of surrounding space to heal the destroyed blank white area into normality, a shout actually being heard in this region of Spatial storms as the spray figure of a single Royal Wolf could be seen unharmed!","It wasn't because he was something unique or extremely strong, but...","\"You simply weren't selected as a target.\"","...!","The Ascendant Sword of Reality was utterly Cataclysmic, but it selected its targets under Noah's will as a single Royal Wolf was left behind.","Noah's True Sanguine Clone remained floating in a seated position in space as, his arm coming to stroke his chin calmly and with a devilish smile as he spoke to the trembling Seventh Firmament Royal Wolf that was gazing around in utter fear and disbelief!","\"Go on. Tell them what happened here. Let's see what more you all can bring.\"","....!","A direct challenge was cast out at this moment as the instant Noah's words landed, the Royal Wolf turned into a streak of blue light as he ran away fearfully while looking back every microsecond- as if a cruel devil had its eyes on his back that could pounce on him at any moment!","The tides of destiny flowed serenely as Noah simply watched the retreating figure, closing his eyes and going through the newly gained Edicts to see if any concepts held unique ideas for him to forge into his own better ones.","As always- he could continue to try and improve!","As this clone waited for a train of loot to come his way, the portion of soul that had actually arrived into a Forgotten Reality had arrived in the boundary of the space that leaked ancientness and oldness.","The surroundings were filled with bleakness and a pervasive black essence that made everything hard to see, but Noah's solidified soul holding the golden book could see the shocking sight of endless ruins beginning before him!","Long spanning structures that at first, one would think they were buildings- but when they looked at the shattered pieces of these humongous structures...they would actually notice them to similarly match to body parts and bones.","Mountainous skulls of different species as vast as Cosmos.","Somehow a preserved and pulsing heart the size of a universe leaking a black fluid that formed into a sea around it!","A finger...that glimmered with the dimming light of a Reality as it was multiple Cosmos vast in size.","Boundless oddities seemed to lay before Noah's eyes as when he began floating towards this region, his soul began to buzz with activity!"]},{"number":1689,"title":"Chapter 1689: Chapter 1688 A Grave From A Past Era! l","paragraphs":["Chapter 1688 A Grave From A Past Era! l","An expanse of shocking ruins lay before Noah's eyes as each one was more wondrous than the last.","The bleak darkness filling everything was unique as when he entered the region where the ruins began, things could actually be seen more clearly as destroyed structures and body parts of ancient beings could be seen strewn all around.","Noah's solidified soul was garbed in a simple white robe as he couldn't call upon his entire strength with a mere portion of his soul, and the ruins caused everything to be enveloped with a terrifying sense of pressure that caused even him to feel a sense of suffocation!","He grasped the golden book in his hands tightly before even proceeding forward as he voiced out thoughtfully.","\"Are there any spatial restrictions similar to Forsaken Treasure Realities...?\"","OOOM!","<No, Master. This Forgotten Reality is merely located in an extremely far away pocket of space.>","\"Mmm, good.\"","His will moved out as he pulled upon the connection of his main body and locked onto the positioning of where his portion of soul was.","Each Reality was unique and held its own restrictions as the past Forsaken Treasure Reality had spatial restrictions that didn't even allow one to teleport within the Reality, much less into or out of it!","But this Forgotten Reality...did not seem to have such a restriction as this allowed Noah to call upon a True Sanguine Clone to come here. The mere portion of his soul would not be enough for what was to come as at this moment, droves of Mana and the Essence of Reality was burned in Noah's Origin, a spatial light erupting out near him as soon after, a devilishly handsome Noah with boundlessly domineering pressure stepped out of the spatial light.","SHAA!","His body was covered by Runic Kainos Mana Lines of Ascendancy and Runic Ecritures powerfully reading <MANA> and <LIFE>, his skin painted with stellar Cosmos releasing a beautiful hue of colors.","The spatial light faded around him as the portion of soul that had anchored to this location and called him over turned into a streak of light that shot into the head of the True Sanguine Clone and disappeared right after!","\"Hmmm...\" Noah felt his full strength coursing through him as he nodded, bountiful light erupting from him as 20 Black Tier Ascendancy Halos soon bloomed from his body- his clone calling upon their authority at this moment so he could move easier in this oppressively dangerous location and be ready for any threats that came.","This was a Forgotten Reality. A visage of the past contained in a vast pocket of space as it could hold treasures or secrets...or even possibly vestiges of the past that might still be alive even now!","With his preparations in place, Noah fully entered the ruins and observed everything around him, even his surging will being restricted to the areas he could see as he marveled at the oddities around him.","The strewn-out body parts that were still preserved even now.","The grand broken structures made of material he could pinpoint!","They all seemed utterly unique as Noah came in front of a pulsating heart the size of a universe that was leaking out a vile black essence that he instantly recognized to be Pandemonium.","BZZZT!","Arcs of golden light erupted from his eyes as Author's Jurisdiction and Reader's Viewpoint pulled in information on all his surroundings, a prompt rising about the heart before his eyes soon after.","<Desolate Kun Peng's Heart>:: A heart from an ancient beast that was prominent in a past Age. Its body has perished during a Cataclysmic battle, but the heart refuses to fade as it has been feeding on the Essence of Reality and the natural essence of Pandemonium it was born with to continue beating to this day. It has now fallen under the category of an Ultimate TABOO Material as it can be utilized to enhance already forged TABOO Relics, giving those Relics the chance to awaken the will and Bloodline of the race this heart belonged to. It can also be utilized as a substitute material for most required ingredients to form a TABOO Relic, with the item born also having the chance to attain a trace of the Kun Peng Bloodline if the Forger is proficient enough. Handling it is extremely hard as sufficient strength is required...","...!","A mere pulsing heart in the periphery of the ruins actually turned out to be the heart of a being that held an ancient Bloodline Noah had yet to even hear of- Kun Peng!","His eyes brightened up as he wondered about the other things around him, his eyes coming to land on the skulls and bones around him stretching the size of Universes or Cosmos, along with the finger that glimmered with the dimming light of a Reality that was multiple Cosmos vast in size.","<Appendage of the Ruined Emperor>:: A finger from a fallen Emperor whose destiny exceeded most others in his Age. It has fallen to the ravages of time as all the remaining destiny has been condensed into it, its core holding the pervasive Will of the Ruined Emperor as it can be activated two times to release this will onto one's enemies. Each activation will require 100,000 Units of the Essence of Reality as it activates <The Ruined Will of the Reality Crusher> that rages out a base True Reality Damage Value of 1,000-5,000. Depending on the caster's authority and power, the released will of the Ruined Emperor can cause damage as low as A Legend's Visage and as high as a powerful attack of a beginner LEGEND...","...!","Another item with shocking history and usage appeared as a mere finger that could potentially release an attack of a LEGEND!","It was something wild as even Noah's Keystone Ascendant Skill Tree held some abilities that at their base only held a range of 5 or 20 Base True Reality Damage Values.","It was the authority of his Ascendancy Halos that came through to multiply this damage Value to crazy levels- and this was how it worked for everyone else!","All of the existences in the Firmaments of Ascendancy relied on the authority of their Halos formed by their Flames of Edicts to multiply the damage of their abilities, with the higher tier Halos like Noah's Black Ascendancy Halos having much higher damage and defense value Multipliers.","This was why in the highest stage of the Firmaments of Ascendancy and for those beginning their path as LEGENDS, they all strove to forge Quasi-TABOO and TABOO Nomological Edicts to attain stupendous authorities that elevated their power even higher!"]},{"number":1690,"title":"Chapter 1690: Chapter 1689 A Grave From a Past Era! ll","paragraphs":["Chapter 1689 A Grave From a Past Era! ll","Something like the <Appendage of the Ruined Emperor> that could actually only be utilized twice had a base damage value of 1,000-5,000. Depending on who utilized it...the multiplier of such damage was unbelievable as if one just said their True Reality Damage Value was 1,000x when fused with their Halos, this was Damage in the millions as it far exceeded the mere 20,000 True Reality Damage Value threshold that was required to eradicate the natural laws of Reality and form blank white space!","It was enough to be considered a saving talisman for any existence that had yet to become a LEGEND as Noah reached out for it right away.","\"Come!\"","HOOONG!","His will barreled out greedily as he reached out for both this and the Desolate Kun Peng's Heart, his will wrapping around them to bring them into his Expansive Space when...","BZZZT!","Baleful black arcs of light rebuffed his will the moment he imposed it on the items to call them onto him- these arcs of light utterly inviolable as they dissipated all of Noah's surrounding will in an instant!","\"...\"","Noah stared forward with shining eyes at such a result as he cracked his neck and stretched his body soon after, ready to explode to attain what he wanted as it seemed that nothing would ever be so easy.","But a moment later...","<Interesting.>","BOOOM!","A maddening voice full of Age and ancientness boomed out from all around!","<You are the 188th being to have fallen into this grave that buried many fools eons ago.>","...!","Noah's eyes released Resplendent rays of light as his Ascendancy Halos retreated into his body to fuse with him right away, his soul feeling a shocking level of threat from this voice alone while it seemed nonchalant!","<You have no need to worry. I am merely a will that is hard to kill even with time, and I am just preserving the remains of old friends. Since destiny has drawn you here, I will give you the same options I gave the others. Withstand my <Aged Remembrance> and learn about the history of those who fell here...and you shall be allowed to leave with 5 Remnant Relics like the ones you were reaching out to.>","WAA!","Noah was already erupting with an aurora of wings and into the true form of a Samsara Cosmic Dao Origin when these words booked out calmly, his will convening with his Origin as he found no falsehood within these words that didn't seem to have a source!","<I will also give you a warning that some others have ignored. Even LEGENDS have fallen into this grave as they tried to desecrate the remains of those here and go against my will, and this is the result...>","HOOONG!","The stable ruins filled with age shocking began to shift and move as further inside the ruins, structures were moved aside as others were brought forward!","What came forward this time was truly dreadful as the figure of an existence split in half could be seen, a shattered river of Reality still dazzling with incandescent light cleanly cleaving in two being visible on their chest.","The figure was humanoid as it was the size of a Cosmos, its head cleanly preserved as one could see crimson horns rising from its forehead as flames still burned at the tips of these horns!","This...was a fallen LEGEND who held a look of authority and power even in death- as if he did with this look with his death being too quick for him to even notice.","BZZZT!","Soon after, the ancient ruins shifted again as another body floated forward, this time the shattered shell of an enormous turtle being seen as the Cosmos painted over it were already dim, an air of sadness and desolation surrounding it as it was another dead LEGEND!","<Withstand my <Aged Remembrance> and learn of the history of the fallen...and you can leave with 5 of what they left behind. Or leave as is and your memories of this place shall be wiped...what shall it be?>","\"...\"","The surroundings calmed.","Noah didn't bother with anything else as the only thing he convened with was his destiny.","It had never led him wrong before, and its boundless seas would not lead him wrong now as they told him...there was great fortune to be found in this Forgotten Reality, and whatever the story is that caused this to be the grave of many Legends!","The more shocking thing was that he might not be able to fuse this Reality into his Infinite Reality after everything was done as the will overseeing it...could even decimate LEGENDS!","'Let's do it...'","While fused with his Ascendancy Halos, the raging essence within his body calmed as while looking like a cluster of 10 Billion Cosmos, his will voiced out.","\"I shall withstand your <Aged Remembrance>!\"","WAA!","A voice of determination that the Aged Will overseeing everything gave an unseen nod to, the surrounding ruins beginning to shake as a black light that was painting and holding all the ruins in place shone out, coagulation together to form into a dense trapezoidal obsidian crystal that came to float in front of Noah!","A dark crystal that continued to receive the obsidian authority of this Forgotten Reality as soon after, it released a black pillar of light that shot towards Noah's body.","He didn't shake or flutter as this light sank into his mind, his form of Cosmos only shining with greater light as its vision changed.","He didn't see the ruins before his eyes anymore as a shocking image began to rise before him- a scene of boundless wonder and beauty that he had no authority to see playing out before him at this moment!","<Before the Will of Primordials changed many things, there were the Ancient Bloodlines that lorded over the vast and nigh endless singular Reality...>","Noah's soul shuddered as he was shown a scene from ages past.","A scene of an Era that had long since passed...a scene of a time before the Infinite Realities came to be!"]},{"number":1691,"title":"Chapter 1691: Chapter 1690 The Age of Destiny! l","paragraphs":["Chapter 1690 The Age of Destiny! l","<In the Ages past, there was only ever the concept of Reality.>","BZZZT!","Terrifying swirls of power and pressure of a will cascaded onto Noah's mind as he bore a heavy oppression to be shown the things he was currently seeing- this being the process of <Aged Remembrance> that one had to go through if they wanted to have the chance of taking out 5 things from this Forgotten Reality!","Noah's exceptionally strong soul bore everything as he had his Mana, Destiny, Fortune, and Essence of Reality on standby to soothe and strengthen his soul whenever the ancient will that was imposing its memories onto him became too heavy.","<The idea of Infinite Realities was not even something that danced in the minds of any beings, with Reality being something that continued to expand outwards endlessly as nobody had even found where its edges were.>","As the aged voice came down, Noah's vision opened to a scene of utter stupor as he could see an endless blue sky and an earth below whose very sand glimmered with the stellar light of stars.","It seemed to stretch out for many light years as it gave a feeling of vastness, but its endlessly expanding horizons made one feel extremely small!","If ones will stretched out for millions of light years more, they would be able to notice bright colored rifts and portals stretched throughout, hiding unknown wonders within as for some areas of the skies- there would even be a sudden transition from sky to stellar space that would go on for many more light years.","There were many words to describe the feel of the Endless skies and stellar earth, but only a single feeling came to light as Noah watched it all.","Boundless!","<Before the Olden Times ended, the last Age of Emperors was known...as the Age of Destiny.>","HOONG!","As the aged will spoke, Noah's surroundings unfurled with even more wonder as across the skies, seas of golden Essence bloomed and stretched out for light years on end, the stellar earth below rising with lush vegetation that glimmered with Universes and Cosmos.","Unique animals without conscious wills could be seen grazing on the stellar earth as their bodies were robust and the size of mountains, droves of four legged Beasts walking around the stellar earth calmly as they foraged and ate from the dense vegetation around them.","The unique thing was their bodies showing illusory Origins of Universes and Cosmos that showed their Realm...and these were mere Beasts that were at the lowest rungs of power as they lived their lives simply!","<It was an Age where everything flourished as destiny was exceedingly more dense than any of the past Ages, with more Candidate Emperors being born and more mysterious Domain Spaces filled with dangers and treasures materializing throughout constantly forming. It was also the Age where the Ancient Bloodlines moved with fervor to grasp onto this abundant destiny, each one wishing to have their Bloodline be the one to birth the True Emperor.>","The vibrant skies filled with golden seas of destiny changed as they were replaced with scenes of the Illusory images of many creatures- each portraying a different Bloodline!","<The Ancient Bloodlines were on good terms even while competing, with the Prominent ones in the lead being the fierce Kun Peng, Nature Spirits, Qilins, Celestial Nymphs, Eldritch Champions, and many more. There were also Bloodlines rising in power within this Age that began making major waves- these Bloodlines namely being the Astral Bloodline, Infinite Willow Trees, Reality Ursidae...and a few more.>","The images shifted to show shocking beings as Noah's eyes were mesmerized by the astounding figure of the one called Kun Peng.","A glorious beast leaking horrifying majesty as it seemed to be a fusion of a mythical bird and a deep sea Emperor that held flames swirling all over its body, its skin alone littered and made entirely of Runic Ecritures as it boasted terrifying majesty!","The Nature Spirits were wondrous as their bodies seemed entirely made of different wavelengths of light, their form constantly changing as they seemed to meld with the surrounding natural laws of Reality- essence of Reality naturally suffusing into them and bathing them with power.","The Qilins, Eldritch Champions, and Celestial Nymphs were just as majestic, but Noah's eyes could help but be carried towards the 'rising' Bloodlines that he knew about now as the Pure-Blooded Cardinal Royal Bloodlines!","The dazzling image of an ancient tree that glimmered with the light of stars could be seen floating side by side with the shocking visage of a creature taking on the form of something reminiscent to a Bear- but this bear like creature imposed astounding majesty as a river of Reality coursed over its entire body, its irises unique shaped like spinning golden crowns.","This...was the mere image of a Reality Ursidae!","Besides it was an image that should be foreign to Noah, but he recognized it somewhat as it was a constantly changing form of Cosmos- the entire figure made up of stellar bodies as it actually reminded him of the True Form he took on right now of a Samsara Cosmic Dao Origin.","This...was a creature of the Astral Bloodline!","<Each Bloodline held their own uniqueness as they ruled over vast stretches of land that went on for untold Light Years, the more land under their authority granting them more power and destiny as the goal of every Bloodline was to expand and increase what they already had.>","The surroundings changed once more as the Illusory figures of Bloodlines faded from the dazzling skies, the old voice taking a pause as it seemed to be gazing at Noah's mind.","When it saw him calmly take in the surroundings while waiting for more and not being disturbed, it continued on!","<In these vast stretches of land and endless Domain Spaces of Reality, oddities and mysteries were many as a certain group had picked up on shocking news during their journey, a group that had rushed back towards the prosperous lands of the Olden Alliance where the countless Ancient Bloodlines had their representatives residing.>","Noah's will felt even more strain as a new stage of the <Aged Remembrance> continued, shocking secrets about to be unveiled at this moment!"]},{"number":1692,"title":"Chapter 1692: Chapter 1691 The Age of Destiny! ll","paragraphs":["Chapter 1691 The Age of Destiny! ll","Noah's destiny was surging madly as he paid utmost attention, his vision of the dazzling endless skies and starry earth below changing as something new came to be shown!","In this austere region of blue skies, multicolored light surged around a certain area as there, one could see a glorious Legion of existences enthroned in uniform heavy armor and were all actually situated on regal War Horses whose robust black bodies were inscribed with Runic Lines that released golden flames.","These black horses with golden flaming Runic lines...had golden flames surging at the soles of their limbs as they floated in the skies while carrying on their backs what looked like hardened soldiers and generals at the very forefront!","One such particular general was an existence adorned in a crimson heavy armor that had an illusory Reality shining on it, his eyes sharp and unyielding as his dark hair was tied into an exalted bun on his back. Above his head, a solidified crown could be seen floating majestically as around it, Runic Ecritures reading <EMPEROR> could actually be seen swirling gloriously.","The power this being released was utterly frightening as even his War Horse was different from the others, its body actually shining with purple blue Cosmos as even brighter golden flames surged at its feet to keep it floating in the air!","<This was a small Legion under Commander Feng that he moved with for thousands of years to scour the lands after he picked up traces of information foretelling of a shocking plan that would be carried out by a group of unknown Bloodlines. Groups of Bloodlines...that would later come to be known as the Cardinal Royal Primordial Bloodlines.>","WAA!","The Legion tore across the skies as the War Horses flew with austere majesty, the golden War Horse at the very forefront carrying an important personage that when Noah focused on him, his eyes opened wider as he observed faint illusory images of not a single Reality...but many Realities flashing vibrantly within his body!","This...was an existence that had far exceeded the stage of Reality as the mere aura he gave off was akin to an unshakable existence that could not be shaken by anything.","<Commander Feng had come across the information after observing another Commander secretly meet with a group of personages from multiple weaker Bloodlines like the Immemorial Dwarfs, Royal Wolves, and a few more. The contents of their talks were so heinous that he sent word to the Olden Alliance to let this news be known by all.>","Across the skies the Legion tore, unhindered by nothing as for over a dozen days they moved and warped across space of these exceedingly vast lands of Reality, finally arriving in the Lands of the Olden Alliance on the 15th day.","Noah's luminous eyes were just about to take it the sight of these ancient lands and their structures when once more, the scene changed as this time, it showed Commander Feng dismounting from his War Horse as a few from his Legion followed him through majestic golden doors that revealed the shocking visage of many others figures within!","Through the golden doors was a stellar Domain Space that held many floating thrones, beings enshrouded by a hazy golden light situated on these thrones as they represented the Ancient Bloodlines of the Age of Destiny.","Noah could not see past the hazy golden light that covered them in any way as beside their floating thrones, the powerful shadows of their Bloodlines could be seen around them as hundreds of figures floated serenely and with majesty all over this stellar domain of space!","Mind you...these were only mere representatives of the Ancient Bloodlines as their power was in no way the core of these Bloodlines, but even such beings were too profound for even memories to display.","When Commander Feng entered this stellar domain of space, he bowed towards everyone respectfully as before he even rose- a booming voice thundered out from one of the thrones.","\"You are greatly exceeding your capabilities to irresponsibly call for an Assembly with your few Merits, young Feng!\"","OOOM!","The eardrums of any beings who held any Origin lesser than Reality would have burst along with their heads if they heard this voice, but Commander Feng rose from his bow and actually only nodded towards the figure that had spoken as his voice began to emanate calmly.","\"I called for this Assembly and rushed back to stand before you all because of heavy machinations that I have come across...machinations that involve going against and harming the very Will of Reality!\"","BOOOOM!","Destiny exploded out shockingly at such words as the atmosphere in this domain of space became utterly cold, nobody speaking out a word until another voice from a different throne echoed out.","\"What could you be asserting, Commander Feng? For you to call us all here and lay such dangerous claims, does it mean they apply to those here?\"","...!","This voice stemmed from a throne that was surrounded by existences with shining stellar bodies, Commander Feng raising his head calmly towards it as he replied soon after before any discussion arose.","\"They are machinations spreading among prominent Bloodlines, yes. Machinations that could affect everything we know if we let them come to pass.\"","The air in the surroundings tightened as silence ensued, a silence that was broken once more by yet another voice- this one filled with wisdom and ancientness.","\"I commend you for not blatantly lying down any accusations against such charges on any Bloodlines yet. Your reason for calling this assembly is to...\"","\"To obtain the permission and authority from this Assembly to carry out an investigation on all involved Bloodlines.\"","HOONG!","\"Preposterous!\"","\"Commander Feng, you sure are becoming bold!\"","Booming voices rose out as Commander Feng withstood all of them, remaining calm as he continued to speak.","\"The other option was for me to make my move on suspected Bloodlines right away, killing all that must die as War and bloodshed would have bloomed out once more.\"","...!","His words caused the surroundings to turn cold as a snort rang out right after, a domineering voice from another Throne echoing out.","\"Is this your play to bid for the seat of the True Emperor? Kill all those you want by simply stating they are beings trying to harm the very Reality we flourish in?\"","BZZZT!","Shocking words that caused the expressions of all those in this stellar Domain Space to change as maddening power began to leak out from all around!","But before it could explode out...","\"Everyone.\"","OOOM!","A calming and aged voice resounded once more as it came from the Throne that held the hazy being who was surrounded by existences whose bodies were made of pure stellar light.","\"We do not need to break into conflict over such an issue. An accusation such as this can simply be investigated as Commander Feng wishes as we will all know the truth.\"","The air calmed as many beings looked at each other.","The eyes of Commander Feng turned sharp as he saw this person out of all beings actually cooperating, keeping his thoughts hidden as the existence upon the throne pointed towards a few beings around him.","\"You all can act as our Bloodline Representatives to aid Commander Feng in his investigation.\" The enthroned existence pointed to over 20 existences whose bodies exuded the light of stars as he pointed to one final one with an even greater authority.","\"Commander Oppenheimer, make sure to give Commander Feng any support he needs on this.\"","WAA!","The one that was being addressed nodded respectfully as he bowed towards the being on the Throne, this stellar existence actually holding a solidified crown above his head similar to Commander Feng as his eyes...shone with a boundless light that nobody here could see nor understand!"]},{"number":1693,"title":"Chapter 1693: Chapter 1692 The Age of Destiny! lll","paragraphs":["Chapter 1692 The Age of Destiny! lll","OPPENHEIMER!","Noah actually heard this name uttered once more as it was actually a Commander being addressed, a being that seemed like a subordinate of the one chosen to represent the Astral Bloodline in this Olden Assembly!","This...was the same being that had risen to occupy the seat of a True Emperor?!","OOOM!","The scene paused as uniquely, boundless light shone on the bowing figure of OPPENHEIMER.","Noah felt the pressure from <Aged Remembrance> intensify even further as his vision trembled slightly when he tried to focus on the image of OPPENHEIMER.","<Most of those who arrived at this point of the Remembrance could not withstand the visage of OPPENHEIMER as they broke down...you are among the few who can calmly continue.>","The voice of the being that had been shifting the scenes before Noah's eyes this who time came through as the image before him stabilized.","<Yes...>","The aged will within the Forgotten Reality continued to narrate once more as everything seemed to be focused on the single existence that was surrounded by those from the Astral Bloodline...so he had to naturally be of the same Bloodline, right?","Noah couldn't affirm this as similar to the beings sitting on the thrones, there was a hazy golden light surrounding OPPENHEIMER- and it was much denser than even those sitting on the thrones as the only thing visible for him was the solidified Throne above his head!","<An existence that at that time, many did not even think of or have any high aspirations about. He was merely a distinguished Commander who also held Candidacy to be the True Emperor like many others, but he wasn't among the pool of beings that many thought would lead.>","WAA!","<Those who were thought to have a chance to attain the seat of the True Emperor were those who ruled over the Ancient Bloodlines- the ones who presided and foresaw countless light years of space. OPPENHEIMER...he wasn't even a Chosen Emperor blessed with astounding destiny, and yet in the Age of Destiny- he grasped the most destiny as he superseded even Chosen Emperors to do what he did.>","...!","What!","Chosen Emperors! This name floated in Noah's mind from the memories of the Will Bearers he had swallowed as they were in tune with more abstruse knowledge than others.","What Noah knew about them was the singular fact that those who became True Emperors of their Age were more often than not Chosen Emperors with astounding destiny. So much so that it was the laid down truth known by all that OPPENHEIMER...was such a being as well!","'Falsehood...'","Noah came across something unique at this moment.","The memories of others were true, but they could also contain falsehood if these beings believed information as fact merely because it was passed down as the truth.","The truth about history that Noah was collecting from the memories of others...it might not be entirely accurate as even this astounding will he was seeing the memories of at this time had to also be questioned! But when it came to the memories he was seeing, even his destiny was inclined towards them being true as he proceeded carefully.","<At that stage, nobody had the name OPPENHEIMER in their radar...not even Commander Feng.>","The narrating voice continued after pausing on the shielded figure of OPPENHEIMER, its voice even more somber for the events that were about to come.","<Commander Feng discovered the machinations of some Bloodlines and sought to unveil them, being granted authority by the Olden Assembly to investigate these claims along with representatives of their Bloodlines.>","The aged voice of the will within the Forgotten Reality rang out again as the scene of the stellar domain of space where austere beings were enthroned began to tremble, the hazy Astral figure of OPPENHEIMER going towards Commander Feng while followed behind by other existences from the Astral Bloodline being seen.","Before the scene entirely faded, the voice of the enthroned existence that was surrounded by the Astral beings could be heard once more.","\"The other Bloodlines...can also send in their people to aid in this investigation, with the truth being established as if there is any merit- those who actually dared to make such schemes will face the wrath of all Ancient Bloodlines!\"","WAA!","The will carried undeniable authority as figures of other Ancient Bloodlines began to go towards Commander Feng, the astounding visage of the Kun Peng outshining all others as their bodies glinted with golden majesty.","With the representatives of all the Ancient Bloodlines joining the fray, the already Unstable scene faded as Noah found his vision seeing blank stellar darkness.","<I was merely a Soldier under Commander Feng at that time, so the memories I have are limited to what I saw. After the Assembly and being granted authority to investigate...then came the Cataclysm for me and many others.>","OOOM!","The surroundings began to change once more.","This time, the scene forming was a bloody one it began with free flowing rivers of golden blood and strewn body parts of Ancient Bloodlines.","<Commander Feng was an astounding existence, but even he did not think the machinations to harm the very Will of Reality involved so many Bloodlines. He took it upon himself that he would root out any poisonous rats along the way if they showed their fangs, where even if half of the Ancient Bloodline Representatives turned out to be the culprits- the other half with him would be able to contain them all and get the proof they needed. He had this mindset because of the trust in his own power as everything should have gone according to plan...had it not been for a single being that exceeded all logic.>","The bloody scene opened up more as Noah saw the ruptured bodies of glimmering War Horses, Qilins, Eldritch Champions, and even...the magisterial Kun Peng beginning to show.","There was a circle of coldly staring existences surrounding the bloody scene as at its forefront was none other than OPPENHEIMER!"]},{"number":1694,"title":"Chapter 1694: Chapter 1693 The Age of Destiny! lV","paragraphs":["Chapter 1693 The Age of Destiny! lV","A bloody scene of rivers of golden blood freely flowing!","The glorious form of a fusion of a kingly bird and fish spitting out golden flames from its very scales and feathers could be seen- its beak grasped by the two hands of a hazy crowned figure that pulled apart the beak of this majestic creature and tore it apart like it was nothing!","A creature that held many layers of glimmering Realities...torn in half with his mere hands as he seemed to hold an unshakable authority that surpassed any defenses the Kun Peng held.","<Many things were in Commander Feng's calculations, but Commander Oppenheimer exceeded any made calculations as a few days after setting off from the Olden Assembly, the Bloodline Representatives of Astral, Reality Ursidae, Infinite Willow Trees, Dragon Phoenix, and Royal Humans all moved in tacit agreement to attack all other Representatives in a locked off a pocket of space. Even this wasn't enough to hinder Commander Feng as the perpetrators had revealed themselves, with all that was left being to withstand and expose them... but things went awry when a singular being exposed his power.>","More of the scene opened up.","The brilliant bodies of many representatives of the Astral, Reality Ursidae, Dragon Phoenix, Infinite Willow Trees, and Royal Humans could be seen bound by arcs of light and blood- their aura giving off feelings of immense tiredness as even they were looking towards the figure that had ripped apart a Kun Peng like it was nothing!","\"You have hidden yourself deeply, Commander Oppenheimer.\"","At the center of the bloody golden sea forming, the calm voice of Commander Feng came out as one could see his Origin leaking out stellar light in an Unstable fashion, the very golden blood that leaking out of him actually being surrounded and filled with Runic Ecritures reading <VITALITY>.","These wisps of golden blood had formed into lines that connected to a few beings near Oppenheimer, one of them being a soldier that the vision Noah was seeing was centered around!","This...was the being that the ancient will residing in the Forgotten Reality was.","After the words of Commander Feng on the scene, the hazy figure of OPPENHEIMER didn't seem to retort back or say anything else, his hand merely bearing down towards Commander Feng and all those remaining around him boosted up by his life force!","BZZZZT!","The golden blood full of vitality that was holding the few remaining soldiers alive trembled as it was disconnected even before the unfathomable hand of Commander Oppenheimer arrived, the eyes of a certain soldier dimming as with it...so did the scene.","Noah watched in silence as the pressure on his soul slowly began to fade.","<This was the last scene I held as a minuscule portion of my will survived remarkably due to something Commander Feng had done, with me only coming to countless years later in this pocket of Reality with a few Remnants of that battle contained here as well. That was the last time I lived in the Age of Destiny...and I only awoke to find out I was in a new Age entirely!>","...!","<I know not how the party of Bloodline Representatives led by Commander Oppenheimer explained themselves upon their return. I do not know how they cleared their suspicions. I only knew after waking up countless years later how this very reality felt different as only when a few entrants came here did I learn roughly of what had happened. Merely that somehow, the silent and unremarkable Commander Oppenheimer had achieved exactly what we were worried about as there are still many things unknown as to how it all occurred.>","...!","<I...also do not know whether the being that had initially tried to stop all this is alive or dead, and thus comes the reason for my Aged Remembrance.>","OOOM!","The bloody scene faded as Noah was enveloped in darkness again before a new vision began to show itself!","As this occurred, Noah's mind was buzzing with questions about what had occurred back then.","Did War break out between the Ancient Bloodlines before the True Emperor was enthroned? How did Commander Oppenheimer go from bowing down to a substitute representative of the Astral Bloodline in the Olden Alliance to begin the existence that superseded current rulers and Emperors of that time to obtain the authority of the True Emperor?","And where were the Kun Peng, Qilins, and other Ancient Bloodlines Noah had now learned of?","Were they among the non-Primordial Bloodlines currently closed off in other Realities?","Were they like the Telos who had allied with Primordial Beasts during this ensuing chaos?!","There were too many questions and little answers, Noah's mind buzzing from it all as he didn't know where to begin to answer them.","He dug into the memories of all the beings he killed and what they knew of all the Bloodlines out there, a small picture gradually being painted in his mind as he thought of Ancient Bloodlines and where they could now be as the forming scene before him finished!","It was none other than the image of a grand Commander Feng situated on a golden War Horse brimming with power.","<Alive or dead. Since I did not see it with my own eyes, my will has persevered all these years as this is the reason for my Aged Remembrance. To have someone take on the task of merely finding out whether Commander Feng perished on that day!>","WAA!","Noah could hear the pain and respect in the old will as his eyes shone sharply, his own will surging out as his thoughts echoed out.","\"Time alone has ground out any vestige of history. How would one find out the status of such an existence so long before? How would one even begin to track down the visage of beings that were wiped out to not reveal what Primordials were going to do even before OPPENHEIMER attained the seat of a True Emperor?\"","He couldn't help but raise his questions against the sentimental nature of the old will that was trying to confirm something extremely hard!","Silence ensued thereafter as the Illusory image of Commander Feng remained, the solidified crown above his head shining with untold splendor as only after a few seconds did the narrating voice return.","<I still have a visage of the Ancient True Blood that the Commander had spared before I perished. This...is something I will grant to the one who will taken on the task of my Aged Remembrance.>","HOOONG!","<With it, even if the task is near impossible...traces of history should still be possible to be found. The truth of how things ended back them...I just what their confirmation!>"]},{"number":1695,"title":"Chapter 1695: Chapter 1694 Resonance! l","paragraphs":["Chapter 1694 Resonance! l","<The truth of how things ended back them...I just what their confirmation!>","The aged will bellowed out as a heavy task was laid out at this moment!","The secret of the past Age of Destiny and the events that had occurred to allow the fundamental change of Reality itself were extremely crucial. Understanding how things were altered so greatly by OPPENHEIMER and those who followed him was something that very few beings could confidently rise up to do, so what would someone like Noah do?!","He stayed silent as the overbearing will cascading onto him lessened as the image of Commander Feng faded, his vision eventually returning back to the ruins of the Forgotten Reality as the shocking vestiges of history floated silently.","The vibrant pulsing Kun Peng's Heart and Appendage of the Ruined Emperor flashed before his eyes as innumerable thoughts were hidden behind the flashing light.","<You have withstood the Aged Remembrance as I will stay true to my words and allow you to pick 5 Remnant Relics...but what say you on the task of discerning what happened all those years ago to Commander Feng?>","The Olden Will was straightforward as it stated things simply.","As for Noah and his thoughts...he truly didn't have any reason to deny seeking the mystery behind what happened in the past- with it even getting him closer to understanding a being as spectacular as Oppenheimer and Commander Feng!","BZZZT!","His will was robust as arcs of light shot from his eyes, his voice coming out with his decision soon after.","\"It is merely to locate traces of history...I can find this out for you!\"","...!","Glorious and unseen waves of destiny bloomed.","The aged voice was silent for the first time after Noah retorted back, the silence stretching for over a dozen seconds as Noah waited calmly!","<Your agreement is the first aspect. 18 other existences apart from you reached this point and agreed, all of them similar to you thinking about the visage of the Ancient True Blood of Commander Feng and what being tied to such a destiny would grant them.>","...!","<It is natural to want boons and treasures, but you also have to be strong enough and Destined enough to take them! The second aspect apart from your agreement...is for you to actually be capable of withstanding the Visage of the Ancient True Blood of Commander Feng. A sort of Remnant Destiny and Will of a long forgotten Era as all 18 other beings before you that had reached this point and chose to receive it...were not accepted by this will as they perished!>","<They perished because even though it is a Remnant Destiny and Will of the Age of Destiny, it is still Commander Feng's visage of Ancient True Blood as it knows right away if the existence trying to accept it is tied to those who had made machinations back then. It senses right away if the soul of this existence seeks the same gains as those bloodlines in the past, or they are not truthful in locating the truth of the past...and it rages out as in the past billions of years, the other 18 beings that had accepted it all perished under the Visage of the Ancient True Blood.>","\"...\"","Silence ensued as it was broken soon after by the same aged voice.","<5 among those 18 were those who had achieved the measly beginner stages of Reality.>","OOOM!","As if to cement the terrible dangers of continuing on this path and accepting the mission of finding out the truth by taking in the Remnant Will and Destiny of Commander Feng, the Olden Will made it clear that not just those in the Firmaments of Ascendancy- even LEGENDS had perished if their hearts weren't true or they were moving with Primordials!","<Do you still wish to proceed?>","A final question that would be a decider for something major was asked!","—","The Olden Will was tired.","Too many years had passed.","Too many things had happened.","All it wanted to know was the truth of what had happened back then, but it had never been successful even after it came to!","It was restricted and bound by shackles nobody in this Era could understand, its minuscule portion of will not dissipating due to its unique Bloodline and sheer willpower to find out the truth before perishing.","This Olden Will had watched too many beings fail the Aged Remembrance when they entered this pocket of Reality, and then it had proceeded to watch 18 of those that withstood Aged Remembrance also perish from not being able to pass the test of the Remnant Will and Destiny of Commander Feng!","The destiny of Commander Feng was something unquestionable as he was a genuine Chosen Emperor- with the Visage of Ancient True Blood that merely held an aspect of him still being powerful enough to discern the true nature and destiny of the one accepting it.","If their destiny and disposition were nowhere close to Commander Feng, they would be utterly rejected with their souls destroyed soon after.","For the past 18 existences, the most promising one had only had a mere .05% resonance with the Remnant Will and Destiny of Commander Feng!","'After all these years...my own will and even the barely remaining residual will within the Ancient True Blood is about to fade...'","The thoughts of the Olden Will were somber and filled with sadness as it watched the calm existence who wasn't faltered or shaken by his words.","'If this time fails as well...would this be the last time? Would there be even one more chance after this? Or will I simply join the unconscious sprouting Realities in this changed world...'","...!","Terrifying thoughts that would shake the souls of even LEGENDS rang out as this Olden Will focused on the unhindered existence that spoke with confidence as if he owned the very space he floated in.","\"It is merely accepting a small portion of a will that has survived for eons...I will accept it easily and see what needs to be done!\""]},{"number":1696,"title":"Chapter 1696: Chapter 1695 Resonance! ll","paragraphs":["Chapter 1695 Resonance! ll","The most recent being to receive the Remnant Will and Destiny of Commander Feng was extremely confident as he wasn't the first to be like this!","But the Olden Will could do nothing apart from giving it a try like before, so it forged forward and simply let the flow of destiny decide how things would play out.","BZZZT!","The vast stretches of the ruins began to tremble as something began to be called upon at its very depths.","In the past, the blood of Commander Feng filled with Runic Ecritures of <VITALITY> had seeped into the bodies of this Olden Will and a few other soldiers during the terrifying battle, traces of merely the will and destiny of this blood being preserved over time under the portion of soul of the Olden Will.","This Remnant Will and Destiny of Commander Feng was now called upon from the deepest parts of the Forgotten Reality as it pushed aside any vestige clustered within this Reality and surged towards the only living existence within it!","It was akin to an aurora of a golden will and authority surging out as it was directed by the Olden Will to head towards and surge into the body of a single being.","'Leave everything up to fate...let us see what level of resonance you can achieve. If it is even 1%...I will soothe the Remnant Will and Destiny of Commander Feng to not lash out to destroy your soul as truly, the time and chances are running out.'","Melancholy was hidden in the thoughts of the Olden Will as it observed what changes would bloom as the compatibility of this being was tested with the Remnant Will and Destiny of Commander Feng!","Surrounded by aged remnants of a long forgotten past, Noah's True Sanguine Clone still retained his true form when the Remnant Will and Destiny of Commander Feng surged into him. It seemed like a mere aurora of light. But even this minuscule trace of will carried immense authority as it sank into his soul.","The Olden Will watched with slight apprehension for signs of resonance, its aged will becoming somber as...","\"...\"","Seconds passed without anything happening.","'...What is this? Has the will been entirely expanded already?'","Despondency began to set in the old soldier's will as it seemed the Olden Will was Destined to never find out what happened to its Commander!","Normally when the Remnant Will and Destiny of Commander Feng descended onto an existence, a shining light of authority would begin to bloom from their bodies if there was any resonance.","The shining light actually followed the Color Spectrum of Authority- namely the sequence of White, Blue, Purple, and Gold.","All the previous entrants that had reached this point had their most promising ones release a dim light to represent a decimal percentage of resonance, but the being before his eyes wasn't displaying any colors at all!","'...Forgive me, Commander.' The despondent Olden Will sighed as it was about to move to retrieve whatever remained of the diminished will.","But...","<Huh?>","The voice of the Olden Will couldn't help but exclaim out loud as the authority it held all this time over the Remnant Will and Destiny of Commander Feng didn't seem to work anymore.","<What is->","BZZZT!","Space and time seemed to come to a lull as even the thoughts of the Olden Will were restricted.","The body of Noah's True Sanguine Clone was silent as the Remnant Will and Destiny of Commander Feng had passed through it and followed the source to arrive within the origin of Noah's main body in a far away Cosmic Holy Land!","So there was a slight delay in what the Olden Will observed as in the next instant...","BOOOOM!","A blinding, magisterial, and utterly horrific golden light surged out from the True Sanguine Clone to cover the vast Ruins of the Forgotten Reality!","But this was nothing.","This True Sanguine Clone was merely an extension of Noah's will that was affected, Noah's slumbering main body being the source of all this as at this moment- a blinding and inviolable golden light had maddeningly surged out to bathe over not just the Cosmic Holy Land, but it was spreading out over the innumerable Universes from all the fused Realities within the Infinite Reality!","—","HOOOONG!","<The will of an exceedingly old Bloodline is resonating with your soul!>","Glorious prompts were rising before the eyes of all True Sanguine Clones no matter where they were.","The one acting as Alexander in the Vestigial Flames Mountain taking in Golden Vestigial Flames back to the slumbering main body.","The one waiting for more Legions of the Royal Cosmic Wolves to bring themselves to him. The one traversing the edges of the Mirror Dimension with RUINATION!","The one traversing the edges of the Dream Dimension...and the Clone that was within the Forgotten Reality itself.","These prompts rose before all of their eyes as Noah's will moved to focus them on the True Sanguine Clone within the Forgotten Reality- even though his slumbering main body was the one facing the shocking resonance of wills and soul!","The very blood within his body was vibrating and shaking with austere power at this moment as his biggest accomplishment of a Bloodline began to burn with glory.","<Surpassing Space and Time, the Unnamed Kainos Emperor Bloodline resonates with the Will of a Chosen Emperor.>","BZZT!","Noah's slumbering body on the golden throne of the Cosmic Holy Land rose unconsciously- still surrounded by the Golden Vestigial Flames being brought by another clone as at this moment, a unique will matched with his own with such intensity that it was scaring the Olden Will that was only seeing a reflection of it in the Forgotten Reality.","As for Noah's own people in the Infinite Reality?","Little Henry and the others still had their main bodies in the Infinite Reality as they left with clones of Noah's Animus Summons and their own to traverse the vast Realities on the Serendipity of Cataclysmic Reality to seek their own destiny- so they were all able to observe the shocking phenomenon of an inviolable golden light encompassing the vast stretches of the Infinite Reality!","The phenomenon was utterly pristine and awe-inducing as nobody was affected more than the fading Olden Will within the Forgotten Reality.","<This...it can't be...!>","The aged voice had lost its calm that came with countless years of existence as some events truly took even the most knowledgable beings by surprise!","<Perfect Resonance!>","WAA!"]},{"number":1697,"title":"Chapter 1697: Chapter 1696 Resonance! lll","paragraphs":["Chapter 1696 Resonance! lll","The one to receive the Remnant Will and Destiny of Commander Feng had to be someone that was entirely opposed to what the Primordials did as if they stemmed from Primordial Bloodlines- things would turn problematic very quickly.","Noah held the Pure-Blooded Cardinal Royal Infinite Willow Tree Bloodline and Royal Human Bloodline...and yet this didn't seem to hinder the intent of the Remnant Will and Destiny of Commander Feng as it looked past it all and achieved Perfect Resonance!","It had resonated with his soul as the dying will of an existence that had nearly faded was able to find something so profound in Noah's soul that it utterly matched anything and everything it could have sought to perfection.","100% Resonance was a statement that said there was no other existence out there who could be better suited to receive this will- so what was seen within Noah to make this will grant such a high evaluation?!","<Wondrous Destiny...>","The Olden Will that had gone into shock found itself unconsciously voicing out while feeling the cascading golden light of Perfect Resonance wash over the Forgotten Reality.","A golden light that...actually began to pull upon the visage of the Remnant Relics and the Visage of defeated existences within this Reality!","The Olden Will noticed this as it quickly got out of its stupor and probed, becoming even more shocked soon after.","<The Remnant Will and Destiny of Commander Feng is...pulling upon any remaining Olden Destiny and Wills to achieve something past Perfect Resonance!>","The Olden Will was shocked by this conclusion as it could even feel its own residual will getting pulled, but unlike the Remnant Relics and bodies within this Forgotten Reality, it could withstand the pull and remain as it was.","<What...are you?>","In its shock, the Olden Will stared at the floating body of a calm existence that had begun to pull in much more than expected from the Forgotten Reality, not knowing of any of the wondrous changes being brought about with the Remnant Will and Destiny of Commander Feng!","—","<You have achieved Perfect Resonance with a blood trace of will and destiny stemming from the Age of Destiny- this action pulling upon the strings of the space time continuum as an aspect of the visage of the will contained in the Ancient True Blood blooms within you.>","WAA!","Blinding light surged around Noah as the prompts rained through his mind.","<The Age of Destiny Absolute Skill- [Bloodline Runic Ecriture Inscription] has been attained.>","Something glorious that Noah did not expect began to be branded onto his soul, but this wasn't all!","<The Remnant Will and Destiny of Commander Feng heavily approves of your Destiny and the Unnamed Kainos Emperor Bloodline it carries.>","HOOONG!","The ridiculously overbearing light became even more ridiculous as the visages of wills and destinies that had been pulled from the Forgotten Reality were all collected and infused into this already ridiculous process to achieve an even greater result.","<The infinitesimally minute trace of Destiny from the Remnant Will merges with your soul.>","\"...!\"","<Your Maximum Reserves of Fortune and Destiny have been increased by 20 times.>","HOOOOONG!","An utterly ridiculous prompt rise before Noah's eyes as his slumbering body twitched...before an Apocalyptic golden wave of fortune and destiny erupted from it!","Outside of the Cosmic Holy Land, Little Henry was floating in front of Queen Adelaide and his Grandmother among many other beings as they were all surrounded by the cascading waves of golden light that caused them to turn their heads towards its source.","\"Father must have come across a fortuitous event, with this merely being the aftereffects. We can ask him when it dies dow-\"","BOOOM!","At this moment in time was when ridiculously, Noah's already obscene reserves of Fortune and Destiny that he believed exceeded all beings in the Firmaments of Ascendancy...were somehow multiplied 20 times by merging with a mere 'infinitesimally minute trace of Destiny' from the Remnant Will and Destiny of Commander Feng!","Golden seas of destiny and fortune maddeningly rushed out from his body as they permeated everywhere, Little Henry and the others becoming drowned in this sea of destiny as they could only watch in a stupor while their own destinies bubbled excitedly.","Even Noah was shocked by what this development represented as he even felt his domineering will knocked down a little!","20 times. His already ridiculous reserves of Fortune and destiny were truly surging upwards in a straight line as they would have made any graph that was tracking his progress seem illogical","Just how vast was that being's Destiny and Fortune that a sliver of his will granted this? As an existence from the Age of Destiny, was he just someone exceptional to have his destiny be so outrageous?","Bountiful questions...but no answers came as more prompts rained down.","<Due to merging the Remnant Will and Destiny of a visage of Ancient True Blood, the standing of the Unnamed Kainos Emperor Bloodline has been further elevated.>","His golden blood became heavy and pristine as it bubbled forth slowly with intensity, his heart beginning to beat loudly as if it was a stellar drum stretching out across Realities!","<The Unnamed Kainos Emperor Bloodline has made a great advancement- exceeding the halfway point to become a VENERABLE Bloodline.>","BZZZT!","<A Destiny Link has been established with a Will of a Past Era- this Destiny Link pulling you towards anything associated with the merged Will.>","The shining golden light was brightest at this point in time as it signified the most glorious moment before everything died down.","In the Forgotten Reality, the Olden Will was shaking to its very core as whether it was actually reality or merely its imagination, it saw a shocking scene around the figure of Noah's True Sanguine Clone that was surrounded by the cascading waves of golden light.","Whether it was due to Perfect Resonance or something else entirely, the sight of the Olden Will saw that around Noah's body, an illusory form of an existence it knew all too well began to superimpose itself!","WAA!"]},{"number":1698,"title":"Chapter 1698: Chapter 1697 The Remnant Relics of the Forgotten Reality! l","paragraphs":["Chapter 1697 The Remnant Relics of the Forgotten Reality! l","A shocking illusory image was superimposing itself on the being undergoing a Perfect Resonance!","An illusory form of an existence that the Olden will had made its obsession- a form of a Commander situated upon a golden war horse that bellowed out with boundless glory.","The eyes of the illusory existence it knew all too well flashed brightly as they seemed to land on the very core of the Olden Will, appearing for only a microsecond before soon after...it disappeared entirely as the surging golden light began to die down!","\"...\"","The Olden Will within the forgotten Reality was entirely silent as it watched this shocking Resonance go towards a close.","It was about to end, and the being directly involved in it knew this well as within his mind, one last glimmering prompt appeared to finish off a Perfect Resonance of wills of different Eras.","<The Age of Destiny Absolute Skill [Emperor's Aged Remembrance] has been attained.>","OOOM!","The blaring golden seas that had shot out like storms from Noah began to recede.","The Remnant Will and Destiny of Commander Feng had all but faded where apart from the last prompt, there was still one more thing that remained before this will was entirely extinguished!","It was...a message.","An imperceptible set of words that somehow stretched out across space and time!","<If you can reign in Destiny...it might actually be possible.>","...!","A rumbling and ancient voice!","It left behind that message...and that was it.","SHAA!","The Remnant Will was entirely extinguished.","All the wondrous lights began to die down as Noah's body only gave off mere pulses of golden light, his eyes opening as they showed a residual golden sea within them.","Yet his thoughts were many as he thought about the message left behind as well as all the boons he had attained this time around!","'What might be possible?'","Many of the old existences or anyone pretentious that Noah had met so far loved to speak with abstruse words or riddles as they were never straightforward. Why must they be cryptic when they can just as easily lay out a clear message that made things go all that much faster?!","Noah shook the light frustrations away as his luminous eyes honed in on the boons gained so far, his eyes coming to focus on the conceptualized gains of the Age of Destiny Absolute Skills <Bloodline Runic Ecriture Inscription> and <Emperor's Aged Remembrance>.","<Bloodline Runic Ecriture Inscription>:: The rare art of inscribing Runic Ecritures into one's very Blood has now become a possibility. Currently, the Runic Ecriture of VITALITY has been learned and can be formed through the expenditure of 100,000 Units of the Essence of Reality. A single VITALITY Runic Ecriture passively increases True Reality Defense Values by 10. The number of Runic Ecritures that can be formed is dependent on Essence of Reality and the Physique of the Body to be capable of withstanding a large number of Runic Ecritures coursing through one's very own blood. If one's Physique is weak while withstanding the authority of Runic Ecritures passing through their vessels, their bodies and origin will instead face deterioration from the pressure of power they cannot withstand...","<Emperor's Aged Remembrance>:: As you progress from here on out, coming across anything linking the Will and Destiny of Commander Feng will trigger this ability as memories that stretch across the spacetime continuum will be obtained. The passive triggering of the ability has no resource requirement, but the Essence of Reality can be utilized to focus on specific memories once the ability is active...","Brilliant new skills bloomed as each had its own usage, with <Emperor's Aged Remembrance> promising more history and understanding of the past events so long as Noah came across any traces of this Chosen Emperor that had nearly gotten in the way of making the Infinite Realities possible!","Then there was <Bloodline Runic Ecriture Inscription>.","Noah recalled the golden blood of Commander Feng leaking out and surging into his soldiers as it was littered with bountiful glimmering Runic Ecritures that read <VITALITY>, and he now knew that even a single one of those ecritures took 100,000 Units of the Essence of Reality to forge as it granted a passive boost of 10 True Reality Defense Values!","So long as one's physique could withstand these ecritures etched onto their True Blood, they could continue to increase their Defense Values endlessly. And Noah had seen just from the golden blood flowing out of Commander Feng...minuscule Runic Ecritures of VITALITY in the tens of thousands.","\"...\"","He was speechless at such a reality.","It revealed a shocking number of base True Reality Defense Values before they were even multiplied with any authority through the casting of abilities as the concept of it alone was utterly dreadful while showing the immense power that the beings in the Age of Destiny wielded!","\"How different are the scales of power from the Age of Destiny to the current Age...\"","Noah's mesmerizing voice echoed out in the Forgotten Reality as the shocked Olden Will came to, focusing onto him as its voice that was now filled with emotion boomed out.","<Were...were you able to obtain the <Destiny Link>? That will be the most crucial in finding out traces of Commander Feng.>","The will wondered about the results of Perfect Resonance as Noah's head rose, a calm smile becoming plastered on his face as he nodded.","\"That, and more. Commander Feng's Remnant Will has helped me greatly as I won't take the task to locate his destiny lightly.\"","OOOM!","Bright waves of destiny flowed out as the Olden Will that had been passing through the ravages of time felt a great weight lifted off of its shoulders!","<Good...good!>","The aged voice felt free of worries as soon after, it continued in a serious tone.","<I know not of your Destiny...but you achieved a Perfect Resonance with Commander Feng's will- an action that should not have even been a possibility! But with it in place, an old soldier like me who merely followed him can only use the last of what remains on my will to make sure of your success. I know how crucial destiny and treasures are...so I will not stop you from taking whatever you wish from this Forgotten Reality.>","...!"]},{"number":1699,"title":"Chapter 1699: Chapter 1698 The Remnant Relics of the Forgotten Reality! ll","paragraphs":["Chapter 1698 The Remnant Relics of the Forgotten Reality! ll","The Remnant Will and Destiny of Commander Feng had made it very clear that if the truth could be found out- it would be through this being that had arrived in this ancient graveyard!","The Olden Will would not stand in the way of such Destiny, especially after seeing the image of Commander Feng flash around this being- no matter how briefly.","So the Olden Will went past the limitation it had given before that said Noah could only take 5 Remnant Relics as now, whatever he wished within this Forgotten Reality could be his!","Noah's figure smiled brilliantly at such a development as he held himself back from playing with <Bloodline Runic Ecriture Inscription> and gazed into the slightly altered ruins around him.","\"Then, all of the Remnant Relics in here are mine for the taking?\"","The Olden Will paused silently before speaking out.","<All that remains, yes. Although during your resonance, the remnant wills and destinies within the corpses or items here had a large majority of their Essence drawn out to maintain and exceed the best possible results.>","\"...\"","Noah's smile faded as he looked at the ruins closely, seeing at this moment that the austere ancient looking structures, Cosmic sized body parts, and other oddities he hadn't even explored began to turn to ash at this moment!","\"No...\"","He felt like his heart was aching and hurting greatly from any of the loot that was fading, but he also couldn't complain too much as the boons he had gotten from the Perfect Resonance was simply too much.","His reserves of Destiny and Fortune had exploded by over 20 times as he even gained Age of Destiny Absolute Skills...all of these might not have landed in his hands if the resonance was not maintained or exceeded to attain the best results!","But it was still painful as he controlled his aching heart while speaking out.","\"Can you bring forward all of the remaining Remnant Relics, Corpses, and unique items that could be of use?\"","<Mmm. After this, I shall put my remaining will in a half state of sleep to preserve myself for as long as possible- whether it takes you a few hundred or a few million years to uncover what happened back then, I want to be here to learn about it!>","HUUUM!","A blaring storm of essence surged from all corners of the Forgotten Reality as the aged will spoke, the things that had all their wills and destinies turning entirely to dust as those that still remained began to be pulled forward.","Even though a majority of Remnant Visages had their wills and destinies drawn, this ancient graveyard still had many things that escaped the ravenous pull of resonance!","Bountiful oddities and wonders began to float before Noah's eyes as they shone with a piercing light, the details of these items being revealed.","The items could be arranged into categories as there were body parts or organs of unknown creatures, broken up Relics, or inanimate structures that had not fallen until now as they screamed of age and vicissitude!","<Iris of the Cosmic Archer>, <Thread of the Forgotten Emperor>, <Nymph's Righteous Grace>, <Broken Sternum of the Eldritch King>...","The body parts or organs were similar to the uses of <Desolate Kun Peng's Heart> as over the years, much of their will and destiny were ground down as they fell into the category of Ultimate TABOO Materials.","With such items, enhancing TABOO Relics would be a given as similar to the Kun Peng's Heart, many were listed as Ultimate TABOO Materials capable of replacing the required materials from a Blueprint of a unique Relic!","There were also body parts like the Appendage of the Ruined Emperor that contained a violent will that could be released once or twice to dish out terrifying damage equivalent to or close to the strike of a Legend as long as one could activate them.","There were bountiful things for Noah to obtain as while he looked at them, his hands began to beckon as these oddities flew towards him in a calm fashion- the Desolate Kun Peng's Heart being one of the first things that still remained that he collected!","<So long as we do not disrespect and desecrate their remains, all of them would be happy to be able to aid the one who is seeking traces of Commander Feng.>","As the many body parts of unique races and Bloodlines entered Noah's Expansive Space, the Olden Will continued to speak as Noah listened to it closely, his eyes twinkling as he replied calmly.","\"Since I can take everything, I also plan to take this very Forgotten Reality.\"","...!","\"There should be no issues with that, right?\"","Unseen surprise passed through the Olden Will at such words!","<If you already have such capability, yes. I will be falling into deep slumber soon as I will only wake when you come back with news of the happenings of history.>","Noah's smile only brightened up at such words as he gazed at this Reality around him filled with darkness and Age. He wondered what unique space would be created in the Infinite Reality after he fused this into it...as well as a question that he posed to the very Will of the Infinite Reality that he was connected to!","'When there is a conscious will such as this in a fused Reality, will you be able to merge with it seamlessly and obtain its memories?'","WAA!","Noah wondered of what would happen to the Olden Will as soon after, the will of his Infinite Reality replied to him.","<It is uncertain, Master. The will stems from a sliver of an existence that has gone to impose itself on a Reality. It might take time to fully assimilate it onto myself and obtain whatever memories it has.>","Memories of the Age of Destiny. Memories of how beings were many billions of years ago!","Noah's gaze wanted to see it all as while collecting the remaining Remnant Relics of the Forgotten Reality, his will began to spread out to attain a unique authority and pull this aged domain of space onto his Infinite Reality!"]},{"number":1700,"title":"Chapter 1700: Chapter 1699 A Most Wanted Blacklister! l","paragraphs":["Chapter 1699 A Most Wanted Blacklister! l","Across the bounds of the vast Realities.","Atop a glacial mountain the size of a thousand Cosmos, an innumerable number of cerulean Royal Cosmic Wolves could be seen bowing towards the peak with utmost regality.","Countless blue furred Wolves with arcs of vibrant light cascading over their bodies ranged from the Sixth Firmament to the Ninth Firmament of paid homage to the existence at the peak of this glacial mountain- this existence being the Bloodline Master of the Royal Cosmic Wolf Bloodline!","Such a Bloodline was among the over a dozen who statues lined up the Primordial Temples spread out over the vast Realities, where even though it was considered a second tier Primordial Bloodline compared to the 5 Pure-Blooded Cardinal Royal Bloodlines, it still held immense power as there were many LEGENDS born from this Bloodline.","They had even recently subjugated the Primal Titans of the Isles of the Gilded Forge and all other Realities these beings were in as they obtained Blacksmiths to obtain another constant source of Relics!","Their power was rising ever higher as the conflict stemming from Primordial Beasts and their allied Bloodlines had only propelled them to increase the range of their dominion.","Yet right now, there was another issue brought up to the coldly glistening claws of the Bloodline Master whose body alone exceeded all other Royal Cosmic Wolves by five times.","With an illusory crown now shining on his head, the Bloodline Master's beastial eyes gazed down coldly towards a bowing Wolf that had its snout touching the frozen earth below them.","\"The culprit of Little Snow's death has been located this whole time as even after a Legion is sent to bring him in, you all couldn't succeed?!\"","HUUUM!","The surrounding air of this glacial mountain buzzed as the bowing Royal Cosmic Wolf at the Seventh Firmament fearfully replied.","\"He called down a blade glimmering with countless Cosmos that eradicated our whole Legion, Master! He is not at the Seventh Firmament as it states on the Primordial Blacklist as I feel like he even exceeds the Eighth Firmament. He let me go so I could report back and call even more Legions against him...as if he is challenging our very authority as a Bloodline by showing whatever we send will not be able to do anything against him!\"","...!","BZZZT!","Immense coldness spread out as the fearfully speaking Seventh Firmament Royal Wolf remembered the cold gaze of the devilishly handsome man.","\"He wishes to challenge the authority of a Primordial Bloodline?\"","The eyes of the Bloodline Master released domineering light as he gazed past the bowing Royal Wolf and towards his armored Generals lined up in neat rows around the glacial mountain.","\"He does carry one of the Destined Names...so there could be more to this existence.\"","...!","Destined Names!","A set of a few names that prominent existences in the Primordial Bloodlines held as they were passed down to many Primordials as a show of respect.","Among them were Noah, Ezekiel, Aegon, and a few others...but what was unique was the fact that the most influential and astounding Primordial who had changed everything in the past Age- his name was nowhere to be found in the ranks of Primordials.","Other names were respected as they were handed to their progeny, but the name of OPPENHEIMER was respected as one unique couldn't find it given to anyone else in the Primordial Bloodlines!","After all, who could bear the weight and comparison of such a name?","The Royal Wolf Emperor had this passing thought as he quickly turned back to his Generals.","\"How many Legions that aren't stationed to counter Primordial Beasts can we send out?\"","\"Master, we can mobilize 12 Destroyer Legions, 8 Glacial Legions, and 2 of the Royal Legions are still on standby!\"","Multiple Legions of Royal Cosmic Wolves led by prominently powerful Ninth Firmament Wolves were mentioned as the Bloodline Master nodded.","\"Good. Let it be known in the Primordial Blacklist that this Noah Osmont is at the danger level of the Ninth Firmament of Ascendancy. Grant him the Most Wanted status and elevate his bounty while spreading it to the nearby Primordial Bloodlines that a Most Wanted Blacklister is bodacious enough to challenge the will of Primordials as he hasn't even moved from his location.\"","...!","The eyes of the Royal Wolf Emperor shone with age and malice as he continued.","\"Since he is this confident to challenge our will, let us not put our own forces at risk to grind down his existence as we can employ others to take the brunt force for us...get everything in order!\"","WAA!","\"Yes, Sire!\"","Cold storms raged as orders passed down.","The Glacial, Royal, and Destroyer Legions of the Royal Cosmic Wolves were put on standby to move as in a nearby Primordial Temple, the bounty of a certain Blacklister being elevated immensely.","The vast realities were already chaotic with many Primordial Legions spread out, but word began to spread locally as Primordial Bloodlines near the domains of the Royal Cosmic Wolves caught wind of an existence trying to deny the authority of a Primordial Bloodline!","In a certain reality filled with technological vessels mixed with pulsing mana.","\"Treat the enemy as if he was another Primordial Beast to get rid of...go!\"","A command from a unique Spirit Race Commander boomed out as glistening armored mechanical suits releasing vibrant auras at the Eighth and Ninth Firmament of Ascendancy formed into a Legion and set off.","In another Reality.","\"This will be an interesting case. Go forth with beauty and grace and take the head of this existence...do not let him stay in the Most Wanted of the Primordial Blacklist for too long.\"","\"Yes!\"","Bellows of affirmation rang out as even the Cardinal Royal Bloodline of Empyrean Elves set off with a legion of exceedingly beautiful experts ranging all the way to the Ninth Firmament of Ascendancy!","All of them and more were heading towards a single location.","A location that held a single True Sanguine Clone that waited silently and with utmost calmness- a clone of a being that was undertaking great tasks at this same period of time in multiple different areas!"]}]);
